INSERT INTO `continents` VALUES (1,'Asia','asia','kayak_1acf825e478ff743e4ae134d72793579.jpg','What is the most popular destination in Asia?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular destination is Tokyo (56% of total searches to Asia). The next most popular destinations are Bangkok (18%) and Seoul (14%). Searches for hotels in Hong Kong (12%) are also popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular regions of Asia?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular region to stay in Asia is Tokyo Prefecture. Bangkok and Seoul are also very popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular countries of Asia?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular country to stay in Asia is Japan. Thailand and India are also very popular.\n\nHow much is a cheap hotel in Asia?\nKAYAK users have found double rooms in Asia for as cheap as $6 (Manila) in the last 3 days. The average price is $112.',0,'https://www.kayak.com/Cheap-Hotels-in-Asia.as.htc.html','Nguồn: KAYAK','2026-11-18 14:19:33','2026-11-19 23:50:45'),(2,'North America','north-america','kayak_4bc5e6e58b50c3599bf1e11b0be98e34.jpg','What is the most popular destination in North America?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular destination is New York (35% of total searches to North America). The next most popular destinations are Las Vegas (35%) and Chicago (17%). Searches for hotels in Orlando (13%) are also popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular regions of North America?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular region to stay in North America is Florida. California and New York are also very popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular countries of North America?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular country to stay in North America is United States. Canada and Mexico are also very popular.\n\nHow much is a cheap hotel in North America?\nKAYAK users have found double rooms in North America for as cheap as $9 (Mexico City) in the last 3 days. The average price is $268.',0,'https://www.kayak.com/Cheap-Hotels-in-North-America.na.htc.html','Nguồn: KAYAK','2026-11-18 14:22:16','2026-11-18 14:22:27'),(3,'Africa','africa','kayak_f49888e7f109b4fea705ceb5e3d82e13.jpg','What is the most popular destination in Africa?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular destination is Cairo (32% of total searches to Africa). The next most popular destinations are Sharm el-Sheikh (24%) and Marrakech (22%). Searches for hotels in East London (22%) are also popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular regions of Africa?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular region to stay in Africa is Al Qahirah. Western Cape and Al Bahr al Ahmar are also very popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular countries of Africa?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular country to stay in Africa is Egypt. South Africa and Morocco are also very popular.\n\nHow much is a cheap hotel in Africa?\nKAYAK users have found double rooms in Africa for as cheap as $6 (Cairo) in the last 3 days. The average price is $155.',0,'https://www.kayak.com/Cheap-Hotels-in-Africa.af.htc.html','Nguồn: KAYAK','2026-11-19 14:47:45',NULL),(4,'Caribbean','caribbean','kayak_fb6c79addd611a8fec61c66c07bd264c.jpg','What is the most popular destination in Caribbean?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular destination is Punta Cana (43% of total searches to Caribbean). The next most popular destinations are San Juan (27%) and Oranjestad (16%). Searches for hotels in Nassau (14%) are also popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular regions of Caribbean?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular region to stay in Caribbean is La Altagracia. and are also very popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular countries of Caribbean?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular country to stay in Caribbean is Dominican Republic. Puerto Rico and Aruba are also very popular.\n\nHow much is a cheap hotel in Caribbean?\nKAYAK users have found double rooms in Caribbean for as cheap as $14 (Cabarete) in the last 3 days. The average price is $312.',0,'https://www.kayak.com/Cheap-Hotels-in-Caribbean.cb.htc.html','Nguồn: KAYAK','2026-11-19 14:47:51',NULL),(5,'Central America','central-america','kayak_eee8fc93a4d39be951c9a0da674f6987.jpg','What is the most popular destination in Central America?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular destination is Panama City (37% of total searches to Central America). The next most popular destinations are San José (37%) and La Fortuna (13%). Searches for hotels in Belize City (13%) are also popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular regions of Central America?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular region to stay in Central America is Panama. San José Province and Guanacaste are also very popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular countries of Central America?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular country to stay in Central America is Costa Rica. Panama and Belize are also very popular.\n\nHow much is a cheap hotel in Central America?\nKAYAK users have found double rooms in Central America for as cheap as $6 (San Juan del Sur) in the last 3 days. The average price is $202.',0,'https://www.kayak.com/Cheap-Hotels-in-Central-America.ca.htc.html','Nguồn: KAYAK','2026-11-19 14:47:56',NULL),(6,'Europe','europe','kayak_54338a2f1a96cc25d0c6ee49eebcf791.jpg','What is the most popular destination in Europe?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular destination is London (31% of total searches to Europe). The next most popular destinations are Paris (30%) and Rome (23%). Searches for hotels in Barcelona (16%) are also popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular regions of Europe?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular region to stay in Europe is England. Ile-de-France and Lazio are also very popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular countries of Europe?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular country to stay in Europe is Italy. United Kingdom and Spain are also very popular.\n\nHow much is a cheap hotel in Europe?\nKAYAK users have found double rooms in Europe for as cheap as $7 (Budapest) in the last 3 days. The average price is $203.',0,'https://www.kayak.com/Cheap-Hotels-in-Europe.eu.htc.html','Nguồn: KAYAK','2026-11-19 14:48:02',NULL),(7,'Middle East','middle-east','kayak_f8e42bc41fd0c8c538c578947effc9c5.jpg','What is the most popular destination in Middle East?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular destination is Dubai (44% of total searches to Middle East). The next most popular destinations are Mecca (32%) and Medina (18%). Searches for hotels in Doha (7%) are also popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular regions of Middle East?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular region to stay in Middle East is Dubai. Makkah and Al Madinah are also very popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular countries of Middle East?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular country to stay in Middle East is Saudi Arabia. United Arab Emirates and Israel are also very popular.\n\nHow much is a cheap hotel in Middle East?\nKAYAK users have found double rooms in Middle East for as cheap as $10 (Wadi Musa) in the last 3 days. The average price is $234.',0,'https://www.kayak.com/Cheap-Hotels-in-Middle-East.me.htc.html','Nguồn: KAYAK','2026-11-19 14:48:08',NULL),(8,'South America','south-america','kayak_ae294e9704df029f64129db7c78a9b45.jpg','What is the most popular destination in South America?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular destination is Rio de Janeiro (31% of total searches to South America). The next most popular destinations are Riohacha (27%) and Cartagena (21%). Searches for hotels in Medellín (20%) are also popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular regions of South America?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular region to stay in South America is Rio de Janeiro. Sao Paulo and La Guajira are also very popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular countries of South America?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular country to stay in South America is Brazil. Colombia and Argentina are also very popular.\n\nHow much is a cheap hotel in South America?\nKAYAK users have found double rooms in South America for as cheap as $6 (Riohacha) in the last 3 days. The average price is $136.',0,'https://www.kayak.com/Cheap-Hotels-in-South-America.sa.htc.html','Nguồn: KAYAK','2026-11-19 14:48:17',NULL),(9,'South Pacific','south-pacific','kayak_e090520bac789a7812b9c42b3fa65e09.jpg','What is the most popular destination in South Pacific?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular destination is Sydney (36% of total searches to South Pacific). The next most popular destinations are Vaitape (33%) and Nadi (17%). Searches for hotels in Auckland (14%) are also popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular regions of South Pacific?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular region to stay in South Pacific is New South Wales. Leeward Islands and Queensland are also very popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular countries of South Pacific?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular country to stay in South Pacific is Australia. New Zealand and French Polynesia are also very popular.\n\nHow much is a cheap hotel in South Pacific?\nKAYAK users have found double rooms in South Pacific for as cheap as $17 (Auckland) in the last 3 days. The average price is $285.',0,'https://www.kayak.com/Cheap-Hotels-in-South-Pacific.sp.htc.html','Nguồn: KAYAK','2026-11-19 14:48:26',NULL);
