INSERT INTO `countries` VALUES (1,'Vietnam','vietnam',1,'VN','kayak_ea73b26d9283e913de34e9f16848dab5.jpg','Where are the best places in Vietnam for a quiet couples’ or family holiday?\nAlthough Vietnam has become a booming tourist destination, it still has many countryside enclaves where you can truly wind down and relax. The ruggedly beautiful area of Hà Giang, with its valleys of terraced rice paddies, is one such place. For the best views, book a room at the Royal Hotel Hà Giang. Another attraction is Ke Bang National Park, with its dramatic labyrinth of caves, one of which is the tallest in the world. Here you can book a stay at Phong Nha River View Hotel in the town of Son Trach.\n\nWhere is the best beach resort in Vietnam?\nOne of the main reasons Vietnam has become such a popular tourist destination is its abundance of alluring beaches. The archetypal example is Phu Quoc, with its icing sugar-white beaches and virtually transparent water, surrounded by lush jungle foliage. A couple of great places to stay in this southern part of the country are Chen Sea Resort & Spa and Miana Resort Phu Quoc. For a more action-packed holiday, experience the high energy vibe of Nha Trang, another very popular coastal resort. Here you can book a room at the Eastin Grand Hotel.\n\nWhat annual events are good to look out for in Vietnam?\nThe most significant annual event in Vietnam is the Lunar New Year, known as Tet Nguyen Dan. It takes place in late January or early February. The Perfume Festival occurs from the middle of February through to early March, and the Hung King Temple Festival is held in early April. One of the country\'s largest and most fascinating events is the Wandering Souls Day in early September. All these events are celebrated throughout Vietnam, so you can stay in any of the main cities to experience them.\n\nWhat is the most popular destination in Vietnam?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular destination is Ho Chi Minh City (44% of total searches to Vietnam). The next most popular destinations are Da Nang (24%) and Hanoi (18%). Searches for hotels in Phu Quoc (14%) are also popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular regions of Vietnam?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular region to stay in Vietnam is Ho Chi Minh. Da Nang and Ha Noi are also very popular.\n\nHow much is a cheap hotel in Vietnam?\nKAYAK users have found double rooms in Vietnam for as cheap as $6 (Ho Chi Minh City) in the last 3 days. The average price is $94.',0,'https://www.kayak.com/Vietnam-Hotels.259.dc.html','Nguồn: KAYAK','2026-11-18 09:53:55','2026-11-18 10:33:14'),(2,'Mexico','mexico',2,'MX','kayak_b3abfee486eacc12f5de5988f9dbd68a.jpg','How do I find cheap accommodation in Mexico?\nFinding cheap accommodation in Mexico is pretty straightforward. In the less touristy locations, you will find cheap hotels concentrated around the central plaza. Others will be located next to big markets and bus or train stops. In the larger cities, the more affordable hotels will be clustered in a relatively small area. Most of the modern and expensive hotels tend to be outside the cities and only accessible by car or taxi. The only difficult time to access cheap accommodation in Mexico is over The Christmas, Easter, or Mexican holidays, or during festivals, and it would be prudent to book your cheap hotel through KAYAK in advance.\n\nWhere is the best place to stay to enjoy watersports on Mexican beaches?\nIf you wish to engage in water sports as you visit Mexico, you’ll be better off in hotels by the Sea of Cortez or the Gulf of Mexico. Most of the beaches around Los Cabos by the Sea of Cortez host a lot of marine life, making them ideal for sport fishing and most kinds of water sports. A great Los Cabos hotel you should consider is Hyatt Ziva Los Cabos. For a more thrilling experience, how about surfing in the crashing waves around Veracruz and Oaxaca? Some great hotels in these areas are Hotel Lois Veracruz and Oaxaca Real Hotel.\n\nWhere should I stay in Mexico for a tour of the archeological sites?\nIf you wish to check out the ancient civilizations that once occupied the Mexican territory, head out to the northern area of Vallecito in Baja California. Between the extensive deserts, dunes, and mountains lay cave paintings and ceremonial mounds used by these civilizations. Ensenada is a great hotel in Baja California which you should consider when visiting this area.\n\nWhat is the most popular destination in Mexico?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular destination is Cancún (57% of total searches to Mexico). The next most popular destinations are Playa del Carmen (18%) and Cabo San Lucas (13%). Searches for hotels in Puerto Vallarta (12%) are also popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular regions of Mexico?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular region to stay in Mexico is Quintana Roo. Baja California Sur and Jalisco are also very popular.\n\nHow much is a cheap hotel in Mexico?\nKAYAK users have found double rooms in Mexico for as cheap as $8 (Puebla City) in the last 3 days. The average price is $235.',0,'https://www.kayak.com/Mexico-Hotels.158.dc.html','Nguồn: KAYAK','2026-11-18 09:53:55','2026-11-18 14:22:16'),(3,'United States','united-states',2,'US','kayak_4bc5e6e58b50c3599bf1e11b0be98e34.jpg','Which hotel is the best for a honeymoon in the United States?\nHawaii boasts of some of the most beautiful scenery in the United States, including fiery volcanoes, verdant valleys, beautiful beaches, rainbows, and incredible cliffs. If you’re looking for a great honeymoon destination, you couldn’t ask for a better place than Honolulu. Here you’ll have many great hotels to choose from, including Hilton Hawaiian Village Waikiki Beach Resort, Waikiki Beach Marriott Resort & Spa, and Sheraton Waikiki.\n\nWhich is the best hotel to stay at when visiting the capital region?\nA tour of the United States won’t be complete without a visit to the capital region. Washington DC is filled with great museums and monuments; a must-stop for anyone visiting this region. A tour will introduce you to the National Mall and the White House and monuments honoring American heroes such as Abraham Lincoln, George Washington, Martin Luther King, Jr, and veterans of the various wars fought by Americans. The most iconic museums reside in Washington DC, and you’ll get a chance to see the National Gallery of Art and the National Air & Space Museum. For the best experience, consider booking a downtown Washington Hotel such as Washington Plaza.\n\nWhich hotels are ideal for someone visiting Florida?\nIf you’re looking for some fun in the sun, the Sunshine State is the place to be. Great hotels, beaches, the everglades, loads of cuisines, and culture are some of the great things about Florida. You’ll find Orlando and its fabulous theme parks to the north, and to the south, there’s Miami and everything else. If you’re in Miami, you’d want to be just by the beach, and Intercontinental Miami should do the trick for you. Those visiting Orlando also have great hotel options, such as Universal’s Hard Rock Hotel and Hilton Grand Vacations At SeaWorld.\n\nWhat is the most popular destination in United States?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular destination is New York (35% of total searches to United States). The next most popular destinations are Las Vegas (35%) and Chicago (18%). Searches for hotels in Orlando (13%) are also popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular regions of United States?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular region to stay in United States is Florida. California and New York are also very popular.\n\nHow much is a cheap hotel in United States?\nKAYAK users have found double rooms in United States for as cheap as $13 (Detroit) in the last 3 days. The average price is $264.',0,'https://www.kayak.com/United-States-Hotels.253.dc.html','Nguồn: KAYAK','2026-11-18 09:53:55','2026-11-18 14:22:18'),(4,'Singapore','singapore',1,NULL,'kayak_3369cd1e06d2e084cd1b83bfc912efae.jpg','What are the best hotels for a luxury stay in Singapore?\nSplash out and stay in the Mandarin Oriental on Raffles Street. With its central location near the business centre and tourist sights, as well as the views of the bay and city from the rooms and the rooftop swimming pool, it is an ideal location to relax and yet be at the centre of the action. Another luxury option is the Marina Bay Sands Hotel, which is well-located for both the casino and the Gardens by the Bay, the nature park in the central region of Singapore.\n\nWhich hotels in Singapore are best located for shopping?\nOrchard Street is one of the most luxurious shopping streets in Singapore and the hotels match the mood. Stay at the Hilton Singapore if you want to spoil yourself, or save your money for shopping and book into the more mid-range Orchard Hotel Singapore at the top end of the shopping street. We suggest placing yourself in the centre of the activity, so consider staying at the Singapore Marriott Tang Plaza Hotel right next door to Tangs – the oldest department store in Singapore.\n\nWhat are the best hotels in Chinatown in Singapore?\nFor a completely different cultural experience in the same city, think about staying in Chinatown, Singapore’s Chinese centre, where you can buy a variety of delicious foods from hawkers and visit the local shops. Stay in the Parkroyal Collection Pickering, which is within walking distance of the Chinatown Street Market. Alternatively, opt for the Hotel 81 Chinatown, which is very close to the metro stop and a short walk from the Chinatown Heritage Center, where you can walk through some of Singapore’s history in the museum exhibitions.\n\nWhat is the most popular destination in Singapore?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular destination is Singapore (100% of total searches to Singapore).\n\nWhat are the most popular regions of Singapore?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular region to stay in Singapore is .\n\nHow much is a cheap hotel in Singapore?\nKAYAK users have found double rooms in Singapore for as cheap as $13 (Singapore) in the last 3 days. The average price is $230.',0,'https://www.kayak.com/Singapore-Hotels.218.dc.html','Nguồn: KAYAK','2026-11-18 10:33:35','2026-11-18 14:22:21'),(5,'Morocco','morocco',3,NULL,'kayak_e347fb7197bc618a8b724e18989d36a9.jpg','Where is the best place for families to stay in Morocco?\nWhile Marrakesh continues to be a popular choice with families, you can also get away from the hustle and bustle of the city with your family by staying in Essaouira. This coastal town offers plenty for a family to do and ensures no one will get bored; the historic old town is full of interesting sights while the beaches offer a number of activities, including surfing and windsurfing.\n\nWhere is the best place to stay for a surfing holiday in Morocco?\nMorocco is considered a hidden gem for surfers around the world; the North African destination is often overlooked in favour of other European locations. You can find fantastic places to surf in Moroccan cities such as Taghazout and Agadir. These fishing villages have now been converted into surf havens, offering hotels ranging from basic accommodation to luxury resorts to suit your stay.\n\nWhat is a good area to be based for seeing most of the country?\nWith so much to see and do in Morocco, there are many travellers that want to explore the whole country during their stay. For this, a suitable place to base yourself is in the capital city of Marrakesh. Here, you can spend a few days visiting everything the city has to offer, ranging from the bustling markets to the incredible and unique street food options. From Marrakesh, you can take day trips to some of the top sights located on the Atlantic coast, including towns such as Essaouira and incredible natural parks such as the High Atlas mountains.\n\nWhere can I find top luxury resorts in Morocco?\nIf you want a luxury experience during your visit to Morocco, then consider looking outside of the capital city. For example, to the north, in the city of Tangier, you can find incredible resorts that offer a tranquil and luxurious experience, such as Hilton Tangier Al Houara Resort & Spa. Alternatively, you can head to the often overlooked city of Medina. This offers much to see and do and, of course, plenty of time to relax at top hotels, including Ryads Al Maaden Medina & Golf Resort, where you can also enjoy a quick round on the top-quality golf course.\n\nWhat is the most popular destination in Morocco?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular destination is Marrakech (55% of total searches to Morocco). The next most popular destinations are Casablanca (20%) and Tangier (13%). Searches for hotels in Agadir (12%) are also popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular regions of Morocco?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular region to stay in Morocco is Marrakech-Safi. Casablanca-Settat and Tanger-Tetouan-Al Hoceima are also very popular.\n\nHow much is a cheap hotel in Morocco?\nKAYAK users have found double rooms in Morocco for as cheap as $12 (Tangier) in the last 3 days. The average price is $97.',0,'https://www.kayak.com/Morocco-Hotels.167.dc.html','Nguồn: KAYAK','2026-11-19 14:58:39','2026-11-19 17:12:35'),(6,'South Africa','south-africa',3,NULL,'kayak_74c3b39add7899afaf230f661226f672.jpg','Where should I visit for a romantic getaway in South Africa?\nIf you seek a romantic escape in South Africa, consider booking a hotel around The Garden Route in Western Cape. The path through the forest, canopy excursions, and breathtaking scenery are all couples need for a romantic experience away from the bustling world. Lovebirds can also enjoy various attractions on this route, including Robbery Natural Reserve, Congo Caves, and Birds of Eden. Consider staying at The Plettenberg Hotel, a great choice for a bonding experience for couples near The Garden Route. Also, this beachfront establishment features a pool with a scenic sea view, a spa and a wellness center, ideal for a romantic vacation.\n\nWhich is the best place to stay for a family vacation in South Africa?\nIf you seek a memorable family vacation in South Africa, consider booking a hotel in the southern part of the country, preferable, Cape Town. Cape Town offers a wealth of exciting family-friendly attractions and activities tucked between the mountains and the ocean. Cape Town features lovely beaches, scenic hiking trails, and attractive gardens, making it ideal for a fun-filled family vacation. Also, children will love riding the rotating cable car to the summit of the Table Mountains, which features spectacular views of the city. Staying at Best Western Cape Suites Hotel will place you at the foot of Table Mountain, and offer you convenient access to many others attractions within the city. This establishment also features a kid-friendly buffet, playground, family rooms, ample storage, and laundry services, ideal for families.\n\nWhere is the best place to stay for business travelers in South Africa?\nIf you are traveling to South Africa, consider booking a hotel in Johannesburg. The city is the top business destination in South Africa, placing you close to various business hubs, top exhibitions and trade fairs, and corporate events. Staying at Radisson Blu Hotel Sandton, Johannesburg is well recommended. This hotel is ideally positioned on Rivonia Road, only a few minutes from the Johannesburg Stock Exchange and Sandton Convention Centre. Also, the establishment features a business center, an in-room working desk, laptop safe, and currency exchange on-site, making it a great fit for business travelers.\n\nWhat is the most popular destination in South Africa?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular destination is East London (37% of total searches to South Africa). The next most popular destinations are Cape Town (35%) and Durban (16%). Searches for hotels in Johannesburg (11%) are also popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular regions of South Africa?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular region to stay in South Africa is Western Cape. Eastern Cape and KwaZulu-Natal are also very popular.\n\nHow much is a cheap hotel in South Africa?\nKAYAK users have found double rooms in South Africa for as cheap as $11 (Johannesburg) in the last 3 days. The average price is $121.',0,'https://www.kayak.com/South-Africa-Hotels.223.dc.html','Nguồn: KAYAK','2026-11-19 14:59:00','2026-11-19 17:12:38'),(7,'Dominican Republic','dominican-republic',4,NULL,'kayak_fb6c79addd611a8fec61c66c07bd264c.jpg','What annual events are worth attending in the Dominican Republic?\nIn February, the Carnival season sees the country\'s largest parade festival of the year, with each region represented by its own traditional costumes. During the carnival, parades are held in all the major cities. The Dominican Republic Jazz Festival takes place in November, with concerts held in rotating venues in the main cities. One of the most delicious annual events is the Mango Festival in June, which showcases more than 100 varieties of the fruit produced in the country. The festival is held in the town of Bani where you could book a stay at Casa Gloria.\n\nWhere are the best child-friendly hotels in the Dominican Republic?\nYou’ll find child-friendly family hotels in all of the main resorts on the island, with many of them in Punta Cana. Barceló Bávaro Palace and Occidental Caribe are just two of them. In Santo Domingo, you can stay at Catalonia Santa Domingo or the Dominican Fiesta Hotel & Casino with its children\'s pool. Cribs and high chairs are provided if required, and babysitting and child care services are also available.\n\nWhere will I find the best nightlife in the Dominican Republic?\nPunta Cana is the city of choice for restaurants, bars, nightclubs and other nightlife activities in the Dominican Republic. There are party buses, beach parties and a whole host of dance clubs and live music venues to choose from. The Hard Rock Hotel & Casino makes for a good choice of hotel to be in the thick of things. Alternatively, you could stay in an establishment like Kepler’s Place if you prefer an apartment-style hotel.\n\nWhat is the most popular destination in Dominican Republic?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular destination is Punta Cana (91% of total searches to Dominican Republic). The next most popular destinations are Puerto Plata (4%) and Santo Domingo (3%). Searches for hotels in La Romana (2%) are also popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular regions of Dominican Republic?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular region to stay in Dominican Republic is La Altagracia. Puerto Plata and Distrito Nacional are also very popular.\n\nHow much is a cheap hotel in Dominican Republic?\nKAYAK users have found double rooms in Dominican Republic for as cheap as $19 (Santo Domingo) in the last 3 days. The average price is $235.',0,'https://www.kayak.com/Dominican-Republic-Hotels.68.dc.html','Nguồn: KAYAK','2026-11-19 15:10:58','2026-11-19 17:12:43'),(8,'Jamaica','jamaica',4,NULL,'kayak_7d0f116f372affe84f15b795d92416f6.jpg','What are the best hotels for a luxury stay in Jamaica?\nJamaica has a variety of luxury hotels to stay in throughout the country. Montego Bay has many luxury hotels; some include Half Moon, Jewel Grande Montego Bay Resort and Spa, and Zoetry Montego Bay. All these hotels and resorts have beautiful views of the beach and all the luxury amenities you could ask for. Kingston also has various luxury hotels; some of these include Terra Nova All Suite Hotel and AC Hotel Kingston Jamacia. These hotels are in the heart of the capital and are close to many popular attractions.\n\nWhich hotels in Jamaica are best located for shopping?\nKingston is a fantastic city if you are looking to do some shopping. One of the main shopping areas in the city is Half Way Tree. Some hotels that are in this area are Labrish Guest House and Tropical Manor Inn. Another popular shopping area is New Kingston. There are many hotels in the area that are within walking distance of the shops. Some recommendations are Sunset Inn Hotel and The Spanish Court Hotel.\n\nWhich hotels in Jamaica are best for a family holiday?\nThere are many hotels in Jamaica that are great for a family holiday. Montego Bay is a great city to visit with your family due to the beautiful beaches and seaside amenities. Some recommended hotels in the Montego Bay area are Mynt Retreat Bed & Breakfast, Hotel Sahara de La Mar and Caribic House.\n\nWhat is the most popular destination in Jamaica?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular destination is Montego Bay (61% of total searches to Jamaica). The next most popular destinations are Negril (17%) and Ocho Rios (15%). Searches for hotels in Kingston (7%) are also popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular regions of Jamaica?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular region to stay in Jamaica is Saint James. Westmoreland and Saint Ann are also very popular.\n\nHow much is a cheap hotel in Jamaica?\nKAYAK users have found double rooms in Jamaica for as cheap as $19 (Port Antonio) in the last 3 days. The average price is $366.',0,'https://www.kayak.com/Jamaica-Hotels.119.dc.html','Nguồn: KAYAK','2026-11-19 15:23:03','2026-11-19 17:12:47'),(9,'Costa Rica','costa-rica',5,NULL,'kayak_cdb82bb9447b2e77b5925d21024bab11.jpg','Where are the main natural attractions in Costa Rica?\nCosta Rica is a country full of national parks, most of which are made up of the lush tropical rainforests that characterise the region. Monteverde Cloud Forest is known for its birdlife, and Tortuguero National Park is a turtle haven. The brightest jewel is Corcovado National Park, one of the most biologically dense forests in the world. It\'s located on the Osa Peninsula, and the nearest town is Puerto Jiménez, where you can stay at Iguana Lodge & Spa Beach Resort.\n\nWhere should I stay to experience Costa Rica\'s nightlife?\nThe nightlife and party capital of Costa Rica has always been the coastal resort of Jacó. It has a wealth of bars, nightclubs, live music and entertainment venues, as well as plenty of accommodation options for tourists. One of the best situated is Croc\'s Resort and Casino, right in the middle of the action. The capital city of San José comes a close second in the party stakes, and here, the Hotel Colonial makes a good choice.\n\nWhere is the best location in Costa Rica for a family holiday?\nCosta Rica has developed a growing reputation for being an ideal destination for family trips. One of the finest places to spend your holiday is the Blue River Resort & Hot Springs in the northern town of Liberia. It\'s about 3 miles from the Rincón de la Vieja Volcano National Park, with a commanding view of the nearby dormant volcano. The resort has a full range of children\'s facilities, including a child care and babysitting service.\n\nWhat is the most popular destination in Costa Rica?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular destination is San José (59% of total searches to Costa Rica). The next most popular destinations are La Fortuna (21%) and Tamarindo (12%). Searches for hotels in Manuel Antonio (7%) are also popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular regions of Costa Rica?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular region to stay in Costa Rica is San José Province. Guanacaste and Alajuela are also very popular.\n\nHow much is a cheap hotel in Costa Rica?\nKAYAK users have found double rooms in Costa Rica for as cheap as $10 (San José) in the last 3 days. The average price is $147.',0,'https://www.kayak.com/Costa-Rica-Hotels.59.dc.html','Nguồn: KAYAK','2026-11-19 15:34:01','2026-11-19 17:12:50'),(10,'Panama','panama',5,NULL,'kayak_eee8fc93a4d39be951c9a0da674f6987.jpg','What location is best for my hotel stay if I\'ll be going to Panama on a romantic escape?\nBocas del Toro in Panama\'s Caribbean Coast has breathtaking islands and a laidback atmosphere away from the bustling city scene, bringing about a serene environment to relax with your better half. A great romantic destination is Punta Caracol Aqua Lodge, with cabins over water, and you can even go snorkeling right underneath. The Red Frog Beach Island Resort is another hotel that couples are likely to enjoy, thanks to its stunning room views of the ocean water and miles of private beach.\n\nWhich are the popular Panama beach resorts?\nWith multiple Panama locations lying beside the Caribbean and Pacific Coast, you might want to explore the oceanside. Booking a room at a beach resort is the way to go. Las Olas Beach Resort in David and Royal Decameron Golf, Beach Resort & Villas in Río Hato sit at the beach. Both locations also offer room choices with stunning views of the nearby ocean waters.\n\nWhere in Panama can history buffs have a good time?\nYou\'ll want to stay close to Casco Viejo, Panama City\'s old town, if you love history. The old quarter houses colonial-era landmarks and plazas. Some hotel choices you have include the four-star American Trade Hotel that\'s just a 5min walk away from the Museum of History Panama and The Selina Shared Casco Viejo Panama City, which is steps away from the Metropolitan Cathedral and Independence Square.\n\nWhat is the most popular destination in Panama?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular destination is Panama City (89% of total searches to Panama). The next most popular destinations are Bocas del Toro (5%) and Río Hato (3%). Searches for hotels in Boquete (2%) are also popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular regions of Panama?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular region to stay in Panama is Panama. Bocas del Toro and Cocle are also very popular.\n\nHow much is a cheap hotel in Panama?\nKAYAK users have found double rooms in Panama for as cheap as $9 (Panama City) in the last 3 days. The average price is $152.',0,'https://www.kayak.com/Panama-Hotels.189.dc.html','Nguồn: KAYAK','2026-11-19 15:42:54','2026-11-19 17:12:54'),(11,'France','france',6,NULL,'kayak_54338a2f1a96cc25d0c6ee49eebcf791.jpg','Where can I go for a restaurant with some views?\nParis is world famous for its cuisine, but with a rooftop restaurant you’ll be able to admire the 2000-year-old city and its historical landmarks while you dine. Ibis Paris Gare Du Nord TGV is close to Maison Blanche, a first-class restaurant on the rooftop of the Champs-Elysées Theatre where you can enjoy views of the Eiffel Tower while you dine.\n\nWhere should I stay for a wine tasting trip?\nFrance is almost synonymous with wines, with names of places like Champagne, Bordeaux, Châteauneuf-du-Pape, and Burgundy frequently appearing on the labels of bottles. While each is worth a visit (and a taste), Bordeaux is perhaps best known as the capital of France’s wine region. From the La Cité du Vin - literally the Wine City, you’ll be able to learn all about the rich culture of wine in the region, as well as book wine tasting tours at famous châteaux like Saint-Émilion, Saint-Julien, Margaux, and Médoc.\n\nWhat are some hotels with a good location for a beach holiday?\nFrance has many excellent beaches to choose from but La Grande Plage is one of the most renowned. Hôtel du Palais Biarritz, in The Unbound Collection by Hyatt is a 5-star beachfront palace. Deauville Beach is another large beach, just two hours away from Paris that is famed for its cleanliness. Prado Beach in Marseille is next to a seaside park with plenty of activities including a Ferris wheel. B&B Hotel Marseille Prado Vélodrome is just 1.2 miles from the beach and steps from the Velodrome Stadium.\n\nWhat is the most popular destination in France?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular destination is Paris (89% of total searches to France). The next most popular destinations are Nice (8%) and Cannes (2%). Searches for hotels in Marseille (2%) are also popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular regions of France?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular region to stay in France is Ile-de-France. Provence-Alpes-Côte d\'Azur and Auvergne-Rhône-Alpes are also very popular.\n\nHow much is a cheap hotel in France?\nKAYAK users have found double rooms in France for as cheap as $21 (Clermont-Ferrand) in the last 3 days. The average price is $225.',0,'https://www.kayak.com/France-Hotels.82.dc.html','Nguồn: KAYAK','2026-11-19 15:51:37','2026-11-19 17:12:59'),(12,'Italy','italy',6,NULL,'kayak_f9b0c7cf410ab6fb1d97f9eaf00289e3.jpg','What are some convenient hotels for wine tasting in Italy?\nLocated in the heart of Lombardy wine country, Hotel Eremo della Giubiliana offers an ideal base for a vineyard tour of the region. Those interested in learning more about Italian agriculture and vineyards could also stay at Antico Feudo San Giorgio, which is part of a local farm in Sicily.\n\nWhere can I find hotels with fitness facilities in Italy?\nMany hotels in Italian cities have fitness suites on the premises. Hotels like Grand Palace Hotel in Rome and Ny Hotel Milan by Leonardo Hotels in Milan offer fully equipped gyms with exercise machines and some free weights. It is less common to find city hotels with on-site pools in Italy; however, some larger city hotels do have them.\n\nWhere should I stay for shopping in Italy?\nIf you plan to hit the shops while in Italy, major cities like Rome and Milan have some fantastic hotels situated just a short distance from the stores. Hotels like Hotel Indigo Milan Corso Monforte are conveniently located roughly just a 5min walk from Milan’s famous designer shopping district. Meanwhile, in Rome, Hotel Milton Roma is located in the city centre and is within walking distance of numerous boutiques and stores.\n\nWhat is the most popular destination in Italy?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular destination is Rome (59% of total searches to Italy). The next most popular destinations are Milan (15%) and Venice (14%). Searches for hotels in Florence (12%) are also popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular regions of Italy?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular region to stay in Italy is Lazio. Lombardy and Veneto are also very popular.\n\nHow much is a cheap hotel in Italy?\nKAYAK users have found double rooms in Italy for as cheap as $12 (Florence) in the last 3 days. The average price is $142.',0,'https://www.kayak.com/Italy-Hotels.118.dc.html','Nguồn: KAYAK','2026-11-19 16:00:46','2026-11-19 17:13:03'),(13,'Spain','spain',6,NULL,'kayak_968a175165581ea1569a8857ca8d9d3d.jpg','Where are good places to stay in Spain for arts and culture?\nIf you love visiting art galleries, Madrid is an ideal destination for you. Madrid is home to the Prado National Gallery, which has a vast collection of European art, and other heritage sites like the Monumento a Goya. Booking a hotel close to these attractions may be expensive, as they are very popular and central; try and book accommodation slightly further away but with good public transport links. Options such as the Hotel Rui Plaza Espana put you close to Underground stations, which will help you reach the Prado in around 30min.\n\nWhere are good places to stay in Spain with young children?\nLooking for places to keep kids thoroughly entertained during your stay in Spain? Although it was once famous as a party town, Benidorm, on the Costa del Sol, now has plenty of great family-friendly hotels. It is also located close to several great water parks, such as Aqualandia and Aqua Natura.\n\nWhat are some good places to stay for nightlife in Spain?\nIf you’re looking for nightlife in Spain, the island of Ibiza is a great choice for you. Choose a hotel right on the beach, like the Hotel Mim Ibiza Es Vive – Adults Only, for easy access to popular seafront bars and clubs. Or stay slightly inland at the Casa Maca for access to bars at night and peace and quiet during the day.\n\nWhat is the most popular destination in Spain?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular destination is Barcelona (52% of total searches to Spain). The next most popular destinations are Madrid (35%) and Palma de Mallorca (8%). Searches for hotels in Seville (5%) are also popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular regions of Spain?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular region to stay in Spain is Catalonia. Madrid and Andalusia are also very popular.\n\nHow much is a cheap hotel in Spain?\nKAYAK users have found double rooms in Spain for as cheap as $7 (Madrid) in the last 3 days. The average price is $147.',0,'https://www.kayak.com/Spain-Hotels.225.dc.html','Nguồn: KAYAK','2026-11-19 16:10:06','2026-11-19 17:13:06'),(14,'United Arab Emirates','united-arab-emirates',7,NULL,'kayak_f8e42bc41fd0c8c538c578947effc9c5.jpg','What is the most popular destination in United Arab Emirates?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular destination is Dubai (86% of total searches to United Arab Emirates). The next most popular destinations are Abu Dhabi (11%) and Sharjah (2%). Searches for hotels in Ras Al Khaimah (1%) are also popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular regions of United Arab Emirates?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular region to stay in United Arab Emirates is Dubai. Abu Dhabi and Sharjah are also very popular.\n\nHow much is a cheap hotel in United Arab Emirates?\nKAYAK users have found double rooms in United Arab Emirates for as cheap as $7 (Sharjah) in the last 3 days. The average price is $205.',0,'https://www.kayak.com/United-Arab-Emirates-Hotels.251.dc.html','Nguồn: KAYAK','2026-11-19 16:18:39','2026-11-19 17:13:10'),(15,'Qatar','qatar',7,NULL,'kayak_adbc1403d28eb3e3d1f018fe60f3e0b3.jpg','What are the best parts of the country to stay in if I am traveling to surf?\nThe western part of Qatar has several surfing spots, including the most famous Dukhan Beach, located in the municipality of Al-Shahaniya. If you book a room at Papa Dukhan Beach Resort or Dukhan Lodge, you will be at a walkable distance to this famous surfing spot. Dukhan Beach is a surfing spot suitable for all types of surfers regardless of their level of experience. Papa Dukhan Beach Resort has relaxing rooms, which offer great gulf views.\n\nWhere can I stay in Qatar if I am going for a romantic getaway?\nIf you are going for a romantic getaway in Qatar, you need to consider staying in a quiet and peaceful neighborhood but with great attractions. Booking a room at the Movenpick Hotel Doha or Golden Tulip Doha will be a good option. You will be close to the famous Museum of Islamic Art (MIA) Park, which has the beautiful Arabian Sea on one side and a museum with great works of art on the other. The two hotels are famous for their tranquil environment that will give the quietness needed on a romantic trip.\n\nWhat are the best beach resorts to book a room in Qatar?\nA large number of travelers to Qatar come to spend time by the ocean, and the best way to do this is to book a room at a beach resort. The Marsa Malaz Kempinski, and the Sealine Beach, a Murwab Resort, will be good options. In addition to their access to the beach, these hotels are located a short distance to Souq Waqif, where a traveler can go and do their shopping with convenience.\n\nWhat is the most popular destination in Qatar?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular destination is Doha (99% of total searches to Qatar). The next most popular destinations are Al Khisah (0%) and Al Rayyan (0%). Searches for hotels in Al Udeid (0%) are also popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular regions of Qatar?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular region to stay in Qatar is Ad Dawhah. Al Wakrah and Ar Rayyan are also very popular.\n\nHow much is a cheap hotel in Qatar?\nKAYAK users have found double rooms in Qatar for as cheap as $41 (Doha) in the last 3 days. The average price is $180.',0,'https://www.kayak.com/Qatar-Hotels.199.dc.html','Nguồn: KAYAK','2026-11-19 16:27:38','2026-11-19 17:13:16'),(16,'Brazil','brazil',8,NULL,'kayak_ae294e9704df029f64129db7c78a9b45.jpg','Are there any all-inclusive resorts in Brazil?\nYes, there are a few all-inclusive resorts in Brazil. All-inclusive resorts are popular with travelers because they have onsite dining and activities that guests can enjoy without leaving the resort. They also typically charge one fee for lodging, food and some basic activities. If this is what you\'re looking for, you can book your vacation at Vila Gale Mares in Camacari or the Cana Brava Resort in Ilheus. Some things that you can do at these resorts include swimming, tennis, canoeing, and taking a Brazilian cooking class.\n\nWhat is the largest airport in Brazil?\nSao Paulo Guarulhos International Airport is the main airport in Brazil. If you stay close to the airport, it will be easy to fly in and out of the country. The airport is also very close to public parks, restaurants, the zoo, and shopping centers such as the Parque Shopping Maia. If you book a room by the airport, you\'ll have a wide selection of hotels to choose from. You\'ll find something to fit pretty much every budget. A few include the TRYP by Wyndham Sao Paulo Guarulhos Airport (if you can afford to splurge), the Colt Hotel (if you\'re traveling on a budget) and the Hampton by Hilton Guarulhos Airport (a mid-range priced hotel).\n\nAre there any five-star hotels in Brazil?\nIf you’re looking for extreme luxury, you can book a room at one of Brazil’s five-star hotels. The Windsor Barra Hotel in Rio de Janeiro is an option. This hotel offers upscale amenities like sea views, a solarium, concierge service, and a beautiful outdoor pool and hot tub. There is also the Melia Jardim Europa in Sao Paulo. Its amenities include a concierge, outdoor pool/sauna, tennis courts, and a restaurant with room service.\n\nWhat is the most popular destination in Brazil?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular destination is Rio de Janeiro (65% of total searches to Brazil). The next most popular destinations are Sao Paulo (22%) and Florianopolis (7%). Searches for hotels in Foz do Iguaçu (6%) are also popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular regions of Brazil?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular region to stay in Brazil is Rio de Janeiro. Sao Paulo and Santa Catarina are also very popular.\n\nHow much is a cheap hotel in Brazil?\nKAYAK users have found double rooms in Brazil for as cheap as $6 (Brasilia) in the last 3 days. The average price is $125.',0,'https://www.kayak.com/Brazil-Hotels.33.dc.html','Nguồn: KAYAK','2026-11-19 16:37:15','2026-11-19 17:13:19'),(17,'Argentina','argentina',8,NULL,'kayak_dfa83310dc7b526e29ff8dd7010976d9.jpg','What is the most popular destination in Argentina?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular destination is Buenos Aires (74% of total searches to Argentina). The next most popular destinations are Puerto Iguazú (10%) and San Carlos de Bariloche (10%). Searches for hotels in Mar del Plata (7%) are also popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular regions of Argentina?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular region to stay in Argentina is Capital Federal District. Buenos Aires and Cordoba are also very popular.\n\nHow much is a cheap hotel in Argentina?\nKAYAK users have found double rooms in Argentina for as cheap as $7 (Cordoba) in the last 3 days. The average price is $112.',0,'https://www.kayak.com/Argentina-Hotels.10.dc.html','Nguồn: KAYAK','2026-11-19 16:45:49','2026-11-19 17:13:23'),(18,'Australia','australia',9,NULL,'kayak_e090520bac789a7812b9c42b3fa65e09.jpg','Apart from going to the beach, what do visitors to Australia get up to?\nLet’s start with wine tasting and fine dining  – get to know the Hunter Valley, home to some of Australia’s most well-established vineyards. Book your accommodation through KAYAK and you can choose anything from a tree-top cabin in the Barington Tops Wilderness to a five-star hotel such as the Tonic Hotel in Rothbury – KAYAK has nearly 1,000 accommodation suggestions for the Hunter Valley region so there is something for everyone. Many of the picturesque towns have their own food and wine festivals to check dates before booking.\n\nIs Australia all about sport, beaches and being outdoors?\nNo, not at all. Australia is also home to wonderful art, opera, fashion and street culture. Think about spending time in Sydney, possibly by booking a stay at the Shangri-La Sydney through KAYAK. It is just five minutes’ walk from the Museum of Modern Art and its rooms offer spectacular views out over the harbour. Melbourne is sometimes called the cultural capital of Australia, thanks to its distinctive architecture, many theatres and festivals, stunning art galleries and vibrant café culture. Fraser Place Hotel is right in the heart of the theatre district and within walking distance of the central station.\n\nIs it possible to have a desert experience in Australia?\nAlthough visitors are not encouraged to drive off into the desert by themselves, there are many desert tours, usually in sturdy 4WD vehicles driven by experienced guides. Or for a real desert experience, how about booking a stay in quirky Coober Pedy through KAYAK? The famous Desert Cave Hotel with cool underground rooms and the quintessentially Ossie Mud Hut Motel are both bookable through KAYAK.\n\nWhat is the most popular destination in Australia?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular destination is Sydney (56% of total searches to Australia). The next most popular destinations are Melbourne (22%) and Brisbane (15%). Searches for hotels in Perth (8%) are also popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular regions of Australia?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular region to stay in Australia is New South Wales. Queensland and Victoria are also very popular.\n\nHow much is a cheap hotel in Australia?\nKAYAK users have found double rooms in Australia for as cheap as $19 (Perth) in the last 3 days. The average price is $206.',0,'https://www.kayak.com/Australia-Hotels.14.dc.html','Nguồn: KAYAK','2026-11-19 16:54:53','2026-11-19 17:13:27'),(19,'New Zealand','new-zealand',9,NULL,'kayak_1b0796ccf9a94d57b1eebe3a85fcfad4.jpg','Which is the best island to visit in New Zealand?\nNew Zealand is home to some of the most beautiful islands globally, and Waiheke Island is one place you should consider exploring when visiting New Zealand. The island is home to beautiful vineyards, with wine tours conducted all year round. Other than that, you’re welcome to relax on the secluded beaches with an array of outdoor activities available, including golf, sea kayaking, zip-lining, horse riding, and fishing. Consider choosing one of the island’s many great accommodation options: Waiheke Island Resort, Waiheke Waterfront Lodge, or Delamore Lodge.\n\nWhich city is a must-visit in New Zealand?\nAuckland, also known as the city of sails, is a must-see for most tourists visiting New Zealand. The city is bustling with activities, all of which you can view from Sky Tower, the city’s tallest building offering panoramic views of Auckland. Auckland Museum and Auckland Art Gallery are there for those who’d like to know more about the city’s history and culture. And for foodies, the city is exploding with bars and restaurants serving all kinds of food to tourists visiting. Considering a visit? Well, book a stay at Hilton Auckland to be right at the center of all the action.\n\nWhere should I visit for a spa weekend in New Zealand?\nFor anyone longing for a spa vacation, Rotorua is the place for you. The journey to Rotorua will take you through the beautiful and peaceful farmlands of Te Kuiti, a trip that is relaxing in itself. You’ll definitely smell when you’ve arrived in Rotorua, a town that sits on the Pacific Ring of Fire, giving rise to its geothermal spas that emit sulphur and attract visitors from all around the world. For the best experience, book a stay at Holiday Inn Rotorua for a relaxing stay at their onsite hot springs, with plenty of activities to keep everyone entertained.\n\nWhat is the most popular destination in New Zealand?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular destination is Auckland (49% of total searches to New Zealand). The next most popular destinations are Queenstown (28%) and Christchurch (14%). Searches for hotels in Rotorua (8%) are also popular.\n\nWhat are the most popular regions of New Zealand?\nBased on KAYAK hotel searches, the most popular region to stay in New Zealand is Auckland. Otago and Canterbury are also very popular.\n\nHow much is a cheap hotel in New Zealand?\nKAYAK users have found double rooms in New Zealand for as cheap as $12 (Auckland) in the last 3 days. The average price is $339.',0,'https://www.kayak.com/New-Zealand-Hotels.177.dc.html','Nguồn: KAYAK','2026-11-19 17:03:22','2026-11-19 17:13:32');
