d\",\"room was good\",\"great location\",\"hotel staff\",\"swimming pool\",\"good and the service\",\"breakfast buffet\",\"single bed\",\"high quality\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What can I expect from the hotel\'s breakfast?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have praised the great choice and quality of the breakfast at Hanoi Daewoo Hotel, making it a delightful start to the day.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the hotel suitable for business travelers?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel is well-suited for business travelers, with spacious rooms, a business center, and a convenient location for work-related activities.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the cleanliness of the hotel rooms?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have consistently mentioned the spacious and clean rooms at Hanoi Daewoo Hotel, providing a comfortable and tidy environment for their stay.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the parking options available at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers free parking, providing a convenient option for guests who are traveling by car.\"},{\"question\":\"When is the best time to visit the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The high season at Hanoi Daewoo Hotel is in May, offering a great opportunity to experience the hotel\'s amenities and nearby attractions at their best.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests recommended choosing a room with a view, especially those facing the lake, for a more enjoyable stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned noise disturbances, particularly from events and pool parties, so it may be beneficial to inquire about potential noise disruptions during your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Check Room Requests\",\"text\":\"Double-check room requests upon arrival to ensure they align with your preferences, as some guests experienced issues with room allocation.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"Take advantage of the hotel\'s proximity to attractions like the Vietnam Museum of Ethnology and Ho Chi Minh Museum, which are within a reasonable distance for exploration.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Outdated Facilities\",\"text\":\"While the hotel offers spacious rooms, some guests noted that certain facilities, such as the TV and bathroom amenities, were outdated and in need of refurbishment.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Transportation\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s location near two shopping malls is convenient, but guests advised caution when crossing the busy streets filled with motorcycles.\"},{\"title\":\"Inquire About Vegetarian/Vegan Options\",\"text\":\"If you have dietary preferences, consider inquiring about the availability of vegetarian and vegan choices for breakfast and other meals.\"},{\"title\":\"Address Noise Concerns\",\"text\":\"If sensitive to noise, consider requesting a room away from potential sources of disturbance, such as pool areas or event spaces, to ensure a peaceful stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Utilize Nearby Facilities\",\"text\":\"Take advantage of the hotel\'s proximity to RMIT University and nearby shopping malls for added convenience during your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Engage with Friendly Staff\",\"text\":\"Interact with the helpful and friendly staff, as many guests appreciated their assistance and hospitality during their stay.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:07:45\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00','2026-11-11 14:08:08'),(10,4,'Seashells Phu Quoc Hotel & Spa','seashells-phu-quoc-hotel-spa','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_01e0e6cd04844e706d10253c2c83a528.jpg','Spend the day relaxing on the beach or pampering yourself at Seashells Hotel and Spa Phu Quoc\'s full-service spa. \\nSeashells Hotel and Spa Phu Quoc offers 246 air-conditioned accommodations with minibars and safes. Rooms open to balconies. 32-inch LED televisions come with cable channels. Bathrooms include separate bathtubs and showers, bathrobes, slippers, and bidets. Guests can surf the web using the complimentary wireless Internet access. Business-friendly amenities include desks and phones. Additionally, rooms include complimentary bottled water and hair dryers. Housekeeping is provided daily. \\nAn outdoor pool and a children\'s pool are on site. Other recreational amenities include a fitness center.','1 Vo Thi Sau, Duong Dong','+84 297 730 0999',66,5,5509,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_01e0e6cd04844e706d10253c2c83a528.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_07211df38c1d612455e17701dea60289.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_cd9562850977413617c746144c28e140.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_aa78436322cd419a98b5731128964d6d.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_13c75bc5413f6f35f293244c80d73405.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d357ac87b26af3f306796d23aa95e276.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_035ed00db01a1e18206f424dc4589dc5.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_f65c74e63298be73b2fa4042aa254dbf.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_af2f234ea5b0b06a3185b9a6332eb223.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_78753669189214dc82f58c6418ab51e6.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_300a7f7b41d7db33bd1540c7b2db973f.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_8afa711427019d3570d49c6f07f233e7.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_0b635a51517bb099527994db9219b445.jpg\"]',NULL,'https://www.kayak.com/Phu-Quoc-Hotels-Seashells-Phu-Quoc-Hotel-Spa.3008708.ksp','[\"Electric kettle\",\"Wake-up service\",\"Entire unit wheelchair accessible\",\"Internet\",\"Daily housekeeping\",\"Family rooms\",\"Concierge service\",\"Cribs available\",\"Currency exchange on-site\",\"Fire extinguisher\",\"Laundry facilities\",\"Ironing service\",\"Laundry service\",\"Flat-screen TV\",\"Meeting/Banquet facilities\",\"Fold-up bed\",\"Free toiletries\",\"Room service\",\"Smoke alarms\",\"Tour desk\",\"Infinity pool\",\"Spa\",\"Interconnected room(s) available\",\"Child pool\",\"Outdoor pool\",\"Key access\",\"Key card access\",\"CCTV in common areas\",\"K