es, Seashells Phu Quoc Hotel & Spa offers free Wi-Fi.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Seashells Phu Quoc Hotel & Spa offer free parking?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Seashells Phu Quoc Hotel & Spa offers free parking.\"},{\"question\":\"How far is Seashells Phu Quoc Hotel & Spa from the airport?\",\"answer\":\"Seashells Phu Quoc Hotel & Spa is 4.6 miles from Phu Quoc Duong Dang. Seashells Phu Quoc Hotel & Spa is 33.2 miles from Krong Preah Sihanouk Sihanoukville.\"},{\"question\":\"How does KAYAK find such great Seashells Phu Quoc Hotel & Spa hotel deals?\",\"answer\":\"KAYAK scours the web for all room deals available at Seashells Phu Quoc Hotel & Spa in Phu Quoc and lets you compare them to find the best rate for your stay. Many different travel sites will offer discounts or deals at different times for rooms at Seashells Phu Quoc Hotel & Spa and KAYAK will provide you with prices from a huge range of travel sites. That means that you can always find a great deal for Seashells Phu Quoc Hotel & Spa.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Seashells Phu Quoc Hotel & Spa have a pool?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Seashells Phu Quoc Hotel & Spa has a pool onsite.\"}]','{\"score\":9,\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":5509,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":3878},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":893},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":305},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":191},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":83},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":72},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":88}],\"summary\":\"Guests consistently praised the hotel\'s excellent location, often mentioning proximity to the beach, night market, and city center. Many found the staff friendly and helpful, and several highlighted the quality and variety of the breakfast. The pool and overall cleanliness of the hotel were also frequently mentioned as positives. While there were some negative remarks about air conditioning, staff attitude, and breakfast variety, the overall impression from guests was very favorable, especially regarding location, service, and amenities.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":10},{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":8.5},{\"label\":\"Breakfast\",\"score\":8.5},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":8},{\"label\":\"Pool\",\"score\":8}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":9.2,\"reviews\":1166},{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.6,\"reviews\":772}],\"mentions\":[\"infinity pool\",\"friendly staff\",\"breakfast buffet\",\"great hotel\",\"great location\",\"room clean\",\"ocean view\",\"right on the beach\",\"night market\",\"food is excellent\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What dining options are available at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers several dining options, including Coral, which serves fresh seafood with panoramic views of the water, Anchor Bistro offering homemade Italian pasta and pizza, Seashells Lobby Lounge for beverages and light snacks, and Coconut Beach Lounge for guest refreshment options.\"},{\"question\":\"What amenities are available in the rooms?\",\"answer\":\"The rooms come with a flat-screen television with more than 69 channels, a minibar, and daily breakfast at Coral Restaurant. Guests also have access to complimentary high-speed wireless Internet access, tea and coffee, round trip transfer to the airport, and two daily mineral water bottles.\"},{\"question\":\"What can guests expect from the spa at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Sea Serenity Spa at the hotel offers 18 treatment rooms for relaxation, providing guests with a serene and rejuvenating experience during their stay.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the best times to visit the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The high season is in February, offering an ideal time to experience the hotel\'s beautiful location and amenities. However, the hotel is also a great choice during the low season in October.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the cleanliness of the hotel rooms and facilities?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel is described as beautiful and very clean, offering clean rooms with perfect ocean views, and a high standard of cleanliness and tidiness throughout the property.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Sea View Room\",\"text\":\"Consider booking a sea view room for a breathtaking view and a more serene atmosphere.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"Take advantage of the hotel\'s central location by visiting nearby attractions such as the Duong Dong Market, Blue Sea Spa, and Cao Dai Temple.\"},{\"title\":\"Enjoy the Infinity Pool\",\"text\":\"Make time to relax by the infinity pool with a pool bar, offering beautiful views and a warm, inviting atmosphere.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Club Room Benefits\",\"text\":\"If available, consider upgrading to a Club Room for additional perks such as daily alcohol and cocktails, floor butler service, and late checkout.\"},{\"title\":\"Dine at Coral Restaurant\",\"text\":\"Guests highly recommend dining at Coral Restaurant, which offers fresh seafood and panoramic views of the water.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of Complimentary Services\",\"text\":\"Utilize the hotel\'s complimentary services, including high-speed wireless Internet access, tea and coffee, and round trip transfer to the airport.\"},{\"title\":\"Visit the Sea Serenity Spa\",\"text\":\"Indulge in relaxation at the Sea Serenity Spa, which offers 18 treatment rooms and a range of rejuvenating services.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan Airport Transfers\",\"text\":\"Take advantage of the included airport transfer service for added convenience upon arrival and departure.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Vegetarian Options\",\"text\":\"If you have dietary preferences, consider requesting vegetarian items in advance to ensure a satisfying dining experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Sun Lounger Availability\",\"text\":\"Be aware that there may be limited sun loungers available, especially during peak times.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:07:48\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(11,4,'Premier Residences Phu Quoc Emerald Bay Managed by Accor','premier-