eat deal for Premier Residences Phu Quoc Emerald Bay Managed by Accor.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Premier Residences Phu Quoc Emerald Bay Managed by Accor have a pool?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Premier Residences Phu Quoc Emerald Bay Managed by Accor has a pool onsite.\"}]','{\"score\":8.3,\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":2235,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":1330},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":395},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":181},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":126},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":59},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":65},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":82}],\"summary\":\"Guests consistently praised the hotel\'s pool, describing it as large, well-maintained, and enjoyable for both adults and children. The location was also highlighted as a major positive, with easy access to the beach, local attractions, and convenient amenities. Many guests found the hotel suitable for families, with facilities like kids clubs and spacious rooms. However, there were recurring concerns about cleanliness, with some guests reporting issues with room maintenance and housekeeping. Service received mixed feedback, with some staff described as friendly and helpful, while others were seen as lacking professionalism. Bed comfort was mentioned but did not stand out as a strong positive or negative. Overall, the hotel is appreciated for its amenities and setting, but could improve in cleanliness and service consistency.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Pool\",\"score\":10},{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":9},{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":5},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":3.5}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":7.9,\"reviews\":446},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":8.8,\"reviews\":275}],\"mentions\":[\"pool and beach\",\"staff were very friendly\",\"breakfast was very good\",\"beautiful hotel\",\"bad service\",\"room was clean\",\"shuttle bus\",\"white sand\",\"phu quoc\",\"bit pricey\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What are the highlights of the hotel\'s amenities?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers a variety of amenities including a game room, cycling, cooking classes, a pool table, a fitness center, and a spa and wellness center.\"},{\"question\":\"Is there free parking available at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, the hotel provides free parking for guests.\"},{\"question\":\"What are guests saying about the food quality at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have mentioned that the breakfast is good with a nice variety, but some have expressed dissatisfaction with the Vietnamese food and the dinner options.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the cleanliness of the hotel rated by guests?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have generally found the hotel to be nice and clean, with spacious rooms and a very clean swimming pool.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the best time to visit the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The high season is in January, and the hotel is recommended for young kids with lots of activities, but it can be windy during the Christmas period.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Book a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the beach or pool comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Low Season Travel\",\"text\":\"If you prefer fewer crowds, consider visiting in June, which is considered the low season. This could provide a more peaceful and relaxing experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel is conveniently located near various attractions such as Suối Tranh Waterfall, Tranh Stream, and Phu Quoc Beach, making it an ideal base for exploring the area.\"},{\"title\":\"Family-Friendly Amenities\",\"text\":\"Families with children can take advantage of the hotel\'s kids\' club, child pool, and complimentary breakfast, which were highlighted as positive aspects by several guests.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Facilities\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the hotel\'s facilities, including the large swimming pool, spa, and fitness center. Consider incorporating these amenities into your stay for a more enjoyable experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Room Selection\",\"text\":\"Some guests reported issues with specific rooms, such as unpleasant odors. It may be beneficial to inquire about room location and potential odors before finalizing your booking.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Transportation Options\",\"text\":\"While the hotel offers airport transportation, it\'s important to note that this service may not be exclusively for hotel guests. Confirm the details and availability of this service before relying on it for transportation.\"},{\"title\":\"Diverse Dining Options\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers various dining options catering to different tastes, including local Vietnamese delicacies and international cuisine. Guests appreciated the quality of food and dining ambiance.\"},{\"title\":\"Addressing Service Concerns\",\"text\":\"While many guests praised the friendly staff, some mentioned service issues. It\'s advisable to communicate any concerns promptly to the hotel management for resolution.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for High Season Crowds\",\"text\":\"If you prefer a livelier atmosphere and are willing to navigate larger crowds, consider visiting in January, which is considered the high season.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:07:53\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(12,4,'Best Western Premier Sonasea Phu Quoc','best-western-premier-sonasea-phu-quoc','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_7ed708fd24a2d4367e8346475e957802.jpg','Phu Quoc is Vietnam’s Pearl Island, a tropical haven of golden sands and warm seas off the country’s southwest coast. Set along the shores of Long Beach, just eight kilometres from Phu Quoc International Airport, Best Western Premier Sonasea Phu Quoc is an upscale beachfront resort surrounded by lush tropical gardens and overlooking the sea.\\nThe resort offers 566 spacious rooms, suites, and villas, complemented by a 300-metre lagoon-style pool, spa, fitness centre, and kids’ club. Dining options include an all-day restaurant, a pool bar, and a rooftop sky bar, where sunset cocktails come with sweeping ocean views. Flexible meeting and event spaces also make the resort well suited to corporate retreats, incentive trips, and destination weddings.\\nBeyond the resort, more than half of Phu Quoc is protected within Phu Quoc National Park, part of the UNESCO Kien Giang Biosphere Reserve. Here, dense evergreen forests, rich ecosystems, and over 200 bird species offer rewarding hiking and nature experiences.\\nWhether for a family holiday, a romantic escape, or a special celebration, the resort provides a convenient and luxurious base on the island. On Long Beach, the soft golden sand begins right at the doorstep.','Duong Bao Hamlet Duong To Commune, Ward 5','+84 297 627 9999',69,4,2416,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_7ed708fd24a2d4367e8346475e957802.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_4ee28c6aa8e8dd70b638710424db1666.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_b43c3a2949327a76d00ceeceb322c932.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_98bcdf86a5c52a26ea4be610cbe6ab89.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_50d1138216e3e951520cca4377081b89.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_bbe4d63fa5cfefc86b01d7ecbc1232bd.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_81c2cb9687f5a4ab5e278ef4a93656e5.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_3fb98d61bed7a20073b49464e727645c.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_951dcc4c8af07bf7e7abc9062ee09698.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_2d32ec38b497f020b9f354c46e14d47d.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_2a1db2027e7d305e5e31409f26c9dfca.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_6cd4caa0ed1b525fb87d64e2df9cbab9.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_e173844c52c016a64291348044342f7b.jpg\"]',NULL,'https://www.kayak.com/Phu-Quoc-Hotels-Best-Western-Premier-Sona