32},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":79},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":52},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":61}],\"summary\":\"Most guests praised the hotel\'s excellent location, beautiful and spacious pool, and friendly, attentive staff. The hotel is close to attractions like night markets and the airport, making it convenient for travelers. Many reviewers also appreciated the value for money and the relaxing atmosphere. However, there were mixed opinions about breakfast, with some finding it average or crowded. Cleanliness and maintenance issues were noted by several guests, particularly regarding room hygiene and facilities. Overall, the positives of location, pool, and service stood out for most visitors.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":10},{\"label\":\"Pool\",\"score\":10},{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":9},{\"label\":\"Breakfast\",\"score\":5},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":3}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":8.8,\"reviews\":279},{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.2,\"reviews\":323}],\"mentions\":[\"private beach\",\"staff were friendly\",\"breakfast not good\",\"amazing hotel\",\"dirty pool\",\"hotel restaurant\",\"bad service\",\"sky bar\",\"beautiful location\",\"food options\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What can I expect from the hotel\'s breakfast?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers a wide variety of international cuisine for breakfast, making it a delightful experience. However, it can get crowded during peak times.\"},{\"question\":\"Are there any concerns about the cleanliness of the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Some guests have mentioned concerns about the cleanliness, such as mold in the showers and rooms not being cleaned properly daily. However, many guests have also praised the hotel for being very clean and nice.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the highlights of the hotel\'s amenities?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel boasts beautiful pools, a private beach, and a fantastic breakfast. Additionally, the spacious and sprawling layout, along with the fire show and the sky bar, are highly appreciated by guests.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the hotel\'s customer service?\",\"answer\":\"While some guests have expressed dissatisfaction with the service, many others have praised the staff for being very friendly and accommodating. The staff\'s dedication to excellence has been noted and appreciated by numerous guests.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the hotel suitable for families?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel is great for families, offering a big Asian influence, a nice and warm big pool, and a kid\'s club that provides some child-free time for parents. However, some guests have mentioned that the hotel has an \'all-inclusive\' vibe and can be busy at times.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the beach or pool comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Low Season Travel\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s low season is in October, which could be a great time to visit for those looking to avoid crowds and potentially get better deals.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s proximity to the Sonasea Night Market provides convenient access to local eateries and entertainment options, making it a great place to explore during the evenings.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"Some guests noted that noise from the hallways and neighboring rooms could be disruptive. Consider requesting a room in a quieter area of the hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Check Room Amenities\",\"text\":\"Some guests found that the kitchenettes in certain rooms were not fully stocked with kitchen supplies. If planning to use the kitchenette, it may be helpful to inquire about the availability of necessary utensils and cookware.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan for Crowded Breakfasts\",\"text\":\"During peak periods, the dining room may become crowded, leading to a less than ideal breakfast experience. Guests may want to consider arriving early to avoid the rush.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Night Market\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the hotel\'s proximity to the Sonasea Night Market, which offers a variety of dining and shopping options. It\'s a convenient place to explore for a change of scenery.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Transportation Options\",\"text\":\"While the hotel offers an airport shuttle, guests noted that the location is a bit far from the town. Planning for transportation to and from the town center may be beneficial for those interested in exploring beyond the immediate vicinity.\"},{\"title\":\"Family-Friendly Features\",\"text\":\"Families with children may appreciate the hotel\'s kids\' club, child pool, and swimming pool toys, providing entertainment options for younger guests.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned that the hotel\'s rooftop bar and pool area could be noisy, particularly in the evenings. Light sleepers may want to consider this when selecting a room location.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:07:57\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(13,4,'Vinholidays Fiesta Phu Quoc','vinholidays-fiesta-phu-quoc','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_03711f3a704d5981fe46aaa18803772b.jpg','Along with an outdoor pool, this smoke-free hotel has a restaurant and a fitness center. Free WiFi in public areas and free self parking are also provided. Other amenities include a bar\\/lounge, a snack bar\\/deli, and a children\'s pool. \\nVinholidays Fiesta Phu Quoc offers 687 air-conditioned accommodations with minibars and safes. This Phu Quoc hotel provides complimentary wireless Internet access. Bathrooms include bidets, hair dryers, and toothbrushes and toothpaste. Additionally, rooms include complimentary bottled water and blackout drapes\\/curtains. Housekeeping is provided daily. \\nAn outdoor pool and a children\'s pool are on site. Other recreational amenities inclu