nown for being friendly, helpful, and efficient. They provide superb facilities and clean rooms, and the food is highly praised by many guests.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the best times to visit the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel is recommended for a visit during the high season in December, offering a quiet location right on a lovely beach with a great pool. The breakfasts are delicious with lots of different options, and the staff is accommodating and friendly.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the quality of the beds at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The rooms are equipped with comfortable beds, and guests have praised the spacious and clean accommodations, making for a relaxing and enjoyable stay.\"},{\"question\":\"Is parking available at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel provides free public parking on site and offers a free airport shuttle service for its guests, ensuring convenience and ease of access for visitors.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Book a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the beach or sea comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"Take advantage of the hotel\'s proximity to attractions like Phu Quoc Beach, Suối Tranh Waterfall, and Vietnam Explorer Dive Center, all within a short drive.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Transportation Options\",\"text\":\"While the hotel offers a free airport shuttle, some guests found it convenient to use ride-hailing services like Grab for quick and affordable transportation around the island.\"},{\"title\":\"Enjoy the Pool and Beach\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the large swimming pool and beautiful beach. Arriving early to secure a comfortable beach lounge chair was suggested, as some chairs come with mattresses for added comfort.\"},{\"title\":\"Dine at the On-Site Restaurants\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers a variety of dining options, including international buffets, Spanish cuisine, and gourmet snacks. Guests recommended trying the breakfast spread and the burger at the Shack restaurant.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of Free Activities\",\"text\":\"The hotel provides free activities such as morning yoga, aqua exercise, swimming lessons, and fitness classes, adding value to the guest experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Room Selection\",\"text\":\"Some guests recommended requesting rooms with pool access for convenience, while others advised being cautious about potential issues with older room doors and bathroom blinds.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Prepared for Mosquitoes\",\"text\":\"Some guests suggested bringing mosquito deterrents, as a few experienced discomfort due to mosquitoes during their stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Alternative Dining Options\",\"text\":\"While the hotel offers dining choices, some guests found nearby restaurants to offer better quality and value for money, especially for food portions.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for All-Inclusive Package Details\",\"text\":\"If considering the all-inclusive package, guests advised checking the available drink options and prices to ensure it aligns with expectations.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:08:26\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(20,4,'Wyndham Garden Grandworld Phu Quoc','wyndham-garden-grandworld-phu-quoc','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_e671b67885e2e90eb4a786e4b1d29df5.jpg','Thank you for choosing our Wyndham Garden Grandworld Phu Quoc hotel.','Bai Dai Area, Ganh Dau Ward','+84 297 361 2999',45,4,1384,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_e671b67885e2e90eb4a786e4b1d29df5.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_508849e48108a233129ba6ab35af8457.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_758cf4d62f14522c655697adc2c7aac5.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d59f911f6704df65911ae4198282b5f3.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_3e6f293c545b864000150d2e8a90f55a.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_ce3592687cda510a11f8a5d6f