 helpful service, clean and spacious rooms, varied and tasty breakfast, excellent pool and beach facilities, and convenient location near attractions. Some negative feedback was noted regarding occasional maintenance issues, buffet variety, and early bar closing times, but the positives were frequently highlighted.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":9},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":8.5},{\"label\":\"Breakfast\",\"score\":8},{\"label\":\"Pool\",\"score\":8},{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":7.5}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":8.7,\"reviews\":413},{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.3,\"reviews\":326}],\"mentions\":[\"hotel good\",\"hotel staff\",\"room is nice\",\"water park\",\"nice beach\",\"swimming pool\",\"good service\",\"crowded\",\"butlins holiday\",\"low quality\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What are the dining options available at Vinoasis Phu Quoc?\",\"answer\":\"Vinoasis Phu Quoc offers six restaurants on site, each with a range of international cuisines. Guests can choose from Topaz Italiano for Italian meals, Bow Thai for Thai cuisine, Ozone Seafood for excellent seafood options, Chingu BBQ for Korean grill dishes, the Chinese Restaurant for classic Chinese cuisine, or Nautilus Restaurant for a buffet-style meal.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the hotel\'s wellness and recreational facilities?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel features two swimming pools, a fitness center, steam room, spa and beauty services, hot tub, sauna, kids’ pool, and a private beach area. Other activities include regular live music and performances, a kids’ club, bicycle hire services, karaoke nights, a casino, and a golf course located about 3 km from the hotel.\"},{\"question\":\"What are some popular nearby attractions close to the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Popular attractions near the hotel include the Corona Casino, Fish Sauce Factory, Coco Dive Centre, Phu Quoc Night Market, and Su Muon Pagoda, all within a reasonable distance from the property.\"},{\"question\":\"What can guests expect from the hotel\'s customer service?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel provides multilingual staff, 24-hour reception, daily housekeeping, and offers additional services such as babysitting and childcare arrangements. The staff is known for being kind and helpful.\"},{\"question\":\"What are some common concerns about the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Some guests have mentioned concerns about the quality of breakfast and dishes, as well as issues with cleanliness and construction work. Additionally, there have been comments about language barriers and limited dining options.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Book a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the ocean comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Family-Friendly Hotel\",\"text\":\"The hotel is ideal for families, offering a kids\' club, a kids\' pool, and complimentary Vinpearl Land and Safari tickets with some room options.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Water Park\",\"text\":\"Guests have unlimited access to the adventure-filled water park located on the hotel\'s site, making it a great entertainment option for families.\"},{\"title\":\"Diverse Dining Options\",\"text\":\"With six restaurants on-site offering a range of international cuisines, guests can enjoy a variety of dining experiences without leaving the hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Wellness Activities\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers a range of wellness activities, including a fitness center, spa services, and a sauna, providing ample opportunities for relaxation and rejuvenation.\"},{\"title\":\"Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s proximity to popular attractions such as the Corona Casino, Fish Sauce Factory, and Phu Quoc Night Market makes it convenient for guests to explore the area.\"},{\"title\":\"Multilingual Staff\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s reception is open 24/7, and the multilingual staff, fluent in English and Vietnamese, received praise for their helpfulness and courtesy.\"},{\"title\":\"Arrange for Babysitting Services\",\"text\":\"Guests can arrange babysitting and childcare services through the front desk, allowing parents to enjoy some leisure time knowing their children are in good hands.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Transportation Needs\",\"text\":\"While the hotel offers a free return airport shuttle bus, guests noted that the hotel is quite large, and some areas may require transportation, so it\'s advisable to plan for this.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Construction\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned construction noise and inconvenience due to ongoing projects near the hotel, so it\'s worth considering this factor when booking.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:08:36\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(23,4,'Avs Hotel Phu Quoc','avs-hotel-phu-quoc','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_2399e919b19b4cfd485e658c809d1d1e.jpg','A full-service spa, an outdoor pool, and a restaurant are available at this hotel. Free buffet breakfast, free WiFi in public areas, and a free airport shuttle are also provided. Additionally, a bar\\/lounge, a poolside bar, and a snack bar\\/deli are onsite. \\nAVS Hotel Phu Quoc offers 100 accommodations, which are accessible via exterior corridors and feature minibars and laptop-compatible safes. Each accommodation is individually furnished and decorated. 43-inch Smart televisions come with cable channels. Bathrooms include bathtubs or showers with rainfall showerheads, bathrobes, slippers, and bidets. Guests can surf the web using the complimentary wireless Internet access. Business-friendly amenities include desks and phones. Additionally, rooms include complimentary bottled water and hair dryers. Housekeeping is offered daily and irons\\/ironing boards can be requested. \\nRecreational amenities at the hotel include an outdoor pool.','100C/2 Tran Hung Dao, Quarter 7','+84 297 397 7778',41,5,971,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_2399e9