.5,\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":956,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":352},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":162},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":117},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":111},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":65},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":61},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":88}],\"summary\":\"Guests consistently praised the hotel\'s convenient location near the beach and markets, as well as the friendly and attentive staff. Many found the rooms to be spacious and comfortable, making it a good choice for families and groups. However, several reviews highlighted issues with cleanliness and maintenance, particularly in older rooms and public areas. Breakfast quality and management received criticism, with some guests disappointed by limited variety and poor organization during busy times. Despite these drawbacks, the overall experience was positive for many, especially due to the helpful service and large rooms.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":9},{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":8.5},{\"label\":\"Room Size\",\"score\":8.5},{\"label\":\"Breakfast\",\"score\":4},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":3.5}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":7.8,\"reviews\":186},{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":7,\"reviews\":132}],\"mentions\":[\"good hotel\",\"hotel staff\",\"nice pool\",\"good breakfast\",\"room with a great\",\"near the beach\",\"room service\",\"food the location\",\"building site\",\"shuttle bus\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What are the hotel\'s unique amenities?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers a variety of amenities including a private beach, a spa, a game room, a kids\' club, and a pool with a view.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the hotel suitable for families with kids?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, the hotel is family-friendly with amenities such as a child pool, kids\' club, and kids\' outdoor play equipment. Additionally, the complimentary breakfast and swimming pool toys make it a great choice for families.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the best times to visit the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The high season is in April, offering a great time to visit. However, the hotel is also recommended for a peaceful and quiet stay during the low season in May.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the cleanliness of the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel maintains cleanliness with clean rooms, tidy facilities, and a refreshing lobby. However, some guests have mentioned issues with stained carpets and a moldy smell in the rooms.\"},{\"question\":\"What can guests expect from the hotel\'s customer service?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel staff are friendly, courteous, and professional, providing attentive service. However, some guests have expressed concerns about the level of customer service, particularly in terms of staff knowledge and responsiveness.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Book a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the sea or pool comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Low Season for Better Rates\",\"text\":\"Visiting during the low season, particularly in May, may offer lower room rates and fewer crowds, providing a more relaxed experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel is close to various attractions, such as Phu Quoc Beach, Suối Tranh Waterfall, and Tranh Stream, making it convenient for guests to explore the area.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"Some guests reported issues with noise, so it may be beneficial to request a room away from potential sources of disturbance, especially if noise sensitivity is a concern.\"},{\"title\":\"Check Room Amenities\",\"text\":\"Prioritize rooms with well-maintained amenities, as some guests reported issues such as inoperable safes, non-functional mini-fridges, and stained carpets.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Transportation Options\",\"text\":\"While the hotel offers a free airport shuttle, guests noted that the hotel\'s location may require additional transportation expenses to visit tourist attractions. It may be worth exploring alternative transportation options for cost-effectiveness.\"},{\"title\":\"Verify Dining Options\",\"text\":\"Some guests expressed dissatisfaction with the dining experience, citing limited food choices, long wait times, and cold or incorrect orders. Guests may want to explore dining options outside the hotel for greater variety.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan for Off-Site Activities\",\"text\":\"As the hotel offers activities like karaoke, bicycle rental, and a game room, guests can plan for off-site activities to complement their stay and enhance their overall experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Aware of Beach Conditions\",\"text\":\"While the hotel is near the beach, some guests mentioned cleanliness issues and the need to walk a distance to reach it. Guests may want to manage expectations regarding the beach experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Seek Assistance from Friendly Staff\",\"text\":\"Many guests praised the helpful and friendly staff, particularly mentioning individuals by name. Seeking assistance from staff members like Turen, Ms. Thao, and Mr. Giau may enhance the overall guest experience.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:08:44\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(25,4,'M Hotel Phu Quoc','m-hotel-phu-quoc','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_c2150da94da73411e2062488fb352ec8.jpg','An outdoor pool, a restaurant, and a fitness center are available at this hotel. Free WiFi in public areas and a free airport shuttle are also provided. Other amenities include a bar\\/lounge, a snack bar\\/deli, and coffee\\/tea in a common area. \\nM Hotel Phu Quoc offers 21 accommodations with minibars and safes. Each accommodation is individually furnished. Pillowtop beds feature premium bedding. 55-inch flat-screen televisions come with premium cable channels. Bathrooms include bathrobes, slippers, complimentary toiletries, and hair dryers. Guests can surf the w