fers a chic bar and an in-house restaurant, including a 24-hour deli and Nouvo. Guests can enjoy delicious food and a variety of dining options.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the hotel environmentally responsible?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, the hotel is environmentally responsible, providing an oasis in the city with a sense of responsibility towards the environment.\"},{\"question\":\"What are guests saying about the hotel\'s cleanliness and staff?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have praised the cleanliness of the rooms, the welcoming staff, and the excellent breakfast. The staff are described as extremely friendly and helpful.\"},{\"question\":\"What practical amenities does the hotel offer for guests\' convenience?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel provides free private parking, a 24-hour business center, a sun deck, a shuttle service to the city center, and a 24-hour front desk for guests\' convenience.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with a Garden View\",\"text\":\"Some guests recommended choosing a room with a garden view for a more private and serene experience, as the pool is located near the restaurant terrace.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Late Night or Early Morning Stays\",\"text\":\"Several guests highlighted the hotel\'s suitability for late-night arrivals or early morning departures from Cape Town International Airport, making it a convenient choice for such travel schedules.\"},{\"title\":\"Verify Room Configuration Upon Arrival\",\"text\":\"It\'s advisable to double-check the room configuration upon arrival, especially if specific arrangements like twin beds were requested, to ensure a comfortable stay from the outset.\"},{\"title\":\"Check the Efficiency of Room Services\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned that the quality of room services, particularly with food, did not meet the standards set by other aspects of the hotel, suggesting that guests may want to consider this when planning their stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore the Eco-Friendly Features\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the hotel\'s environmentally responsible approach and its beautiful gardens, making it an attractive choice for those who value sustainability and natural surroundings.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Free Shuttle Service\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers a free shuttle service to and from the airport, which guests found to be convenient and reliable, especially for late-night or early morning flights.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider the Proximity to Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s location close to the airport and its free shuttle service make it a convenient base for accessing tours to various attractions, such as Aquila day safari, Table Mountain, and city tours.\"},{\"title\":\"Enjoy the Natural Pool\",\"text\":\"Guests praised the natural pool and the lovely staff, making it a favorite sanctuary in Cape Town, suggesting that visitors take advantage of this unique feature during their stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Verify Room Amenities\",\"text\":\"Some guests experienced issues with room amenities such as water and milk, so it may be beneficial to ensure that these essentials are in good condition upon arrival.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan for Early Morning Departures\",\"text\":\"For those with early morning flights, the hotel\'s proximity to the airport, free shuttle service, and availability of breakfast from 4 am make it a convenient and comfortable choice for such travel plans.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:09:09\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(32,11,'Kenzi Club Agdal Medina','kenzi-club-agdal-medina','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_8025ba6d27a203af9dcb4de80730bb72.jpg','Nestling in the shade of the silver olive tree groves, overlooking the breath taking Atlas Mountains, the KENZI CLUB AGDAL MEDINA is encrusted like a precious jewel in a ten hectors setting, to combine a full range of leisure activities with the best in contemporary design, with the prestigious KENZI CLUB AGDAL MEDINA.','4000 Avenue Mohamed VI Zone de Touristique de l\'Agdal Marr