ool onsite.\"}]','{\"score\":8.2,\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":2437,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":1102},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":501},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":374},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":157},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":134},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":55},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":114}],\"summary\":\"Guests consistently highlight the hotel\'s friendly and helpful staff, beautiful city views, and overall cleanliness. The location is appreciated for its scenery, though some mention safety concerns in the surrounding area. Rooms are generally described as comfortable, with positive remarks about bed comfort and a peaceful atmosphere. Some guests note minor issues with room size, bathroom functionality, and noise, but these do not overshadow the positive experiences. Safety and tranquility are also frequently mentioned as strong points.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":9},{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":8.5},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":8},{\"label\":\"Bed Comfort\",\"score\":7},{\"label\":\"Safety\",\"score\":7}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.1,\"reviews\":1704},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":8.6,\"reviews\":193}],\"mentions\":[\"staff was very friendly\",\"city view\",\"room was comfortable\",\"everything was perfect\",\"parking space\",\"hot water\",\"bed was comfortable\",\"nothing not to like\",\"little bit\",\"bathroom is small\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What can I expect from the food quality at Signal Hill Lodge?\",\"answer\":\"The breakfast is delicious, and there are special diet menus available upon request. However, some guests have mentioned that the sausages were undercooked and the coffee was lukewarm.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the cleanliness at Signal Hill Lodge?\",\"answer\":\"The lodge is very clean, and the staff is attentive to maintaining a clean environment. However, some guests have mentioned a smell coming from an adjacent storeroom and that the bathrooms smelled of human waste.\"},{\"question\":\"Are the beds comfortable at Signal Hill Lodge?\",\"answer\":\"The beds are very comfortable, and the rooms have everything you would need for a comfortable stay. However, some guests have mentioned that the noise between rooms and the tiny bathrooms were a downside.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the parking options at Signal Hill Lodge?\",\"answer\":\"There is free parking available, but some guests have mentioned that there is not enough parking on the premises, making it difficult to get in and out.\"},{\"question\":\"When is the best time to visit Signal Hill Lodge?\",\"answer\":\"The high season is in April, and the low season is in August. However, it\'s important to note that the lodge operates with \'dynamic pricing,\' which means the price varies by demand.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Book a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the fountain comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Low Season Travel\",\"text\":\"August is mentioned as the low season, which could be a good time to visit for those looking to avoid crowds and potentially get better rates.\"},{\"title\":\"Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel is within walking distance of Long Street, St. George\'s Cathedral, Company Gardens, and Greenmarket Square, making it convenient for exploring these attractions.\"},{\"title\":\"Parking Consideration\",\"text\":\"Several guests noted limited parking on the premises, so it\'s advisable to inquire about parking availability and alternatives in advance.\"},{\"title\":\"Room Size and Layout\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned that the rooms and facilities were smaller than expected for a 4-star hotel, particularly the bathrooms. It may be worth considering this aspect when booking.\"},{\"title\":\"Breakfast Experience\",\"text\":\"While some guests enjoyed the breakfast, others found it limited and not as expected. It might be helpful to set appropriate expectations for the breakfast offering.\"},{\"title\":\"Staff Friendliness\",\"text\":\"Many guests praised the friendly and helpful staff, citing specific individuals for their exceptional service. It\'s worth acknowledging and appreciating the staff during your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Accessibility Note\",\"text\":\"The hotel is mentioned to have increased accessibility, which could be beneficial for guests with specific mobility needs.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned noise from the kitchen and the elevator, so light sleepers may want to take this into account when choosing a room.\"},{\"title\":\"Currency Exchange Service\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers currency exchange on-site, which could be convenient for international travelers.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:09:31\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(38,11,'Kenzi Menara Palace & Resort','kenzi-menara-palace-resort','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_cca9883e22e0fb39f464db5e19cd1286.jpg','The KENZI MENARA PALACE is a priceless jewel set in the crown of the privileged and World Class location: the ochre, legendary resort of Marrakesh, located right opposite the original ramparts, ancient walls which surrounded this unique, timeless oasis, whilst facing the splendid, manicured lawns, greenery and citrus groves of the Agdal Royal Gardens, shaded in the dappled sunlight, a joy to behold.The kenzi Menara Palace offers mineral water, tea and coffee in the room','Av. Mohamed VI, Zone Agdal','+212 524 459 900',14,4,4305,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_cca9883e22e0fb39f464db5e19cd1286.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_ff33836e1eab3f3d7133331db90de503.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d28985fe536c07ecf4087be71faaa6e6.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_5055b04a5757cf6a698c89c21a168ff3.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_f921e1383476a196f746d