ce & Resort?\",\"answer\":\"Check-in time is 3:00 PM and check-out time is 12:00 PM at Kenzi Menara Palace & Resort.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Kenzi Menara Palace & Resort offer free Wi-Fi?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Kenzi Menara Palace & Resort offers free Wi-Fi.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Kenzi Menara Palace & Resort offer free parking?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Kenzi Menara Palace & Resort offers free parking.\"},{\"question\":\"How far is Kenzi Menara Palace & Resort from the airport?\",\"answer\":\"Kenzi Menara Palace & Resort is 3.2 miles from Marrakech Menara. Kenzi Menara Palace & Resort is 78.1 miles from Ouarzazate.\"},{\"question\":\"How does KAYAK find such great Kenzi Menara Palace & Resort hotel deals?\",\"answer\":\"KAYAK scours the web for all room deals available at Kenzi Menara Palace & Resort in Marrakech and lets you compare them to find the best rate for your stay. Many different travel sites will offer discounts or deals at different times for rooms at Kenzi Menara Palace & Resort and KAYAK will provide you with prices from a huge range of travel sites. That means that you can always find a great deal for Kenzi Menara Palace & Resort.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Kenzi Menara Palace & Resort have a pool?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Kenzi Menara Palace & Resort has a pool onsite.\"}]','{\"score\":8.1,\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":4305,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":2361},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":686},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":468},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":266},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":216},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":112},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":196}],\"summary\":\"Most guests appreciated the friendly and attentive service, highlighting staff professionalism and helpfulness. The pool area is frequently mentioned as clean and enjoyable, and the breakfast is described as varied and tasty. Cleanliness is generally praised, especially in rooms and common areas, though a few guests noted areas for improvement. The location is considered convenient by several reviewers. While there are some complaints about noise, maintenance, and food variety, the overall impression is positive, with many guests expressing a desire to return.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":9.5},{\"label\":\"Pool\",\"score\":9},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":8.5},{\"label\":\"Breakfast\",\"score\":8.5},{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":8}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.1,\"reviews\":1186},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":9,\"reviews\":11},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":7.7,\"reviews\":1}],\"mentions\":[\"staff very friendly\",\"swimming pool\",\"nice hotel\",\"food wasn\'t good\",\"room service\",\"breakfast\",\"free shuttle\",\"last day\",\"restaurant not very good\",\"five star\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What are the highlights of the hotel\'s amenities?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel boasts a stunning view and hotel staff\'s attentive service enhances the experience, ensuring a seamless stay. The on-site dining offers a delightful journey through Moroccan cuisine, while the immaculate cleanliness of the premises adds to the overall sense of luxury. With the captivating view, delectable food, and impeccable cleanliness, Kenzi Menara Palace promises a truly unforgettable retreat in the heart of Morocco.\"},{\"question\":\"What can guests expect from the hotel\'s outdoor facilities?\",\"answer\":\"This contemporary hotel provides free Wi-Fi, outdoor tennis courts, and a free shuttle service. It offers a Turkish steam bath and 24-hour room service, as well as a badminton court. The hotel also features a heated pool, spa, indoor pool, outdoor pool, plunge pool, pool with a view, steam room, spa and wellness center, massage, sauna, and an indoor play area for kids.\"},{\"question\":\"What practical services are available at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers a business center, wake-up service, car rental, concierge service, entertainment staff, currency exchange on-site, hammam (Turkish bath), meeting/banquet facilities, room service, tour desk, key card access, express check-out, 24hr front desk, wedding services, ticket service, safety deposit box, and complimentary breakfast for families.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the common concerns about the hotel\'s services?\",\"answer\":\"Some guests have expressed concerns about the maintenance of the rooms, the hardness of the pillows, and the quality of the evening meals. Additionally, there have been comments about the complicated payment system on checkout and the loud music at the pool.\"},{\"question\":\"When is the best time to visit the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The low season is in February, while the high season is in December. It\'s important to note that the hotel may be quieter during the low season, which could impact the atmosphere and availability of certain services and facilities.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Book a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the fountain comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider All-Inclusive Option\",\"text\":\"Guests found the all-inclusive option worthwhile, allowing them to indulge in the hotel\'s facilities and services without worrying about additional costs.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s proximity to attractions like Agdal Gardens and Saadian Tombs makes it convenient for guests to explore the cultural and historical sites of Marrakech.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Room Amenities\",\"text\":\"Some guests experienced issues such as slow Wi-Fi and limited TV channels. It\'s advisable to inquire about these amenities before booking, especially if they are essential to your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Free Shuttle\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers a free shuttle service, which guests found convenient for traveling to Jemaa el-Fna Square. It\'s a great way to explore the city without the hassle of arranging transportation.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Off-Peak Season\",\"text\":\"Some guests noted that the hotel was quieter during off-peak seasons, which may be preferable for those seeking a more tranquil experience. However, it\'s important to note that certain facilities and services may have limited availability during this time.\"},{\"title\":\"Engage with Guest Relations\",\"text\":\"Guests highlighted the exceptional service provided by the guest relations manager, particularly in addressing concerns and ensuring a memorable stay. Engaging with the guest relations team could enhance the overall experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Additional Costs\",\"text\":\"Some guests found certain services, such as bar meals and spa access, to have additional charges. It\'s advisable to inquire about any extra costs associated with specific amenities or activities.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan Your Dining Options\",\"text\":\"While the hotel offers various dining choices, some guests found the buffet prices to be relatively high. It\'s recommended to explore alternative dining options in the area for more budget-friendly meals.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Transportation Needs\",\"text\":\"As the hotel is a short drive from the main center, guests recommended planning transportation, especially if intending to explore the city frequently. Additionally, some guests found limited taxi availability in the immediate vicinity, so it\'s advisable to plan transportation in advance.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:09:34\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(39,12,'DoubleTree by Hilton Cape Town - Upper Eastside','doubletree-by-hilton-cape-town-upper-eastside','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_3cbfb46b4b660ff095bdb9d6779cc3fb.jpg','Discover Cape Town from DoubleTree by Hilton Hotel Cape Town - Upper Eastside. Enjoy the perfect location, just 10 minutes from the vibrant heart of Cape Town, and the V&A Waterfront and 15 minutes from Cape Town International Airport. From museums to natural wonders, wineries to fine dining options and adventurous sporting activities, Cape Town is a tourist\'s haven. We\'ll greet you to our hotel with a freshly baked chocolate chip cookie on arrival.\\nCombining style with convenience, our rooms offer an array of choice amenities to help you relax and stay productive. Settle in to your elegant guest room with WiFi, a sumptuous bed and indulgent bathroom amenities. Step up to a one-bedroom suite for more space or choose an exclusive executive room for access to the Executive Lounge, serving complimentary continental breakfast.\\nWorkout in the modern fitness center at this Cape Town DoubleTree hotel. With years of experience across South Africa and Europe, our Executive Chef has created a menu of fusion dishes and traditional favorites. Sip cocktails in the sophisticated bar which combines a cozy lounge with a library area and plenty of space for casual meetings. With nine versatile event spaces, A\\/V equipment, superb catering options and a dedicated events team, DoubleTree by Hilton Hotel in Cape Town offers the perfect venue for meetings and celebrations for up to 350 guests.','31 Brickfield Road','+27 214 040 570',80,4,1320,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_3cbfb46b4b660ff095bdb9d6779cc3fb.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_4233f916b86e3630f4506e8fe9d6767b.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_eda13141134565092652226f0a566217.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_3fec7d84c73c66b60e43b586e726b2ae.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_99d86572941868fa1531bda4b4557763.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_98ecc5917a3ad1dbab444de78d0ab176.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_1fa18e915c04063bba0c8642ea1ec730.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_74e1314d64efc1f28bdf06e4f5e4f373.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_aab99ebf4fb2f82dead4e6f1ab9d2dce.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_fde123e767a1d8