nt\":90},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":59},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":30},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":35}],\"summary\":\"Overall, guests appreciated the friendly and helpful staff, clean and comfortable rooms, and good breakfast options. Many found the hotel modern and well-maintained, with some highlighting the spaciousness of the rooms. However, several guests experienced issues with service, particularly at breakfast and with booking management, and some noted inconsistent cleanliness and a less-than-ideal location. Despite these drawbacks, the positive experiences with staff and room comfort were frequently mentioned.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":10},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":9.5},{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":2}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.2,\"reviews\":975},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":8.5,\"reviews\":19},{\"name\":\"Priceline\",\"score\":8,\"reviews\":3},{\"name\":\"HotelsCombined\",\"score\":8.9,\"reviews\":1},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":7.8,\"reviews\":4}],\"mentions\":[\"staff were friendly\",\"breakfast was very good\",\"parking should be free\",\"room service\",\"great food\",\"good value for money\",\"shuttle service\",\"room was clean\",\"chip cookies\",\"room clean\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"How is the cleanliness of the rooms and common areas?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have consistently praised the cleanliness of the rooms and common areas, highlighting the neat and well-decorated rooms, clean amenities, and exceptional housekeeping service.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the pros and cons of the hotel\'s food quality?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have enjoyed the excellent breakfast, great service, and vegan options available. However, some have mentioned that the breakfast buffet was small and didn\'t offer many choices.\"},{\"question\":\"Is parking readily available at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"While some guests have mentioned having to pay for parking, others have appreciated the parking availability and quietness of the area.\"},{\"question\":\"How are the beds and linen at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have consistently praised the comfortable beds, clean and fresh linen, and spacious rooms, providing a comfortable stay.\"},{\"question\":\"What can guests expect from the hotel\'s customer service?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have highlighted the extremely friendly and helpful staff, outstanding reception and housekeeping, and exceptional service. However, some have mentioned issues with the service in the morning at breakfast and unhelpful staff at times.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Some guests recommended requesting a room with a view, particularly of Table Mountain, for a more enjoyable stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Bringing Your Own Toiletries\",\"text\":\"A few guests mentioned that the provided toiletries were near empty or not refilled, so it might be helpful to bring your own.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of the Location\",\"text\":\"Several guests noted that the hotel\'s location is a bit far from the city center, so consider this when planning your activities and transportation.\"},{\"title\":\"Check the Room Amenities\",\"text\":\"Some guests experienced issues with room amenities such as hot water, air conditioning, and fridge functionality, so it\'s advisable to check these upon arrival.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Aware of Additional Costs\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned extra charges for parking and breakfast, so it\'s recommended to clarify these details before booking or upon check-in.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"A few guests reported noise disturbances, particularly loud music in the evening, so it may be helpful to inquire about this when selecting a room.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel is close to various attractions such as the Old Biscuit Mill, Castle of Good Hope, and District Six Museum, making it convenient for sightseeing.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Shuttle Service\",\"text\":\"As the hotel provides a shuttle service to the city center, guests may find this convenient for exploring without the hassle of driving or finding parking.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Vegan Options\",\"text\":\"If you have dietary preferences, it\'s advisable to inquire about the availability of vegan options at the hotel\'s restaurant to ensure a satisfying dining experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Bringing Earplugs\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned noise-related issues, so packing earplugs may be beneficial for light sleepers.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:09:38\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(40,11,'La Mamounia','la-mamounia','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_5a03bdfc11d7b217832b099d8ea7f509.jpg','Along with 6 restaurants, this hotel has a full-service spa and an indoor pool. Free WiFi in public areas and free valet parking are also provided. Additionally, an outdoor pool, 4 bars\\/lounges, and a fitness center are onsite. \\nLa Mamounia offers 209 accommodations with minibars and safes. Each accommodation is individually furnished and decorated. Beds feature premium bedding. Satellite television is provided. Bathrooms include separate bathtubs and showers with deep soaking bathtubs, bathrobes, designer toiletries, and bidets. Guests can surf the web using the complimentary wired and wireless Internet access. Business-friendly amenities include desks and phones. Additionally, rooms include hair dryers and complimentary toiletries. A nightly turndown service is provided and housekeeping is offered daily. \\nAn indoor pool, an outdoor pool, a children\'s pool, and a hot tub are on site. Other recreational amenities include outdoor tennis courts, a sauna, and a fitness center. The recreational activities listed below are available either on site or nearby; fees may apply.','Avenue Bab - Jdid Marrakech 40 040 MA','+212 524 388 600',542,5,33,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_5a03bdfc11d7b217832b099d8ea7f509.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_56aa9aeea9958f7ad7dfc9ccdccdf35f.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_a0363b76913e82606d01e1881caf8644.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_52c9c244d9cddea50508047759bfa8f9.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_7d86bcd3d2cd0291991713a6de56b549.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_63eea803b1f4073eada7fdd18eace912.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_472587213032864c18a8141872b0b456.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_975128f4786484d8cf69f5f400619a40.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_8629708e828568c9a790610375d4eb6d.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_ef681049b0da720853df79635e64f356.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d2d28afa36032f96cd23e38c90ebd078.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_cb80614047eaf3a28af99a13927f97cd.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_f793eecc1fb592d2642d81778c119bd8.jpg\"]',NULL,'https://www.kayak.com/Marrakech-Hotels-La-Mamounia.58448.ksp','[\"Free valet parking\",\"ATM on-site\",\"Wedding services\",\"Business center\",\"Outdoor tennis\",\"Pets allowed on request. Charges may apply.\",\"Terrace/Patio\",\"Daily housekeeping\",\"Linens\",\"Concierge service\",\"Towels\",\"Cribs available\",\"Currency exchange on-site\",\"Gift shop\",\"Hammam (Turkish bath)\",\"Laundry facilities\",\"Elevator\",\"Laundry service\",\"Meeting/Banquet facilities\",\"Multi-lingual staff\",\"Massage\",\"Fold-up bed\",\"Yoga\",\"Library\",\"Free toiletries\",\"Pool bar\",\"Room service\",\"Tour desk\",\"Bicycle rental\",\"Accessible parking\",\"Game room\",\"Spa\",\"Hot tub\",\"Interconnected room(s) available\",\"Child pool\",\"Indoor pool\",\"Snack bar\",\"Foosball table\",\"Outdoor pool\",\"Bathtub\",\"Restaurant\",\"Bar/Lounge\",\"Bidet\",\"Gym\",\"Beauty salon\",\"Express check-out\",\"Hairdryer\",\"Fitness center\",\"Cable or satellite TV\",\"Telephone\",\"Air-conditioned\",\"Newspapers\",\"Safe\",\"Sauna\",\"Mountain biking\",\"Airport shuttle (surcharge)\",\"Babysitting/child services (surcharge)\",\"Continental breakfast\",\"TV\",\"Free parking\",\"Desk\",\"Shopping\",\"Pool table\",\"Coffee shop\",\"Bathrobe\",\"Private bathroom\",\"Garden\",\"24hr front desk\",\"Designated smoking area\",\"Steam room\",\"Storage available\"]',0,'[{\"question\":\"What makes the La Mamounia restaurants outstanding?\",\"answer\":\"Gourmet food is served in all of the four restaurants spread across the premises, and a traditional Moroccan setup can be found at Le Marocain with an airy library atmosphere and daylight-drenched alcoves with tataoui ceilings. The Le Pavilion de la Piscine offers breakfast, lunch, and dinner at the pool until 9:00 pm, but is specifically popular for the Sunday Brunch buffet with delicious seafood like oysters and lobster, or tajines and pastries. A glass of champagne is also included with brunch.\"},{\"question\":\"What do the La Mamounia bars provide for guests?\",\"answer\":\"For a chill-out atmosphere accompanied by relaxing jazz tunes, visit the Le Churchill bar, which is wedged between the lobby and the tearoom. With leopard chairs and poufs, the bar emanates a wild, yet elegant vibe and is open daily until 1:00 am. Plush velvet sofas, panoramic views, and a large cocktail await at the Le Marocain bar, and for a light, romantic setting, the L’Italien bar is perfect for you as it entertains with piano music.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the La Mamounia resort feature anything special for honeymooners?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel’s bespoke honeymoon suite is the perfect place to unwind after the hectic wedding business. The Baldaquin Suite is a cozy and luxurious room with wedding-themed decoration, such as photos from Moroccan brides in their traditional gear and photographs of legendary couples like Alain Delon and Romy Schneider. The canopy bed in white invites to romantic hours for two. Additionally, there is the Romantic Escape in Marrakech deal that includes a spa treatment and romantic dinner at Le Français, among more.\"},{\"question\":\"What packages or signature treatments does the La Mamounia spa offer?\",\"answer\":\"Hammams are offered at the hotel’s spa and are also available as part of packages, like the Hammam La Mamounia where the skin is returned to its youthfulness through a thorough scrub and ensuing ghassoul wrap. The spa has devised its own signature massage as well, and with the La Mamounia massage, you get an individualized experience that employs the healing powers of their signature product: Argan oil. La Mamounia is also available as part of the hotel’s signature ritual that fuses Argan oil with almond powder, and more.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I take up fitness classes during my stay at the La Mamounia resort?\",\"answer\":\"As part of their fitness program, the La Mamounia resort features professional coaches that can help you perfect your workout. Private lessons in the gym are possible, or you can go jogging with the hotel’s jogging gurus. For in-class fitness, try the Pilates, Aerobics, or yoga sessions. Working up a sweat without leaving the studio is also possible with spinning classes and the power plate.\"},{\"question\":\"What kind of event venues are available at the La Mamounia resort?\",\"answer\":\"To celebrate your wedding, anniversary, birthday, or simply hold a work retreat here, benefit from the extensive event venues available, such as the Grand Salon with almost 5,000 sq ft of space. The elegantly furnished room is ideal for social events and can host up to 300 people. It can, however, also be subdivided into 3 smaller lounges to adapt to your needs. Smaller business events and meetings find place in the hotel’s business center that features an internet corner and room for 10-40 people, depending on setup.\"},{\"question\":\"Where is La Mamounia located?\",\"answer\":\"La Mamounia is located at Avenue Bab - Jdid Marrakech 40 040 MA in Medina, 0.9 miles from the center of Marrakech. Le Grand Casino de la Mamounia is the closest landmark to La Mamounia.\"},{\"question\":\"When is check-in time and check-out time at La Mamounia?\",\"answer\":\"Check-in time is 3:00 PM and check-out time is 12:00 PM at La Mamounia.\"},{\"question\":\"Does La Mamounia offer free parking?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, La Mamounia offers free parking.\"},{\"question\":\"How far is La Mamounia from the airport?\",\"answer\":\"La Mamounia is 2.5 miles from Marrakech Menara. La Mamounia is 79.9 miles from Ouarzazate.\"},{\"question\":\"How does KAYAK find such great La Mamounia hotel deals?\",\"answer\":\"KAYAK scours the web for all room deals available at La Mamounia in Marrakech and lets you compare them to find the best rate for your stay. Many different travel sites will offer discounts or deals at different times for rooms at La Mamounia and KAYAK will provide you with prices from a huge range of travel sites. That means that you can always find a great deal for La Mamounia.\"},{\"question\":\"Does La Mamounia have a pool?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, La Mamounia has a pool onsite.\"}]','{\"score\":9.2,\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":33,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":27},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":2},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":0},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":3},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":0},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":0},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":1}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":9.2,\"reviews\":24}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:09:42\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(41,12,'Radisson Hotel Cape Town Foreshore','radisson-hotel-cape-town-foreshore','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_f075af8c08cae09f63d6cd712a0c956a.jpg','Along with a restaurant, this hotel has a fitness center and a bar\\/lounge. Free WiFi in public areas, a free area shuttle, and a free shopping center shuttle are also provided. Additionally, 24-hour room service, a meeting room, and concierge services are onsite. \\nChange of towels is available on request. \\nRadisson Hotel Cape Town Foreshore offers 120 air-conditioned accommodations with minibars and laptop-compatible safes. Each accommodation is individually decorated. Beds feature premium bedding. 54-cm Smart televisions come with satellite channels. Bathrooms include showers, complimentary toiletries, and hair dryers. Business-friendly amenities include desks, desk chairs, and phones. Additionally, rooms include espresso makers and complimentary bottled water. Change of towels and change of bedsheets can be requested. Housekeeping is provided daily. \\nRecreational amenities at the hotel include a fitness center. The recreational activities listed below are available either on site or nearby; fees may apply.','29 Heerengracht Street','+27 214 274 800',114,4,2280,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_f075af8c08cae09f63d6cd712a0c956a.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_db914b9c13b62a24f54738bfb561e09e.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_5c8aa7d8a5c3dd8bb59d0ae7f3c410e7.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_b90b06bd45738a5d045859c00477be27.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_9d61241a2a1802184db39d519ee7923d.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_23e0fece15593139dd0d676d86343a31.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_a153119beb977b49dbaf73edf64c8c4a.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_7bb89967d2f872c8ed7198202e11e1e2.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_2c21838479e97259b5c6d1684f221b85.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_4e2c402bdb95ffa078f68188dadcf9ae.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_91b39b97f70e0f0edef877b68bf65640.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_f31dca559b9be07138f6cef90d366786.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_b1d00de39c3856fba9bcd349d3532fb6.jpg\"]',NULL,'https://www.kayak.com/Cape-Town-Hotels-Park-Inn-Cape-Town-Foreshore.629852.ksp','[\"Window\",\"Electr