answer\":\"Some guests have mentioned challenges with parking availability, so it\'s advisable to inquire about parking slots in advance.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room Away from Construction\",\"text\":\"Some guests experienced noise disturbances due to ongoing construction, so consider requesting a room away from any renovation work.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Bringing a Power Bank\",\"text\":\"Some guests found that the sockets in the room didn\'t work, so it might be useful to carry a power bank or cord extension.\"},{\"title\":\"Check Room Location Beforehand\",\"text\":\"Guests who were allocated rooms near the gym experienced noise disturbances and vibrations, so it\'s advisable to confirm the room location in advance.\"},{\"title\":\"Request a Room with Functional Air Conditioning\",\"text\":\"A few guests reported issues with the air conditioning, so it\'s recommended to ensure that the air conditioning in the room is in good working condition.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of the Bathroom Size\",\"text\":\"Several guests found the bathrooms to be small, making it uncomfortable to use, so it\'s worth considering this aspect when booking.\"},{\"title\":\"Verify Parking Availability\",\"text\":\"Some guests were charged for parking slots that were not available, so it\'s advisable to confirm parking availability before making any payments.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"Due to ongoing renovations, some guests experienced noise disturbances, so it\'s worth considering the potential impact of construction work on the overall stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Reliable Internet Access\",\"text\":\"If reliable internet access is essential, it\'s recommended to verify the internet reliability with the hotel, as some guests found it to be unreliable.\"},{\"title\":\"Confirm the Room Configuration\",\"text\":\"Some guests found the double beds to be made of two single beds, causing discomfort, so it\'s advisable to confirm the bed configuration in advance.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Aware of Bathroom Privacy\",\"text\":\"In some rooms, the bathroom had a glass wall with a blurry sticker, which could compromise privacy when the lights were on, so it\'s worth considering this aspect.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:09:45\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(42,11,'Hotel Aqua Mirage Marrakech','hotel-aqua-mirage-marrakech','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_516e1e37c6b1a17fde1c9961a725f3d1.jpg','This modern hotel boasts a package of a traditional-style courtyards, wonderfully landscaped gardens and a waterpark-crowned pool scene. The rooms are designed with a contemporary flair, offering all the modern amenities, including flat-screen TVs. Their only downside is that due to the amount of attractions the venue offers, guests won\'t spend enough time in them. They will be spoiled with choice at the exciting first-rate waterpark that is loaded with slides including a Spacebowl, Blackhole and a section just for the youngest guests chock-full of slides and fountains. Plus there are 2 extra pools and a poolside bar to provide endless stream of chilled drinks. The lights of the Red City, called so due to the blush-coloured walls that surround it, are just a 20-minute shuttle bus ride away and it is still exciting as ever and still offers a magical mix of modern and traditional.','Km 5, Route de Tahanaout','+212 525 078 000',101,4,1226,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_516e1e37c6b1a17fde1c9961a725f3d1.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d4276756e3934c1898a9aaf12b37f3e4.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_cdb1873423220e0faa096fa209b1da5d.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_aa9fa5cd9bb98c34ef0ee73b7c2ff869.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_286b3544fc551147df940f6de42d5a3b.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_4566c9087338933c349f7b9abe776d1a.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_b7d9d3307d7aa63e5cdebbfb1e982858.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_6c5cdf510bef84a58e92330a7cea1df5.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_1afc034cc4dc79b92964745122824f2a.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_c9af675b78bb4597016fa29d01412d4c.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_15af5d591bee9d7a6ec3fa9c811aba8f.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_44475bcdbbb2ac313abb110a4b2b597d.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_65db44bc1fd9db0dad7542ce610f9b15.jpg\"]',NULL,'https://www.kayak.com/Marrakesh-Hotels-Aqua-Mirage-Club.2295891.ksp','[\"Indoor tennis\",\"Conference rooms\",\"ATM on-site\",\"Free Wi-Fi\",\"Outdoor tennis\",\"Internet\",\"Basketball court\",\"Daily housekeeping\",\"Family rooms\",\"Linens\",\"Towels\",\"Safety deposit box\",\"Fire extinguisher\",\"Gift shop\",\"Hammam (Turkish bath)\",\"Laundry facilities\",\"Elevator\",\"Laundry service\",\"Flat-screen TV\",\"Meeting/Banquet facilities\",\"Multi-lingual staff\",\"Massage\",\"Library\",\"Free toiletries\",\"Pool bar\",\"Shared lounge/TV area\",\"Smoke alarms\",\"Heating\",\"Shower\",\"Wheelchair accessible\",\"Accessible by elevator\",\"Accessible parking\",\"First-aid kit\",\"Spa\",\"Child pool\",\"Snack bar\",\"Outdoor pool\",\"Evening entertainment\",\"No smoking\",\"Balcony\",\"Games for kids\",\"Restaurant\",\"Bar/Lounge\",\"Gym\",\"Beauty salon\",\"Hairdryer\",\"Fitness center\",\"Bottle of water\",\"Cable or satellite TV\",\"Telephone\",\"Karaoke\",\"24-hour security\",\"Kids\' club\",\"Air-conditioned\",\"Safe\",\"Airport shuttle\",\"Complimentary breakfast\",\"Free parking\",\"Table tennis\",\"Desk\",\"Pool table\",\"Private bathroom\",\"Garden\",\"Wardrobe or closet\",\"24hr front desk\",\"Designated smoking area\",\"Steam room\",\"Storage available\",\"Water slide\",\"Shuttle service (additional charge)\"]',0,'[{\"question\":\"Why should I stay at the Aqua Mirage Club, and not another hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The Aqua Mirage Club not only offers an easy arrival from the airport, on account that it is only six miles away, but it also offers easy access to Marrakesh city centre. The airport runs a shuttle system to and from the city centre for guests who stay there, and while some of the shuttles are paid, some are free. The hotel also offers unrivalled views of the nearby mountain landscape as well as free access to the water park for any guests who are staying at the hotel.\"},{\"question\":\"I am interested in planning an event during my stay, what facilities does the business centre have?\",\"answer\":\"If you think that you may have to do some work or host an event during your stay, then the Aqua Mirage Club can help you. The hotel has a conference centre which offers meeting and banquet facilities, including audio-visual equipment, the latest technological equipment in presentation, and a fast internet connection. The hotel offers four meeting rooms that are situated near the entrance to the hotel, but far from the resort activities, ensuring that you and your guests have the privacy you need. The conference room can be used for seminars or cocktail parties and can host hundreds of people on request. Finally, the gardens of the hotel can be booked to host weddings, birthdays, and other celebratory events.\"},{\"question\":\"What treatments and facilities are available in the spa at the Aqua Mirage Club?\",\"answer\":\"If you are looking to truly relax and get pampered during your stay at the hotel, then the spa is the right place for you. The hotel offers 100% natural steam hammam rituals, in the Turkish bath style, as well as the option to have a massage. If you would like to relax surrounded by nature, then you can move your massage to the gardens, or take a soak in the jacuzzi surrounded by greenery. The spa also offers beauty and body treatments, such as manicures, pedicures, makeup, and hairstyling for guests who are interested.\"},{\"question\":\"What family-friendly features does the Aqua Mirage Club hotel have for guests who plan on staying with children?\",\"answer\":\"If you are planning on staying at the hotel with your children, then you will be pleased to know that family rooms are available upon request. The hotel has a qualified team that can welcome your children into the kid’s club, where they can take part in activities and sports. The kid’s club is aimed at children from 4 to 12 years old. The biggest highlight for a lot of children is the water park. The Aqua Park has water slides, a wave pool, tubes, sun loungers, a children’s pool with castles for them to climb and even has a snack bar for when you and your children get hungry.\"},{\"question\":\"What are my dining options at the on-site restaurant at Aqua Mirage Club hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The main restaurant of the hotel offers a variety of cuisine, including a theme every night that rotates between local Moroccan dishes, Asian, Mexican, Mediterranean, and a French gastronomy evening. There is a buffet available, for both adults and children, and the pool bar offers some snacks and fast food if you get hungry between meals.\"},{\"question\":\"Where is Hotel Aqua Mirage Marrakech located?\",\"answer\":\"Hotel Aqua Mirage Marrakech is located at Km 5, Route de Tahanaout, 6.7 miles from the center of Marrakech. Agdal Gardens is the closest landmark to Hotel Aqua Mirage Marrakech.\"},{\"question\":\"When is check-in time and check-out time at Hotel Aqua Mirage Marrakech?\",\"answer\":\"Check-in time is 3:00 PM and check-out time is 12:00 PM at Hotel Aqua Mirage Marrakech.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Hotel Aqua Mirage Marrakech offer free Wi-Fi?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Hotel Aqua Mirage Marrakech offers free Wi-Fi.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Hotel Aqua Mirage Marrakech offer free parking?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Hotel Aqua Mirage Marrakech offers free parking.\"},{\"question\":\"How far is Hotel Aqua Mirage Marrakech from the airport?\",\"answer\":\"Hotel Aqua Mirage Marrakech is 5.6 miles from Marrakech Menara. Hotel Aqua Mirage Marrakech is 76.3 miles from Ouarzazate.\"},{\"question\":\"How does KAYAK find such great Hotel Aqua Mirage Marrakech hotel deals?\",\"answer\":\"KAYAK scours the web for all room deals available at Hotel Aqua Mirage Marrakech in Marrakech and lets you compare them to find the best rate for your stay. Many different travel sites will offer discounts or deals at different times for rooms at Hotel Aqua Mirage Marrakech and KAYAK will provide you with prices from a huge range of travel sites. That means that you can always find a great deal for Hotel Aqua Mirage Marrakech.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Hotel Aqua Mirage Marrakech have a pool?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Hotel Aqua Mirage Marrakech has a pool onsite.\"}]','{\"score\":7.3,\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":1226,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":337},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":172},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":294},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":134},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":108},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":71},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":110}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":7.4,\"reviews\":279}],\"mentions\":[\"staff to the food\",\"staff at the reception\",\"variety of food\",\"water park\",\"kids club\",\"fun for kids\",\"swimming pool\",\"evening entertainment\",\"free wifi\",\"facilities were excellent\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What kind of activities are available at Aqua Mirage Club?\",\"answer\":\"Aqua Mirage Club Marrakech offers a wide range of activities including a large water park with giant slides, a wave pool, tennis courts, a football pitch, a dance hall, and a fitness room with professional coaches.\"},{\"question\":\"What amenities are provided in the rooms at Aqua Mirage Club?\",\"answer\":\"All rooms at Aqua Mirage Club Marrakech are non-smoking and air-conditioned, equipped with a flat-screen TV, refrigerator, safe, and a private bathroom with complimentary toiletries and a hairdryer. Family rooms and suites are also available upon request.\"},{\"question\":\"What can guests expect at the Moroccan spa in Aqua Mirage Club?\",\"answer\":\"Aqua Mirage Club Marrakech offers 100% natural steam Hammam rituals and outdoor massages in the cool shade of the gardens. The spa also provides beauty treatments such as manicure, pedicure, makeup, and hairdressing.\"},{\"question\":\"Is there a children\'s pool at Aqua Mirage Club?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Aqua Mirage Club Marrakech features a children\'s pool with a Prince and Princess castle for climbing and sliding, along with a snack bar offering unlimited drinks throughout the day.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the nearby attractions to Aqua Mirage Club?\",\"answer\":\"Nearby attractions to Aqua Mirage Club Marrakech include Agdal Gardens, Assoufid Golf Club, Saadian Tombs, Bab Agnaou, Royal Palace, Bahia Palace, Dar Si Said Museum, Mosquée de la Koutoubia, Jamaa el Fna, Souk Zrabi, Almoravid Koubba, and Museum of Moroccan Arts.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Consider a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Some rooms offer panoramic views of the Atlas Mountains, while others overlook the gardens or waterpark. Guests recommend requesting a room with a view for a more enjoyable stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel is conveniently located near various attractions such as Agdal Gardens, Saadian Tombs, and the Royal Palace. Take advantage of the hotel\'s proximity to these sites for a well-rounded experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Family-Friendly Features\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers a child pool and complimentary breakfast, making it a suitable choice for families. Families traveling with children may appreciate these amenities.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan Your Visit According to Season\",\"text\":\"The low season is in November, while the high season is in April. Consider these factors when planning your trip to Marrakech to make the most of your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of Spa Services\",\"text\":\"Guests speak highly of the natural steam Hammam rituals and outdoor massages offered at the hotel\'s spa. Consider indulging in these rejuvenating experiences during your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Engage in Recreational Activities\",\"text\":\"With facilities such as tennis courts, a football pitch, and a fitness room with professional coaches, the hotel offers ample opportunities for sports and fitness enthusiasts to stay active during their visit.\"},{\"title\":\"Utilize the Free Shuttle Service\",\"text\":\"The hotel provides a free shuttle service to and from Menara Airport, offering convenience for guests. Take advantage of this service for a hassle-free arrival and departure.\"},{\"title\":\"Check Room Amenities\",\"text\":\"Rooms are equipped with flat-screen TVs, refrigerators, and safes. However, some guests have mentioned that the air conditioning may not be consistent in all rooms. It\'s advisable to check the room amenities upon arrival.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Cancellation Policies\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s cancellation and prepayment policies vary by room type and provider. It\'s recommended to familiarize yourself with these policies before making a reservation to avoid any inconvenience.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Moroccan Spas\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s spa offers a range of beauty treatments including manicures, pedicures, and hairdressing. Guests looking for relaxation and pampering may find these services appealing.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:09:49\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(43,12,'Radisson Blu Hotel Waterfront, Cape Town','radisson-blu-hotel-waterfront-cape-town','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_368a9d1f6f05419f942b39d0b46bac31.jpg','This hotel features a full-service spa, an outdoor pool, and a restaurant. Free WiFi in public areas, free valet parking, and a free shopping center shuttle are also provided. Additionally, a health club, a bar\\/lounge, and a poolside bar are onsite. \\nRadisson Collection Hotel, Waterfront Cape Town offers 177 accommodations with minibars and safes. 35-inch LCD televisions co