rfect for getting around.\"},{\"title\":\"Enjoy the Breakfast with a View\",\"text\":\"The breakfast at Tobago’s Restaurant offers a feast with almost limitless options and a fantastic ocean view, making it a must-try.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Room Selection Carefully\",\"text\":\"Some guests suggested that certain rooms may be noisy, especially those directly above the breakfast zone, so it\'s advisable to inquire about room locations.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Housekeeping Services\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned inconsistencies with housekeeping services, such as unfulfilled requests for amenities and cleaning, so it\'s advisable to communicate any specific needs clearly.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Play Club for Children\",\"text\":\"Families with children can make use of the play club provided by the hotel, offering a convenient option for keeping kids entertained.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Prepared for Slow Service\",\"text\":\"Some guests experienced slow service, particularly at the restaurant, so it\'s advisable to plan accordingly.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Room Upgrades\",\"text\":\"Some guests were pleasantly surprised with room upgrades, so it might be worth inquiring about the possibility during check-in.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider the Hotel\'s Location\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s location is highly praised for its proximity to the waterfront and stunning views, making it a top choice for many guests.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Aware of Room Size\",\"text\":\"Some guests noted that certain rooms were smaller than expected, so it\'s advisable to clarify room size preferences during the booking process.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:09:52\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(44,11,'Hivernage Hotel & Spa','hivernage-hotel-spa','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d2b1106e50074adb9d4fd2b6a26c6be6.png','Along with an outdoor pool, this hotel has a restaurant and 2 bars\\/lounges. Free buffet breakfast is provided, as well as free WiFi in public areas, free valet parking, and a free manager\'s reception. Additionally, a health club, a poolside bar, and 3 coffee shops\\/cafes are onsite. \\nHivernage Hotel And Spa offers 84 air-conditioned accommodations with minibars and espresso makers. Beds feature premium bedding. Satellite television is provided. Bathrooms include shower\\/tub combinations, bathrobes, slippers, and bidets. This Marrakech hotel provides complimentary wireless Internet access. Business-friendly amenities include complimentary newspapers, safes, and phones. Additionally, rooms include complimentary bottled water and coffee\\/tea makers. In-room massages and irons\\/ironing boards can be requested. A nightly turndown service is provided and housekeeping is offered daily. \\nAn outdoor pool and a children\'s pool are on site. Other recreational amenities include a health club and a sauna. The recreational activities listed below are available either on site or nearby; fees may apply.','4 Angle Avenue Echouhada',NULL,112,4,2728,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d2b1106e50074adb9d4fd2b6a26c6be6.png\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_8ff90359cff31db5cbc0faa9ea4b2626.png\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_c05555dedb476656660ad7c91f525494.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_a5d3bdeac26d73de7d2285521902516a.png\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_e2fbb42133be7dde53411f033562fc68.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_b204d6ba701df8288158ea66dda51356.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_52cd5d27a90a926264703f813365e37b.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_5c5dad5a70b6f0e9a222b0ad99b0c51c.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_915d5cbf6d135aa73e60836c1169d70a.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_7cf2ef1bbf55e8ac51994c86bf16d810.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_f06b9afb622138e102b1b5bace07a789.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_946ffa8d310a25081133ed8f33ec0a0c.jpg\",\"http://travel