 providing a sanctuary for relaxation and rejuvenation during your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Room Upgrades\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned being upgraded to suites, which enhanced their overall experience. Inquire about potential upgrades during the booking process for a chance to elevate your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Room Selection\",\"text\":\"While some rooms offer views of Table Mountain or the city, a few guests were disappointed with their room\'s view. It\'s advisable to communicate preferences clearly during the booking process.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan for High and Low Seasons\",\"text\":\"Considering the hotel\'s high season in February and low season in August can help in making informed decisions about the timing of your visit, taking into account factors such as crowd levels and pricing.\"},{\"title\":\"Utilize the Concierge Service\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the helpfulness of the concierge staff, particularly in arranging tours and providing local information. Engaging with the concierge can enhance your overall experience and exploration of the area.\"},{\"title\":\"Stay Mindful of Service Feedback\",\"text\":\"While many guests praised the staff, a few mentioned issues with lounge service and communication. Being mindful of potential service inconsistencies can help manage expectations during your stay.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:10:21\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(52,11,'Royal Mirage Deluxe Marrakech','royal-mirage-deluxe-marrakech','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_270c9b447077e1c065194a571c8bd527.jpg','Along with 3 restaurants, this hotel has a full-service spa and an outdoor pool. Free WiFi in public areas and free self parking are also provided. Other amenities include a nightclub, a fitness center, and a bar\\/lounge. \\nRoyal Mirage Deluxe Marrakech offers 76 accommodations with minibars and safes. Rooms open to balconies. Beds feature premium bedding. 32-inch plasma televisions come with cable channels.