estion\":\"What are the standout features of the hotel\'s staff?\",\"answer\":\"The staff at Royal Mirage Deluxe Marrakech are known for being friendly, helpful, and accommodating. Guests have particularly praised individuals like Fatima and Ahmed for their exceptional service and professionalism.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the cleanliness of the hotel generally perceived?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel is generally clean, but some guests have mentioned that there were issues with housekeeping, such as inconsistent replenishment of amenities and occasional oversights in maintaining the rooms\' condition.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the best time to visit the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel is an excellent choice for a visit in February, which is considered the low season. This could be a great time to enjoy the hotel\'s amenities and explore the nearby attractions with fewer crowds.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the fountain comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Room Upgrade\",\"text\":\"Some guests were pleasantly surprised with room upgrades, so it might be worth inquiring about the possibility of an upgrade during your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s central location makes it convenient for exploring nearby attractions such as Mosquée de la Koutoubia, Jamaa el Fna, and the Royal Palace, all within walking distance.\"},{\"title\":\"Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"Some guests reported noise from the street, so light sleepers may want to consider requesting a room away from the street to ensure a peaceful night\'s sleep.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Special Events\",\"text\":\"Inquire about any special events or weddings scheduled during your stay, as these may impact noise levels and the overall atmosphere of the hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Room Maintenance\",\"text\":\"