pg','Discover the captivating charm of Cape Town at the Protea Hotel by Marriott Sea Point. As one of the top hotels near Cape Town promenade, a stay here offers the perfect combination of relaxation and adventure whilst embracing the city\'s natural beauty. With sweeping views of Table Mountain and the sparkling ocean, each of our elegantly designed rooms is a haven of comfort, including the option for stunning sea-view accommodations. As one of the most ideally situated Marriott hotels in Cape Town, we are just steps away from the Sea Point Promenade, Cape Town’s Blue Flag beaches, and the vibrant V&A Waterfront. This prime location makes us a top choice among Cape Town hotels, perfect for those seeking a stay at a Cape Town city hotel. Whether you\'re planning a family getaway, a business trip, or a special event, our hotel has it all, including a rooftop pool, on-site gym, and versatile event spaces. Our vibrant lobby, outdoor plunge pool, and family-friendly dining options add to a memorable stay.','Arthur\'s Road, Sea Point','+27 214 343 344',13,4,1516,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_db19a1320594aaca9e444da7e4eba245.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_6190b4ac368427bd681921cf5bef6842.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_88a3188dce2bdb1504b9fbadff866f27.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_92f5245dbc343259eac8513773b92f38.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_418500abd273558c23607edc5b788928.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_49beeac1cf030fc98aeef8bb2670319f.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_14c59babb99e68617148ae2cda8e9ee6.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_0f0289a83781a4a80eecd3651ad0d198.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_94900f7caed42183c152f7ce4c575545.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d10bd547e2bde6aa04ea527a6b8b8ee5.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_415c44e83ef20d79934e58533ffa0da8.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/me