'{\"score\":8.1,\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":1516,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":554},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":263},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":274},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":139},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":136},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":62},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":88}],\"summary\":\"Guests consistently praised the hotel\'s excellent location near the beach, markets, and restaurants, as well as the friendly and helpful staff who provided efficient service. The breakfast was frequently described as delicious and varied, and many guests appreciated the clean rooms and comfortable beds. While some mentioned minor issues such as small bathrooms, limited parking, or occasional noise, the overall experience was positive, with many guests recommending the hotel and expressing intentions to return.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":10},{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":9.5},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":9},{\"label\":\"Breakfast\",\"score\":9},{\"label\":\"Bed Comfort\",\"score\":7.5}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.1,\"reviews\":1200},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":7.8,\"reviews\":12},{\"name\":\"HotelsCombined\",\"score\":8.6,\"reviews\":1},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":8,\"reviews\":1}],\"mentions\":[\"room was small\",\"staff was friendly\",\"location is great\",\"breakfast was good\",\"bed was comfortable\",\"swimming pool\",\"good view\",\"pay for parking\",\"sea view\",\"close to the beach\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What are the hotel\'s unique amenities?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers an outdoor pool with a view, a fitness center, and a gift shop. Additionally, guests can enjoy beach access, bicycle rental, and various water activities like fishing, scuba diving, and snorkeling.\"},{\"question\":\"What practical services does the hotel provide?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers a business center, concierge service, room service, and a 24-hour front desk. Guests can also benefit from shuttle services, private parking, and a safety deposit box.\"},{\"question\":\"What can guests expect from the hotel\'s dining options?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel provides a restaurant, bar/lounge, and coffee shop. Guests can also have food delivered to their accommodation and enjoy breakfast in their room. Additionally, there is a minibar and vending machine for snacks.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the common concerns about the hotel\'s rooms?\",\"answer\":\"Some guests have mentioned that the rooms are not spacious and lack a home/family touch. Additionally, there were comments about the small bathrooms and the need for room maintenance.\"},{\"question\":\"When is the best time to visit the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel is ideal to visit in April during the low season or in December during the high season. Guests can enjoy the excellent location and convenient access to various attractions.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests recommended choosing a room with a balcony facing the beach for a spectacular view and a relaxing experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Early Check-in\",\"text\":\"Guests mentioned that the hotel accommodated early check-in requests, allowing them to explore the city sooner.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s location near the beach and various restaurants makes it convenient for guests to enjoy leisurely walks and dining options.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Room Size\",\"text\":\"Some guests found the rooms to be compact, so consider this when booking, especially for longer stays.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Room Upgrades\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated room upgrades, so it might be worth inquiring about this option for a more comfortable stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Note Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"Some guests experienced noise disturbances, particularly from the surroundings and within the hotel, so light sleepers may want to be prepared for this.\"},{\"title\":\"Utilize Gym Facilities\",\"text\":\"The 24-hour accessible gym was highlighted as a convenient feature for guests looking to maintain their fitness routines during their stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Parking Options\",\"text\":\"While some guests were dissatisfied with the parking situation, others found it convenient, so it\'s advisable to inquire about parking arrangements in advance.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of Personalized Service\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the personalized service from various staff members, enhancing their overall experience at the hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan for Breakfast\",\"text\":\"If breakfast is included, guests recommended ensuring that the payment method for breakfast is clarified upon arrival to avoid any confusion during the stay.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:10:35\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(56,11,'Park Hyatt Marrakech','park-hyatt-marrakech','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_c6b2abab436c3002a0fa183055939453.jpg','2 restaurants, 3 outdoor pools, and a full-service spa are available at this hotel. Free WiFi in public areas, free valet parking, and a free manager\'s reception are also provided. Additionally, a golf course, an indoor pool, and a fitness center are onsite. \\nPark Hyatt Marrakech offers 130 air-conditioned accommodations with minibars (stocked with some free items) and espresso makers. Rooms open to furnished balconies or patios. Accommodations offer separate dining areas and include dining tables. Beds feature Egyptian cotton sheets, down comforters, and premium bedding. A pillow menu is available. 55-inch flat-screen televisions come with premium satellite channels. Bathrooms include bathrobes, slippers, complimentary toiletries, and hair dryers. Guests can surf the web using the complimentary wireless Internet access (speed: 25+ Mbps). Business-friendly amenities include desk chairs and safes. Additionally, rooms include complimentary bottled water and coffee\\/tea makers. A nightly turndown service is provided and housekeeping is offered daily. Amenities available on request include in-room massages. \\nGuests can play rounds at the 18-hole golf course. 3 outdoor swimming pools are on site along with an indoor pool. In addition to a children\'s pool, other recreational amenities include a sauna and a fitness center. Children under 12 years old are not allowed in the swimming pool, health club, or fitness facility without adult supervision. The recreational activities listed below are available either on site or nearby; fees may apply.','Al Maaden Golf Resort','+212 524 441 234',415,5,92,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_c6b2abab436c3002a0fa183055939453.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_de876bf437e7167aabd5c4d95b770343.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_6fa8f417e2a412ff17e5f4361efb55a2.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_40ce0c968569787e230220a000413dd0.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_522cb0e9186517dd2e8ad5ab8696d993.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_87ff71a2914c913d4f4b06b95e17a942.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_3d53f3e9162628efb4d8329e9eb8d007.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_7c362d15246962dc7d23406998a3f4be.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_bf19d29389f79c5788980db2303f6e77.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_dc0a7152ca0769898607c81b1a96b88e.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_4d0cf53949847466a4d4c31ef04d5603.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_b3017289051253dc352fd60344a3dc0a.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_3f46a41e823bf365bfae6e79a2c3249a.jpg\"]',NULL,'https://www.kayak.com/Marrakech-Hotels-Park-Hyatt-Marrakech.1070699679.ksp','[\"Electric kettle\",\"Car rental\",\"Wake-up service\",\"Wi-Fi available in all areas\",\"Internet\",\"Daily housekeeping\",\"Family rooms\",\"Concierge service\",\"Cribs available\",\"Currency exchange on-site\",\"Fire extinguisher