re mixed opinions about the location, with some finding it convenient and others citing difficult access or safety concerns. A few negative comments address dated or unclean rooms, but overall, guests are satisfied with the service, cleanliness, and breakfast.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":9.5},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":9},{\"label\":\"Breakfast\",\"score\":9},{\"label\":\"Bed Comfort\",\"score\":8},{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":5}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.9,\"reviews\":812},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":9.2,\"reviews\":49},{\"name\":\"Priceline\",\"score\":10,\"reviews\":1},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":2,\"reviews\":1}],\"mentions\":[\"staff were friendly\",\"breakfast was great\",\"modern hotel\",\"great location\",\"great rooms\",\"great service\",\"great food\",\"pool area\",\"shuttle service\",\"great view\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What can I expect from the hotel\'s breakfast?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers a fantastic buffet breakfast with a wide range of choices and a la carte options. Guests have praised the delicious and varied breakfast options, making it a highlight of their stay.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the hotel close to the V&A Waterfront?\",\"answer\":\"While the hotel is not within walking distance to the V&A Waterfront, it provides a complimentary boat transfer along the canal, offering a unique and enjoyable way to access the waterfront. Additionally, guests can easily use Uber or private taxis for convenient transportation.\"},{\"question\":\"How are the beds at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have consistently praised the hotel\'s comfortable and spacious beds, providing a restful and relaxing stay. The rooms are modern and clean, with comfortable bedding to ensure a good night\'s sleep.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the hotel\'s unique sustainability initiatives?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel has implemented sustainability initiatives such as complimentary water in glass bottles and refillable hand pumps for bathroom soaps. These efforts contribute to a more eco-friendly and responsible stay for guests.\"},{\"question\":\"What transportation options are available from the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers convenient shuttle services to and from the V&A Waterfront by van and boat, providing guests with easy access to popular attractions. Additionally, private parking and airport shuttle services are available for added convenience.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the waterfront comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider the Hotel\'s Sustainability Initiatives\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the hotel\'s sustainability efforts, such as complimentary water in glass bottles and refillable hand pumps for soaps in the bathroom.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Shuttle and Water Taxi\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers a shuttle and a water taxi service to the V&A Waterfront, which can be convenient for guests. However, be mindful that the boat and shuttle service may limit options for exploring the area on foot.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of the Location\",\"text\":\"While the hotel is in a good location, it\'s important to note that the views from some rooms may be of the shipyard, and the hotel is not within walking distance to the waterfront as indicated in some booking platforms.\"},{\"title\":\"Check Room Amenities\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned that the rooms were modern, spacious, and clean, with comfortable beds. However, it\'s advisable to confirm the room type and view to avoid any disappointment upon arrival.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Transportation\",\"text\":\"While the hotel is close to the city center and offers easy access to the waterfront, guests may need to rely on taxis or ride-sharing services for transportation, especially after dark.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan Around Breakfast Timing\",\"text\":\"Guests noted that the buffet breakfast was excellent, but at times, the breakfast hall could get full, leading to seating in another hall. Planning breakfast timing accordingly can enhance the experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Aware of Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"Some guests found the restaurant area to be cold and windy due to the air conditioning, and the lobby experience was not up to par with expectations. Being mindful of potential noise and temperature issues in certain areas of the hotel can help manage expectations.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Alternative Dining Options\",\"text\":\"While the hotel\'s dinner menu received positive feedback, some guests found the restaurant to be cold due to the air conditioning. Exploring alternative dining options in the nearby area could provide a more comfortable experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Confirm Room Details\",\"text\":\"It\'s advisable to double-check room bookings to ensure that the reserved room matches the one received upon arrival, especially if there have been any prior booking discrepancies.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:10:42\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(58,13,'Royal Beach Hotel Punta Cana','royal-beach-hotel-punta-cana','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_afacdff38a7ee4d6f3fb1408d7506bf0.jpg','A full-service spa, an outdoor pool, and a restaurant are available at this hotel. Free WiFi in public areas and free self parking are also provided. Additionally, a 24-hour fitness center, a bar\\/lounge, and a poolside bar are onsite. \\nRoyal Beach Hotel Punta Cana A Jdv By Hyatt Hotel offers 66 air-conditioned accommodations with minibars and espresso makers. Each accommodation is individually furnished and decorated. 55-inch Smart televisions come with digital channels. Bathrooms include showers, bidets, and hair dryers. Business-friendly amenities include desks, desk chairs, and phones. Additionally, rooms include safes and irons\\/ironing boards. Housekeeping is provided daily. \\nR