Selection Bávaro Suites','iberostar-selection-bavaro-suites','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_bcc622b822b772a27cc0addf04e3b166.jpg','Set in Punta Cana, 18 km from freshwater lagoons, Iberostar Selection Bávaro Suites features an outdoor pool and views of the lake. The resort has a children\'s playground and views of the garden, and guests can enjoy a meal at the restaurant or a drink at the bar. The rooms have a flat-screen TV. You will find a coffee machine in the room. All rooms come with a private bathroom. For your comfort, you will find bath robes, slippers and free toiletries. There is babysitting service and shops at the property. You can play tennis at this resort, and the area is popular for golfing and snorkeling. Cap Cana Marina is 19 km from Iberostar Bavaro, while Playa Juanillo is 19 km away. The nearest airport is Punta Cana International Airport, 12 km from the property.','Carretera Arena Gorda - Playa Bavaro','+1 809 221 6500',236,4,411,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_bcc622b822b772a27cc0addf04e3b166.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_8e411cd5a64b21a7f6e105dc4ccc912a.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_a225c9e5d2dd4dbf4a3611ec81d3be63.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_44f902fc429ed04ef690a2d60a308441.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_6a3697a7ea992fe20f7e473833562523.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_58699d9e0aeb19946df60be6aca62a56.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_1d23c5939925303757a0b4e3770ab8da.jpg\"]',NULL,'https://www.kayak.com/Punta-Cana-Hotels-Iberostar-Selection-Bavaro-Suites.343568.ksp','[\"Free Wi-Fi\",\"Babysitting or child care\",\"Non-smoking rooms available\",\"Wi-Fi available in all areas\",\"Internet\",\"Terrace/Patio\",\"Daily housekeeping\",\"Beach chairs\",\"Family rooms\",\"Linens\",\"Towels\",\"Fan\",\"Safety deposit box\",\"Cribs available\",\"Entertainment staff\",\"Sea view\",\"Seating area\",\"Laundry facilities\",\"Ironing service\",\"Flat-screen TV\",\"Meeting/Banquet facilities\",\"Massage\",\"Yoga\",\"Shampoo\",\"Pool bar\",\"Garden view\",\"Room service\",\"Smoke alarms\",\"Shower\",\"Casino\",\"Game room\",\"Adapted bath\",\"Golf\",\"Slippers\",\"First-aid kit\",\"Spa\",\"Hot tub\",\"Snack bar\",\"Outdoor pool\",\"Darts\",\"Socket near the bed\",\"Diving\",\"Snorkeling\",\"Key access\",\"Sofa\",\"Evening entertainment\",\"Key card access\",\"Kids meals\",\"Kid-friendly buffet\",\"Balcony\",\"Restaurant\",\"Bar/Lounge\",\"Body soap\",\"Street parking\",\"Hairdryer\",\"Fitness center\",\"Tea/coffee maker\",\"Tennis\",\"Telephone\",\"Tile/marble floor\",\"Kids\' club\",\"Air-conditioned\",\"Kids\' outdoor play equipment\",\"Toilet\",\"Toilet paper\",\"Sauna\",\"Airport shuttle (surcharge)\",\"Trash cans\",\"Food can be delivered to guest accommodation\",\"Coffee machine\",\"TV\",\"Free parking\",\"Table tennis\",\"Conditioner\",\"Pool towels\",\"Pool view\",\"Playground\",\"Desk\",\"Pool with a view\",\"Coffee shop\",\"Private beach\",\"Windsurfing\",\"Bathrobe\",\"Private bathroom\",\"Walk-in shower\",\"Garden\",\"Wardrobe or closet\",\"24hr front desk\",\"Private entrance\",\"Night club\",\"Storage available\",\"Private parking\"]',0,'[{\"question\":\"Why should I stay at Iberostar Bavaro?\",\"answer\":\"Situated on the outskirts of Punta Cana and the northern tip of the Bavaro region, you’ll experience a stunning beachside getaway that is a distant memory from life’s problems. Close enough to the city to enjoy functional amenities but remote enough to provide a peaceful sea breeze, there is no better location imaginable when visiting the Dominican Republic.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the best room for a couple at Iberostar Bavaro?\",\"answer\":\"Book a Honeymoon Junior Suite and indulge in a magical romantic holiday. Awaiting you in your room after check-in will be a bottle of sparkling wine, chocolates and strawberries. The spacious suite features a king size bed, hydromassage bathtub and private balcony that overlooks the luscious gardens. Included in the reservation is a romantic dinner on the beach and access to the spa. Available from roughly RD$14,000 (approximately $276) per night, it is the perfect place to spend quality time together.\"},{\"question\":\"Where should I eat when staying at Iberostar Bavaro?\",\"answer\":\"Spend a night dining at Kabuki and you’ll have the opportunity of tasting delicious Japanese cuisine prepared as fresh as you could possibly imagine. The sushi bar offers a casual experience where you can choose from a wide variety of flavors, while teppanyaki tables will grill your food directly in front of you. Only open between 6:30 pm and 9:30 pm, reservations are required.\"},{\"question\":\"What family-friendly services are offered at Iberostar Bavaro?\",\"answer\":\"Kids will have a smile on their face the entire time at Star Camp, a supervised children’s program that promotes creative fun and healthy lifestyles. With three dedicated age groups ranging from 4 to 17 years of age, some of the activities include mini golf, aqua fun and arts & crafts.\"},{\"question\":\"What exercise options are available at Iberostar Bavaro?\",\"answer\":\"Experienced trainers are on hand to keep you in shape while you’re away on vacation, with group classes such as boot camp, TRX, dance and aerobics. Pilates, yoga and tai chi offer a gentler approach to fitness, while there is also the ability to hit the sand and have a game of beach volleyball.\"},{\"question\":\"What spa treatments are offered at Iberostar Bavaro?\",\"answer\":\"For a unique spa experience that you’ll remember for a long time, indulge with a chocolate day package. Consisting of an oil massage, body exfoliation and face mask, chocolate will be used throughout the entire 1h 50m session (approximately RD$13,700 or $270). If you are looking for a shorter treatment, the 50m hot and cold stone massage is a fantastic option.\"},{\"question\":\"What entertainment is provided at Iberostar Bavaro?\",\"answer\":\"Nightly entertainment creates a buzzing atmosphere throughout the hotel, with magic shows and musical performances a hit with guests. There is an escape room to navigate if you are looking for an adventure, while Spanish lessons and dance classes provide insight into local culture.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the easiest way to get to Iberostar Bavaro from the airport?\",\"answer\":\"Taxis are the quickest mode of transport from Punta Cana International Airport, with the drive taking roughly 30m. You can expect the fare to cost roughly RD$2,500 (approximately $50).(Prices checked 18/06/19).\"},{\"question\":\"Where is Iberostar Selection Bávaro Suites located?\",\"answer\":\"Iberostar Selection Bávaro Suites is located at Carretera Arena Gorda - Playa Bavaro in Pueblo Bavaro, 2.5 miles from the center of Punta Cana. Iberostar Golf Course is the closest landmark to Iberostar Selection Bávaro Suites.\"},{\"question\":\"When is check-in time and check-out time at Iberostar Selection Bávaro Suites?\",\"answer\":\"Check-in time is 3:00 PM and check-out time is 11:00 AM at Iberostar Selection Bávaro Suites.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Iberostar Selection Bávaro Suites offer free Wi-Fi?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Iberostar Selection Bávaro Suites offers free Wi-Fi.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Iberostar Selection Bávaro Suites offer free parking?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Iberostar Selection Bávaro Suites offers free parking.\"},{\"question\":\"How far is Iberostar Selection Bávaro Suites from the airport?\",\"answer\":\"Iberostar Selection Bávaro Suites is 11.6 miles from Punta Cana. Iberostar Selection Bávaro Suites is 35.3 miles from La Romana.\"},{\"question\":\"How does KAYAK find such great Iberostar Selection Bávaro Suites hotel deals?\",\"answer\":\"KAYAK scours the web for all room deals available at Iberostar Selection Bávaro Suites in Punta Cana and lets you compare them to find the best rate for your stay. Many different travel sites will offer discounts or deals at different times for rooms at Iberostar Selection Bávaro Suites and KAYAK will provide you with prices from a huge range of travel sites. That means that you can always find a great deal for Iberostar Selection Bávaro Suites.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Iberostar Selection Bávaro Suites have a pool?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Iberostar Selection Bávaro Suites has a pool onsite.\"}]','{\"score\":8.3,\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":411,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":206},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":76},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":56},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":32},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":14},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":10},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":17}],\"summary\":\"Several guests expressed dissatisfaction with the hotel\'s cleanliness, citing issues such as roaches, dirty pools, and stained sheets. Service was also a common concern, with complaints about unprofessional or inattentive staff, language barriers, and slow response times. Restaurant experiences were mixed, with some guests disappointed by food quality, lack of variety, and difficulties making reservations. While there were some positive mentions of attentive staff and good facilities, the negatives were frequently highlighted.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Restaurant\",\"score\":2.5},{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":2},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":1.5}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.3,\"reviews\":92},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":7.6,\"reviews\":1},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":7.9,\"reviews\":3}],\"mentions\":[\"staff were very nice\",\"food is excellent\",\"beach and the pool\",\"hotel is very nice\",\"arrived earlier\",\"duration of our stay\",\"security guard\",\"worth the money\",\"room was next\",\"landscape\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What dining options are available at Iberostar Bávaro?\",\"answer\":\"Iberostar Bávaro offers a variety of dining options, including onsite restaurants with delicious menus and live music. Guests can also enjoy a buffet and a la carte restaurants, as well as an ice cream stand at the pool area. Fresh fruit juices are available during all meals, and there are options for kids as well.\"},{\"question\":\"Are there any concerns about the room facilities at Iberostar Bávaro?\",\"answer\":\"Some guests have mentioned that the rooms at Iberostar Bávaro had a few broken things and could benefit from renovations. Additionally, some guests experienced issues with the air conditioning not cooling the room effectively. However, overall, guests found the rooms spacious, comfortable, and clean.\"},{\"question\":\"What activities are available for families at Iberostar Bávaro?\",\"answer\":\"Iberostar Bávaro is a family-friendly resort that offers a kids\' club with a variety of activities and sweet staff. Additionally, the resort provides services for people of all ages, making it a relaxing experience for families. The proximity to nearby attractions also allows everyone in the family to easily enjoy a variety of activities.\"},{\"question\":\"Is there any feedback about the quality of food at Iberostar Bávaro?\",\"answer\":\"While some guests have mentioned that the food at Iberostar Bávaro was great, others expressed concerns about the lack of vegetarian meal options and the quality of certain restaurants. It\'s important to note that the buffet was praised for its variety and tastiness.\"},{\"question\":\"What are some highlights of the customer service at Iberostar Bávaro?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have highlighted the helpful and attentive staff at Iberostar Bávaro, noting that they worked hard to make people\'s stay great. The staff are described as nice, kind, and attentive, with daily room cleaning and excitement kept alive with activities and music at the pool.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Book a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the beach or gardens comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Golf Courses\",\"text\":\"The Iberostate Bavaro Golf and Club is less than a mile away, making it a convenient option for golf enthusiasts. Consider planning a day to enjoy a round of golf during your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of Onsite Dining\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the delicious menus and unique atmosphere at the onsite restaurants. Be sure to try out the live music offered at the dining venues for a memorable experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Family-Friendly Services\",\"text\":\"The resort offers a variety of services for guests of all ages, including a kids\' club with engaging activities. Families can take advantage of the kid-friendly buffet and child pool for a relaxing stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Room Renovations\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned that the rooms would benefit from renovations, particularly regarding the air conditioning and overall room maintenance. It may be helpful to inquire about recently renovated rooms when making a reservation.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan for Vegetarian Dining\",\"text\":\"If you have dietary preferences, consider planning your meals in advance, as some guests found it challenging to find suitable vegetarian options. Contacting the hotel in advance to discuss dietary needs could enhance the dining experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Enjoy Beach and Pool Activities\",\"text\":\"Guests enjoyed the expansive beach and pool areas, as well as the entertainment provided by the staff. Take advantage of the activities and music at the pool for a lively and engaging experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Sales Pitches\",\"text\":\"Some guests reported feeling pressured to attend a presentation during their stay. If you prefer to avoid such engagements, it may be helpful to politely decline any offers and express your preference to enjoy your vacation uninterrupted.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Room Upgrades\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned issues with room amenities such as air conditioning and room size. Consider inquiring about the availability of room upgrades or specific room features to ensure a comfortable stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Language Considerations\",\"text\":\"While many staff members are friendly and helpful, some guests found that knowledge of basic Spanish phrases enhanced their communication with the staff. Consider learning a few essential Spanish words to facilitate interactions during your stay.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:11:04\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(60,13,'TRS Turquesa by Palladium - Adults Only','trs-turquesa-by-palladium-adults-only','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_4cce25dcbdbc25ca53b56e57b4a65c1e.jpg','This luxurious adults-only resort is located within the Grand Palladium Complex of 5 hotels with full access to all of them including their facilities and features a full-service spa, numerous on-site dining options and endless recreational and entertainment options. On-site at the TRS Turquesa Hotel - Adults only, guests will find everything needed for an unforgettable stay. From numerous swimming pools and a nightclub to gift shops and beauty salons, there is something for everyone. A large variety of recreational activities, including soccer, tennis, basketball and volleyball are also available on-site. The TRS Turquesa Hotel - Adults only is ideally located along the beautiful beaches of the Dominican Republic. Deep-sea fishing, diving, windsurfing and snorkeling can be found only moments away. Area attractions, including Manati Water Park along with a number of shopping centers are also nearby.','Av. Francia','+1 809 221 8149',247,4,642,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_4cce25dcbdbc25ca53b56e57b4a65c1e.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_92bb7532cb92a6106fff2b6f8c3e1cbc.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_bc0ccb7ac6601ae443ba40771ad5fc65.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_15b0337f5db333b57206d722f4948ac1.jpg\"