ing\",\"DVD player\",\"Theme park\"]',0,'[{\"question\":\"Where is TRS Turquesa by Palladium - Adults Only located?\",\"answer\":\"TRS Turquesa by Palladium - Adults Only is located at Av. Francia in Pueblo Bavaro, 0.3 miles from the center of Punta Cana. Dolphin Island Park is the closest landmark to TRS Turquesa by Palladium - Adults Only.\"},{\"question\":\"When is check-in time and check-out time at TRS Turquesa by Palladium - Adults Only?\",\"answer\":\"Check-in time is 3:00 PM and check-out time is 12:00 PM at TRS Turquesa by Palladium - Adults Only.\"},{\"question\":\"Does TRS Turquesa by Palladium - Adults Only offer free Wi-Fi?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, TRS Turquesa by Palladium - Adults Only offers free Wi-Fi.\"},{\"question\":\"Does TRS Turquesa by Palladium - Adults Only offer free parking?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, TRS Turquesa by Palladium - Adults Only offers free parking.\"},{\"question\":\"How far is TRS Turquesa by Palladium - Adults Only from the airport?\",\"answer\":\"TRS Turquesa by Palladium - Adults Only is 9.5 miles from Punta Cana. TRS Turquesa by Palladium - Adults Only is 35.9 miles from La Romana.\"},{\"question\":\"How does KAYAK find such great TRS Turquesa by Palladium - Adults Only hotel deals?\",\"answer\":\"KAYAK scours the web for all room deals available at TRS Turquesa by Palladium - Adults Only in Punta Cana and lets you compare them to find the best rate for your stay. Many different travel sites will offer discounts or deals at different times for rooms at TRS Turquesa by Palladium - Adults Only and KAYAK will provide you with prices from a huge range of travel sites. That means that you can always find a great deal for TRS Turquesa by Palladium - Adults Only.\"},{\"question\":\"Does TRS Turquesa by Palladium - Adults Only have a pool?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, TRS Turquesa by Palladium - Adults Only has a pool onsite.\"}]','{\"score\":8.6,\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":642,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":404},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":86},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":52},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":27},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":24},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":14},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":35}],\"summary\":\"Overall, guests appreciated the hotel’s friendly and attentive staff, with many highlighting excellent service from butlers and other personnel. Cleanliness was consistently mentioned as a positive aspect, with rooms and public areas well maintained. The breakfast and dining options received good feedback for variety and quality, though some noted inconsistency in other meals. The pools were popular for being well-kept and relaxing, and several guests enjoyed spacious rooms. Some negative feedback focused on slow or inconsistent service, issues with beach cleanliness, and occasional problems with amenities, but the positives generally outweighed the negatives.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":9},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":8.5},{\"label\":\"Breakfast\",\"score\":8},{\"label\":\"Pool\",\"score\":8},{\"label\":\"Room Size\",\"score\":7.5}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.6,\"reviews\":219},{\"name\":\"Priceline\",\"score\":8.9,\"reviews\":40},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":8.7,\"reviews\":8},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":5.8,\"reviews\":2}],\"mentions\":[\"staff was very friendly\",\"food was good\",\"room service\",\"room was very good\",\"everything was excellent\",\"pool and beach\",\"resorts\",\"trs\",\"bar which was great\",\"la carte\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What are the pros of staying at TRS Turquesa?\",\"answer\":\"Everything about the resort was wonderful. The staff was so accommodating and the grounds were beautiful. Great beach, great pools, convenient to rooms, plenty of seating at beach. Some of the restaurants were great, others were good. Staff was great and great location. It was gorgeous. The views the beach was amazing. Service, the staff, the food, how clean it was. My wife and I stayed for 5 days. The hotel was next to the beach. Our room had a pool and ocean view. The staff was polite and very helpful. There are a couple of restaurants with different cuisine. The food was great and well arranged, especially for dinner. I would recommend the TRS Turquesa hotel to anyone who wants a nice vacation. Staff were great! Different pools and dining options. Could walk around or catch a ride. Super friendly and helpful staff. Beach access. Serene grounds. Spa was fabulous! Very zen throughout!\"},{\"question\":\"What are the cons of staying at TRS Turquesa?\",\"answer\":\"My ONLY complaint is the bathroom stall in the rooms. There is not much privacy of others are in the room. Sometimes music outside too loud, very loud in room, when wanted quiet. The curtains in room was dirty. The curtains around the bed was dusty. When cleaning the rooms they need to think about after each person to wash or place new clean curtains around bed and windows. I wiped them down myself and sprayed Lysol which I wouldn’t have to. All the solicitors on the beach going back and forth all day... I did feel like the staff was choosy on who they wanted to serve which seemed a little impartial which was sad because the people who they chose to appeal treated them not nice epically with tips but because what they looked like. Hopefully they do better. Food variety was limited. This a fraud I couldnt stay when my reservation was paid in fulll and they charge me more than usual for stay one night and the supervisor was not professional and didnt give me option to feel comfortable I lost a lots of money charge for one room. The “travel club” people are relentless in trying to sell you their club which is like a time share. They roam around looking to talk to you all the time. Food was average. Lots of different cuisine options for dinner. Lunch became repetitive. Overall quality of food, especially the chicken and meat, was disappointing. Our room, while cleaned fantastic every day, had some issues with hot water a few times. Bathroom facilities at pools could have used a little extra attention and our sliding door to the pool was very loud and squeaky. The service did not correspond to a 5 star hotel, specially at the restaurants. We asked for an infusion and they said they didn’t have hot water. We insisted and after 30min we left. No one brought the infusion. We were there for 4 days, on 2 days there was no cold water and we couldn’t shower with hot boiling water. We had to call to get it fixed so we could shower. The battery of the door lock died and we waited for 30min and had to ask a couple of times if anyone was coming anytime soon. Timeshare spills. Older buildings. Loud when ppl pass rooms have to put towel under door . Can’t find butler half the time. Guest using speakers blasting music till 230a . Clientele is not a 4-5 star base. Flies all over the buffet . Smoke detector flashing strobe light in room till maintenance ripped it off wall and never brought it back . Room never got changed like promised. Every free gift offered for timeshare was never fulfilled . Lack of customer service, they were sanding the walls of the hallway, power outtage, food wasn’t all that great. The fact that the 2nd day there was that nasty seaweed rolled in. No fault of the hotel but the beach did not get cleaned up by staff and spent the day at the pool.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the highlights of TRS Turquesa\'s amenities?\",\"answer\":\"The property features a private beach, outdoor pools, multiple dining options, and a spa. The staff is accommodating and the grounds are beautiful. There are different pools and dining options, and guests can walk around or catch a ride. The hotel offers beach access and serene grounds, with a fabulous spa and zen atmosphere throughout.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the common complaints about TRS Turquesa\'s amenities?\",\"answer\":\"Some guests mentioned issues with the cleanliness of the curtains in the rooms, as well as the loud music outside and in the rooms. There were also complaints about the staff\'s service, food variety, and the presence of solicitors on the beach. Additionally, some guests experienced problems with hot water, door locks, and bathroom facilities at the pools.\"},{\"question\":\"When is the best time to visit TRS Turquesa?\",\"answer\":\"The low season at TRS Turquesa is in August, while the high season is in February. Visitors may consider these seasonal variations when planning their stay.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Book a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the beach or pool comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"Take advantage of the hotel\'s proximity to various attractions such as Avalon Casino Punta Cana, Dolphin Island Park, and Hoyo Azul, all within a short distance from the resort.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Upgrading to Swim-Up Suites\",\"text\":\"Guests were impressed with the swim-up suites, which provide a luxurious and convenient way to access the pool directly from the room.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Time Share Solicitors\",\"text\":\"Some guests reported being approached by time share representatives upon check-in. Being aware of this and politely declining if not interested can help avoid any inconvenience.\"},{\"title\":\"Diverse Dining Options\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the variety of dining options available, with particular praise for the breakfast at Helios with its sea views and live music.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the All-Inclusive Meal Plan\",\"text\":\"Many guests found the all-inclusive meal plan to be convenient and good value for the diverse food and drink options available.\"},{\"title\":\"Stay Informed About Services\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned a lack of information about the services offered and experienced challenges with reservations. It\'s advisable to stay informed and confirm reservations to avoid any inconvenience.\"},{\"title\":\"Access to Other Palladium Resorts\",\"text\":\"Guests highlighted the advantage of having access to other Palladium resorts, providing additional amenities and activities to explore.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Aware of Potential Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"Some guests noted that music outside could be loud, impacting the tranquility of the room. Consider this when selecting the room location.\"},{\"title\":\"Mindful of Room Cleanliness\",\"text\":\"While many guests praised the cleanliness of the resort, a few mentioned specific areas for improvement, such as curtains and bathroom facilities. It may be helpful to communicate any concerns directly to the staff for prompt resolution.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:11:12\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(61,13,'Excellence Punta Cana by The Excellence Collection - Adults Only','excellence-punta-cana-by-the-excellence-collection-adults-only','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_3457bc31a3e790ddd85b0d3ed40a7f11.jpg','Compare prices and find the best deal for the Excellence Punta Cana by The Excellence Collection - Adults Only. Rates from $223.','1, Playas Uvero Alto','+1 809 685 9880',271,4,6,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_3457bc31a3e790ddd85b0d3ed40a7f11.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_0fdab73a6238ef21b29e1b709a5a0ca7.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_6c93fda5414ee7470d6bc32cf02541e3.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_c0ef9236ab3b337cdeae04460110d79e.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_f30b69b776b389d1119eae7745f0c640.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_207418369be37c57c751f05411ca7743.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_65dc98cfd05f0763f9f9768a2c124067.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_5173af6a2856453657dcb309ab0bb6b2.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_b53f0186fcc295cd3b6cea70a476200c.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_970d3cc4d017bbb2021a49772871e6ab.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_1e60ec2102db1c5248e668f408b618c3.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_c3a6b0582821f759c74cbba68e10d6a9.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_e52cdb025fdba2a9faca598830815b3f.jpg\"]',NULL,'https://www.kayak.com/Punta-Cana-Hotels-Excellence-Punta-Cana-by-The-Excellence-Collection---Adults-Only.50729.ksp','[\"Wedding services\",\"Free Wi-Fi\",\"Babysitting or child care\",\"Outdoor tennis\",\"Car rental\",\"Wi-Fi available in all areas\",\"Internet\",\"Terrace/Patio\",\"Daily housekeeping\",\"Increased accessibility\",\"Beach towels\",\"Linens\",\"Concierge service\",\"Towels\",\"Fan\",\"Currency exchange on-site\",\"Surfing\",\"Gift shop\",\"Rooftop\",\"Hammam (Turkish bath)\",\"Laundry facilities\",\"Elevator\",\"Laundry service\",\"Meeting/Banquet facilities\",\"Multi-lingual staff\",\"Massage\",\"Yoga\",\"Free toiletries\",\"Pool bar\",\"Room service\",\"Eco tourism\",\"Chauffeur\",\"Special diet menus (on request)\",\"Tour desk\",\"Hypoallergenic\",\"Slippers\",\"First-aid kit\",\"Spa\",\"Hot tub\",\"Indoor pool\",\"Outdoor pool\",\"Scuba diving\",\"Diving\",\"Snorkeling\",\"No smoking\",\"Fitness classes\",\"Bathtub\",\"Restaurant\",\"Bar/Lounge\",\"Beauty salon\",\"Laptop safe\",\"Hairdryer\",\"Fitness center\",\"Bottle of water\",\"Cable or satellite TV\",\"Telephone\",\"Air-conditioned\",\"Safe\",\"Sauna\",\"Toothbrush\",\"Airport shuttle (surcharge)\",\"Coffee machine\",\"TV\",\"Free parking\",\"Desk\",\"Shopping\",\"Pool table\",\"Coffee shop\",\"Private beach\",\"Bathrobe\",\"Private bathroom\",\"Garden\",\"24hr front desk\",\"Designated smoking area\",\"Steam room\",\"Storage available\",\"Shuttle service (additional charge)\"]',0,'[{\"question\":\"Does the Excellence Punta Cana - Adults Only have any special lounges?\",\"answer\":\"Prelude Bar is one of the most popular hangout spots at Excellence Punta Cana Adults Only, as it is located directly on the beach and serves a variety of coffee and homemade drinks. To enjoy a beverage while you are relaxing by the pool, go to Blue, the hotel’s swim-up bar. For guests that would like to watch an important game during their trip, there is the Sports Bar lounge that is equipped with a large screen, casual appetizers, and a selection of beers.\"},{\"question\":\"What shows or forms of entertainment are offered at the Excellence Punta Cana - Adults Only?\",\"answer\":\"At the main stage of Excellence Punta Cana Adults Only, guests can enjoy a variety of daily shows for free without needing to reserve tickets ahead of time. While some of the performances relate to the local culture and Dominican folklore, others are musicals, comedy performances, or tributes to famous artists, such as Michael Jackson. Additionally, many of the hotel’s bars and lounges have bands and musicians that play throughout the afternoon and night, so make sure to look at the daily entertainment schedule to see if something catches your eye.\"},{\"question\":\"What sports activities does the Excellence Punta Cana - Adults Only offer?\",\"answer\":\"To learn more about the region and see the area’s lush landscape, guests are invited to embark on a guided bike tour that is offered in both English and Spanish. If you would like to spend your vacation relaxing on the beach, you can join a game of beach football or volleyball. To try something new, sign up for a complimentary Spanish dancing class, which takes place in the facilities of Excellence Punta Cana Adults Only.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the best way to travel from Punta Cana International Airport to Excellence Punta Cana - Adults Only?\",\"answer\":\"If you will be flying into Punta Cana International Airport, you can either rent a car or take a taxi to travel to Excellence Punta Cana - Adults Only. With no additional traffic or bad weather, the drive should take you between 40 to 50m. For those hoping to grab a taxi, you can find cabs outside of the airport’s arrivals terminal 24h a day, and the fare will cost you between 3,500 to 4,000 DOP (approximately 70 to 80 USD).\"},{\"question\":\"What are the business amenities offered by the Excellence Punta Cana - Adults Only?\",\"answer\":\"For those that are interested in hosting a meeting or workshop at the Excellence Punta Cana - Adults Only, it is possible to book the hotel’s 1,830 sq ft meeting room. To have a reception, happy hour, or opening ceremony for your conference, you can also use one of the resort’s several cocktail terraces that offer guests direct views of the nearby ocean. If you need any additional help planning your event, there is a team of professional event coordinators that can offer advice and support in regards to creating your dream meeting, as well as employees that are specialized in technology and food catering. (Prices checked 30/04/19).\"},{\"question\":\"Where is Excellence Punta Cana by The Excellence Collection - Adults Only located?\",\"answer\":\"Excellence Punta Cana by The Excellence Collection - Adults Only is located at 1, Playas Uvero Alto in Uvero Alto, 15 miles from the center of Punta Cana. Sirenis Aquagames Water Park is the closest landmark to Excellence Punta Cana by The Excellence Collection - Adults Only.\"},{\"question\":\"When is check-in time and check-out time at Excellence Punta Cana by The Excellence Collection - Adults Only?\",\"answer\":\"Check-in time is 3:00 PM and check-out time is 12:00 PM at Excellence Punta Cana by The Excellence Collection - Adults Only.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Excellence Punta Cana by The Excellence Collection - Adults Only offer free Wi-Fi?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Excellence Punta Cana by The Excellence Collection - Adults Only offers free Wi-Fi.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Excellence Punta Cana by The Excellence Collection - Adults Only offer free parking?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Excellence Punta Cana by The Excellence Collection - Adults Only offers free parking.\"},{\"question\":\"How far is Excellence Punta Cana by The Excellence Collection - Adults Only from the airport?\",\"answer\":\"Excellence Punta Cana by The Excellence Collection - Adults Only is 23.7 miles from Punta Cana. Excellence Punta Cana by The Excellence Collection - Adults Only is 32.9 miles from La Romana.\"},{\"question\":\"How does KAYAK find such great Excellence Punta Cana by The Excellence Collection - Adults Only hotel deals?\",\"answer\":\"KAYAK scours the web for all room deals available at Excellence Punta Cana by The Excellence Collection - Adults Only in Punta Cana and lets you compare them to find the best rate for your stay. Many different travel sites will offer discounts or deals at different times for rooms at Excellence Punta Cana by The Excellence Collection - Adults Only and KAYAK will provide you with prices from a huge range of travel sites. That means that you can always find a great deal for Excellence Punta Cana by The Excellence Collection - Adults Only.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Excellence Punta Cana by The Excellence Collection - Adults Only have a pool?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Excellence Punta Cana by The Excellence Collection - Adults Only has a pool onsite.\"}]','{\"score\":8.5,\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":6,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":3},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":1},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":0},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":1},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":0},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":0},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":0}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":10,\"reviews\":1},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":8.3,\"reviews\":2}],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What are the dining options at Excellence Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"Excellence Punta Cana offers nine world-class restaurants, 12 bars, a buffet, and a beachside snack hut. Guests can enjoy prime steaks and seafood at The Grill, dig into flavorful Mexican favorites at Agave, or indulge in Asian fusion specialties at Spice.\"},{\"question\":\"What activities are available at Excellence Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"Excellence Punta Cana provides activities such as helicopter rides over Punta Cana, whale watching excursions, speedboat and catamaran tours, guided scuba diving expeditions, private tennis lessons, and more.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the accommodations like at Excellence Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"Accommodations at Excellence Punta Cana consist of five-star suites filled with tropical furnishings. Rooms include the Junior Swim-Up Suite with a private furnished terrace, jetted whirlpool bath, a stocked minibar, and high-end entertainment features. The ocean-front Terrace Suite with Plunge Pool includes turn-down service, a pillow menu, and a 450 square-foot terrace. The Excellence Club Honeymoon Suite with ocean views is the perfect spot for newlyweds to soak in the sun and bask in privacy.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the health and safety measures at Excellence Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"Excellence Punta Cana has enhanced cleaning, hand sanitizer in guest accommodation and key areas, daily housekeeping, safe, and disinfection of high-touch surfaces to ensure the well-being of guests.\"},{\"question\":\"When is the high season at Excellence Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"The high season at Excellence Punta Cana is in February.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for the Excellence Club Honeymoon Suite\",\"text\":\"Guests highly recommend the Excellence Club Honeymoon Suite for a private and romantic experience, perfect for newlyweds or couples celebrating anniversaries.\"},{\"title\":\"Make Use of the Miilé Spa\",\"text\":\"Indulge in the Miilé Spa\'s beauty treatments and therapies for a relaxing and rejuvenating experience, as recommended by several guests.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"Take advantage of the hotel\'s proximity to attractions such as Sirenis Aquagames Water Park, Macao Beach, and various golf courses for a diverse and enjoyable vacation experience.\"},{\"titl