car. By driving via Boulevard Punta Cana and Turístico del Este, you get the most direct route to the resort.\"},{\"question\":\"Are children’s beds available at the Majestic Mirage Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"All children are welcome at the Majestic Mirage Punta Cana and the hotel provides extra cots or beds for children. Cots for infants from 0-1 years of age can be arranged for your stay and are free of charge, whereas an additional bed for children aged 2+ comes at an additional charge.\"},{\"question\":\"Which fitness programs are offered at the Majestic Mirage Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"A spacious fitness center is part of the Majestic Mirage Punta Cana facilities and invites with modern equipment, but there is more to explore for the body. With a personal trainer, you can work out even more efficiently during your holidays, and if you prefer to focus on your mind as well as the body, you can benefit from the yoga classes that regularly take place at the gym. The concierge will be happy to provide the current timetable.\"},{\"question\":\"Which kinds of entertainment can I enjoy at the Majestic Mirage Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"Keep your eyes peeled for magical events, as the Majestic Mirage Punta Cana Hotel entertains with themed dinner parties as well as live music. Not far from the hotel, there is also the casino on Caribbean Street to which hotel guests have free access. Cap off the night with a little gambling and gaming before sinking into your soft pillows.\"},{\"question\":\"Which facilities for children are offered at the Majestic Mirage Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"The Majestic Mirage Punta Cana Hotel prides itself on family friendliness and caters to every need – little and bigger ones included. At the hotel’s main buffet, you will find child-friendly selections. Babysitting services can also be booked, so the grown-ups get to enjoy a night out, too.\"},{\"question\":\"When are the restaurants at the Majestic Mirage Punta Cana open?\",\"answer\":\"Travelers coming to the Majestic Mirage Punta Cana Hotel are spoiled for choice when it comes to dining – also because round-the-clock dining is available. The Draft Sports Bar offers American cuisine 24/7, as well as good sports entertainment and equipment (like billiards and pool). If eating without children is more up your sleeve, the La Rinascita indulges guests over 18 with Italian delicacies for breakfast and lunch. For stunning views over the sea, the Seaside Restaurant opens its doors for breakfast, lunch, and dinner.\"},{\"question\":\"What is part of the Mirage Club at the Majestic Mirage Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"Part of the Adults Only experience are the eight swimming pools, as well as exclusive access to the restaurant La Rinascita and two VIP lounges, which makes it the perfect experience for honeymooners and or other people who want to enjoy a child-free holiday. The check-in procedures already take place in a remote lobby to which people under 18 have no access, so you can start your vacation relaxed.\"},{\"question\":\"Where is Majestic Mirage Punta Cana – All-Suite Resort located?\",\"answer\":\"Majestic Mirage Punta Cana – All-Suite Resort is located at Playa Arena Gorda, Carr. El Macao in Pueblo Bavaro, 4.1 miles from the center of Punta Cana. Cana Bay Golf Club is the closest landmark to Majestic Mirage Punta Cana – All-Suite Resort.\"},{\"question\":\"When is check-in time and check-out time at Majestic Mirage Punta Cana – All-Suite Resort?\",\"answer\":\"Check-in time is 3:00 PM and check-out time is 12:00 PM at Majestic Mirage Punta Cana – All-Suite Resort.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Majestic Mirage Punta Cana – All-Suite Resort offer free Wi-Fi?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Majestic Mirage Punta Cana – All-Suite Resort offers free Wi-Fi.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Majestic Mirage Punta Cana – All-Suite Resort offer free parking?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Majestic Mirage Punta Cana – All-Suite Resort offers free parking.\"},{\"question\":\"How far is Majestic Mirage Punta Cana – All-Suite Resort from the airport?\",\"answer\":\"Majestic Mirage Punta Cana – All-Suite Resort is 13.2 miles from Punta Cana. Majestic Mirage Punta Cana – All-Suite Resort is 34.9 miles from La Romana.\"},{\"question\":\"How does KAYAK find such great Majestic Mirage Punta Cana – All-Suite Resort hotel deals?\",\"answer\":\"KAYAK scours the web for all room deals available at Majestic Mirage Punta Cana – All-Suite Resort in Punta Cana and lets you compare them to find the best rate for your stay. Many different travel sites will offer discounts or deals at different times for rooms at Majestic Mirage Punta Cana – All-Suite Resort and KAYAK will provide you with prices from a huge range of travel sites. That means that you can always find a great deal for Majestic Mirage Punta Cana – All-Suite Resort.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Majestic Mirage Punta Cana – All-Suite Resort have a pool?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Majestic Mirage Punta Cana – All-Suite Resort has a pool onsite.\"}]','{\"score\":8.7,\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":2442,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":1596},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":313},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":199},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":97},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":88},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":37},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":112}],\"summary\":\"Guests consistently highlight the attentive and friendly service, especially from butlers and staff, as a major positive. Many appreciate the variety and quality of restaurants and food options, with several mentioning excellent experiences at à la carte venues. Spacious and comfortable rooms are also frequently praised. However, some guests note issues with cleanliness, humidity, and food variety, as well as occasional maintenance concerns. Overall, the positive service and amenities stand out, making for a generally enjoyable stay.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":9.5},{\"label\":\"Restaurant\",\"score\":9},{\"label\":\"Room Size\",\"score\":8.5},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":5}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.7,\"reviews\":1222},{\"name\":\"Priceline\",\"score\":8.5,\"reviews\":128},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":9.9,\"reviews\":2},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":8.3,\"reviews\":4}],\"mentions\":[\"staff was friendly\",\"food was good\",\"butler service\",\"beautiful beach\",\"good room\",\"room service\",\"everything was great\",\"sports bar\",\"overall experience\",\"steak house\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What are the dining options available at Majestic Mirage Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"Majestic Mirage Punta Cana offers seven restaurants, including the Don Jaume Steak House, L´Essence, and Kabuki, serving a variety of cuisines from Japanese to Caribbean fare.\"},{\"question\":\"Are there any specific amenities for adults at Majestic Mirage Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, the resort offers specific adults-only amenities at the Mirage Club, including VIP lounges and bars with scratch-made cocktails, beer, and wine.\"},{\"question\":\"What can guests expect at the Splash Kids Club at Majestic Mirage Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"Children can enjoy two pools with water slides, a maze, and various kid-friendly activities at the Splash Kids Club at Majestic Mirage Punta Cana.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the nearby attractions to Majestic Mirage Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"Nearby attractions include Cana Bay Golf Club, Hard Rock Casino Punta Cana, and Macao Beach, offering guests various options for entertainment and activities.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the common concerns about the hotel according to guest reviews?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have expressed concerns about the difficulty in finding the right person to ask about activities, the layout of the resort, the quality of the food, and the loud outdoor music. Some guests also mentioned issues with room cleanliness and the availability of cold milk and reliable Wi-Fi.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Book a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the beach or ocean comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Golf Courses\",\"text\":\"The hotel is conveniently located near several golf courses, such as Cana Bay Golf Club and Punta Blanca Golf Course, making it an ideal destination for golf enthusiasts.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Upgrading to the Mirage Club\",\"text\":\"Guests looking for an adults-only experience with exclusive amenities should consider upgrading to the Mirage Club, which offers specific adult-only services and facilities.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Splash Kids Club\",\"text\":\"Families traveling with children can make the most of the Splash Kids Club, which features pools with water slides, a maze, and various kid-friendly activities, providing a fun and safe environment for young guests.\"},{\"title\":\"Enjoy the Variety of Dining Options\",\"text\":\"With seven restaurants on-site, including options like the Don Jaume Steak House, L´Essence, and Kabuki, guests can indulge in a diverse range of cuisines, from Japanese to Caribbean fare, ensuring a delightful dining experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan Your Visit According to Season\",\"text\":\"Considering the high season in February and the low season in September, guests can plan their visit based on their preferences for crowd levels and weather, ensuring a more personalized experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Request Assistance from the Butlers\",\"text\":\"Guests can benefit from the attentive service provided by the butlers, who have been praised for their helpfulness and dedication in ensuring a special and enjoyable stay for guests.\"},{\"title\":\"Make Reservations for Popular Activities\",\"text\":\"To avoid disappointment, it\'s advisable to make reservations for popular activities and restaurants in advance, such as the hibachi dining experience, ensuring access to desired services and experiences.\"},{\"title\":\"Utilize the 24-Hour Room Service\",\"text\":\"Guests can take advantage of the 24-hour room service available at the hotel, providing convenience and flexibility for dining and refreshments at any time of the day.\"},{\"title\":\"Check Out Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s proximity to attractions like Hoyo Azul, Macao Beach, and Dolphin Island Park offers guests the opportunity to explore and experience the natural beauty and activities available in the surrounding area.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:11:37\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(64,13,'Hotel Hm Bavaro Beach - Adults Only','hotel-hm-bavaro-beach-adults-only','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_98bc40875412177ac0e2cf9af3f24f51.jpg','Compare prices and find the best deal for the Hotel Hm Bavaro Beach - Adults Only. Rates from $99.','C. Mare','+1 809 688 1612',106,4,622,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_98bc40875412177ac0e2cf9af3f24f51.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_0c3accbf3f79778c1da9ad0479952a45.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_e9f60fa2e28b96901defb070fe8ddaab.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_75c987d0ee89cf3b5add8628290128dd.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_bae74b4ac3b9ec74d944b304d89ecc3a.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_e63879dd28854820e406d903c54fe5c2.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_c7ad4c1a0bd52edba2c7b38f6d6f0bd6.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_b5edfa1819740d3dbd21158a6584e8e9.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_cd373b8cc20c9d605c8062af1ec25eaa.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d795fb5256c59457713fe11ed7a4759f.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_73a81becfb91de4699dd092e8971fb7f.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d1dc357efe7262bd3a23a4c89f8ec68b.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_e0bb6a7aac51ae68518401c91279bf6a.jpg\"]',NULL,'https://www.kayak.com/Punta-Cana-Hotels-Hotel-Hm-B