ers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.2,\"reviews\":204}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:11:44\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(65,13,'Majestic Elegance - Punta Cana','majestic-elegance-punta-cana','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_029fec0d49f3028a333031e288df827a.jpg','This Caribbean beachfront resort hotel offers an on-site theater, 6 restaurants and 9 bars. All rooms feature at least 1 spa bath and a full bathroom with walk-in shower. The elegant suites at the Majestic Elegance – Punta Cana are fitted with European marble and contain a plasma TV with satellite service and a DVD player. A coffee machine, work desk and minibar are included. Room service is provided through an independent door in each suite. Some suites feature indoor and outdoor spa baths. Guests of Majestic Elegance have access to a golf course and a casino. A supervised children\'s club is a 2-minute walk from the suites. A pool, spa and water sports are also available. The Elegance Club is an adult-only place of entertainment that features a private pool and beach areas. Among other amenities, the Club provides upgraded services such as butler service and free internet access. Restaurants feature a variety of international cuisine. Some include live music and a dress code. The Majestic Elegance Punta Cana is within 12 minutes drive from Manati Park and within 30 minutes drive from Punta Cana International Airport.','Playa Bavaro - Punta Cana','+1 809 221 9898',208,4,2142,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_029fec0d49f3028a333031e288df827a.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_9cefada03fa98e9bd20aa02c31b44fc9.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_c6352c63502d9a5119e3cb90e1625d1a.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_34f4dc407417334bf635488d6eaf3d08.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_aa6654b4ef7ab285f27b94c837771c49.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_963ce4cc7688a5d7ad4885b13d25dae2.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/me