ry breakfast\",\"Free parking\",\"Table tennis\",\"Pool towels\",\"Pool view\",\"Playground\",\"Pool table\",\"Water sport facilities (on site)\",\"Coffee shop\",\"Private beach\",\"Windsurfing\",\"Bathrobe\",\"Private bathroom\",\"Garden\",\"Private check-in/check-out\",\"24hr front desk\",\"Designated smoking area\",\"Private entrance\",\"Steam room\",\"Night club\",\"Storage available\",\"Private parking\",\"Wedding services\",\"Free Wi-Fi\",\"Ticket service\",\"Outdoor tennis\",\"Basketball court\",\"Terrace/Patio\",\"Increased accessibility\",\"Beach chairs\",\"Beach towels\",\"Linens\",\"Towels\",\"Safety deposit box\",\"Grill\",\"Sea view\",\"Seating area\",\"Elevator\",\"Massage\",\"Boating\",\"Yoga\",\"Shampoo\",\"Pool bar\",\"Shower\",\"Rain showers\",\"Accessible by elevator\",\"Accessible parking\",\"Adapted bath\",\"Slippers\",\"First-aid kit\",\"Additional bathroom\",\"Snack bar\",\"Socket near the bed\",\"Sofa\",\"Alarm clock\",\"Balcony\",\"Bathtub\",\"Spa bath\",\"Gym\",\"Body soap\",\"Flexible event space\",\"Bottle of water\",\"Tea/coffee maker\",\"Kayaking\",\"Telephone\",\"Tile/marble floor\",\"Chapel/shrine\",\"Toilet\",\"Toilet paper\",\"Safe\",\"Sauna\",\"Clothes rack\",\"Trash cans\",\"Coffee machine\",\"Parasailing\",\"TV\",\"Upper floors accessible by elevator\",\"Conditioner\",\"Sailing\",\"Desk\",\"Shopping\",\"Dining area\",\"Walk-in shower\",\"Wardrobe or closet\",\"Drying rack for clothing\",\"DVD player\",\"Water slide\",\"Theme park\"]',0,'[{\"question\":\"Are there any special services available for couples on honeymoon at Majestic Elegance – Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"Newlyweds who choose to celebrate at the hotel will be treated to a romantic in-suite breakfast as well as a dinner in the beach restaurant, a bottle of champagne and fruit platter upon arrival, a souvenir photograph and a discount at the spa. Extras like room upgrades and early check-in are also offered subject to availability.\"},{\"question\":\"What kid-friendly amenities are offered at Majestic Elegance – Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"The entire family can enjoy a stay at the hotel thanks to the services provided by the Family Club. Unlimited snacks and drinks are available 24/7, and kids can burn off all their energy in the Splash Kids pool and dedicated activities areas; teenagers have one all to themselves, with table football and darts. A children’s club provides plenty of supervised activities from 9:00 am to 6:00 pm daily, leaving mom and dad free to enjoy some relaxation.\"},{\"question\":\"Is it possible to arrange a late checkout at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Majestic Elegance – Punta Cana can offer a late checkout depending on availability; an extra fee will apply for this service. Late checkout customers can benefit from a courtesy shower in the hotel lobby to wash away the sand after a last day on the beach.\"},{\"question\":\"What kind of entertainment is on offer at Majestic Elegance – Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"Entertainment at Majestic Elegance – Punta Cana comes in a variety of forms, with a regularly changing schedule of performances in the hotel’s bars and common areas. Live music is performed every evening in the Plaza Bar, while the Piano Bar and Sports Bar will keep music and sports fans happy. Other experiences include the wine tasting room, where for an additional fee you can sample fine wines from across the world.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Majestic Elegance – Punta Cana offer any tours or excursions?\",\"answer\":\"If you want to explore the local area, Majestic Elegance – Punta Cana can help book several exciting adventures. A dedicated tourist information service is available in the lobby, with several experiences on offer such as swimming with dolphins, an island swim and lunch on Cayo Levantado, boating to Saona Island, or exploring the town of Santo Domingo.\"},{\"question\":\"Are there any VIP areas at Majestic Elegance – Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"Accessible only to adults (18+) who have booked an Elegance Club stay at Majestic Elegance – Punta Cana, the three Elegance Club VIP lounges offer amenities such as computers, table games and a library.\"},{\"question\":\"Is it possible to indulge in a shopping spree at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, located between Majestic Elegance – Punta Cana and the neighboring Majestic Colonial hotel, you will find the Calle Caribeña. This traditionally designed street features a range of boutiques carrying jewelry and clothing, gifts, souvenirs, cosmetics and tobacco products.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the best way to get from the airport to Majestic Elegance – Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"Driving from Punta Cana Airport to the hotel should take around 30m. Cabs are readily available at the airport and will cost around 2,000 DOP (40 USD) for the trip, but it may be cheaper to book a prepaid service online in advance – companies such as Dominican Plus offer competitive rates of around 1,600 DOP (32 USD) for the trip.(Prices checked 05/02/19).\"},{\"question\":\"Where is Majestic Elegance - Punta Cana located?\",\"answer\":\"Majestic Elegance - Punta Cana is located at Playa Bavaro - Punta Cana in Pueblo Bavaro, 4.1 miles from the center of Punta Cana. Cana Bay Golf Club is the closest landmark to Majestic Elegance - Punta Cana.\"},{\"question\":\"When is check-in time and check-out time at Majestic Elegance - Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"Check-in time is 3:00 PM and check-out time is 12:00 PM at Majestic Elegance - Punta Cana.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Majestic Elegance - Punta Cana offer free Wi-Fi?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Majestic Elegance - Punta Cana offers free Wi-Fi.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Majestic Elegance - Punta Cana offer free parking?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Majestic Elegance - Punta Cana offers free parking.\"},{\"question\":\"How far is Majestic Elegance - Punta Cana from the airport?\",\"answer\":\"Majestic Elegance - Punta Cana is 13.3 miles from Punta Cana. Majestic Elegance - Punta Cana is 35.1 miles from La Romana.\"},{\"question\":\"How does KAYAK find such great Majestic Elegance - Punta Cana hotel deals?\",\"answer\":\"KAYAK scours the web for all room deals available at Majestic Elegance - Punta Cana in Punta Cana and lets you compare them to find the best rate for your stay. Many different travel sites will offer discounts or deals at different times for rooms at Majestic Elegance - Punta Cana and KAYAK will provide you with prices from a huge range of travel sites. That means that you can always find a great deal for Majestic Elegance - Punta Cana.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Majestic Elegance - Punta Cana have a pool?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Majestic Elegance - Punta Cana has a pool onsite.\"}]','{\"score\":8.5,\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":2142,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":1317},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":315},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":182},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":91},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":97},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":33},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":107}],\"summary\":\"Most guests highlighted the hotel\'s excellent service, friendly and attentive staff, and well-maintained, clean facilities. The pools and pool areas were frequently mentioned as a highlight, and many appreciated the spacious rooms. Breakfast and food quality received positive remarks in several reviews. While some guests noted areas for improvement such as food variety, maintenance, and beach conditions, the overall sentiment was positive, especially regarding service and cleanliness.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":9},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":8.5},{\"label\":\"Pool\",\"score\":8},{\"label\":\"Room Size\",\"score\":7},{\"label\":\"Breakfast\",\"score\":6.5}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.6,\"reviews\":971},{\"name\":\"Priceline\",\"score\":7.5,\"reviews\":71},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":7.6,\"reviews\":3},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":7.9,\"reviews\":6}],\"mentions\":[\"amazing and the staff\",\"food was good\",\"nice beach\",\"butler service\",\"well maintained\",\"elegance\",\"club members\",\"swim up bar\",\"daily activities\",\"everything was perfect\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What are the dining options like at Majestic Elegance Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"Majestic Elegance Punta Cana offers nine restaurants and 11 bars with distinct ambiance and gourmet delights. Guests can enjoy fresh seafood and unbeatable oceanside views at See and Sea, crave-worthy Japanese cuisine at 9 Doors, and the finest Argentinian and U.S.-styled beef at Asadito Steakhouse.\"},{\"question\":\"What activities are available for guests at Majestic Elegance Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"Guests at Majestic Elegance Punta Cana can enjoy unlimited free golf at the Nick Price-designed Punta Blanca Golf Course, access to the fitness center and tennis courts, and thrilling water sports such as scuba lessons, kayaking, windsurfing, catamaran riding, and snorkeling.\"},{\"question\":\"What are guests saying about the cleanliness at Majestic Elegance Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have consistently praised the resort for being very clean and well-lit at night, providing a safe and comfortable environment for all visitors.\"},{\"question\":\"What are some common concerns about the food at Majestic Elegance Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"Some guests have expressed concerns about the food, mentioning that it could have been better and that one of their party got food poisoning after eating shrimp. However, others have described the food as delicious and exceptional.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the best times to visit Majestic Elegance Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"The low season at Majestic Elegance Punta Cana is in June, while the high season is in February. Visitors can expect beautiful weather and a range of activities throughout the year.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for the Elegance Club\",\"text\":\"If you prefer a more adult-oriented and exclusive experience, consider booking a room in the Elegance Club section, which is reserved for guests over 18 and offers a more serene atmosphere.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Golf Courses\",\"text\":\"Take advantage of the all-inclusive program\'s free access to the Punta Blanca Golf Course and consider visiting other nearby golf courses, such as Cana Bay Golf Club and Iberostar Golf Course, for a diverse golfing experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan Off-Peak Visits\",\"text\":\"Consider visiting during the low season in June to potentially enjoy fewer crowds and more affordable rates, while still experiencing the resort\'s amenities and nearby attractions.\"},{\"title\":\"Request Room Amenities\",\"text\":\"If specific amenities like robes, drying racks, or DVD players are important to you, it may be beneficial to request them in advance to ensure they are available in your room upon arrival.\"},{\"title\":\"Dine at See and Sea\",\"text\":\"Guests highly recommend visiting the See and Sea restaurant for its fresh seafood and stunning ocean views, making it a must-visit dining option during your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Beach Vendors\",\"text\":\"While the beach is beautiful, be prepared for persistent vendors. Consider politely declining their offerings to maintain a peaceful and relaxing beach experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Alternative Dining Options\",\"text\":\"While the resort offers a variety of dining choices, some guests found the buffet food to be subpar in taste. Exploring the a la carte dining options may provide a more satisfying culinary experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of Butler Services\",\"text\":\"If available, utilize the butler services for assistance with reservations and any other needs during your stay, as many guests found the butlers to be attentive and accommodating.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Room Upgrades\",\"text\":\"If available, consider inquiring about room upgrades, as some guests appreciated being upgraded to newer accommodations and appreciated the gesture, especially for special occasions.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan for Flight Delays\",\"text\":\"If you have a late flight departure, inquire about the possibility of extending your stay to continue enjoying the resort\'s amenities until your departure, as some guests were allowed to do so and found it convenient.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:11:50\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(66,13,'Bahia Principe Escape Aquamarine - Adults Only','bahia-principe-escape-aquamarine-adults-only','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_45735551ab741aa24598bd90ce4aa01f.jpg','Compare prices and find the best deal for the Bahia Principe Escape Aquamarine - Adults Only. Rates from $129.','Carretera Arena Gorda Macao','+1 809 552 1444',134,4,603,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_45735551ab741aa24598bd90ce4aa01f.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_48f79112f7b983f33ed544399b0535b7.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_8b2a762180b0e53f393ef9046d30e51a.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d5d57e3122b85e6e3350ccee2d0a0c1c.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_82a83dc7713312d0f57fedc7a18dd6f6.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_2ffbca6de99f8b3f62d3a1199fc9197e.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_25c83a3a9cb2cb837b3a16892eee36c7.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_3555f5f794326f78d5f3cfd8e97387db.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_4fa09447d5889c1cabed4b9b2f3374c0.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_9819958c06c2e41028053a33164492ab.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_543bb94f7364fe509bbf3de973a65196.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_54ece9c25ce988664fb1234d1220a8c3.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_c1ad20396e733815752e8544be5593e9.jpg\"]',NULL,'https://www.kayak.com/Punta-Cana-Hotels-Bahia-Principe-Escape-Aquamarine---Adults-Only.4058871.ksp','[\"ATM on-site\",\"Business center\",\"Car rental\",\"Wake-up service\",\"Wi-Fi available in all areas\