ry is well designed and offers clean beach and pool areas. However, some guests have reported issues with room cleaning and mentioned that the rooms were not fully dry, and there was a damp smell in the bedding.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the highlights of the Premium Package at Impressive Premium Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"The Premium Package offers a range of amenities, including a premium beach, bars at the pool and beach, and a variety of dining options. Additionally, Premium guests can get a good discount for massages. However, some guests have mentioned that the Premium upgrade may not be worth it, as the exclusive areas designated for Premium customers were easily accessible by everyone.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the best times to visit Impressive Premium Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"The high season at the hotel is in June, offering an amazing beach with lots of palms and convenient on-the-beach bars. However, it\'s important to note that the low season is in May.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the customer service at Impressive Premium Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"The staff at the hotel is generally friendly and welcoming, with some guests highlighting the excellent service provided by specific staff members. However, there have been reports of poor customer service, including unfriendly and unhelpful staff, as well as issues with the butler service and communication with the hotel staff.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for the Premium Side\",\"text\":\"Guests recommend staying on the premium side of the hotel for a quieter experience, worth the extra cost, with beautiful and clean beaches.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"Take a short walk to the town for shopping and pharmacy, where sunscreen is more affordable than at the resort. Nearby attractions like Dolphin Island Park and Cocotal Golf and Country Club are within a mile.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Room Selection Carefully\",\"text\":\"Some guests recommend avoiding ground floor rooms near the housekeeping station due to noise disturbances, and suggest checking the room location upon arrival.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Additional Costs\",\"text\":\"Non-inclusive items such as massages and manicures are reported to be expensive, so consider this when planning for extra services.\"},{\"title\":\"Book Restaurant Reservations Early\",\"text\":\"To avoid being limited to buffet meals, consider booking other restaurants well in advance, as some require reservations made days ahead.\"},{\"title\":\"Stay Informed About Booking Procedures\",\"text\":\"Guests advise that some restaurants require bookings made in advance, and recommend being aware of this information before arrival to secure reservations.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Cautious of Room Odors\",\"text\":\"Some guests reported unpleasant smells in their rooms, suggesting a need for improvement in room cleanliness and maintenance.\"},{\"title\":\"Stay Vigilant with Security\",\"text\":\"A few guests reported security concerns, including unauthorized access to rooms, highlighting the importance of ensuring personal safety and belongings.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Aware of Butler Services\",\"text\":\"While some guests praised the butler service for enhancing their vacation, others found it to be ineffective, suggesting a need for consistency and improvement in this aspect.\"},{\"title\":\"Check Wi-Fi Connectivity\",\"text\":\"Several guests experienced issues with Wi-Fi connectivity, so it\'s advisable to be prepared for potential challenges with internet access during the stay.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:12:13\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(68,13,'Riu Republica - Adults only','riu-republica-adults-only','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_912aeab2ffda230884bdb501ba292df4.jpg','Compare prices and find the best deal for the Riu Republica - Adults only. Rates from $111.','Playa Arena Gorda','+1 809 933 0101',111,4,2650,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_912aeab2ffda230884bdb501ba292df4.jpg\"