port facilities (on site)\",\"Windsurfing\",\"Bathrobe\",\"Private bathroom\",\"Garden\",\"24hr front desk\",\"Designated smoking area\",\"Steam room\",\"Night club\",\"Storage available\",\"Private parking\",\"Wedding services\",\"Free Wi-Fi\",\"Non-smoking rooms available\",\"Beachfront\",\"Terrace/Patio\",\"Increased accessibility\",\"Beach chairs\",\"Beach towels\",\"Linens\",\"Towels\",\"Safety deposit box\",\"Soap and Shampoo Provided\",\"Adults only\",\"Sea view\",\"Seating area\",\"Elevator\",\"Massage\",\"Shampoo\",\"Pool bar\",\"Shared lounge/TV area\",\"Shower\",\"Slippers\",\"First-aid kit\",\"Snack bar\",\"Socket near the bed\",\"Sofa\",\"Sofa bed\",\"Balcony\",\"Bathtub\",\"Spa bath\",\"Gym\",\"Body soap\",\"Bottle of water\",\"Locally curated art gallery\",\"Tea/coffee maker\",\"Kayaking\",\"Telephone\",\"Toilet\",\"Toilet paper\",\"Safe\",\"Trash cans\",\"Coffee machine\",\"TV\",\"Conditioner\",\"Shopping\",\"Wardrobe or closet\",\"Water slide\"]',0,'[{\"question\":\"Is the Riu Republica - Adults only an eco-friendly hotel?\",\"answer\":\"RIU Hotels & Resorts is working to minimize its impact on the environment through projects designed to reduce CO2 emissions, save water, and protect biodiversity in the areas the resort operates in. The hotel uses energy efficient appliances to reduce energy consumption, actively recycles and reduces waste, and aims to reduce water consumption, and maximize its reuse. The hotel also participates in projects that protect endangered species. RIU hotels are certified by the TRAVELIFE sustainability in tourism certification program.\"},{\"question\":\"Are there any offers or special discounts at the Riu Republica - Adults only?\",\"answer\":\"If you want to benefit from exclusive discounts at Riu Republica, sign up for the RIU Class loyalty card and begin to accumulate points to redeem for future holidays. Classic, Diamond, or Gold memberships receive special benefits, and hotel advantages include a welcome gift, early check-in, late check-out, and room upgrades. RIU Class cardholders also benefit from partner discounts on shopping, golf and PADI scuba diving courses.\"},{\"question\":\"Can the Riu Republica - Adults only accommodate people with gluten allergies?\",\"answer\":\"If you have a food allergy or intolerance, please inform the hotel and speak to your server about your needs when you visit any of the restaurants at Riu Republica. There is a selection of gluten-free meals available, but it is best to discuss your needs clearly before you arrive at the hotel to ensure stress-free dining.\"},{\"question\":\"Is there a dress code at Riu Republica - Adults only?\",\"answer\":\"Riu Republica has a formal dress code for men when dining at the onsite restaurants for dinner. Gentlemen are not permitted to wear sleeveless shirts in the main restaurants, and are requested to wear long pants as well when dining at the theme restaurants.\"},{\"question\":\"What kind of entertainment and nightlife can I find at Riu Republica - Adults only?\",\"answer\":\"Guests can enjoy a variety of shows every night at Riu Republica, from live music and acrobatics to dance performances and magic. The entertaining team of performers welcomes audience participation and the schedule for shows and entertainment is posted in the lobby daily. If you feel like going drinking and dancing, the Pacha disco is open 6 nights a week from 11:00 pm until 2:00 am. The Sports bar is open 24/7 and serves a variety of drinks and snacks.\"},{\"question\":\"What kind of fitness and recreational activities are possible at Riu Republica - Adults only?\",\"answer\":\"If you want to stay active on vacation, there are a number of fitness programs and activities available at the resort. Group fitness classes including yoga and aqua fitness are held in the covered RiuFit area every day. If you prefer to work out on your own, go for a run on the beach or hit the gym, which is equipped with fitness machines and free weights. There is also a beach volleyball court that guests are welcome to use. If you want to spend some time in the water, sign up for a scuba diving lesson in the pool, or rent a snorkel, kayak, windsurf, or catamaran, and go exploring.\"},{\"question\":\"Where is Riu Republica - Adults only located?\",\"answer\":\"Riu Republica - Adults only is located at Playa Arena Gorda in Pueblo Bavaro, 4.6 miles from the center of Punta Cana. Cana Bay Golf Club is the closest landmark to Riu Republica - Adults only.\"},{\"question\":\"When is check-in time and check-out time at Riu Republica - Adults only?\",\"answer\":\"Check-in time is 3:00 PM and check-out time is 12:00 PM at Riu Republica - Adults only.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Riu Republica - Adults only offer free Wi-Fi?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Riu Republica - Adults only offers free Wi-Fi.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Riu Republica - Adults only offer free parking?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Riu Republica - Adults only offers free parking.\"},{\"question\":\"How far is Riu Republica - Adults only from the airport?\",\"answer\":\"Riu Republica - Adults only is 13.6 miles from Punta Cana. Riu Republica - Adults only is 34.6 miles from La Romana.\"},{\"question\":\"How does KAYAK find such great Riu Republica - Adults only hotel deals?\",\"answer\":\"KAYAK scours the web for all room deals available at Riu Republica - Adults only in Punta Cana and lets you compare them to find the best rate for your stay. Many different travel sites will offer discounts or deals at different times for rooms at Riu Republica - Adults only and KAYAK will provide you with prices from a huge range of travel sites. That means that you can always find a great deal for Riu Republica - Adults only.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Riu Republica - Adults only have a pool?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Riu Republica - Adults only has a pool onsite.\"}]','{\"score\":7.1,\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":2650,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":1010},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":465},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":328},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":184},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":211},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":124},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":328}],\"summary\":\"The reviews reveal several recurring issues, with guests frequently mentioning poor cleanliness, unsatisfactory service, and problems with breakfast quality. Many found the rooms to be spacious and appreciated the pool areas, which were highlighted as enjoyable aspects of the hotel. However, negative experiences with staff, lack of cleanliness in both rooms and public areas, and breakfast dissatisfaction were common. Despite these drawbacks, some guests did find the pool facilities and room sizes to be positive features of their stay.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Pool\",\"score\":7.5},{\"label\":\"Room Size\",\"score\":6.5},{\"label\":\"Breakfast\",\"score\":3.5},{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":1.5},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":1}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":7.1,\"reviews\":920},{\"name\":\"Priceline\",\"score\":6.5,\"reviews\":72},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":8,\"reviews\":42},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":8.6,\"reviews\":3}],\"mentions\":[\"pools\",\"beach is just beautiful\",\"costumer\",\"plan\",\"bavaro\",\"republica\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What are the dining options available at Hotel Riu Republica?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers various dining options, including an Italian restaurant, an Asian-themed dining option, and the Grill-Steakhouse for American fare.\"},{\"question\":\"What can I expect from the hotel\'s entertainment program?\",\"answer\":\"Guests can enroll in the resort’s entertainment program and gain access to activities such as windsurfing, snorkeling, diving, water polo, and water exercise classes.\"},{\"question\":\"Are there any concerns about the cleanliness of the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Some guests mentioned concerns about cleanliness, such as rooms not being mopped upon arrival and issues with dirty dishes in the stairwell. However, the hotel has daily housekeeping and enhanced cleaning protocols in place.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the quality of the beds at Hotel Riu Republica?\",\"answer\":\"While some guests found the bedding to be of high quality, others expressed concerns about the bedding being unclean and not changed regularly. The hotel ensures high-end linens and modern amenities in every room.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the best times to visit Hotel Riu Republica?\",\"answer\":\"The high season is in December, offering an ideal time to experience the indulgent amenities and entertainment options. However, it\'s essential to consider potential concerns about food quality and cleanliness mentioned in some reviews.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Book a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the beach or the pools comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"Take advantage of the hotel\'s proximity to various attractions such as the Hard Rock Casino Punta Cana, Cana Bay Golf Club, and Hoyo Azul, which are all within a few miles of the hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Low Season Travel\",\"text\":\"If you prefer fewer crowds, consider visiting in August, which is considered the low season. You may find better deals and a more relaxed atmosphere.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Room Selection\",\"text\":\"Some guests reported issues with outdated rooms and maintenance problems. Consider requesting a recently renovated room to ensure a more comfortable stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan Dining Reservations Wisely\",\"text\":\"Guests mentioned challenges with restaurant reservations. It\'s advisable to make dining reservations early in your stay to secure preferred dining times.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of All-Inclusive Amenities\",\"text\":\"Make the most of the all-inclusive offerings, including access to the various dining options, bars, and entertainment programs available on the property.\"},{\"title\":\"Stay Informed About High Season\",\"text\":\"If you plan to visit in December, the high season, be prepared for larger crowds and potentially higher prices. Booking in advance is advisable during this time.\"},{\"title\":\"Utilize Nearby Water Activities\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the proximity to water activities such as windsurfing, snorkeling, and diving. Take advantage of these offerings for a memorable experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Transportation Options\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers car rental and tour desk services, making it convenient to explore the nearby attractions and make travel arrangements.\"},{\"title\":\"Communicate Preferences Clearly\",\"text\":\"Some guests experienced issues with room assignments. Clearly communicate any specific preferences or requirements to the hotel staff to ensure a suitable accommodation.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:12:31\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(69,13,'Occidental Punta Cana','occidental-punta-cana','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d9b46c6cde872d6acd4bd1bf82c87973.jpg','Compare prices and find the best deal for the Occidental Punta Cana. Rates from $116.','España, 3','+1 809 221 8787',116,4,4414,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d9b46c6cde872d6acd4bd1bf82c87973.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_89aefb4559ebe37dcb8cac99f70d3b6e.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_238ff26356431641e58cf5c09b13a810.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_7b9c1a1c5932c537caf998d6e971863f.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_1cc7dd419c8a426a44b7445aea130e90.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_cc7f98aeaf2c4f6735d6861db82335b2.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_097cbbc468a59a91f68007816b4bef90.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_939b3c9f8a196c8128b71292c6655e79.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_035c5d2f5cf004270cb0ecdafbaa4824.j