",\"Wedding services\",\"Free Wi-Fi\",\"Outdoor tennis\",\"Non-smoking rooms available\",\"Basketball court\",\"Terrace/Patio\",\"Increased accessibility\",\"Beach chairs\",\"Beach towels\",\"Linens\",\"Towels\",\"Safety deposit box\",\"Sea view\",\"EV charging station\",\"Seating area\",\"Elevator\",\"Massage\",\"Yoga\",\"Shampoo\",\"Pool bar\",\"Shared bathroom\",\"Shared toilet\",\"Shower\",\"Mini-fridge\",\"Accessible parking\",\"First-aid kit\",\"Snack bar\",\"Sofa\",\"Sofa bed\",\"Solarium\",\"Balcony\",\"Bathtub\",\"Spa bath\",\"Body soap\",\"Flexible event space\",\"Bottle of water\",\"Kayaking\",\"Telephone\",\"Toilet\",\"Toilet paper\",\"Safe\",\"Sauna\",\"Coffee machine\",\"TV\",\"Upper floors accessible by elevator\",\"Conditioner\",\"Desk\",\"Shopping\",\"Dining area\",\"Wardrobe or closet\"]',0,'[{\"question\":\"What special deals and offers can guests book through the Occidental Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"For those that will be staying at the Occidental Punta Cana with their families, consider booking the Family Special package, as it will provide you with early check-in and allow your first child to stay at the hotel for free. To have a particularly luxurious vacation, there is the Live Your Barcelo Stories package, which includes early check-in and either a free round-trip airport transfer, or a fully stocked minibar.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the most popular rooms to stay in at the Occidental Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"If you will be visiting the Occidental Punta Cana with a group of people or your family, select one of the Family Junior Suites, as they can fit up to five people and contain a sofa bed, living room, and a work desk. For a room that provides a particularly scenic view, opt for a Junior Suite Ocean Front, as they directly overlook the water and come with additional perks, such as private check-in and check-out, daily restocking of the mini fridge, and concierge service. If you would prefer a more affordable room, there is the Superior Deluxe Room that is still comfortable and provides standard perks, like a safe and flat screen television.\"},{\"question\":\"What sports and recreational activities can guests participate in at the Occidental Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"To spend a majority of your stay at the Occidental Punta Cana by enjoying the nearby ocean, take advantage of the windsurfing, boogie boarding, and snorkeling equipment that can be rented by guests for free. Additionally, the hotel is equipped with a basketball court, a beach soccer area, and a volleyball court, as well as dance classes, darts, badminton, and life-size chess, allowing visitors to stay active and remain fit during their vacations.\"},{\"question\":\"What kid-friendly activities can guests expect at the Occidental Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"For those that will be visiting the Occidental Punta Cana with their families, there are a variety of activities to keep the little ones entertained during your trip, including a Kids Club that is open everyday from 9:00 am to 11:00 pm and is meant for guests between the ages of 4 and 12. Some examples of activities at this club are arts and crafts, board game competitions, a mini disco party that takes place every night at 8:30 pm, and movie viewings.\"},{\"question\":\"What transportation options do guests have when going from Punta Cana International Airport to the Occidental Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"As the region does not have an extensive public transportation system that connects the two locations, the best way to go from Punta Cana International Airport to the Occidental Punta Cana is by taking a local taxi or reserving a shuttle service through a private company. Depending on which taxi you use, your fare will end up costing you around 1,775 DOP (approximately 35 USD) each way. If you decide to book a private shuttle service instead, the price will be around 1,320 DOP for a round-trip reservation (approximately 26 USD). (Prices checked 03/07/19).\"},{\"question\":\"Where is Occidental Punta Cana located?\",\"answer\":\"Occidental Punta Cana is located at España, 3 in Pueblo Bavaro, 0.8 miles from the center of Punta Cana. Arena Blanca Beach is the closest landmark to Occidental Punta Cana.\"},{\"question\":\"When is check-in time and check-out time at Occidental Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"Check-in time is 3:00 PM and check-out time is 12:00 PM at Occidental Punta Cana.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Occidental Punta Cana offer free Wi-Fi?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Occidental Punta Cana offers free Wi-Fi.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Occidental Punta Cana offer free parking?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Occidental Punta Cana offers free parking.\"},{\"question\":\"How far is Occidental Punta Cana from the airport?\",\"answer\":\"Occidental Punta Cana is 10 miles from Punta Cana. Occidental Punta Cana is 35.6 miles from La Romana.\"},{\"question\":\"How does KAYAK find such great Occidental Punta Cana hotel deals?\",\"answer\":\"KAYAK scours the web for all room deals available at Occidental Punta Cana in Punta Cana and lets you compare them to find the best rate for your stay. Many different travel sites will offer discounts or deals at different times for rooms at Occidental Punta Cana and KAYAK will provide you with prices from a huge range of travel sites. That means that you can always find a great deal for Occidental Punta Cana.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Occidental Punta Cana have a pool?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Occidental Punta Cana has a pool onsite.\"}]','{\"score\":8.1,\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":4414,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":1993},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":744},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":596},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":305},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":304},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":155},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":317}],\"summary\":\"Guests consistently praise the hotel\'s beachfront location, variety of restaurants, and range of activities. Many found the staff to be friendly and helpful, though experiences with service varied. Cleanliness was a concern for some, particularly in rooms and pools. Food quality and variety received mixed feedback, with some enjoying the options and others finding them lacking. Overall, the hotel offers a lively atmosphere and convenient amenities, but improvements in cleanliness and consistency of service are needed.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":7.5},{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":7},{\"label\":\"Restaurant\",\"score\":6},{\"label\":\"Breakfast\",\"score\":4},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":2.5}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.2,\"reviews\":897},{\"name\":\"Priceline\",\"score\":6.5,\"reviews\":65},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":8.7,\"reviews\":12},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":8.3,\"reviews\":2}],\"mentions\":[\"food was good\",\"staff was friendly\",\"pool and beach\",\"great service\",\"bad service\",\"beautiful resort\",\"snack bar\",\"make reservations\",\"front desk\",\"italian restaurant\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What are the main draws of Occidental Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"Occidental Punta Cana\'s main draws include its gorgeous sandy beach, free non-motorized water sports, three pools catering to different preferences, a spa, gym, kid activities, and 11 restaurants as part of the all-inclusive plan.\"},{\"question\":\"What practical amenities are available at Occidental Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"The resort offers practical amenities such as daily housekeeping, contactless check-in/check-out, free parking, shuttle service, and a variety of water sports facilities.\"},{\"question\":\"What are guests saying about the food at Occidental Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"While some guests found the food and drinks to be delicious, others expressed dissatisfaction with the food at the main buffet, mentioning issues with taste and variety.\"},{\"question\":\"What are guests saying about the cleanliness at Occidental Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have praised the resort for being very clean, but some have reported concerns about the presence of cockroaches in the rooms.\"},{\"question\":\"When is the best time to visit Occidental Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"The low season is in August, and the high season is in November, making these months ideal for visiting to avoid crowds or to experience peak season activities and events.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Consider Upgrading to a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the ocean or pool comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan Your Dining Reservations Early\",\"text\":\"Some guests found it difficult to secure reservations at the restaurants due to limited availability. It\'s advisable to make dining reservations as soon as possible upon arrival to ensure you can experience the variety of dining options.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the All-Inclusive Plan\",\"text\":\"With 11 restaurants to choose from as part of the all-inclusive plan, guests recommended exploring the different dining options available on the property.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s proximity to attractions such as Avalon Casino Punta Cana, Hoyo Azul, and various golf courses provides ample opportunities for off-site exploration and entertainment.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of High Season Crowds\",\"text\":\"If you prefer a quieter experience, consider visiting during the low season in August to avoid the larger crowds that tend to visit during the high season in November.\"},{\"title\":\"Stay Informed About Resort Activities\",\"text\":\"Some guests noted a lack of information or guidance about the resort\'s facilities and activities. It\'s recommended to stay informed about the available amenities and activities to make the most of your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Check Room Amenities\",\"text\":\"While the rooms are described as simple and modern, some guests found them lacking in certain amenities such as extra toiletries and washcloths. It\'s advisable to check the room amenities upon arrival and request any additional items needed.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Prepared for Limited Wi-Fi Connectivity\",\"text\":\"Several guests experienced issues with the Wi-Fi, with connectivity being inconsistent in certain areas. It\'s advisable to be prepared for potential limitations in Wi-Fi connectivity during your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider the Noise Level\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned that the resort can be lively, with loud music and activities throughout the day. If you prefer a quieter environment, it\'s recommended to inquire about quieter areas of the resort or consider bringing earplugs for a peaceful night\'s sleep.\"},{\"title\":\"Manage Expectations for Food and Beverage Options\",\"text\":\"While some guests praised the food and drinks, others expressed disappointment with the variety and quality. It\'s advisable to manage expectations regarding the food and beverage options available and explore off-site dining alternatives if desired.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:12:37\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(70,13,'Bakour Punta Cana Suites','bakour-punta-cana-suites','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_56ef3d7be0f748d9cc1dbbad70b985b8.jpg','Catch some rays on Bakour Punta Cana Suites\'s private white sand beach or spend the day relaxing at the full-service spa. Then enjoy a meal at one of the hotel\'s 3 restaurants. \\nBakour Punta Cana Suites offers 73 air-conditioned accommodations with free minibar items and safes. Cable television is provided. Bathrooms include showers, bathrobes, slippers, and hair dryers. Guests can surf the web using the complimentary wireless Internet access (speed: 100+ Mbps (good for 1–2 people or up to 6 devices)). Business-friendly amenities include desks and phones. Housekeeping is offered daily and hypo-allergenic bedding can be requested. \\nGuests can experience the thrill of a safari, and 