 Caribe Club Princess Beach Resort & Spa clean and comfortable?\",\"answer\":\"Many guests have praised the clean and comfortable rooms at the resort, while a few have mentioned issues with the condition of the rooms and the need for better maintenance.\"},{\"question\":\"Is there a shortage of towels at Caribe Club Princess Beach Resort & Spa?\",\"answer\":\"Some guests have experienced difficulties in obtaining fresh towels, with reports of the hotel frequently running out of towels.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the best times to visit Caribe Club Princess Beach Resort & Spa?\",\"answer\":\"The high season at the resort is in March, while the low season is in August.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the customer service at Caribe Club Princess Beach Resort & Spa?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have generally praised the friendly and helpful staff, but a few have mentioned instances of poor service and communication issues.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Book a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the ocean or garden comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel is conveniently located near various attractions such as Manati Park Bavaro, Imagine Punta Cana Disco, and several golf courses. Consider planning day trips to these places for added enjoyment.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Low Season Travel\",\"text\":\"If you prefer fewer crowds, consider visiting in August, which is the low season. This could provide a more relaxed experience with potentially better deals.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Room Conditions\",\"text\":\"While many guests found the rooms clean and comfortable, some mentioned issues with poor room conditions, so it\'s advisable to check recent reviews for room quality before booking.\"},{\"title\":\"Check Restaurant Reservations\",\"text\":\"Guests reported challenges in securing reservations at the specialty restaurants. It\'s recommended to plan and book dining options in advance to avoid disappointment.\"},{\"title\":\"Stay Informed About All-Inclusive Offerings\",\"text\":\"Some guests noted that certain food items were not up to standard. It\'s advisable to explore the full range of dining options and understand the all-inclusive offerings to make the most of the dining experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan for Mosquito Protection\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned a mosquito issue, so it\'s wise to come prepared with insect repellent to fully enjoy outdoor activities and the beach.\"},{\"title\":\"Stay Updated on Wi-Fi Availability\",\"text\":\"While some guests experienced issues with the Wi-Fi, others found it reliable. It\'s recommended to inquire about the current status of the Wi-Fi and plan accordingly if internet access is crucial during your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Utilize On-Site Entertainment\",\"text\":\"Take advantage of the various on-site activities and entertainment options, such as the game room, water sports, and evening shows, to enhance your overall experience at the resort.\"},{\"title\":\"Communicate Special Requests\",\"text\":\"If you have specific needs or preferences, consider communicating them to the hotel in advance. Some guests mentioned challenges with certain requests, so clear communication beforehand may help ensure a smoother experience.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:13:30\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(73,13,'Majestic Colonial - Punta Cana','majestic-colonial-punta-cana','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_7f95d922d73b93fd061231c58e74df03.jpg','Situated on Arena Gorda Beach, overlooking the Caribbean Sea, this oceanfront resort boasts tennis courts, a luxury spa, 7 restaurants and private beach access. All suites have a bathroom with a spa bath. The elegant and spacious suites offer tile floors and four-poster beds. Each features a minibar and large seating area with a desk. Bathrooms boast a walk-in shower and bathrobes. Majestic Colonial boasts 11 bars including a poolside and beach bar, and many feature live music. Seven restaurants provide casual and fine dining. Local Caribbean as well as international food is offered. Majestic Colonial-Punta Cana offers a 400-meter outdoor pool with 2 hot tubs. Guests can workout in the gym or play on the basketball courts. The kid’s club features a large playground with a castle. Guests can relax at Spa Resort Colonial which offers 10 treatment rooms surrounded by gardens, 2 saunas and a large hot tub. Various body and beauty treatments are available.','Playa Bavaro, Higuey,','+1 809 221 9898',259,4,3351,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_7f95d922d73b93fd061231c58e74df03.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_23c2de0e0b26536bb8419ee111336dcc.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d9992e043776e2cdfd746ef3c100fbc5.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_f66ff79f3db39309117f6efc81fb5f14.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_db423696c73f94121b0b019e2cbb0d08.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_8f6e14e3c10eddee08ed372819134ab2.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_ab2a5fd2b3da082e5b1c2d04a78fed07.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_f4e9020fa33eb833be668aaf90c51ffa.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_90fd548301f804fb21b75c7479ba7256.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_cfa6dee2710db35ed0223d31cce0c522.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_cc3c1dae3ab535d74daf5a05a65d0671.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_37b7773eedfc78b60d492360b6fcd16f.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_126ecf1663393c82538ac97940df80c8.jpg\"]',NULL,'https://www.kayak.com/Punta-Cana-Hotels-Majestic-Colonial---Punta-Cana.154208.ksp','[\"Computer use available\",\"ATM on-site\",\"Business center\",\"Entire unit located on ground floor\",\"Wake-up service\",\"Internet\",\"Executive lounge access\",\"Daily housekeeping\",\"Family rooms\",\"Concierge service\",\"Fan\