r\",\"Massage\",\"Boating\",\"Yoga\",\"Shampoo\",\"Pool bar\",\"Shared lounge/TV area\",\"Shower\",\"Rain showers\",\"Accessible by elevator\",\"Accessible parking\",\"Adapted bath\",\"Slippers\",\"First-aid kit\",\"Additional bathroom\",\"Snack bar\",\"Socket near the bed\",\"Sofa\",\"Sofa bed\",\"Balcony\",\"Games for kids\",\"Bathtub\",\"Spa bath\",\"Gym\",\"Body soap\",\"Flexible event space\",\"Bottle of water\",\"Tea/coffee maker\",\"Kayaking\",\"Telephone\",\"Tile/marble floor\",\"Chapel/shrine\",\"Toilet\",\"Toilet paper\",\"Toilet with grab rails\",\"Safe\",\"Sauna\",\"Toothbrush\",\"Trash cans\",\"Coffee machine\",\"Parasailing\",\"TV\",\"Upper floors accessible by elevator\",\"Conditioner\",\"Sailing\",\"Valet parking\",\"Desk\",\"Shopping\",\"Dining area\",\"Walk-in shower\",\"Wardrobe or closet\",\"Drying rack for clothing\",\"Water slide\",\"Theme park\"]',0,'[{\"question\":\"Are there any kid-friendly activities offered at the Majestic Colonial - Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"Children staying at the Majestic Colonial - Punta Cana are welcome to go to the Splash Kids Club, a fun club that is meant for all kids under the age of 18 and offers activities such as movies, arts and crafts, and games. The hotel also has a variety of games spread throughout its property, including darts, table tennis, table football, pool tables, and air hockey.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the best rooms to stay in at the Majestic Colonial - Punta Cana and why?\",\"answer\":\"The 523 sq ft Junior Suites are a popular and affordable choice that can fit up to four guests and offer scenic views of either the hotel’s pool or garden. They also contain private balconies, walk-in showers, sofa beds, and a mini bar. For a particularly luxurious experience at the Majestic Colonial - Punta Cana, opt for the Colonial Club Jr. Suite with Jacuzzi, which offers the same amenities but also includes a private jacuzzi tub for guests to enjoy.\"},{\"question\":\"What adults-only amenities are offered at the Majestic Colonial - Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"If you’re hoping to have a relaxed vacation that is away from the little ones, opt to stay in a room that is within the Colonial Club area of the hotel. The Colonial Club is reserved for guests aged 18 and up, and it has a series of private restaurants, bars, and lounges that are known for being quiet and chic. The check-in area for this club is also different than the check-in zone for regular rooms, ensuring that your vacation will be relaxing and adults-only from the moment that you arrive at the Majestic Colonial - Punta Cana. Additionally, the hotel has a wine-tasting room that allows guests to taste wines from all over the world for a small additional fee.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the easiest way to travel from Punta Cana International Airport to the Majestic Colonial - Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"Because there is not an extensive public transportation system in the area, it is best to travel from Punta Cana International Airport to the Majestic Colonial - Punta Cana by either renting a car or taking a taxi. When driving between these two locations, the trip will be between 25m to 30m depending on how congested the roads are at the time. If you will be grabbing a taxi from outside of the airport’s arrivals terminal, the fare will cost around 2,000 DOP to 2,500 DOP (approximately 40 USD to 50 USD).\"},{\"question\":\"Does the spa at the Majestic Colonial - Punta Cana offer any special services?\",\"answer\":\"The spa area in Majestic Colonial - Punta Cana is located directly in its gardens and offers a variety of services, ranging from facials to massages. The \\\"humid area\\\" of the spa contains eight different showers that incorporate treatments such as dry ice, saunas, Turkish baths, and aromatherapy. The beauty salon area of the spa is where you can receive classic treatments, such as manicures, haircuts, and hair styling. Additional types of treatments include hydrotherapy, Vichy showers, thalassotherapy, and fragrance showers meant to soothe the skin. (Prices checked 08/05/19).\"},{\"question\":\"Where is Majestic Colonial - Punta Cana located?\",\"answer\":\"Majestic Colonial - Punta Cana is located at Playa Bavaro, Higuey, in Pueblo Bavaro, 4.1 miles from the center of Punta Cana. Cana Bay Golf Club is the closest landmark to Majestic Colonial - Punta Cana.\"},{\"question\":\"When is check-in time and check-out time at Majestic Colonial - Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"Check-in time is 3:00 PM and check-out time is 12:00 PM at Majestic Colonial - Punta Cana.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Majestic Colonial - Punta Cana offer free Wi-Fi?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Majestic Colonial - Punta Cana offers free Wi-Fi.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Majestic Colonial - Punta Cana offer free parking?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Majestic Colonial - Punta Cana offers free parking.\"},{\"question\":\"How far is Majestic Colonial - Punta Cana from the airport?\",\"answer\":\"Majestic Colonial - Punta Cana is 13.2 miles from Punta Cana. Majestic Colonial - Punta Cana is 34.9 miles from La Romana.\"},{\"question\":\"How does KAYAK find such great Majestic Colonial - Punta Cana hotel deals?\",\"answer\":\"KAYAK scours the web for all room deals available at Majestic Colonial - Punta Cana in Punta Cana and lets you compare them to find the best rate for your stay. Many different travel sites will offer discounts or deals at different times for rooms at Majestic Colonial - Punta Cana and KAYAK will provide you with prices from a huge range of travel sites. That means that you can always find a great deal for Majestic Colonial - Punta Cana.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Majestic Colonial - Punta Cana have a pool?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Majestic Colonial - Punta Cana has a pool onsite.\"}]','{\"score\":8.4,\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":3351,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":2001},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":534},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":330},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":137},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":129},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":84},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":136}],\"summary\":\"Guests appreciated the hotel\'s excellent restaurants, beautiful beachfront location, and spacious, comfortable rooms. Many highlighted the variety and quality of food, as well as the pleasant common areas and amenities. However, several reviews noted issues with service, including unfriendly or discriminatory staff, and problems with cleanliness, such as musty smells and poor housekeeping. Some guests also mentioned maintenance issues and noise disturbances, but overall, the positive aspects like food, location, and room comfort stood out.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Restaurant\",\"score\":9},{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":8.5},{\"label\":\"Room Size\",\"score\":7.5},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":2},{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":1.5}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.4,\"reviews\":1437},{\"name\":\"Priceline\",\"score\":8.1,\"reviews\":55},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":8.9,\"reviews\":13},{\"name\":\"HotelsCombined\",\"score\":9.7,\"reviews\":1},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":8.7,\"reviews\":1}],\"mentions\":[\"amazing food\",\"amazing staff\",\"beach was beautiful\",\"room was nice\",\"everything was perfect\",\"butler service\",\"excellent service\",\"well maintained\",\"good entertainment\",\"colonial\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What are the dining options at Majestic Colonial Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"Visitors at the hotel can choose from an array of options for breakfast, lunch, and dinner with each of the on-site restaurants serving a variety of delicious cuisine.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the main attractions near Majestic Colonial Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel is situated directly on the beach, with multiple golf courses nearby, a number of smaller private venues, and attractions ranging from boat and helicopter rides to historical sites.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the cleanliness at Majestic Colonial Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel is described as very clean and beautiful by guests, with staff being friendly and helpful.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the common concerns about the hotel\'s accommodations?\",\"answer\":\"Some guests have mentioned concerns about the rooms not being super clean and needing some repairs and maintenance. Additionally, there were comments about inconsistent/late timing in cleaning rooms.\"},{\"question\":\"When is the best time to visit Majestic Colonial Punta Cana?\",\"answer\":\"The high season is in March, offering an ideal time to experience the beautiful property, great staff, and a variety of activities. However, guests may want to consider the low season in May for potentially fewer crowds.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Book a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the beach or pool comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider the All-Inclusive Package\",\"text\":\"Guests staying for more than five nights can enjoy a complimentary free green fee at the Punta Blanca Golf Club, making the all-inclusive package a great option for golf enthusiasts.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Golf Courses\",\"text\":\"Golf enthusiasts will appreciate the proximity to multiple golf courses, such as Cana Bay Golf Club, Hard Rock Golf Club, and Punta Blanca Golf Course, offering diverse options for golfing experiences.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan Ahead for Dinner Reservations\",\"text\":\"Guests reported challenges in securing dinner reservations, especially for specialty restaurants. It\'s advisable to make reservations well in advance to ensure access to preferred dining options.\"},{\"title\":\"VIP Experience\",\"text\":\"Consider upgrading to a VIP experience to access exclusive clubs and amenities, including beautiful cabanas on the beach and poolside, enhancing the overall stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of Water Sports\",\"text\":\"The all-inclusive package includes access to water sports, making it convenient for guests to enjoy activities such as snorkeling, diving, and canoeing without additional costs.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Room Selection\",\"text\":\"Some guests encountered issues with room maintenance and specific amenities. It\'s advisable to communicate preferences clearly during the booking process and upon arrival to ensure a comfortable stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Evening Entertainment\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the high-quality entertainment and shows at the theater in the evenings, providing a vibrant and enjoyable nightlife experience within the resort.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Transportation Options\",\"text\":\"While the hotel is easily accessible from the airport, guests reported delays with the affiliated pickup company. It\'s recommended to consider alternative transportation options for a seamless arrival experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Stay Informed About Dining Options\",\"text\":\"While the hotel offers an array of dining choices, some guests expressed disappointment with specific restaurants. Researching and understanding the dining options in advance can help manage expectations and enhance the dining experience.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:13:37\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(74,14,'Iberostar Waves Rose Hall Beach','iberostar-waves-rose-hall-beach','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_f5ebf162c284376b478b366ac975e128.jpg','Set in Montego Bay in the Saint James Region, 47 km from Runaway Bay, Iberostar Waves Rose Hall Beach features a year-round outdoor pool, hot tub, a private beach area and a spa and wellness centre. Car hire is available at the property. The rooms come with a flat-screen TV, minibar and coffee maker. All rooms are fitted with iPod dock and a private bathroom and a shower. The on-site restaurant offers buffet, à la carte menu and also special diet menus upon request. Breakfast in room is also available. Children Policy From 0 - 2 years old: Infants free of charge From 3 to 12 year old: children paying children rate From 13 Years old: paying adult rate Request child rates information at hotel reservation department. You will find a 24-hour front desk, table tennis and tennis court at the resort. Guests can request massage service and enjoy sauna and hammam. Other activities offered on site are nightclub, kid\'s club and entertainment staff. The nearest airport is Montego Bay Airport Airport, 16 km from Iberostar Waves Rose Hall Beach.','Rose Hall Beach Main Road Montego Bay 00000 JM','+1 876 680 0000',255,4,707,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_f5ebf162c284376b478b366ac975e128.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_e06cc079cdae699275437baaa7a62de1.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_6115b94ecc1d5d87d42cdaca499ee9a7.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_4b0bafd345ad4328514932ef31346e40.jpg\"]',NULL,'https://www.kayak.com/Montego-Bay-Hotels-Iberostar-Waves-Rose-Hall-Beach.210298.ksp','[\"ATM on-site\",\"Babysitting or child care\",\"Business center\",\"Car rental\",\"Wi-Fi available in all areas\",\"Internet\",\"Daily housekeeping\",\"Family rooms\",\"Concierge service\",\"Fan\",\"Entertainment staff\",\"Currency exchange on-site\",\"Gift shop\",\"Hammam (Turkish bath)\",\"Laundry facilities\",\"Laundry service\",\"Flat-screen TV\",\"Meeting/Banquet facilities\",\"Multi-lingual staff\",\"Free toiletries\",\"Garden view\",\"Shops (on site)\",\"Room service\",\"Wheelchair accessible\",\"Special diet menus (on request)\",\"Infinity pool\",\"Spa\",\"Hot tub\",\"Outdoor pool\",\"Snorkeling\",\"Key access\",\"Evening entertainment\",\"Key card access\",\"No smoking\",\"Fitness classes\",\"Restaurant\",\"Bar/Lounge\",\"Hairdryer\",\"Fitness center\",\"Cable or satellite TV\",\"Karaoke\",\"24-hour security\",\"Air-conditioned\",\"Airport shuttle (surcharge)\",\"Continental breakfast\",\"Food can be delivered to guest accommodation\",\"Complimentary breakfast\",\"Free parking\",\"Table tennis\",\"Pool view\",\"Pool with a view\",\"Coffee shop\",\"Private beach\",\"Windsurfing\",\"Bathrobe\",\"Private bathroom\",\"Garden\",\"24hr front desk\",\"Designated smoking area\",\"Private entrance\",\"Night club\",\"Storage available\",\"Private parking\",\"Shuttle service (additional charge)\",\"Conference rooms\",\"Wedding services\",\"Free Wi-Fi\",\"Outdoor tennis\",\"Basketball court\",\"Terrace/Patio\",\"Increased accessibility\",\"Beach chairs\",\"Beach towels\",\"Linens\",\"Towels\",\"Safety deposit box\",\"Sea view\",\"Elevator\",\"Massage\",\"Shampoo\",\"Shower\",\"First-aid kit\",\"Sofa\",\"Sofa bed\",\"Balcony\",\"Gym\",\"Body soap\",\"Flexible event space\",\"Telephone\",\"Tile/marble floor\",\"Toilet\",\"Toilet paper\",\"Safe\",\"Sauna\",\"Coffee machine\",\"TV\",\"Conditioner\",\"Desk\",\"Shopping\",\"Wardrobe or closet\",\"Drying rack for clothing\"]',0,'[{\"question\":\"What is the easiest way to get from Sangster International Airport (MBJ) to the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Those who are wanting to travel to the hotel from the airport will find that the quickest and easiest form of transport is taking a car or picking up a taxi. You can expect the 10.7-mile journey will take you around 18min, depending on traffic and the time of day that you travel. The easiest and fastest route is via the A1.\"},{\"question\":\"What rooms are available at Iberostar Rose Hall Beach?\",\"answer\":\"Those staying at the hotel can find themselves with a wide variety of rooms available to them. Enjoy the likes of Double, Double Superior, Sea-View Double, Double Ocean Front, Junior Suite Ocean Front, Presidential Suite and Two Bedroom Family. All rooms are unique in their own way and offer great facilities to those that stay in them.\"},{\"question\":\"Why should I book a suite at this hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The suites in the hotel are fitted with great facilities and provide lots of additional space to give you optimal comfort during your stay. The suites are the biggest rooms of the hotel, and you will find yourself with great ocean views. The Presidential Suite is the biggest of the suites and has a terrace occupied by a spa tub and a hammock. You’ll also have a large living area with a kitchen and dining space, as well as two bathrooms.\"},{\"question\":\"What does Iberostar Rose Hall Beach offer to those staying with children?\",\"answer\":\"When you stay at the hotel, you can expect that your children are well accommodated for. Make use of the kids-stay-free offer, where you can enjoy the family holiday that you’ve always wanted. Kids can enjoy the onsite swimming pools and can also make use of the Star Camp, where child-friendly activities are offered. There’s also a children’s pool and children’s park especially adapted to the little ones.\"},{\"question\":\"What spa facilities does the hotel offer?\",\"answer\":\"You’ll find a variety of spa facilities at Rose Hall Beach. Make use of Sensations SPA that’s located within the hotel, with an additional indoor hydromassage pool. You can also enjoy the beauty salon at the spa with additions of either a couple’s massage, hydrotherapy area, sauna or thalassotherapy pool. Alternatively, experience a massage on the beach.\"},{\"question\":\"What dining and beverage options are available at Iberostar Rose Hall Beach?\",\"answer\":\"Guests who stay at this hotel will find themselves with a great variety of dining options available to them. Enjoy the likes of Uncle Tony’s buffet and rotisserie, Little River Buffet, Olivetti Italian Restaurant and Samurai Asian Restaurant. If you’re looking for smaller options then enjoy Happy Cones Ice Cream Shop, Deep Blue pool bar, Chill Out snack bar, Blue Mountain lobby bar, Calypso theatre bar, Jamrock sports bar and Mango Walk Nightclub.\"},{\"question\":\"What diving facilities does the hotel offer?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers a fully equipped Dressel Divers diving centre. You’ll be able to book trips, hire equipment and also undertake a PADI course. You’ll dive in Montego Bay at either Montego Bay Marine Park, Airport Wall Reef or Falmouth Luminous Lagoon.\"},{\"question\":\"Where is Iberostar Waves Rose Hall Beach located?\",\"answer\":\"Iberostar Waves Rose Hall Beach is located at Rose Hall Beach Main Road Montego Bay 00000 JM, 10.2 miles from the center of Montego Bay. Cinnamon Hill Golf Course is the closest landmark to Iberostar Waves Rose Hall Beach.\"},{\"question\":\"When is check-in time and check-out time at Iberostar Waves Rose Hall Beach?\",\"answer\":\"Check-in time is 3:00 PM and check-out time is 11:00 AM at Iberostar Waves Rose Hall Beach.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Iberostar Waves Rose Hall Beach offer free Wi-Fi?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Iberostar Waves Rose Hall Beach offers free Wi-Fi.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Iberostar Waves Rose Hall Beach offer free parking?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Iberostar Waves Rose Hall Beach offers free parking.\"},{\"question\":\"How far is Iberostar Waves Rose Hall Beach from the airport?\",\"answer\":\"Iberostar Waves Rose Hall Beach is 9.4 miles from Montego Bay Sangster Intl. Iberostar Waves Rose Hall Beach is 39.6 miles from Negril.\"},{\"question\":\"How does KAYAK find such great Iberostar Waves Rose Hall Beach hotel deals?\",\"answer\":\"KAYAK scours the web for all room deals available at Iberostar Waves Rose Hall Beach in Montego Bay and lets you compare them to find the best rate for your stay. Many different travel sites will offer discounts or deals at different times for rooms at Iberostar Waves Rose Hall Beach and KAYAK will provide you with prices from a huge range of travel sites. That means that you can always find a great deal for Iberostar Waves Rose Hall Beach.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Iberostar Waves Rose Hall Beach have a pool?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Iberostar Waves Rose Hall Beach has a pool onsite.\"}]','{\"score\":8.4,\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":707,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":307},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":126},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":102},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":52},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":46},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":23},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":51}],\"summary\":\"Overall, guests had a positive experience at the hotel, frequently highlighting the excellent and friendly service, clean rooms and facilities, and enjoyable breakfast options with good variety. Many appreciated the amenities and entertainment available, as well as the convenient location. While some reviews mentioned issues such as food quality, additional charges, and occasional maintenance concerns, the majority of guests were satisfied with their stay and would recommend the hotel for its comfort, service, and overall value.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":9.5},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":8.5},{\"label\":\"Breakfast\",\"score\":8.5},{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":8}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.4,\"reviews\":590},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":8.3,\"reviews\":10},{\"name\":\"Priceline\",\"score\":5,\"reviews\":3},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":9.3,\"reviews\":3}],\"mentions\":[\"staff was very friendly\",\"food was great\",\"room was clean\",\"great service\",\"room service\",\"beach was great\",\"good entertainment\",\"front desk\",\"activities with the entertainment\",\"everything was great\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What can I expect from the food at Iberostar Rose Hall Beach?\",\"answer\":\"Guests can expect a variety of international dining options, including four restaurants and various bars offering drinks and snacks. Some guests have praised the amazing food and the buffet restaurant, while others have mentioned that some of the food could be improved in terms of taste and variety.\"},{\"question\":\"How are the beds at Iberostar Rose Hall Beach?\",\"answer\":\"While some guests have found the beds uncomfortable, others have mentioned that the rooms are spacious and clean. The hotel offers a range of room types, including Standard, Superior, Ocean View, and Star Prestige rooms, catering to different party sizes and preferences.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the cleanliness and maintenance standards like at Iberostar Rose Hall Beach?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel has received positive feedback regarding the cleanliness of the property and the rooms. However, some guests have mentioned issues such as broken toilets and slow response to maintenance requests. Overall, the property is well-maintained, with daily housekeeping and enhanced cleaning protocols in place.\"},{\"question\":\"Is parking available at Iberostar Rose Hall Beach?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers free parking and shuttle services for guests\' convenience. Additionally, the property provides various amenities and services, including a fitness center, outdoor pool, spa, and entertainment activities, ensuring a well-rounded experience for visitors.\"},{\"question\":\"When is the best time to visit Iberostar Rose Hall Beach?\",\"answer\":\"The high season at Iberostar Rose Hall Beach is in December, while the low season is in September. Guests can enjoy a range of activities, including sports-related programs, evening entertainment, and access to a private beach. However, it\'s important to note that some guests have mentioned limitations in water activities and additional costs for certain excursions.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Consider Room Size and View\",\"text\":\"Depending on your preference, choose a room with garden, pool, or ocean views. Some guests found the ocean view rooms particularly enjoyable.\"},{\"title\":\"Check Water Dispenser Locations\",\"text\":\"If you prefer drinking water from dispensers, inquire about their locations upon check-in, as some guests had difficulty finding them.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"Take advantage of the hotel\'s proximity to attractions like Greenwood Great House, Cinnamon Hill Golf Course, and Rose Hall Great House for off-site activities.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Room Selection\",\"text\":\"Some guests found the standard rooms to be small, so consider this when choosing your accommodation.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan for Entertainment\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the entertainment options, such as live music and the piano bar, so be sure to check the schedule for these activities during your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Aware of Service Limitations\",\"text\":\"Some guests experienced issues with room service, so it\'s advisable to manage expectations in this regard.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Food Options\",\"text\":\"While many guests praised the food, some found the variety lacking or the quality inconsistent, so it\'s worth exploring the dining options available.\"},{\"title\":\"Stay Informed About Events\",\"text\":\"Some guests wished for better communication about hotel events and activities, so consider checking for printed notifications or asking the staff for information.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Special Services\",\"text\":\"If you\'re interested in specific amenities like the hammam or wedding services, inquire about their availability and any associated costs.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Prepared for Beach Vendors\",\"text\":\"While the beach is beautiful, be aware that some guests found beach vendors to be intrusive, so plan accordingly for a peaceful beach experience.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:13:55\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(75,14,'S Hotel Jamaica','s-hotel-jamaica','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_5d084f8ae339df7e7e563779e57a8c58.jpg','Compare prices and find the best deal for the S Hotel Jamaica. Rates from $324.','7 Jimmy Cliff Boulevard','+1 876 979 0000',324,4,1586,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_5d084f8ae339df7e7e563779e57a8c58.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_f08dffd86afc7d530b65e058da32e770.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_1d12075cf60ccf5666fba597c5a00fc2.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/