hen sharing, others have described the rooms as clean, comfortable, and spacious, with exceptional views. The hotel\'s unique and beautifully decorated boutique feel has been appreciated by many guests.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the main highlights of the hotel\'s beach service?\",\"answer\":\"The beach service at S Hotel Jamaica is efficient and contributes to a comfortable and enjoyable beach experience. Guests have enjoyed the direct access to the beach, with the hotel offering towels and drinks to enhance their beach stay.\"},{\"question\":\"Is parking available at S Hotel Jamaica?\",\"answer\":\"S Hotel Jamaica provides secured parking and free parking for guests, ensuring convenience and security during their stay.\"},{\"question\":\"When is the best time to visit S Hotel Jamaica?\",\"answer\":\"The high season at S Hotel Jamaica is in January, offering an excellent time to experience the hotel\'s beautiful property, friendly staff, and surprisingly great breakfast and dinner options. Additionally, the hotel\'s beachfront location and access to a local Jamaican art make it a perfect choice for a luxurious, relaxing vacation.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Book a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the beach or pool comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel is conveniently located near several attractions, including Cornwall Beach, Doctor\'s Cave Bathing Club, and AquaSol Theme Park, making it easy to explore the area.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Low Season Travel\",\"text\":\"If you prefer quieter periods, consider visiting in July, which is the low season. This could provide a more relaxed experience with potentially fewer crowds.\"},{\"title\":\"Diverse Dining Options\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the variety of dining options, including three restaurants requiring reservations and a buffet. Consider making reservations in advance to ensure access to the restaurants of your choice.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Spa\",\"text\":\"The spa received high praise from guests for its fantastic services. Consider indulging in a spa treatment during your stay for a truly relaxing experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned that the hotel\'s location on the Hip Strip could lead to noise disturbances at night. Light sleepers may want to consider this when selecting a room.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Renovations\",\"text\":\"Some guests experienced inconvenience due to ongoing renovations. It\'s advisable to inquire about this when making a reservation, especially if you are sensitive to noise or dust.\"},{\"title\":\"Enjoy the Beachfront Access\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers direct access to the beach, and guests appreciated the attentive service provided on the beach, including complimentary towels and drinks.\"},{\"title\":\"Embrace the Boutique Vibe\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s small, boutique nature was highlighted by guests as providing an immersive and intimate experience. If you prefer a more personalized stay, this could be the ideal choice for you.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan Excursions with Staff Assistance\",\"text\":\"The hotel staff can assist in organizing off-property activities, such as the luminous lagoon boat cruise, providing an opportunity to explore Jamaica beyond the hotel grounds.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:14:03\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(76,14,'Riu Reggae','riu-reggae','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_e6d9cd1093090af18f99831a508be893.jpg','Compare prices and find the best deal for the Riu Reggae. Rates from $222.','Montego Bay','+1 876 940 8017',222,4,493,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_e6d9cd1093090af18f99831a508be893.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_7d8c1ef8bb7a5c937c0897b9e9cc97c7.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d229d022e3794b7198a15c68ba0766ab.jp