\"Private bathroom\",\"Garden\",\"24hr front desk\",\"Designated smoking area\",\"Steam room\",\"Night club\",\"Storage available\",\"Private parking\",\"Shuttle service (additional charge)\",\"Wedding services\",\"Free Wi-Fi\",\"Non-smoking rooms available\",\"Terrace/Patio\",\"Increased accessibility\",\"Beach chairs\",\"Beach towels\",\"Linens\",\"Towels\",\"Safety deposit box\",\"Soap and Shampoo Provided\",\"Grill\",\"Adults only\",\"Sea view\",\"Seating area\",\"Elevator\",\"Massage\",\"Shampoo\",\"Pool bar\",\"Shared lounge/TV area\",\"Shower\",\"Accessible by elevator\",\"Adapter\",\"Slippers\",\"First-aid kit\",\"Snack bar\",\"Socket near the bed\",\"Sofa\",\"Sofa bed\",\"Balcony\",\"Gym\",\"Body soap\",\"Bottle of water\",\"Locally curated art gallery\",\"Tea/coffee maker\",\"Kayaking\",\"Telephone\",\"Toilet\",\"Toilet paper\",\"Safe\",\"Clothes rack\",\"Trash cans\",\"Coffee machine\",\"TV\",\"Conditioner\",\"Shopping\",\"Wardrobe or closet\",\"Water slide\"]',0,'[{\"question\":\"What is the best room at Riu Reggae?\",\"answer\":\"Make the most of the stunning coastal location by booking a Double Room with Sea View. Boasting roughly 310 sq ft of space, the room can be set up with either a king bed or two doubles. Out on the balcony you’ll find private seating to take in the scenery. Available from roughly 49,920 JMD (approximately 370 USD) per night, there is also a beverage dispenser to help you relax.\"},{\"question\":\"Why should I stay at Riu Reggae?\",\"answer\":\"Home to a classy retro-modern design, expansive open-air spaces create a relaxed setting. Vibrant artwork and abstract furniture help the luxurious resort blend with the Jamaican character. During your visit you are welcome to access the neighboring Riu Montego Bay resort and explore the pools and amenities. Many guests head across to the Pacha nightclub after dark where there are laser lights, smoke machines and a state-of-the-art sound system.\"},{\"question\":\"What dining options does Riu Reggae have?\",\"answer\":\"There are 5 on-site restaurants to dine at, with cuisines offering Italian, Asian, Caribbean, international buffet and steakhouse. For lunch you can grab pizzas, salads, pasta or traditional Jamaican BBQ. Themed dinners occur 3 times per week, with lobster night a popular favorite. In the morning you can grab a light Continental breakfast or a full American feast with live cooking stations. There is also a smoothie station for a refreshing health boost.\"},{\"question\":\"What entertainment is provided at Riu Reggae?\",\"answer\":\"Nightly live music creates a buzzing atmosphere, with common genres including reggae and rock. Theater performances also take to the stage. Organized beach parties and foam pool parties carry the festivities late into the evening.\"},{\"question\":\"What ways are there to keep fit at Riu Reggae?\",\"answer\":\"Join a group fitness class, such as aqua aerobics or yoga, and be guided by professional trainers. Set off on the crystal clear Mahee Bay waters by kayak, catamaran or windsurf. Volleyball is available back on the beach.\"},{\"question\":\"What activities are run at Riu Reggae?\",\"answer\":\"Every guest can take up the offer of a complimentary introductory scuba diving lesson in the pool. Guided deep water dives can be purchased for an additional fee. Bean bag toss, tie die shirt making, and dance competitions are fun throughout the day.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the easiest way to get to Riu Reggae from the airport?\",\"answer\":\"Catching a taxi once you land at Sangster International Airport is quick and hassle-free. The drive will only take about 10min and cost roughly 3,350 JMD (approximately 25 USD).\"},{\"question\":\"Where can I watch a sports game when staying at Riu Reggae?\",\"answer\":\"The Daiquiri bar in the lobby has a sports TV, which broadcasts live action 24h per day. You can play table tennis out on the terrace during quiet times in between games. Snack food, such as sandwiches and nachos, can be ordered at any time throughout the day or night.\"},{\"question\":\"What special services are provided at Riu Reggae?\",\"answer\":\"Upon your arrival you will be greeted with a traditional Jamaican cava cocktail. A tour desk is located within the lobby, offering information and recommendations for sightseeing excursions.(Prices checked 25/07/19).\"},{\"question\":\"Where is Riu Reggae located?\",\"answer\":\"Riu Reggae is located at Montego Bay in Providence Heights - Flankers, 3.8 miles from the center of Montego Bay. Half Moon Bay Equestrian Centre is the closest landmark to Riu Reggae.\"},{\"question\":\"When is check-in time and check-out time at Riu Reggae?\",\"answer\":\"Check-in time is 3:00 PM and check-out time is 12:00 PM at Riu Reggae.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Riu Reggae offer free Wi-Fi?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Riu Reggae offers free Wi-Fi.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Riu Reggae offer free parking?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Riu Reggae offers free parking.\"},{\"question\":\"How far is Riu Reggae from the airport?\",\"answer\":\"Riu Reggae is 2 miles from Montego Bay Sangster Intl. Riu Reggae is 32.6 miles from Negril.\"},{\"question\":\"How does KAYAK find such great Riu Reggae hotel deals?\",\"answer\":\"KAYAK scours the web for all room deals available at Riu Reggae in Montego Bay and lets you compare them to find the best rate for your stay. Many different travel sites will offer discounts or deals at different times for rooms at Riu Reggae and KAYAK will provide you with prices from a huge range of travel sites. That means that you can always find a great deal for Riu Reggae.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Riu Reggae have a pool?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Riu Reggae has a pool onsite.\"}]','{\"score\":8,\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":493,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":252},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":76},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":50},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":23},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":31},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":16},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":45}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8,\"reviews\":329},{\"name\":\"Priceline\",\"score\":7.9,\"reviews\":83},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":9.1,\"reviews\":23},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":9.8,\"reviews\":2}],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What are the amenities offered at Riu Reggae?\",\"answer\":\"Riu Reggae offers a wide range of amenities including daily housekeeping, infinity pools, spa facilities, entertainment staff, and water sport facilities.\"},{\"question\":\"What activities are available nearby Riu Reggae?\",\"answer\":\"Near Riu Reggae, guests can enjoy activities such as golf at the Negril Hills Golf Club, snorkeling, and visiting the AquaSol Theme Park.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the food quality at Riu Reggae?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have praised the food quality at Riu Reggae, mentioning multiple restaurants on the property, great food selection, and a jerk station on the beach.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the common concerns about Riu Reggae?\",\"answer\":\"Some common concerns mentioned by guests include noise levels, hard mattresses, and the need for more flexible dining options.\"},{\"question\":\"When is the best time to visit Riu Reggae?\",\"answer\":\"The high season at Riu Reggae is in March, offering an excellent time to experience the world-class entertainment, while the low season is in October.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Book a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the beach or the infinity pools comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Low Season Travel\",\"text\":\"If you prefer fewer crowds, consider visiting in October, which is the low season. This could provide a more relaxed and peaceful experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Golf Courses\",\"text\":\"Golf enthusiasts can take advantage of the proximity to several golf courses, including the Negril Hills Golf Club, the Half Moon Golf Club, the Cinnamon Hill Golf Club, and the Breezes Runaway Bay Resort and Golf Club.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"Some guests reported noise disturbances, particularly late at night. Consider requesting a room away from areas with potential noise, or bring earplugs for a peaceful night\'s sleep.\"},{\"title\":\"Check Room Amenities\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned loose outlets in the rooms. It might be helpful to bring along adapters to ensure a secure connection for electronic devices.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan Dining Options\",\"text\":\"Guests highlighted the lack of air-conditioned dining options for breakfast and lunch. Consider exploring nearby dining alternatives or planning outdoor dining during cooler times of the day.\"},{\"title\":\"Stay Informed about All-Inclusive Options\",\"text\":\"The all-inclusive options are available 24/7, ensuring that guests can enjoy food and beverages at any time. However, it\'s advisable to check the specific details of the all-inclusive package upon arrival.\"},{\"title\":\"Utilize Onsite Spa Facilities\",\"text\":\"Take advantage of the onsite spa facilities, which offer a range of treatments including massages and facials, providing an opportunity for relaxation and rejuvenation during your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan for Rainy Season\",\"text\":\"If visiting during the rainy season, it\'s advisable to be prepared for potential weather-related issues. Consider packing appropriate clothing and being aware of the hotel\'s response to inclement weather.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Offsite Dining Options\",\"text\":\"If you plan to return late from offsite activities, consider the limited onsite dining options after dinner time. Exploring nearby dining alternatives or planning ahead for late-night snacks may enhance your experience.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:14:09\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(77,14,'Joia Rose Hall by Iberostar','joia-rose-hall-by-iberostar','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d1fd649978d399156f0f26f26e5bd312.jpg','Featuring free WiFi throughout the property, JOIA Rose Hall by Iberostar offers accommodation in Montego Bay, 50 km from Negril. The resort has a year-round outdoor pool and sun terrace, and guests can enjoy a meal at the restaurant. Flat-screen TV, charging station for mobile devices. Coffee maker in the room…. Every room includes a private bathroom. For your comfort, you will find bath robes and slippers. You will find a 24-hour front desk, a cash machine, hairdresser\'s and gift shop at the property. Butler services are available for your comfort for guests staying in Suite with Ocean View and Suite Oceanfront. This resort has a private beach area and car hire is available. Guests can enjoy various activities in the surroundings, including golfing and diving. Alma is 36 km from JOIA Rose Hall by Iberostar, while Rose Hall is 14 km from the property. Montego Bay Airport is 3 km away. The property does not acept any reservation of 10 rooms or more. All reservations that are 10 or more rooms needs to be quoted as a group with group terms and conditions.','Rose Hall Main Road','+1 876 680 0000',339,4,183,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d1fd649978d399156f0f26f26e5bd312.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_fbe44798f62698d5182ae549c738e1dc.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_5a4a108d5df02c646fdd06f7d45444b0.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_43af52ab776bae6c45e544e778fd0307.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_523d726b69667d32cb7261e847cbbd4d.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_ce593690d40c6d78f284f7f6fecf1b54.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_e7891342b0f1a527ebb542696cf5dab5.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_ba1c161ab50390e2ef10ac61da87625c.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_0aa9ad6d5734483da56072d3d349b86e.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_9114c483fe93cde3cc6974e253f9d9d8.jpg