"Pool bar\",\"Shower\",\"Rain showers\",\"Accessible parking\",\"Slippers\",\"First-aid kit\",\"Snack bar\",\"Balcony\",\"Bathtub\",\"Body soap\",\"Flexible event space\",\"Bottle of water\",\"Breakfast in the room\",\"Kayaking\",\"Telephone\",\"Tile/marble floor\",\"CD player\",\"Toilet\",\"Toilet paper\",\"Safe\",\"Sauna\",\"Clothes rack\",\"Coffee machine\",\"Parasailing\",\"TV\",\"Conditioner\",\"Desk\",\"Shopping\",\"Wardrobe or closet\"]',0,'[{\"question\":\"What Sports Services Does Iberostar Grand Rose Hall Provide?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers a wide variety of activities, both on land and in the surrounding ocean, for guests to participate in. Tennis, billiards, football, and ping-pong are among the land-based games that can be played, in addition to golfing. In addition to the modest fitness center, visitors can access a larger fitness center within the spa. This fitness center features a spinning and Pilates studio, as well as a cocktail lounge, a weight room, and a space dedicated to cardio exercises. Other activities involve non-motorized water activities that are free to participate in (windsurfing, yachting, snorkeling, kayak, and catamaran cruise), as well as free workshops and events like aqua aerobics on the beach and shoreline volleyball competitions. Additionally, for an additional cost, scuba diving or parasailing are both activities that can be arranged.\"},{\"question\":\"Why Should You Eat at Iberostar Grand Rose Hall?\",\"answer\":\"At the Iberostar Grand Rose Hall, guests may dine on gourmet cuisine. The gorgeous Iberostar Grand Rose Hall is home to some of the best dining and drinking establishments in all of Montego Bay, including not one but five à la carte restaurants, two buffets, and six bars. Want a light and easy meal? Get some food at the nearby pool. Visit Montego Bay, Jamaica, and stuff your face with various authentic Jamaican dishes. You may choose from dishes like duck magret, crab tartar, and French meringue at the Gourmet Restaurant. At Surf and Turf Galleon, you may choose from various charcoal-grilled meats served with a large assortment of sauces and sides. Numerous possibilities exist.\"},{\"question\":\"What Are the Laundry Services at Iberostar Grand Rose Hall?\",\"answer\":\"This lodging establishment does provide a laundry service for guests. The resort also provides irons and ironing boards for guests to use at their convenience. As a result, you won\'t need to worry about dirty laundry while on vacation, so you can relax and have fun.\"},{\"question\":\"Are There Any Special Lounges at Iberostar Grand Rose Hall?\",\"answer\":\"Star Prestige, the newest experience offered by the hotel, provides guests with the opportunity to enjoy the highest level of exclusivity as well as complete solitude. You will be granted admission to an exclusive beach club with stunning Balinese beds, butler service on the beach, and a bar stocked with quality drinks and snacks. It will seem like a truly private vacation with island music playing in the background and the sound of waves smashing on the shore. Star Prestige visitors are also welcome to make use of the special member\'s lounge that is located on the premises. Find trendy food events and mixologist activities that are going on, as these will excite any person who enjoys food.\"},{\"question\":\"What Are the Pool/Beach Activities the Iberostar Grand Rose Hall Provides?\",\"answer\":\"The pool at Iberostar Grand Rose Hall is quite spacious. It has several different water levels, a volleyball net, a walkway, a swim-up bar, and stylish padded beach chairs covered by umbrellas and cabanas for shade. Although the pools at other Iberostar properties are just as enormous, the atmosphere at this particular property is noticeably calmer, even if guests still expect to hear loud music.\"},{\"question\":\"Where is Joia Rose Hall by Iberostar located?\",\"answer\":\"Joia Rose Hall by Iberostar is located at Rose Hall Main Road, 10.2 miles from the center of Montego Bay. Cinnamon Hill Golf Course is the closest landmark to Joia Rose Hall by Iberostar.\"},{\"question\":\"When is check-in time and check-out time at Joia Rose Hall by Iberostar?\",\"answer\":\"Check-in time is 3:00 PM and check-out time is 12:00 PM at Joia Rose Hall by Iberostar.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Joia Rose Hall by Iberostar offer free Wi-Fi?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Joia Rose Hall by Iberostar offers free Wi-Fi.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Joia Rose Hall by Iberostar offer free parking?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Joia Rose Hall by Iberostar offers free parking.\"},{\"question\":\"How far is Joia Rose Hall by Iberostar from the airport?\",\"answer\":\"Joia Rose Hall by Iberostar is 9.4 miles from Montego Bay Sangster Intl. Joia Rose Hall by Iberostar is 39.6 miles from Negril.\"},{\"question\":\"How does KAYAK find such great Joia Rose Hall by Iberostar hotel deals?\",\"answer\":\"KAYAK scours the web for all room deals available at Joia Rose Hall by Iberostar in Montego Bay and lets you compare them to find the best rate for your stay. Many different travel sites will offer discounts or deals at different times for rooms at Joia Rose Hall by Iberostar and KAYAK will provide you with prices from a huge range of travel sites. That means that you can always find a great deal for Joia Rose Hall by Iberostar.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Joia Rose Hall by Iberostar have a pool?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Joia Rose Hall by Iberostar has a pool onsite.\"}]','{\"score\":8.6,\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":183,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":129},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":23},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":13},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":7},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":3},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":0},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":8}],\"summary\":\"Guests consistently praised the hotel\'s prime beachfront location, attentive and friendly service, high standards of cleanliness, and spacious, comfortable rooms. Many highlighted the excellent and varied breakfast options. While there were some criticisms regarding inconsistent food quality, communication, and certain administrative issues, the overall impression was very positive, with many guests eager to return and recommending the hotel for a relaxing and enjoyable stay.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":9.5},{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":9},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":8.5},{\"label\":\"Room Size\",\"score\":8.5},{\"label\":\"Breakfast\",\"score\":8.5}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.6,\"reviews\":147},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":8.9,\"reviews\":7},{\"name\":\"Priceline\",\"score\":5.5,\"reviews\":2},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":10,\"reviews\":3}],\"mentions\":[\"staff is friendly\",\"food was very good\",\"room service\",\"beach pool\",\"great service\",\"italian restaurant\",\"ocean view\",\"bar were great\",\"great time\",\"two days\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What can I expect from the dining options at Iberostar Grand Rose Hall?\",\"answer\":\"Iberostar Grand Rose Hall offers a global culinary journey with excellent options such as fresh sushi and other Japanese classics at Samurai, fine steakhouse fare at Uncle Tony’s, special cocktails and music at Jammin’, and delicious Cajun specialties at Jambalaya.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the common concerns about the room service at Iberostar Grand Rose Hall?\",\"answer\":\"Some guests have mentioned that the room service at Iberostar Grand Rose Hall was lacking, with issues related to restocking the fridge, bathroom amenities, and cleanliness. However, the staff was described as respectful and nice.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the highlights of the amenities at Iberostar Grand Rose Hall?\",\"answer\":\"Iberostar Grand Rose Hall offers luxury treatments at SPA Sensations, a stunning outdoor infinity pool, an onsite theatre and cinema with shows and movies for all-ages, a discotheque, billiards, and beachside butler service for Double Seaview Star Prestige rooms.\"},{\"question\":\"When is the best time to visit Iberostar Grand Rose Hall?\",\"answer\":\"The high season at Iberostar Grand Rose Hall is in June, offering an ideal time to enjoy the luxurious lodgings, superb beachside location, and an array of watersports and outdoor activities.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the standout features of the staff at Iberostar Grand Rose Hall?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have consistently praised the amazing staff at Iberostar Grand Rose Hall for their friendliness, services, and professionalism, making the resort experience truly exceptional.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for the Butler Service\",\"text\":\"Several guests praised the butler service, highlighting the personalized attention and assistance provided by the butlers.\"},{\"title\":\"Make Dinner Reservations Early\",\"text\":\"To avoid missing out on preferred dining options, it is advisable to make dinner reservations as soon as possible upon arrival, as suggested by some guests.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider the All-Inclusive Privileges\",\"text\":\"Guests recommended opting for the Double Seaview Star Prestige room to enjoy the all-inclusive privileges, enhanced amenities, and beachside butler service.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"Take advantage of the hotel\'s proximity to attractions such as the Dunns River Falls in Ocho Rios, which is about an hour away, and other nearby shopping malls, golf courses, and cafes.\"},{\"title\":\"Enjoy the Wellness Pool\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the wellness pool as a serene and relaxing feature of the property, perfect for unwinding and enjoying the tranquil atmosphere.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Sales Pitches\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned encountering sales pitches during their stay, particularly related to time-share conversations, so it\'s advisable to be cautious and clear about preferences in such situations.\"},{\"title\":\"Request Room Restocking\",\"text\":\"A few guests experienced issues with room restocking and suggested leaving clear notes and tips to ensure that items such as the fridge, bathroom amenities, and other essentials are replenished promptly.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider the SPA Sensations\",\"text\":\"The SPA Sensations at the hotel offers luxury treatments, providing an opportunity for guests to indulge in rejuvenating spa experiences, as recommended by some guests.\"},{\"title\":\"Appreciate the Outdoor Activities\",\"text\":\"Many guests enjoyed an array of watersports and outdoor activities due to the hotel\'s superb beachside location, making it an ideal choice for those seeking outdoor adventures.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Note of Room Selection\",\"text\":\"While the rooms were generally praised for their comfort and furnishings, some guests mentioned issues with in-room towel service, so it\'s advisable to inquire about this aspect when selecting a room.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:14:17\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(78,14,'Royalton Blue Waters Montego Bay, An Autograph Collection Resort','royalton-blue-waters-montego-bay-an-autograph-collection-resort','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_7971d5f4d288e40abfd45f2a8c5ce503.jpg','Catch some rays on Royalton Blue Waters Montego Bay, An Autograph Collection Resort\'s private white sand beach, pamper yourself at the full-service spa, or spend the day at a complimentary water park. \\nHousekeeping is available on request. \\nRoyalton Blue Waters Montego Bay, An Autograph Collection Resort offers 228 air-conditioned accommodations, which are accessible via exterior corridors and feature minibars and safes. Rooms open to balconies. Flat-screen televisions come with premium satellite channels and pay movies. Bathrooms include showers with rainfall showerheads, bathrobes, slippers, and complimentary toiletries. This Falmouth property provides complimentary wireless Internet access. Business-friendly amenities include desks and phones. Additionally, rooms include complimentary bottled water and coffee\\/tea makers. A nightly turndown service is provided and housekeeping is offered daily. Amenities available on request include refrigerators. Housekeeping is provided on request. \\n4 outdoor swimming pools are on site along with a children\'s pool. Other recreational amenities include a private beach, an outdoor tennis court, a complimentary water park, and a lazy river. The recreational activities listed below are available either on site or nearby; fees may apply.','Highway A1 Mountain Spring Trelawny','+1 876 632 7401',264,4,398,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_7971d5f4d288e40abfd45f2a8c5ce503.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_5a4b75f9abf8b1cbca237ab68f6289d2.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_949771c621f86afa99e75d91915ce45f.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_b0314902164ce8cc3befa29566deda6d.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_87be7664aef88eeb9dde182bbab9f4ab.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_e122a2363721e1f41d5e79bbae7a8556.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_b2ced4d5f7bb728649ba5f634d13e110.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_bfcc8739a27ef6b228b044c1967bc6f3.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_acbc0854191de89b4ba39eb1c320a4c8.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_3fe85f9badfb46971d5081b664090872.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_f2ec7ad4f23c9fec9f4f65e84f2eb828.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_142327259a3b921852e6c9decfa307ac.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_9bf094c1768cb82d96880e806bc82537.jpg\"]',NULL,'https://www.kayak.com/Montego-Bay-Hotels-Royalton-Blue-Waters-Montego-Bay-An-Autograph-Collection-Resort.879505.ksp','[\"Babysitting or child care\",\"Business center\",\"Wake-up service\",\"Wi-Fi available in all areas\",\"Internet\",\"Executive lounge access\",\"Daily housekeeping\",\"Family rooms\",\"Concierge service\",\"Fan\",\"Cribs available\",\"Entertainment staff\",\"Grocery deliveries\",\"Gift shop\",\"Ironing service\",\"Laundry service\",\"Flat-screen TV\",\"Meeting/Banquet facilities\",\"Free toiletries\",\"Room service\",\"Eco tourism\",\"Special diet menus (on request)\",\"Beach access\",\"Tour desk\",\"Game room\",\"Health club\",\"Spa\",\"Hot tub\",\"Child pool\",\"Outdoor pool\",\"Scuba diving\",\"Evening entertainment\",\"No smoking\",\"Kid-friendly buffet\",\"Restaurant\",\"Bar/Lounge\",\"Laptop safe\",\"Hairdryer\",\"Fitness center\",\"Cable or satellite TV\",\"Mosquito net\",\"Kids\' club\",\"Air-conditioned\",\"Newspapers\",\"Pay-per-view channels\",\"Outdoor furniture\",\"Airport shuttle (surcharge)\",\"Food can be delivered to guest accommodation\",\"Complimentary breakfast\",\"Pets not allowed\",\"Plunge pool\",\"Free parking\",\"Pool towels\",\"Pool view\",\"Playground\",\"Water park\",\"Pool with a view\",\"Water sport facilities (on site)\",\"Coffee shop\",\"Private beach\",\"Bathrobe\",\"Private bathroom\",\"Garden\",\"24hr front desk\",\"Designated smoking area\",\"Private entrance\",\"Night club\",\"Storage available\",\"Private parking\",\"Shuttle service (additional charge)\",\"Private pool\",\"Wedding services\",\"Free Wi-Fi\",\"Outdoor tennis\",\"Terrace/Patio\",\"Increased accessibility\",\"Beach chairs\",\"Linens\",\"Towels\",\"Safety deposit box\",\"Soap and Shampoo Provided\",\"Sea view\",\"Seating area\",\"Elevator\",\"Massage\",\"Shampoo\",\"Pool bar\",\"Shower\",\"Rain showers\",\"Slippers\",\"First-aid kit\",\"Snack bar\",\"Alarm clock\",\"Balcony\",\"Bathtub\",\"Body soap\",\"Flexible event space\",\"Bottle of water\",\"Breakfast in the room\",\"Locally curated art gallery\",\"Tea/coffee maker\",\"Telephone\",\"Tile/marble floor\",\"Toilet\",\"Toilet paper\",\"Safe\",\"Sauna\",\"Clothes rack\",\"Trash cans\",\"Coffee machine\",\"TV\",\"Smartphone dock\",\"Conditioner\",\"Valet parking\",\"Desk\",\"Dining area\",\"Wardrobe or closet\",\"Drying rack for clothing\",\"Water slide\"]',0,'[{\"question\":\"What is the most convenient way to travel from the airport to the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"There are various ways to go to the hotel. From the Sangster International Airport, the quickest and most convenient method to get to the hotel is by taxi, which can take 30mins. As an alternative, you can use public transportation, like a bus that will get you to the station close to the hotel. As you exit the baggage claim area, on your left, are businesses including Enterprise, Budget, Avis, Hertz, Thrifty, and Alamo from whom you can rent a vehicle. The hotel also provides private pick-up and drop-off services upon request.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the hotel offer any business amenities?\",\"answer\":\"The Royalton Blue Waters, An Autograph Collection Resort hotel, has executive offices, a cutting-edge business center, a conference space that can be used indoors, and multimedia tools. If you reserve the venue, a professional meeting planner will assist you or your organization in organizing the specifics of your upcoming workshop or conference. Additionally, accessibility to binding, photocopying, and printing equipment is available to business travelers. There are also comfortable workstations and seats that give you the comfort you require while working. Business travelers can also have access to guest suites with workstations equipped with all office equipment for those who would love to work from their rooms.\"},{\"question\":\"How is parking at this hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel visitors have a wide range of parking options. Additionally, guests joining the hotel\'s loyalty program can take advantage of discounted or free parking options for valet parking and self-parking in the parking lots. The hotel has a parking garage that guests can utilize for free. However, self-parking is still inexpensive. You can also book services for self-parking and valet services at a fee. If you want to utilize the onsite free parking garage, ensure that you book your space earlier.\"},{\"question\":\"What dining options does the hotel offer its guests?\",\"answer\":\"On the grounds of the Royalton Blue Waters Montego Bay, Autograph Collection Resort hotel, there are 11 dining establishments, including a jerk hut, a buffet, and seven a la carte restaurants. Customers can enjoy cuisine that includes West Indies-style, Mexican, Asian fusion, Italian, Mediterranean, and more for their all-inclusive fee. Views of the pool may be seen from the hotel restaurant, which offers breakfast, lunch, and dinner. You need to make a reservation. While dining at any of these restaurants, you will have a great and inviting ocean view.\"},{\"question\":\"What services does the hotel offer for families traveling with children?\",\"answer\":\"The Royalton Blue Waters Montego Bay, Autograph Collection Resort hotel, has a splash park featuring water slides, a lazy river, and a splash pad for both adults and children. The complementary white Bali beds are available for use by guests by the pool, or they can book a private cabana with a mini-bar and waiter service. There are also a ton of recreational activities available, such as board games, ping pong tables, kayaking, an introductory scuba class, and snorkeling. The Royal Spa provides a full range of body treatments and massages, including a hydrotherapy circuit, for a more tranquil day.\\n \"},{\"question\":\"Where is Royalton Blue Waters Montego Bay, An Autograph Collection Resort located?\",\"answer\":\"Royalton Blue Waters Montego Bay, An Autograph Collection Resort is located at Highway A1 Mountain Spring Trelawny, 20.3 miles from the center of Montego Bay. Cinnamon Hill Golf Course is the closest landmark to Royalton Blue Waters Montego Bay, An Autograph Collection Resort.\"},{\"question\":\"When is check-in time and check-out time at Royalton Blue Waters Montego Bay, An Autograph Collection Resort?\",\"answer\":\"Check-in time is 3:00 PM and check-out time is 12:00 PM at Royalton Blue Waters Montego Bay, An Autograph Collection Resort.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Royalton Blue Waters Montego Bay, An Autograph Collection Resort offer free Wi-Fi?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Royalton Blue Waters Montego Bay, An Autograph Collection Resort offers free Wi-Fi.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Royalton Blue Waters Montego Bay, An Autograph Collection Resort offer free parking?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Royalton Blue Waters Montego Bay, An Autograph Collection Resort offers free parking.\"},{\"question\":\"How far is Royalton Blue Waters Montego Bay, An Autograph Collection Resort from the airport?\",\"answer\":\"Royalton Blue Waters Montego Bay, An Autograph Collection Resort is 19.9 miles from Montego Bay Sangster Intl. Royalton Blue Waters Montego Bay, An Autograph Collection Resort is 42.3 miles from Ocho Rios Boscobel.\"},{\"question\":\"How does KAYAK find such great Royalton Blue Waters Montego Bay, An Autograph Collection Resort hotel deals?\",\"answer\":\"KAYAK scours the web for all room deals available at Royalton Blue Waters Montego Bay, An Autograph Collection Resort in Montego Bay and lets you compare them to find the best rate for your stay. Many different travel sites will offer discounts or deals at different times for rooms at Royalton Blue Waters Montego Bay, An Autograph Collection Resort and KAYAK will provide you with prices from a huge range of travel sites. That means that you can always find a great deal for Royalton Blue Waters Montego Bay, An Autograph Collection Resort.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Royalton Blue Waters Montego Bay, An Autograph Collection Resort have a pool?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Royalton Blue Waters Montego Bay, An Autograph Collection Resort has a pool onsite.\"}]','{\"score\":7.8,\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":398,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":165},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":61},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":48},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":27},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":26},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":25},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":46}],\"summary\":\"Guests appreciated the hotel\'s location, breakfast offerings, and comfortable beds. However, there were repeated concerns about the level of service, with several guests reporting issues with staff attitude, communication, and responsiveness. Cleanliness was mentioned frequently, with mixed feedback ranging from very clean rooms to areas needing improvement. While the location and breakfast were generally praised, service inconsistencies and some maintenance issues detracted from the overall experience for many guests.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":7.5},{\"label\":\"Breakfast\",\"score\":7},{\"label\":\"Bed Comfort\",\"score\":6.5},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":6},{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":2}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":7.7,\"reviews\":352},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":8.9,\"reviews\":25},{\"name\":\"Priceline\",\"score\":7.6,\"reviews\":9},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":6,\"reviews\":1}],\"mentions\":[\"food was great\",\"staff was very friendly\",\"room was ready\",\"excellent service\",\"room service\",\"entertainment was good\",\"pool\",\"front desk\",\"lobby bar\",\"beautiful resort\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What can I expect from the room amenities at Royalton Blue Waters?\",\"answer\":\"You can expect a luxurious stay with amenities such as the Royalton Signature DreamBed™ with high thread count sheets, rain showers, a stocked mini-bar, satellite television, Bluetooth audio stations, 24-hour room service, iron/ironing board, and a coffeemaker.\"},{\"question\":\"Are there any specific dining options available at Royalton Blue Waters?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, there are 11 restaurants on the property, including seven a la carte restaurants, a buffet offering, and an authentic jerk hut. Guests can enjoy cuisine ranging from Asian fusion, Italian, Mediterranean, Mexican, and West Indies-style.\"},{\"question\":\"What recreational activities are available for guests at Royalton Blue Waters?\",\"answer\":\"Guests can enjoy a splash park with water slides, a splash pad, and a lazy river. Additionally, there are options for snorkeling, kayaking, scuba lessons, ping pong, beach volleyball, and board games.\"},{\"question\":\"Is there a \'stay at one, play at two\' policy at Royalton Blue Waters?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, guests at Royalton Blue Waters can venture next door to the Royalton White Sands and enjoy its property and amenities, providing an extended range of experiences.\"},{\"question\":\"What are some common concerns about the dining experience at Royalton Blue Waters?\",\"answer\":\"Some guests have expressed concerns about the limited restaurant options and the food quality, including the need for more variety and better entertainment.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Pre-select Your Room\",\"text\":\"For a faster check-in process, consider pre-selecting your room online for an added charge, as mentioned by the hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"Take advantage of the hotel\'s proximity to attractions such as Greenwood Great House, Cinnamon Hill Golf Course, and Rose Hall Great House for off-site activities.\"},{\"title\":\"Private Cabana by the Pool\",\"text\":\"Reserve a private cabana by the pool for a luxurious experience with mini-bar service and dedicated waiter, as suggested by guests.\"},{\"title\":\"Enjoy Water Activities\",\"text\":\"Engage in water activities such as snorkeling, kayaking, and even an introductory scuba lesson, all available at the hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of \\\"Stay at One, Play at Two\\\"\",\"text\":\"Make use of the \\\"stay at one, play at two\\\" policy, allowing guests to explore and enjoy the amenities at the neighboring Royalton White Sands as well.\"},{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the pool or ocean comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Diverse Dining Options\",\"text\":\"With 11 restaurants on the property, including a la carte options and an authentic jerk hut, guests can enjoy a wide range of cuisines during their stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Family-Friendly Amenities\",\"text\":\"Families can take advantage of the kid-friendly buffet, kids\' club, and complimentary breakfast, making the hotel a great choice for a family vacation.\"},{\"title\":\"Relax at the Royal Spa\",\"text\":\"Indulge in a day of relaxation at the Royal Spa, offering a full menu of body treatments, massages, and a hydrotherapy circuit.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Butler Service\",\"text\":\"Several guests highlighted the exceptional service provided by the butlers. Consider requesting butler service for a more personalized and attentive experience during your stay.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:14:23\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(79,14,'Riu Palace Jamaica Adults Only','riu-palace-jamaica-adults-only','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_9da18a139ded7a0701744a26e93bf359.jpg','This luxurious resort boasts a spectacular setting in Montego Bay. The resort is situated overlooking the shimmering waters of the Caribbean Sea, basking in its picture-perfect setting. The resort is located just a short driving distance away from the town and the airport. Guests will find themselves surrounded by ample opportunities for exploration and discovery. This magnificent resort is sure to impress discerning travellers seeking a truly rejuvenating, invigorating experience. The guest rooms are luxuriously designed, immersing visitors in comfort and style. A wide range of first-class facilities and services ensure that the dining, leisure and entertainment needs of guests are fully catered for, to the highest level of excellence. The new exclusive Elite Service by RIU includes the following:- Premium room locations- Access to premium branded drinks at selected bars (lobby bar, chill out bar and wet bar)- Access to reserved pool area with exclusive bar (wet bar)- Access to reserved beach area with exclusive bar (Elite Club Beach)- Access to exclusive restaurants (breakfast a la carte and specialty Elite Club restaurant)- Access to table booking in themed restaurants via Riu App- Upgraded in-room liquor dispenser with premium brands- Upgraded room service, including vegetarian options- Upgraded minibar with snacks and a bottle of wine- In-room aromatherapy- Exclusive welcome gift- Priority access at reception and Elite Club wristband- Guaranteed late check-out until 1 PM, and early check-in subject to availability','Mahoe Bay - Ironshore P O','+1 876 940 8022',365,4,105,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_9da18a139ded7a0701744a26e93bf359.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_f7a77de8cdabc5e0b5bece62fcb19196.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_a587ab815cce6adf4cb658fe811e69bb.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_e8e85d381a1e9a63eb5367a2b0f50327.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_b2e1a2fb3233a00c3ffdcc78d8169246.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_6ae9fc4c206a1710a40215758ca1785d.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_490a8c93970910585dd7d38eb31e3444.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_4d0741bc937ee78c2386f02030c43b1b.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_f047a1423d0b7589352881a89f6a472c.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_bb2558c18c2776fb46c21b52ca0a6b4a.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_6cec812a7ed5085450c298ccd07c425d.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_dcd08636b5bfb838e3347ff9c1f1a166.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_57b4a4c21410a3d1473f652ba44cc170.jpg\"]',NULL,'https://www.kayak.com/Montego-Bay-Hotels-Riu-Palace-Jamaica-Adults-Only.567258.ksp','[\"Conference rooms\",\"ATM on-site\",\"Wedding services\",\"Free Wi-Fi\",\"Pets allowed on request. Charges may apply.\",\"Daily housekeeping\",\"Beach chairs\",\"Beach towels\",\"Linens\",\"Concierge service\",\"Towels\",\"Fan\",\"Gift shop\",\"Laundry facilities\",\"Elevator\",\"Laundry service\",\"Flat-screen TV\",\"Meeting/Banquet facilities\",\"Multi-lingual staff\",\"Massage\",\"Free toiletries\",\"Pool bar\",\"Living room\",\"Shared lounge/TV area\",\"Room service\",\"Eco tourism\",\"Special diet menus (on request)\",\"Beach access\",\"Tour desk\",\"Adapter\",\"Slippers\",\"Spa\",\"Hot tub\",\"Interconnected room(s) available\",\"Snack bar\",\"Outdoor pool\",\"Scuba diving\",\"Snorkeling\",\"Balcony\",\"Fitness classes\",\"Bathtub\",\"Restaurant\",\"Bar/Lounge\",\"Beauty salon\",\"Laptop safe\",\"Hairdryer\",\"Fitness center\",\"Bottle of water\",\"Locally curated art gallery\",\"Kayaking\",\"Tennis\",\"Cable or satellite TV\",\"Telephone\",\"Air-conditioned\",\"Sauna\",\"Complimentary breakfast\",\"Coffee machine\",\"Rafting\",\"Sailing\",\"Shopping\",\"Pool table\",\"Windsurfing\",\"Bathrobe\",\"Private bathroom\",\"Garden\",\"24hr front desk\",\"Designated smoking area\",\"Night club\",\"Storage available\"]',0,'[{\"question\":\"What are the top natural attractions close to the Riu Palace Jamaica Adults Only?\",\"answer\":\"Visitors staying at the Riu Palace can enjoy the unmistakable natural beauty of Jamaica’s beaches, mountains, forests and waterfalls. Guests can book horseback riding trips, or go on an off-road adventure on an ATV bike. Take a full day excursion to visit the picturesque YS falls or climb the iconic Dunn’s river falls, one of Jamaica’s national treasures. Nature lovers will also love hiking around the Cockpit Country natural reserve and exploring its untouched wilderness.\"},{\"question\":\"How can I stay fit at Riu Palace Jamaica Adults Only?\",\"answer\":\"There are plenty of ways you can stay active on vacation at the Riu Palace Jamaica Adults Only. Join in the group fitness activities, have a game of beach volleyball, or enjoy a tennis match on the floodlit courts. After an invigorating workout in the hotel’s fully equipped gym, relax your muscles in the whirlpool bath and sauna. If you would like to book some tee time, there are a number of golf courses near the hotel with spectacular views. Only 3 mi from Riu Palace Jamaica, the award-winning Half Moon golf course was designed by renowned golf architect Robert Trent Jones. Voted one of the top 5 courses in the Caribbean, the stunning Cinnamon Hill golf course is just 5 mi east of the hotel.\"},{\"question\":\"What kind of watersports are possible at Riu Palace Jamaica Adults Only?\",\"answer\":\"Jamaica’s perfect beaches and hypnotic waters are legendary and guests can enjoy plenty of fun in the sun at the Riu Palace Jamaica. Hire a kayak or a pedal boat and spend a leisurely afternoon on the water. Try stand-up paddling boarding and enjoy the stunning scenery and clear waters of the bay. There are plenty of calm, easily accessible spots for snorkeling and scuba diving, where you can discover an exciting underwater world of marine life and coral reefs. If you’re feeling energetic, rent a windsurf or catamaran and sail into the sunset.\"},{\"question\":\"What kind of entertainment can I find at Riu Palace Jamaica Adults only?\",\"answer\":\"The resort has a friendly team of performers offering a daily program of activities and entertainment. There are shows, lively theme nights, quiz nights, games and karaoke. Guests can also enjoy live music in the evenings such as reggae bands and steel pan bands. If you’re staying at the Riu Palace, you can also enjoy the nightlife and entertainment at the other Riu hotels in the area, including Pacha nightclub.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Riu Palace Jamaica Adults Only an eco-friendly hotel?\",\"answer\":\"To keep the island of Jamaica pristine, the Riu Palace Jamaica is committed to reducing its environmental impact. The hotel has a recycling program, uses energy efficient appliances, and promotes initiatives to save water, reduce CO2 emissions and protect the natural diversity of Montego Bay. Since 2012, RIU Hotels & Resorts has also been certified by the TRAVELIFE sustainability in tourism program, which offers practical tools and resources to improve in-house sustainability at the hotel.\"},{\"question\":\"Where is Riu Palace Jamaica Adults Only located?\",\"answer\":\"Riu Palace Jamaica Adults Only is located at Mahoe Bay - Ironshore P O, 3.9 miles from the center of Montego Bay. Half Moon Bay Equestrian Centre is the closest landmark to Riu Palace Jamaica Adults Only.\"},{\"question\":\"When is check-in time and check-out time at Riu Palace Jamaica Adults Only?\",\"answer\":\"Check-in time is 3:00 PM and check-out time is 12:00 PM at Riu Palace Jamaica Adults Only.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Riu Palace Jamaica Adults Only offer free Wi-Fi?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Riu Palace Jamaica Adults Only offers free Wi-Fi.\"},{\"question\":\"How far is Riu Palace Jamaica Adults Only from the airport?\",\"answer\":\"Riu Palace Jamaica Adults Only is 2.1 miles from Montego Bay Sangster Intl. Riu Palace Jamaica Adults Only is 32.8 miles from Negril.\"},{\"question\":\"How does KAYAK find such great Riu Palace Jamaica Adults Only hotel deals?\",\"answer\":\"KAYAK scours the web for all room deals available at Riu Palace Jamaica Adults Only in Montego Bay and lets you compare them to find the best rate for your stay. Many different travel sites will offer discounts or deals at different times for rooms at Riu Palace Jamaica Adults Only and KAYAK will provide you with prices from a huge range of travel sites. That means that you can always find a great deal for Riu Palace Jamaica Adults Only.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Riu Palace Jamaica Adults Only have a pool?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Riu Palace Jamaica Adults Only has a pool onsite.\"}]','{\"score\":7.8,\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":105,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":58},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":12},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":8},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":5},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":8},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":3},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":11}],\"summary\":\"Overall, guests appreciated the friendly and attentive staff, which contributed greatly to their positive experiences at the hotel. The location was also frequently mentioned as convenient and safe, with easy access to local attractions. Cleanliness and well-maintained facilities were highlighted as positives, and several guests enjoyed the breakfast and food variety. Some negative feedback focused on outdated rooms, inconsistent service, noise from nearby airports, and limited restaurant options, but the positives generally outweighed the negatives.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":9},{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":8.5},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":8}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":7.6,\"reviews\":51},{\"name\":\"Priceline\",\"score\":7.9,\"reviews\":19},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":8.6,\"reviews\":15},{\"name\":\"HotelsCombined\",\"score\":9.7,\"reviews\":1}],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What are the dining options at Hotel Riu Palace Jamaica?\",\"answer\":\"Hotel Riu Palace Jamaica offers a variety of dining options, including a Japanese restaurant, a Fusion restaurant, an Italian restaurant, and a steakhouse. Additionally, guests can enjoy a romantic dinner on the beach for a truly memorable experience.\"},{\"question\":\"What can guests expect from the room amenities at Hotel Riu Palace Jamaica?\",\"answer\":\"The rooms at Hotel Riu Palace Jamaica are designed to provide the utmost rest and relaxation, equipped with amenities like Wi-Fi, a hydromassage bathtub, air conditioning, satellite television, and a balcony or terrace. Guests interested in a room with a view should consider booking the Suite Jacuzzi with sea view.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the nearby attractions to Hotel Riu Palace Jamaica?\",\"answer\":\"Hotel Riu Palace Jamaica is conveniently located near attractions such as SuperClubs Ironshore Golf and Country Club, Three Palms Ocean Course, Cornwall Beach, and Doctor\'s Cave Bathing Club, offering guests the opportunity to explore and enjoy the surrounding town and nature.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the staff at Hotel Riu Palace Jamaica?\",\"answer\":\"The staff at Hotel Riu Palace Jamaica is fantastic, very friendly, and accommodating, ensuring that everything is great for the guests. They are also very accommodating to large groups and the entertainers are fantastic.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the common concerns about Hotel Riu Palace Jamaica?\",\"answer\":\"Some guests have expressed concerns about the limited food variety, high prices at the marketplace, and the need for better internet service. Additionally, there were comments about the lack of sanitation options in the exercise facility and the limited menus at the restaurants.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Book a Suite Jacuzzi with sea view\",\"text\":\"Guests highly recommend booking this room type for a spectacular view and a relaxing experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore nearby attractions\",\"text\":\"Take advantage of the hotel\'s proximity to attractions like SuperClubs Ironshore Golf and Country Club, Three Palms Ocean Course, and Cornwall Beach for a diverse range of activities.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider optional dining\",\"text\":\"While the all-inclusive package offers breakfast, lunch, and dinner, guests suggest trying the Japanese, Fusion, Italian, and steakhouse restaurants for a varied dining experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan a romantic dinner on the beach\",\"text\":\"For a special and memorable experience, consider arranging a romantic dinner on the beach, perfect for celebrating special occasions like honeymoons or birthdays.\"},{\"title\":\"Check room amenities\",\"text\":\"Some guests found the room service options limited, so it\'s advisable to review the room service menu and consider dining options outside the hotel for more variety.\"},{\"title\":\"Enjoy the entertainment\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the entertainment options at the hotel, so make sure to take advantage of the fun activities and shows during your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Be mindful of housekeeping timing\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned housekeeping noise and timing, so consider communicating your preferred service times to avoid any inconvenience.\"},{\"title\":\"Take advantage of the swim-up bar\",\"text\":\"Relax and enjoy a refreshing cocktail at the swim-up bar in the infinity pool for a unique and enjoyable experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider nearby golfing\",\"text\":\"Golf enthusiasts should consider playing a game at the nearby golf course for a leisurely day out.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for room upgrades\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned that the rooms could use a facelift, so it may be worth inquiring about any available room upgrades for an enhanced stay.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:14:30\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(80,14,'Hotel Grand A View','hotel-grand-a-view','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_2b0589aa28ef935f8e4267da3073d706.jpg','Along with an outdoor pool, this smoke-free hotel has a restaurant and a 24-hour fitness center. Free full breakfast is provided, as well as free WiFi in public areas, free self parking, and a free airport shuttle. Other amenities include a bar\\/lounge, a meeting room, and concierge services. \\nHotel Grand A View offers 50 air-conditioned accommodations with safes and irons\\/ironing boards. 48-inch flat-screen televisions come with premium digital channels. Bathrooms include showers. This Montego Bay hotel provides complimentary wireless Internet access. A nightly turndown service is provided and housekeeping is offered daily. Amenities available on request include hair dryers. \\nRecreational amenities at the hotel include an outdoor pool and a 24-hour fitness center.','3 Ramparts Close','+1 876 679 0999',76,4,315,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_2b0589aa28ef935f8e4267da3073d706.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/me