novation disruptions, and occasional service lapses, but overall, guests were satisfied with their stay, especially for short visits or budget-friendly options.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":9.5},{\"label\":\"Breakfast\",\"score\":9},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":8},{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":8}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":7.5,\"reviews\":251},{\"name\":\"Priceline\",\"score\":8.3,\"reviews\":19},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":9.1,\"reviews\":11}],\"mentions\":[\"staff was great\",\"room is spacious\",\"great view\",\"food was not good\",\"pool\",\"front desk\",\"hot water\",\"montego bay\",\"good location\",\"marsha\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What are the best times to visit Hotel Grand A View?\",\"answer\":\"The high season at Hotel Grand A View is in March, while the low season is in May.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the quality of the beds at Hotel Grand A View?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have described the beds at Hotel Grand A View as comfortable and the rooms as clean and spacious.\"},{\"question\":\"Is parking available at Hotel Grand A View?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Hotel Grand A View offers free parking and a private parking area for guests.\"},{\"question\":\"What can guests expect from the food quality at Hotel Grand A View?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have praised the food at Hotel Grand A View, particularly the breakfast, with some mentioning the amazing views of the ocean while dining.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the cleanliness and customer service at Hotel Grand A View?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have appreciated the cleanliness and modern facilities at Hotel Grand A View. The staff has been described as extremely nice, accommodating, and friendly.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Book a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the fountain comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Low Season Travel\",\"text\":\"May is mentioned as the low season, which could be a great time to visit for quieter surroundings and potentially better rates.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel is conveniently located near Cornwall Beach, Doctor\'s Cave Bathing Club, and other attractions, making it easy to explore the area.\"},{\"title\":\"Check Room Amenities\",\"text\":\"Some guests experienced issues with the location of the air conditioning and noise from the main road. It might be helpful to inquire about room specifics before booking.\"},{\"title\":\"Utilize the Free Airport Shuttle\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers a free airport shuttle, which can be a convenient and cost-effective way to reach the hotel upon arrival.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Breakfast Limitations\",\"text\":\"Guests noted limited options for breakfast and restrictions on second portions. It may be helpful to set expectations accordingly.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Alternative Transportation\",\"text\":\"Some guests recommended using local taxis with red number plates and suggested specific apps for booking, potentially offering more affordable and reliable transportation options.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan for Dinner Service\",\"text\":\"A few guests mentioned slow dinner service and limited shuttle times. Considering these factors when planning evening activities could help avoid inconvenience.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Beach Access\",\"text\":\"The hotel provides beach access, allowing guests to enjoy the nearby beaches easily.\"},{\"title\":\"Inquire About Special Services\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers wedding services, ticket service, and a concierge, which could be beneficial for guests seeking assistance with special arrangements or activities.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:14:37\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(81,14,'Round Hill Hotel And Villas','round-hill-hotel-and-villas','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_3a87a47ef3c373d336864a98c7fe8dac.jpg','Spend the day catching some rays at Round Hill Hotel And Villas\'s private sand beach, relaxing by one of the hotel\'s 2 outdoor swimming pools, or pampering yourself at the full-service spa. \\nRound Hill Hotel And Villas offers 137 air-conditioned accommodations with safes and complimentary newspapers. Guests can make use of the in-room refrigerators and coffee\\/tea makers. Bathrooms include separate bathtubs and showers, bathrobes, slippers, and complimentary toiletries. This Montego Bay hotel provides complimentary wireless Internet access. Business-friendly amenities include desks and phones. Additionally, rooms include hair dryers and irons\\/ironing boards. A nightly turndown service is provided and housekeeping is offered daily. Amenities available on request include in-room massages. \\nA private beach, 5 outdoor tennis courts, and a health club are featured at the hotel. 2 outdoor swimming pools are on site along with a children\'s pool. Other recreational amenities include a fitness center. The recreational activities listed below are available either on site or nearby; fees may apply.','John Pringle Drive, PO Box 64','+1 876 956 7050',481,5,99,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_3a87a47ef3c373d336864a98c7fe8dac.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_5941d810ce1322f19c073a365ef78ce1.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_f30c0c8306157be971ec7754a5fa7181.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_c50781e19f745a4e5d6a1eb472feb180.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_4e8d86e843d3469a955e78c37c16a158.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_37a74ea267fa38398056828145a4f9ba.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_33c5aca34ecb30087ceea0d04a818a95.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_0be452551c40a547a778ad44301ff7b2.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_00da2eb4b50fae8ba47f6c4e196cb67f.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_01bf70f5c08a3a1b0be4570f15ad1f49.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_4b64a3b35948a30d396d06c7b6757338.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_9d0daa2a9b6ace42d272cb649f7339b2.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_53c20163bd824b1f65f457f55d37e5bd.jpg\"]',NULL,'https://www.kayak.com/Montego-Bay-Hotels-Round-Hill-Hotel-And-Villas.316161.ksp','[\"Conference rooms\",\"Wedding services\",\"Free Wi-Fi\",\"Business center\",\"Outdoor tennis\",\"Terrace/Patio\",\"Daily housekeeping\",\"Beach chairs\",\"Beach towels\",\"Linens\",\"Concierge service\",\"Towels\",\"Fan\",\"Currency exchange on-site\",\"Grill\",\"Gift shop\",\"Laundry facilities\",\"Laundry service\",\"Meeting/Banquet facilities\",\"Multi-lingual staff\",\"Massage\",\"Boating\",\"Yoga\",\"Library\",\"Free toiletries\",\"Shared lounge/TV area\",\"Room service\",\"Eco tourism\",\"Chauffeur\",\"Tour desk\",\"Fishing\",\"Slippers\",\"Spa\",\"Child pool\",\"Outdoor pool\",\"Scuba diving\",\"Snorkeling\",\"No smoking\",\"Fitness classes\",\"Restaurant\",\"Bar/Lounge\",\"Gym\",\"Beauty salon\",\"Flexible event space\",\"Hairdryer\",\"Fitness center\",\"Kayaking\",\"Telephone\",\"Kids\' club\",\"Air-conditioned\",\"Newspapers\",\"Safe\",\"Airport shuttle (surcharge)\",\"Babysitting/child services (surcharge)\",\"Continental breakfast\",\"Coffee machine\",\"Parasailing\",\"Rafting\",\"Free parking\",\"Sailing\",\"Playground\",\"Desk\",\"Shopping\",\"Private beach\",\"Windsurfing\",\"Bathrobe\",\"Private bathroom\",\"Garden\",\"24hr front desk\",\"Designated smoking area\",\"Shuttle service (additional charge)\"]',0,'[{\"question\":\"Which are the quickest means of transport for Round Hill Hotel and Villas from the airport?\",\"answer\":\"If you want to access Round Hill Hotel and Villas from the airport using the quickest way possible, consider taking a taxi. This way, you will spend around 17 minutes reaching the hotel, and you can equally rent a car from one of the car rentals outside the terminals. Shuttle buses are also available outside the airport terminal, and it will take around 16 minutes, depending on the traffic and stops the bus will make.\"},{\"question\":\"What type of rooms are there at Round Hill Hotel and Villas?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel has two to six-bedroom villas where you can enjoy staying with your family in case you are with them. The rooms have outdoor spaces of decks that your family can enjoy. Private lawns and pools are also part of the amenities that your family can enjoy. The rooms also have a private kitchen in case you need to cook for yourself, and if you need a personal cook, they are also available for you. You also have access to an outdoor and indoor living area with billiard tables and nooks where you have fantastic sea views.\"},{\"question\":\"Are there family activities in Round Hill Hotel and Villas?\",\"answer\":\"If you are visiting the hotel with your family, there are many activities that you can enjoy. One is non-motorized water sports, including Hobie cats, sea kayaks, and pedal boats. Other sporting activities like Tennis can be done on the five all-weather courts. If you have children, there is a pineapple kid\'s club with a supervised program for children of all ages. They can do various activities in the first two rooms, which have craft tables in the central area. Children aged seven years and above can play video games and football in the rear room.\"},{\"question\":\"Why should I stay at Round Hill Hotel and Villas?\",\"answer\":\"At Round Hill Hotel and Villas, you will have a first-hand experience of the golden sandy beach and a beautiful pool that overlooks Montego Bay. The proximity to the airport is also an added advantage. The ocean view rooms and the surrounding pristine natural beaches will also give you a mind-blowing experience. You will enjoy traditional Caribbean meals made with on-site ingredients compared to other hotels. The hotel also has a spa where kids and parents can get services such as mini-massage, manicures, and facials. The indoor wood-fired grill is another unique feature to enjoy on the restaurant\'s rooftop.\"},{\"question\":\"Are there luxury rooms at Round Hill Hotel and Villas?\",\"answer\":\"In case you need more privacy, some rooms have private bathrooms facing the pool. Many celebrities like John F Kennedy and his wife have visited our hotel villas for their honeymoon. For example, our four-bedroom villa number 17 was used by Sir Paul McCartney. The two bedrooms downstairs have private baths and special features like portholes that look into the pool. The bedroom villa has two pools, and you can enjoy fantastic sea views.\\n \"},{\"question\":\"Where is Round Hill Hotel And Villas located?\",\"answer\":\"Round Hill Hotel And Villas is located at John Pringle Drive, PO Box 64, 6.1 miles from the center of Montego Bay. Montego Bay Cruise Port is the closest landmark to Round Hill Hotel And Villas.\"},{\"question\":\"When is check-in time and check-out time at Round Hill Hotel And Villas?\",\"answer\":\"Check-in time is 4:00 PM and check-out time is 11:00 AM at Round Hill Hotel And Villas.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Round Hill Hotel And Villas offer free Wi-Fi?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Round Hill Hotel And Villas offers free Wi-Fi.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Round Hill Hotel And Villas offer free parking?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Round Hill Hotel And Villas offers free parking.\"},{\"question\":\"How far is Round Hill Hotel And Villas from the airport?\",\"answer\":\"Round Hill Hotel And Villas is 7.1 miles from Montego Bay Sangster Intl. Round Hill Hotel And Villas is 23.5 miles from Negril.\"},{\"question\":\"How does KAYAK find such great Round Hill Hotel And Villas hotel deals?\",\"answer\":\"KAYAK scours the web for all room deals available at Round Hill Hotel And Villas in Montego Bay and lets you compare them to find the best rate for your stay. Many different travel sites will offer discounts or deals at different times for rooms at Round Hill Hotel And Villas and KAYAK will provide you with prices from a huge range of travel sites. That means that you can always find a great deal for Round Hill Hotel And Villas.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Round Hill Hotel And Villas have a pool?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Round Hill Hotel And Villas has a pool onsite.\"}]','{\"score\":9.2,\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":99,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":79},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":9},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":6},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":0},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":3},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":1},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":1}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":9.2,\"reviews\":87}],\"mentions\":[\"friendly staff\",\"reception staff\",\"food in their restaurant\",\"slow service\",\"pool and beach\",\"nothing special\",\"room was clean\",\"great service\",\"staff were excellent\",\"food and drinks\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What can I expect from the rooms at Round Hill Hotel And Villas?\",\"answer\":\"The rooms at Round Hill Hotel And Villas are modern, Ralph Lauren-designed, and furnished with high-end decor and nautical themes. They feature amenities such as rainfall showerheads, 4-poster beds, complimentary high-speed WiFi, iPod speaker docks, coffee making facilities, custom bath products, signature mattresses, spacious bathrooms, and air-conditioning. Some rooms also offer private patios and balconies, separate living room areas, and private pools.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the dining options available at Round Hill Hotel And Villas?\",\"answer\":\"Guests at Round Hill Hotel And Villas can enjoy multiple onsite dining options, including a rooftop grill, a Caribbean restaurant, a seaside buffet, and a cocktail bar. The restaurants offer breakfast, lunch, dinner, and happy hour options.\"},{\"question\":\"What are guests saying about the staff and service at Round Hill Hotel And Villas?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have consistently praised the exceptional service at Round Hill Hotel And Villas. They have also highlighted the friendly staff, excellent amenities, and facilities.\"},{\"question\":\"What activities and amenities are available for guests at Round Hill Hotel And Villas?\",\"answer\":\"Round Hill Hotel And Villas offers a wide range of activities and amenities, including a day spa with therapeutic beauty services, a 24/7 fitness center with yoga classes, outdoor swimming pool with a large sundeck and hot tub, water sports, snorkeling, diving, tennis courts, and a kids’ club.\"},{\"question\":\"When is the best time to visit Round Hill Hotel And Villas?\",\"answer\":\"The high season at Round Hill Hotel And Villas is in December, while the low season is in July. Guests can plan their visit accordingly to enjoy the best of the hotel and its surroundings.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Villa\",\"text\":\"Consider booking a villa for a more luxurious experience, as some guests found the villas to offer spectacular views and exceptional amenities.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Local Cuisine\",\"text\":\"While the onsite dining options are praised, some guests suggested adding more local food selections to the menus, so consider exploring nearby restaurants for an authentic taste of Jamaican cuisine.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of Spa Services\",\"text\":\"Guests highly recommend indulging in the therapeutic beauty services at the day spa, including facials, massages, and steam treatments for a truly lavish experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Enjoy Water Sports and Activities\",\"text\":\"Make the most of the variety of water sports, snorkeling, diving, and tennis courts available, as these activities were highlighted as enjoyable by previous guests.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Room with Balcony\",\"text\":\"If you enjoy outdoor space, consider opting for a room with a private balcony or patio to relax and enjoy the serene surroundings, as mentioned by some guests.\"},{\"title\":\"Family-Friendly Amenities\",\"text\":\"Families traveling with children can take advantage of the kid-friendly accommodations, child pool, and babysitting services, ensuring a comfortable and enjoyable stay for all.\"},{\"title\":\"Check Out Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"Explore nearby attractions such as the Tryall Golf Club, Rocklands Bird Sanctuary, and AquaSol Theme Park, which are within a few miles of the hotel, offering additional entertainment options.\"},{\"title\":\"Attend Yoga Classes\",\"text\":\"If you\'re a fan of yoga, consider participating in the yoga classes offered at the 24/7 fitness center, as mentioned by previous guests as a positive experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Request Local Food Options\",\"text\":\"If you have a preference for local cuisine, consider requesting more Jamaican food options, as some guests expressed a desire for a wider selection of local dishes.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan for Longer Stay\",\"text\":\"Several guests expressed a desire to stay longer due to the exceptional experience, so consider planning a more extended visit to fully enjoy the beautiful setting and excellent amenities.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:14:45\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(82,14,'Big Apple Hotel','big-apple-hotel','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_0a82994d468776df213ee5cfd3f544bc.jpg','This hotel features an outdoor pool, a restaurant, and 2 bars\\/lounges. Free WiFi in public areas, free self parking, and a free manager\'s reception are also provided. Other amenities include a snack bar\\/deli, coffee\\/tea in a common area, and a microwave in a common area. \\nChange of towels is available on request. \\nBig Apple Hotel offers 30 accommodations. Guests can surf the web using the complimentary wireless Internet access (speed: 250+ Mbps (good for 3–5 people or up to 10 devices)). Bathrooms include showers. Change of towels and change of bedsheets can be requested. Housekeeping is provided daily. \\nRecreational amenities at the hotel include an outdoor pool.','18 Queens Drive','+1 876 952 7240',65,2,56,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_