sitors can plan their trip accordingly to make the most of their stay.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room Away from the Pool Area\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned that rooms near the pool area can be noisy, especially during the day, so consider requesting a room away from this area for a quieter stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Bringing Your Own Toiletries\",\"text\":\"A few guests noted that the provided toiletries were limited, so if you have specific preferences, it might be helpful to bring your own.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel is within walking distance of several attractions, such as the Children\'s Museum and Morazan Park, making it convenient for sightseeing.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Room Upgrades\",\"text\":\"Some guests reported that certain rooms felt outdated, so it may be worth inquiring about any available room upgrades for a more modern accommodation.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of the Surrounding Area\",\"text\":\"While the hotel itself is well-maintained, a few guests mentioned that the immediate vicinity may not be the most inviting, so it\'s advisable to exercise caution when venturing outside, especially at night.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Gym Facilities\",\"text\":\"Several guests praised the hotel\'s fitness center, highlighting its excellent equipment and cleanliness, making it a great option for those who prioritize their workout routine.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Transportation Options\",\"text\":\"While the hotel offers a shuttle service and private parking, some guests found the location not easily walkable to good restaurants, so it might be beneficial to plan for transportation or dining options in advance.\"},{\"title\":\"Request a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the fountain comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Inquire About Breakfast Options\",\"text\":\"While many guests enjoyed the breakfast buffet, some mentioned limited variety for American-style food, so it could be helpful to check the available options beforehand.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Aware of Pool Area Conditions\",\"text\":\"A few guests noted that the pool area felt cold and the pool itself was icy, so if you plan to use these facilities, it\'s advisable to be prepared for the water temperature.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:16:26\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(93,15,'Sheraton San Jose Hotel, Costa Rica','sheraton-san-jose-hotel-costa-rica','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_2603f98103f58d68891eac189aac7666.jpg','Located in Escazú, Sheraton San José Costa Rica Hotel offers a sophisticated lodging experience that blends contemporary elegance with world-class service. Its 170 soundproofed rooms feature panoramic views, Sheraton Sweet Sleeper beds, complimentary Wi-Fi, and 50” IPTV smart TVs—ensuring a comfortable and connected stay. Enjoy our pool daily from 11:00 a.m. to 6:00 p.m; our fitness center and steam room are available 24 hours a day, 7 days a week. Additional conveniences like complimentary parking, pet-friendly accommodations, and EV charging stations cater to every need. Our flexible event spaces are perfect for social or corporate functions, all supported by modern technology and a professional team. For added exclusivity, the Sheraton Club Lounge offers private breakfast, all-day refreshments, evening happy hour, and a quiet meeting space. Whether for business or leisure, Sheraton San José delivers comfort, convenience, and exceptional hospitality.','Route 27 350 Metros Oeste Multiplaza','+506 4055 0505',92,4,1773,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_2603f98103f58d68891eac189aac7666.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_476315fa4656f6dc6e92fb805fb5c537.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_8b2b185f26096cf1e73c18316f91cd37.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_e8d8c398ca56cedc141ee112c0554c0c.jpg\",\"http:/