 with a balcony facing the fountain comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Club Room Benefits\",\"text\":\"Guests who stayed in the club rooms enjoyed evening snacks and excellent breakfast in the club lounge, with very friendly staff. However, some guests mentioned being overcharged for items in the downstairs restaurant, so it\'s advisable to double-check bills.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"Some guests reported loud music blaring from 9 pm to 2 am, affecting their sleep. It\'s advisable to inquire about potential noise disturbances and request a quieter room if needed.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Dress Code\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s sit-down dinner restaurant has a dress code that prohibits shorts and sandals, which may not align with the casual attire typically worn in Costa Rica. Guests should be aware of this policy when planning their dining experiences.\"},{\"title\":\"Verify Room Amenities\",\"text\":\"While many guests praised the comfortable beds and spacious rooms, a few mentioned missing shower heads and encountering dated bathrooms. It\'s recommended to verify the availability of all expected amenities upon check-in.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Transportation\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers free parking and an airport shuttle, which can be convenient for guests. However, a few guests noted the absence of a free airport shuttle, so it\'s advisable to confirm transportation options in advance.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel is located within a reasonable distance from various attractions, including Parque Metropolitano La Sabana and Museo de Arte Costarricense. Guests interested in exploring the area may find these attractions worth visiting.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Aware of Noise Disturbances\",\"text\":\"Some guests reported noise issues, including blaring music and unaddressed complaints about noise disturbances. It\'s advisable to inquire about the hotel\'s measures to mitigate noise disruptions.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Cleanliness Concerns\",\"text\":\"While many guests praised the cleanliness and comfort of the hotel, some mentioned cleanliness issues in specific areas, such as the gym, pool, and bathrooms. Guests may want to verify the cleanliness of facilities upon arrival.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Dining Options\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers various dining options, including a restaurant, bar/lounge, and food delivery to guest accommodations. However, guests should be aware of potential limitations, such as crowded restaurants and limited menu options for specific dietary preferences.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:16:34\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(94,15,'Apartotel & Suites Villas del Rio','apartotel-suites-villas-del-rio','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_9e877f8f2b9d13bdfbbd5fd00f194dae.jpg','2 outdoor pools, a 24-hour fitness center, and a rooftop terrace are available at this smoke-free aparthotel. Free continental breakfast, free WiFi in public areas, and free self parking are also provided. Other amenities include a 24-hour business center, a conference center, and coffee\\/tea in a common area. \\nEach apartment provides free WiFi and free wired Internet, a Smart TV with digital channels, and a kitchen with a refrigerator, a microwave, and a dishwasher. Comforts include a pillowtop bed and premium bedding, and guests will also find conveniences like a dining area and a sitting area. \\nApartotel & Suites Villas del Rio offers 64 accommodations with safes and coffee\\/tea makers. Accommodations offer separate sitting areas. Pillowtop beds feature down comforters and premium bedding. Smart televisions come with premium digital channels. Accommodations at this 3.5-star aparthotel have kitchens with full-sized refrigerators\\/freezers, microwaves, separate dining areas, and cookware\\/dishes\\/utensils. Bathrooms include shower\\/tub combinations, bidets, complimentary toiletries, and hair dryers. Guests can surf the web usin