 Safety\",\"text\":\"While the hotel is centrally located, some guests mentioned that the neighborhood may not be the safest at night, so it\'s advisable to be cautious when venturing out after dark.\"},{\"title\":\"Appreciate the Unique Room Features\",\"text\":\"Each room has its own unique characteristics, from balconies to historical flair, so consider exploring the different room options to find one that suits your preferences.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Updated Room Options\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned that the hotel has updated many rooms, providing a cozier experience, so it may be worth inquiring about these updated accommodations.\"},{\"title\":\"Utilize the Helpful Staff\",\"text\":\"Guests consistently praised the friendly and helpful staff, from arranging taxis to providing local recommendations, making the overall stay more enjoyable.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan for Self Check-in\",\"text\":\"If arriving late, take advantage of the hotel\'s self-check-in option for a convenient and hassle-free arrival process.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:17:11\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(99,15,'Hotel Milan Costa Rica','hotel-milan-costa-rica','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_b9adab73a14abd6d75c05e68aa22560d.jpg','A restaurant, a bar\\/lounge, and a coffee shop\\/cafe are available at this smoke-free hotel. Free breakfast (local cuisine) and free WiFi in public areas are also provided. Other amenities include concierge services, a 24-hour front desk, and tour\\/ticket assistance. \\nHotel Milan Costa Rica offers 32 accommodations, which are accessible via exterior corridors and feature minibars and laptop-compatible safes. Plasma televisions are featured in guestrooms. Bathrooms include showers and complimentary toiletries. This San José hotel provides complimentary wireless Internet access. Housekeeping is offered daily and hypo-allergenic bedding can be requested.','Calle 20 Con Avenida 7, Esquina','+506 2221 0925',35,4,2781,'[\"http://travelvn.test/