,\"count\":716},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":303},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":287},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":127},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":208}],\"summary\":\"Guests overwhelmingly praised the hotel\'s breakfast, describing it as exceptional, varied, and delicious. The location was also highlighted as a major advantage, with many guests appreciating its central and convenient setting. Cleanliness received positive remarks, with rooms and common areas noted as well maintained. While there were some negative comments about room noise, old beds, and issues with the pool and parking, the overall sentiment was highly favorable, especially regarding breakfast, location, and cleanliness.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Breakfast\",\"score\":10},{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":9.5},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":8.5}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.7,\"reviews\":2029},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":9.1,\"reviews\":38},{\"name\":\"Priceline\",\"score\":8.6,\"reviews\":28},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":8.4,\"reviews\":5}],\"mentions\":[\"breakfast buffet\",\"staff was very friendly\",\"nice hotel\",\"swimming pool\",\"good location\",\"front desk\",\"lobby\",\"excellent facilities\",\"great view\",\"comfortable rooms\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What are the dining options at RIU Plaza Panama?\",\"answer\":\"RIU Plaza Panama offers a variety of dining options including Tastes, Sushi Lounge, a restaurant, bar/lounge, coffee shop, and a snack bar. Guests can enjoy a superb breakfast buffet and a wide selection of dining options in close proximity to the property.\"},{\"question\":\"Are the beds comfortable at RIU Plaza Panama?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have praised the spacious and clean rooms at RIU Plaza Panama, with some mentioning that the beds were comfortable. However, a few guests noted that the beds were a bit hard/firm.\"},{\"question\":\"Is parking available at RIU Plaza Panama?\",\"answer\":\"RIU Plaza Panama offers valet parking and private parking. However, some guests have expressed dissatisfaction with the service of parking, mentioning it as disrespectful and awful.\"},{\"question\":\"What can I expect from the breakfast at RIU Plaza Panama?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have described the breakfast at RIU Plaza Panama as extraordinary, with an unbelievable choice of Latin American and European food. The breakfast buffet is highly praised for its extensive selection and taste.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the nearby attractions to RIU Plaza Panama?\",\"answer\":\"RIU Plaza Panama is conveniently located close to various attractions including Veneto Casino, Fiesta Casino, Multiplaza Pacific, Avenida Balboa, and the Museum of Natural Science, offering guests a range of nearby entertainment and leisure options.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the fountain comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Breakfast Buffet\",\"text\":\"The breakfast buffet received numerous positive comments for its variety and quality. Guests particularly enjoyed the fruit bar and the extensive selection of items.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Room Selection Carefully\",\"text\":\"Some guests reported issues with room facilities such as refrigerators and in-room safes. It\'s advisable to check the functionality of these amenities upon arrival and report any issues to the staff promptly.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Dining Options\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s location offers easy access to a variety of dining choices, including fast food restaurants and sit-down dining options. Frank’s, Concolon, and a French restaurant are within a 5-10 minute walk.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan Early Breakfasts\",\"text\":\"If you have early morning excursions or tours, note that the hotel breakfast opens at 6:30 AM, which may not align with some tour pick-up times. Consider this when planning your activities.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Pool Crowds\",\"text\":\"The pool area can get crowded, especially during peak times, due to the hotel\'s capacity. Consider visiting the pool during off-peak hours for a more relaxed experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Musty Odors\",\"text\":\"Some guests reported musty smells in certain rooms. It\'s advisable to check the room for any odors upon arrival and request a room change if necessary.\"},{\"title\":\"Request a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the views from higher floors, especially those with ocean views. Consider requesting a room on a higher floor for a better vantage point.\"},{\"title\":\"Verify Functionality of In-Room Amenities\",\"text\":\"Some guests encountered issues with the air conditioning, refrigerators, and bathroom facilities. It\'s recommended to ensure the proper functioning of these amenities upon check-in.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Alternative Parking Options\",\"text\":\"Some guests had negative experiences with the hotel\'s parking service. If self-parking is preferred, it\'s advisable to inquire about the availability of this option.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:18:12\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(107,16,'Principe Hotel and suites','principe-hotel-and-suites','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_6cefe7b5972403a8a56162d80d1048b1.jpg','Along with an outdoor pool, this smoke-free hotel has a restaurant and a bar\\/lounge. Free WiFi in public areas and free self parking are also provided. Other amenities include a coffee shop\\/cafe, a business center, and concierge services. \\nPrincipe Hotel and Suites offers 105 air-conditioned accommodations with safes and hair dryers. Pillowtop beds feature down comforters and premium bedding. Flat-screen televisions come with premium cable channels and first-run movies. Bathrooms include showers with rainfall showerheads, and bidets. This Panama City hotel provides complimentary wired and wireless Internet acc