{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8,\"reviews\":979},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":8.3,\"reviews\":35},{\"name\":\"Priceline\",\"score\":8.4,\"reviews\":41},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":8.1,\"reviews\":1}],\"mentions\":[\"view of the canal\",\"swimming pool\",\"reception staff\",\"nice location\",\"right by the canal\",\"breakfast was good\",\"nice room\",\"hotel was very clean\",\"ships entering\",\"tgi friday\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What are the hotel\'s unique offerings?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel provides traditional 4-star accommodation with a spa and wellness center, outdoor pool, Jacuzzi, and free Wi-Fi. It also has an in-house restaurant, T.G.I., and offers room service at certain times. Additionally, it offers a sauna, outdoor tennis courts, and a unique location with a view of the Pacific entrance of the Panama Canal.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the hotel known for its cleanliness and customer service?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, guests have mentioned that the hotel is clean and tidy, and the staff are described as friendly, helpful, and responsive to all requests.\"},{\"question\":\"What can guests expect from the hotel\'s food quality?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have mentioned that the breakfast buffet is great, with a good selection of food. However, some have expressed that the breakfast could be improved with a full continental breakfast and more options.\"},{\"question\":\"Are the beds comfortable?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers spacious rooms with comfortable beds, and guests have specifically mentioned that the business class suite has nice business rooms with everything needed, including comfortable beds.\"},{\"question\":\"When is the best time to visit the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The high season is in February, and the low season is in May. Visitors can expect higher quality and service all around, with excellent transport services available with newer cars.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Book a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the Panama Canal or the Bridge of the Americas comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Low Season Travel\",\"text\":\"May is considered the low season, which could be a great time to visit for those looking to avoid crowds and potentially find better deals.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s proximity to attractions like the Biomuseo and the Amador Causeway makes it an ideal base for exploring these nearby points of interest.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Room Renovations\",\"text\":\"Some guests noted that certain parts of the hotel are in the process of being renovated. It might be worth inquiring about this when booking to ensure a modern room.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Spa and Wellness Center\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the spa, sauna, and outdoor pool facilities. Consider indulging in these amenities for a relaxing experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Transportation Options\",\"text\":\"While the hotel offers an airport shuttle service, guests mentioned that it might be slightly harder to get Uber or taxi services due to the distance. Planning transportation in advance could be beneficial.\"},{\"title\":\"Try the On-Site Restaurant\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s in-house restaurant, T.G.I., received positive feedback for its meals. Consider dining here or taking advantage of the room service offered at certain times.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of High Season\",\"text\":\"February is considered the high season, so if you prefer a livelier atmosphere and are willing to navigate larger crowds, this could be the ideal time to visit.\"},{\"title\":\"Inquire About Breakfast Inclusions\",\"text\":\"Some guests found the breakfast to be of great value, while others felt it was lacking. It might be worth checking the breakfast options and prices before booking.\"},{\"title\":\"Accessibility Considerations\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers increased accessibility features, including elevator access and rooms prepared for people with disabilities. If you have specific accessibility needs, it\'s advisable to inquire about these features when booking.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:19:02\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(113,16,'Hotel Coral Suites','hotel-coral-suites','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_0f6585640e2a45ca919732ee6758d72e.jpg','The Coral Suite is a modern hotel with 62 suites located in the heart of the city of Panama.\\nHotel Coral Suites is located in Panama. Its location on the center of the city is favorable because of its proximity to supermarkets, pharmacies, shopping centers, banks and public transport.The building has 24 hour security and the front desk staff offers information about places and activities of interest in Panama. The property offers daily housekeeping and provides toiletries.The property features a rooftop pool, fitness center and laundry room. For those who wish, Coral Suites also provides laundry and dry cleaning services.Coral Suites also has very good reputation for the best value in Panama City. Customers get more out of their money compared to other accommodations in the same city.','Calle D Zona 9','+507 269 2727',53,4,1662,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_0f6585640e2a45ca919732ee6758d72e.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_f5acd6e9725820c2c5c5184c86d0196a.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_1c95fc377499c7b0080ae2b6b231c926.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_77847ee18524e51ecb92d2ea40195ae8.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_cb50736574d5759268f0f4ae1010c40b.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_213389ad3c1fc1097edf130e23f6e334.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_4b8b31163446210e0d543d22e734ed7d.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_4d7eb7f686f1a794a01cc71b4d423ccb.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_56f4059040c0a7e350b2c5e9e1b5a2d9.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.t