aises about the hotel\'s staff?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have consistently praised the staff for being friendly, helpful, and going above and beyond to provide excellent service.\"},{\"question\":\"Is there anything to be aware of regarding the hotel\'s cleanliness?\",\"answer\":\"While many guests found the hotel to be very clean, a few mentioned concerns about specific areas needing more lighting and occasional odors in certain rooms.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the fountain comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Low Season Travel\",\"text\":\"If you prefer to avoid crowds, consider visiting in April, which is considered the low season. This could provide a more relaxed experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s central location makes it convenient for exploring nearby attractions such as Veneto Casino, Fiesta Casino, Avenida Balboa, and the Museum of Natural Science, all within a short distance.\"},{\"title\":\"Request Vegetarian Breakfast Options\",\"text\":\"Vegetarian guests may want to request clearer signage or more options at breakfast to cater to their dietary preferences.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Ongoing Renovations\",\"text\":\"Some guests noted ongoing renovations in close-by rooms. It may be worth checking with the hotel about the status of these renovations before booking.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned noise from a mobile generator unit across the street. If sensitive to noise, it may be helpful to request a room away from potential sources of disturbance.\"},{\"title\":\"Inquire About Room Facilities\",\"text\":\"Some guests found that certain amenities, such as a hairdryer, were not initially available in the room but were provided upon request. It could be useful to check with the front desk for any missing items.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Business or Leisure\",\"text\":\"The hotel is well-equipped for business needs, with conference rooms and a business center, making it suitable for business travelers. However, it also offers a comfortable stay for vacationers, with a nice gym and pool area.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan for Elevator Maintenance\",\"text\":\"Guests experienced issues with the elevator during their stay. It may be wise to check with the hotel about any ongoing maintenance to avoid inconvenience.\"},{\"title\":\"Engage with the Staff\",\"text\":\"Many guests praised the friendly and helpful staff. Engaging with them for local recommendations or any concerns could enhance the overall experience.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:19:14\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(115,16,'Megapolis Hotel Panama','megapolis-hotel-panama','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_410a86b77a3bf64a6883e5031ce91a28.jpg','Let yourself be carried away by an unparalleled experience at the facilities of the most incredible hotel in Latin America and discover a luxury service inspired to make you feel like a true star. Strategically located in a central point of the great city of Panama, with immediate access to Megapolis Outlets Mall, casino, and the Megapolis Convention Center. Just 20 minutes away from the Tocumen International Airport, 8 minutes from the Old Town and 5 minutes from the City\'s Financial District.Characterized by imposing architecture, stunning views, infinity pool, the best entertainment, and luxury restaurants framed in an exclusive gastronomic offer for your palate, Megapolis Hotel Panama is your ideal destination.','Avenida Balboa','+507 201 8090',85,4,3760,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_410a86b77a3bf64a6883e5031ce91a28.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d13535e0617c3fd48ca75eedab24fc36.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_8b07ebad3d776d80a2e81d773ae7dcff.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_db88f170b9ab85f9fabbb