sts mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the ocean or city skyline comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Upgrading to a Premium Suite\",\"text\":\"Guests highlighted that the premium suites offer upgraded features such as multiple bathrooms, balconies, and ocean-side views, providing an enhanced and luxurious experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Landmarks\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s proximity to major landmarks and shopping centers makes it convenient for guests to explore the city. Consider planning visits to the nearby Multiplaza Pacific Mall and the Multicentro Mall for shopping and entertainment.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Dining Options\",\"text\":\"With four different restaurants to choose from, guests can enjoy a variety of cuisines. Consider trying the Japanese-inspired fare at Soy Restaurant or the continental menu at Baazar.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Special Wellness Packages\",\"text\":\"The hotel provides spa and wellness packages for guests, offering an opportunity for relaxation and rejuvenation during your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Family-Friendly Amenities\",\"text\":\"For families traveling with children, the hotel offers an indoor play area, kid-friendly buffet, and babysitting services, providing convenience and entertainment for both parents and kids.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan Your Visit According to Seasonality\",\"text\":\"Consider visiting during the low season in October for potentially fewer crowds and more favorable rates.\"},{\"title\":\"Utilize the Business Facilities\",\"text\":\"If you\'re traveling for work, take advantage of the hotel\'s business center, conference rooms, and other business facilities to meet your professional needs.\"},{\"title\":\"Inquire About Airport Shuttle Service\",\"text\":\"Guests have appreciated the convenience of the airport shuttle service provided by the hotel. Inquire about this service to streamline your travel arrangements.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Service Feedback\",\"text\":\"While many guests praised the friendly and helpful staff, some mentioned slow service and areas for improvement. Keep this in mind and manage expectations accordingly.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:19:27\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(116,16,'Hotel Dann Carlton Marinn Place Panama Financial District','hotel-dann-carlton-marinn-place-panama-financial-district','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_a9b83bb4440d71bbb07ef41661fa3050.jpg','Strategically located in the Financial Zones distinguished Banking District, you will find Dann Carlton Hotel Panama. Convenient proximity to shopping malls and the Atlapa Convention Center make our hotel perfect for the business traveler. Our contemporary hotel guestrooms in Panama City, Panama, make you feel better than home. Experience Dann Carlton hotel Panama comforts with roomy high-floor options, amenities with sofa-sleeper and a host of high-tech features. Take a tour over our website and find out more reasons why we are the right place to stay in PanamaInformamos a nuestros huspedes que algunas reas comunes del hotel se encuentran actualmente en proceso de mantenimiento preventivo, el cual se realiza con el objetivo de garantizar la seguridad, el confort y la calidad de nuestro servicio.Estos trabajos han sido programados para minimizar cualquier inconveniente y no afectar la experiencia de nuestros huspedes. Agradecemos su comprensin y quedamos a su disposicin para cualquier consulta.','Avenida Aquilino De La Guardia Entre Via Espana Y Calle 52','+507 6669 8291',59,4,6632,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_a9b83bb4440d71bbb07ef41661fa3050.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_12ab0536cc3dc4d9aafa3674215c83b9.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_68034cd02819e2c5cc56afef681ec907.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_6302507d478907f07d5ba7f5fd4f02a5.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_bf878e09cd7a0404959d2e