, such as Veneto Casino, Avenida Balboa, and the Museum of Natural Science, making it convenient for sightseeing and entertainment.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Transportation Options\",\"text\":\"While the hotel offers a shuttle service and valet parking, some guests noted that the distance from the airport can result in a 25-minute ride, so plan accordingly, especially for layovers.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Room Refurbishments\",\"text\":\"The hotel has recently refurbished its 165 rooms, ensuring a modern and comfortable stay. However, some guests mentioned the need for better maintenance in certain areas, so it\'s advisable to inquire about the room\'s condition before booking.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Rooftop Pool\",\"text\":\"Although some guests found the pool small, it offers a splendid view from the rooftop, providing a relaxing spot to unwind after a day of exploring the city.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Breakfast Timing\",\"text\":\"If you\'re an early riser, note that the lobby bar/café area is closed until noon, so plan accordingly for your morning coffee or breakfast needs.\"},{\"title\":\"Request Late Check-Out\",\"text\":\"Several guests appreciated the flexibility of a late check-out, which was provided for free in some cases, allowing for a more relaxed departure.\"},{\"title\":\"Inquire About Special Services\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers services such as booking tours, transportation to the airport, and assistance with sightseeing itineraries, so don\'t hesitate to inquire about these conveniences during your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"Despite being in the financial district, guests found the hotel exceptionally quiet, providing a peaceful environment for relaxation.\"},{\"title\":\"Manage Expectations for Breakfast\",\"text\":\"While the breakfast offers a good amount of options, some guests noted the need for improvement in terms of food quality and organization, so it\'s advisable to manage expectation