 attractions.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Aware of Maintenance Issues\",\"text\":\"Guests reported various maintenance issues such as a leaking faucet, lack of A/C control, and overall run-down appearance of the building. It\'s advisable to inquire about the current state of maintenance.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider the Pool Area\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the clean pool and the city view from the pool area. If you enjoy spending time by the pool, this could be a highlight of your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Language Consideration\",\"text\":\"While some guests noted that the reception staff did not speak English, others found the staff to be friendly and accommodating. It\'s helpful to set language expectations accordingly.\"},{\"title\":\"Evaluate Value for Money\",\"text\":\"Some guests felt that the hotel offered good value for the price, considering its location and cleanliness, while others expressed disappointment and suggested that the hotel needs renovation. Consider your own priorities and expectations when assessing the value.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:19:44\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(118,16,'TRYP by Wyndham Panama Centro','tryp-by-wyndham-panama-centro','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_5d70a7375c107c0d2939e61075f85d67.jpg','The Tryp by Wyndham Panama Centro is located in a residential neighborhood of Panama City, the surroundings offer a great selection of restaurants, stores, banks and offices within walking distance. Our spacious rooms and suites combining luxury and comfort including marble floors, complimentary WIFI and high speed internet, and sound proof windows for a great night sleep and exquisite decor that makes you feel like your home away from home. Our rooms includes a broad choice cable TV, minibar. The hotel offers parking, accessible rooms, and a state of the art fitness facility. We feature 90 rooms equipped with the best technology. You will find a world-class business center and a large collection of meeting rooms that can acc