hotel is located in the most beautiful area of Paris and is close to all amenities, including tube and train stations, shops, coffee shops, restaurants, and sights to visit.\"},{\"question\":\"How are the hotel\'s beds?\",\"answer\":\"Guests loved the beds at the hotel, describing them as comfortable and clean.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the dining options like at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The breakfast buffet is good, including scrambled eggs, poached eggs, and bacon. The hotel also has a bar/lounge and offers food delivery to guest accommodation.\"},{\"question\":\"Is parking available at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers parking and shuttle services for an additional charge, and there are parking options in the area for a reasonable fee.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the staff like at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The staff is described as friendly, helpful, and accommodating, with specific mentions of staff members who went above and beyond to ensure guest satisfaction.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Superior Room\",\"text\":\"Some guests recommended requesting a superior room as standard rooms were described as small.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Direct Booking for Wheelchair Access\",\"text\":\"If you require wheelchair access, consider booking directly with the hotel to ensure accommodation and avoid any confusion during check-in.\"},{\"title\":\"Bring Your Own Tea\",\"text\":\"If you prefer tea over coffee, consider bringing your own tea bags as some rooms only provide a coffee machine.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Room Upgrades\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated room upgrades and found the staff accommodating in this regard.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Noise\",\"text\":\"If you are sensitive to noise, consider that the hotel is above a metro line, and vibrations from the trains can be felt on the ground floor.\"},{\"title\":\"Verify Inclusions\",\"text\":\"Double-check the inclusions to avoid unexpected charges, as some guests were charged for items they believed were complimentary.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Breakfast Options\",\"text\":\"While the hotel offers breakfast, some guests suggested exploring nearby food options for a more satisfying meal.\"},{\"title\":\"Request Early Check-In\",\"text\":\"If you need early check-in, it\'s advisable to request this in advance, as the hotel may charge for early check-in.\"},{\"title\":\"Bring Non-Slip Mats\",\"text\":\"For those requiring accessibility features, consider bringing your own non-slip mats for the wet room, as some guests found the floor slippery.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Bathroom Upgrades\",\"text\":\"Some guests noted the need for bathroom upgrades, so it\'s worth checking the room condition upon arrival.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:22:19\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(135,17,'Pullman Paris Tour Eiffel','pullman-paris-tour-eiffel','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_5278d0a23834a5fd569ef389564bed6a.jpg','Ideally located at the foot of the Eiffel Tower and near Trocadero, Pullman Paris Tour Eiffel invites you to experience an unforgettable stay in the heart of the capital. The hotel has 430 rooms and suites, decorated in a modern and bright style. Some rooms offer a breathtaking view of the Eiffel Tower or the gardens. All rooms are equipped with a flat-screen TV with free movies and high-speed WIFI.','18 Avenue de Suffren','+33 1 44 38 56 00',79,4,7794,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_5278d0a23834a5fd569ef389564bed6a.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_808e38f5b6c71da903e164b4cbeac9a6.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_44b6032c55778cf8da22dcac1e6156b0.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_9dfa38a970f89300b3187241bd872415.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_9ca659251a6d9629716a954f4a8a54a5.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_73616a0e21c2ee1a1911a7716a7b1092.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_6c1f76012912e67a5ec70b1bb3b64983.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_573e3035a9b82314899a87126e54d644.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_9600ab51f3f74b1b42cd6a472cc437ba.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_023da61b64d567b55bd13dc3e5e85ac2.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_bc84862761e4caed34d747cef56a7b79.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_f78e07282a1f17de81ce21427a2fe281.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_ed2557c230a87b057d39b6aec9e9968d.jpg\"]',NULL,'https://www.kayak.com/Paris-Hotels-Pullman-Paris-Tour-Eiffel.72616.ksp','[\"Window\",\"Babysitting or child care\",\"Electric kettle\",\"Business center\",\"Wake-up service\",\"Entire unit wheelchair accessible\",\"Wi-Fi available in all areas\",\"Internet\",\"Daily housekeeping\",\"Extra-long beds (> 2 meters)\",\"Fax/photocopying\",\"Family rooms\",\"Concierge service\",\"Cribs available\",\"Currency exchange on-site\",\"Fire extinguisher\",\"Laundry facilities\",\"Ironing service\",\"Laundry service\",\"Flat-screen TV\",\"Meeting/Banquet facilities\",\"Multi-lingual staff\",\"Fold-up bed\",\"Free toiletries\",\"Garden view\",\"Room service\",\"Smoke alarms\",\"Eco tourism\",\"Heating\",\"Special diet menus (on request)\",\"Tour desk\",\"Hypoallergenic\",\"Inner courtyard view\",\"Interconnected room(s) available\",\"Key access\",\"Key card access\",\"CCTV in common areas\",\"Kids meals\",\"CCTV outside property\",\"No smoking\",\"Kid-friendly buffet\",\"Restaurant\",\"Bar/Lounge\",\"Landmark view\",\"Laptop safe\",\"Express check-out\",\"Hairdryer\",\"Fitness center\",\"Cable or satellite TV\",\"24-hour security\",\"Air-conditioned\",\"Newspapers\",\"Pants press\",\"Food can be delivered to guest accommodation\",\"Parking (surcharge)\",\"Bathrobe\",\"Private bathroom\",\"Garden\",\"24hr front desk\",\"Storage available\",\"Free Wi-Fi\",\"Pets allowed on request. Charges may apply.\",\"Terrace/Patio\",\"Increased accessibility\",\"Linens\",\"Towels\",\"Safety deposit box\",\"Soap and Shampoo Provided\",\"Seating area\",\"Elevator\",\"Shampoo\",\"Shower\",\"Shower cap\",\"Rain showers\",\"Accessible by elevator\",\"Mini-fridge\",\"Accessible parking\",\"Slippers\",\"First-aid kit\",\"Socket near the bed\",\"Sofa\",\"Alarm clock\",\"Sofa bed\",\"Balcony\",\"Soundproof rooms\",\"Bathtub\",\"Soundproofing\",\"Gym\",\"Body soap\",\"Flexible event space\",\"Bottle of water\",\"Breakfast in the room\",\"Locally curated art gallery\",\"Tea/coffee maker\",\"Telephone\",\"Carpeted\",\"Toilet\",\"Toilet paper\",\"Safe\",\"City view\",\"Clothes rack\",\"Trash cans\",\"Coffee machine\",\"TV\",\"Smartphone dock\",\"Upper floors accessible by elevator\",\"Conditioner\",\"Desk\",\"Wardrobe or closet\",\"Drying rack for clothing\"]',0,'[{\"question\":\"What are my options for breakfast while staying at the Pullman Paris Tour Eiffel hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Guests staying at the Pullman Paris Tour Eiffel hotel can enjoy a buffet breakfast that is on offer every morning at the hotel from 6:30 am to 10:00 am. If it’s not included in your room package, breakfast costs 29 € (about $33) per person, and you have the option of eating in your room for an extra 5 € (about $6). If you happen to be there on a Sunday and would like to sleep in, head to the bar of the hotel for the Sunday Brunch instead which sometimes even features a live DJ.\"},{\"question\":\"How do I get from Charles de Gaulle Airport to the Pullman Paris Tour Eiffel hotel using public transport?\",\"answer\":\"If you are looking at using public transport to get to your accommodation, get on board Bus Line 2 which is available from outside Terminal 1 of the airport, heading in the direction of Paris Tour Eiffel. Get off 3 stops later at the Tour Eiffel stop, and the Pullman Paris Tour Eiffel hotel will be a 1m walk away. If your flight lands in a different terminal, take the free CDGVAL train which links all the different terminals of the airport together.\"},{\"question\":\"How much will it cost me to bring my pet to the Pullman Paris Tour Eiffel hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The Pullman Paris Tour Eiffel hotel welcomes does pet dogs to the hotel as long as they are under 29 lb. You can have a maximum of 2 pets per room, and you will be charged an extra fee of 50 € (about $57) per pet for the full stay.\"},{\"question\":\"How can I organize a meeting at the Pullman Paris Tour Eiffel hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Guests wishing to organize a business meeting or event at the Pullman Paris Tour Eiffel hotel will be able to choose one of 25 rooms and event spaces, including some located in the conference center on the 10th floor with a view of the Eiffel Tower. The rooms have varying seating capacities fitting as few as 8 people or as many as 400 people per room. An event manager will be able to help you plan all the details from helping you pick the right space to catering. In addition, the hotel offers a Co-Meeting package which you can book if you need audio-visual equipment such as a projector, a flat screen TV or videoconferencing facilities.\"},{\"question\":\"What check in and check out services are on offer at the Pullman Paris Tour Eiffel hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Make your check in process at the Pullman Paris Tour Eiffel hotel easier by checking in online using the email that will be sent to you prior to your arrival. Fast check out is also available and all you need to do is return your key to the concierge desk. Early check in as of 9:00 am and late check out up to 4:00 pm are also possible when requested in advance for an extra fee of 60 €(about $68) per service.(Prices checked 05/06/19).\"},{\"question\":\"Where is Pullman Paris Tour Eiffel located?\",\"answer\":\"Pullman Paris Tour Eiffel is located at 18 Avenue de Suffren in Tour Eiffel - Champ de Mars, 2.5 miles from the center of Paris. Eiffel Tower is the closest landmark to Pullman Paris Tour Eiffel.\"},{\"question\":\"When is check-in time and check-out time at Pullman Paris Tour Eiffel?\",\"answer\":\"Check-in time is 4:00 PM and check-out time is 11:00 AM at Pullman Paris Tour Eiffel.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Pullman Paris Tour Eiffel offer free Wi-Fi?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Pullman Paris Tour Eiffel offers free Wi-Fi.\"},{\"question\":\"How far is Pullman Paris Tour Eiffel from the airport?\",\"answer\":\"Pullman Paris Tour Eiffel is 9.5 miles from Paris Orly.\"},{\"question\":\"How does KAYAK find such great Pullman Paris Tour Eiffel hotel deals?\",\"answer\":\"KAYAK scours the web for all room deals available at Pullman Paris Tour Eiffel in Paris and lets you compare them to find the best rate for your stay. Many different travel sites will offer discounts or deals at different times for rooms at Pullman Paris Tour Eiffel and KAYAK will provide you with prices from a huge range of travel sites. That means that you can always find a great deal for Pullman Paris Tour Eiffel.\"}]','{\"score\":8.2,\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":7794,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":4095},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":1194},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":850},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":453},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":433},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":247},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":522}],\"summary\":\"Guests overwhelmingly praised the hotel\'s exceptional location and stunning views of the Eiffel Tower, making it a highlight of their stay. However, many expressed dissatisfaction with the service, citing rude or unhelpful staff and slow check-in. Several reviews mentioned small or outdated rooms, and some guests felt the hotel did not offer good value for the price. Cleanliness was positively noted by a few guests.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":10},{\"label\":\"Room Size\",\"score\":2},{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":1.5},{\"label\":\"Value for Price\",\"score\":1.5}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.1,\"reviews\":2764},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":8.6,\"reviews\":226},{\"name\":\"Priceline\",\"score\":8.2,\"reviews\":81},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":8.9,\"reviews\":4}],\"mentions\":[\"eiffel tower\",\"amazing view\",\"location was good\",\"room with a view\",\"room was clean\",\"staff was friendly\",\"near the eiffel\",\"location and view\",\"nice hotel\",\"bed was comfortable\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What are the amenities offered at Pullman Paris Tour Eiffel?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers a modern fitness center, an on-site restaurant with an unparalleled view of the Eiffel Tower, a bar, spacious event space, and Wi-Fi access throughout the property.\"},{\"question\":\"What can guests expect from the rooms at Pullman Paris Tour Eiffel?\",\"answer\":\"Guests can expect modern amenities, including flat-screen TVs, work desks, comfortable furnishings, and pillowtop mattresses. Many rooms also offer balconies with views of the Eiffel Tower or the Seine River.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the best time to visit Pullman Paris Tour Eiffel?\",\"answer\":\"The high season is in July, offering a great opportunity to experience Paris at its liveliest. However, January is the low season, which may appeal to travelers seeking a quieter experience.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the cleanliness at Pullman Paris Tour Eiffel?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have praised the hotel for being clean, quiet, and safe, providing a comfortable and pleasant stay.\"},{\"question\":\"Is parking available at Pullman Paris Tour Eiffel?\",\"answer\":\"Guests can park their rental car overnight at the hotel next door, Mercure, with ease of access and contactless payment on the way out.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Book a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the Eiffel Tower comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"Some guests reported that the rooftop bar played loud music until late at night, affecting their sleep. If you are sensitive to noise, it may be advisable to inquire about the potential for noise disturbances during your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Room Refurbishment\",\"text\":\"A few guests noted that some rooms are in need of refurbishment. It might be beneficial to inquire about the updated status of the rooms or request a recently renovated room.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Location\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s proximity to the Eiffel Tower was praised by many guests. Consider taking advantage of the convenient location for easy access to the iconic landmark and nearby attractions.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Check-in and Check-out Times\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned that the check-in time is at 4:00 PM, which they found to be relatively late. Similarly, the check-out time is at 11:00 AM. It may be helpful to plan your arrival and departure accordingly.\"},{\"title\":\"Inquire About Noise Disturbances\",\"text\":\"A few guests reported experiencing noise disturbances, particularly related to the rooftop bar. If you are sensitive to noise, it may be advisable to inquire about the potential for noise disturbances during your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Engage with the Staff for Special Occasions\",\"text\":\"Guests celebrating special occasions, such as anniversaries, were pleased with the hotel\'s arrangements and the personalized attention from the staff. Consider engaging with the hotel staff for any special arrangements or celebrations during your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Dining Options\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned delays and issues with dining service within the hotel. It might be worthwhile to explore nearby dining options for greater dining flexibility.\"},{\"title\":\"Verify Room Assignments\",\"text\":\"A few guests mentioned discrepancies in the room assignments, such as being assigned a lower floor despite booking a room on a higher floor. It may be beneficial to verify the room assignment upon check-in to ensure it aligns with your reservation.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Accessibility\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers accessibility features, including wheelchair accessibility and multilingual staff. If you have specific accessibility needs, it may be helpful to inquire about the available facilities and services.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:22:28\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(136,17,'Hotel Viator - Gare de Lyon','hotel-viator-gare-de-lyon','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_528834c7f8d0325069e44cb789babb88.jpg','A 24-hour front desk, a computer station, and express check-in are available at this smoke-free hotel. WiFi in public areas is free. Other amenities include express check-out, free newspapers, and a TV in a common area. \\nHotel Viator Paris - Gare de Lyon offers 45 accommodations with safes and complimentary weekday newspapers. Each accommodation is individually furnished and decorated. Pillowtop beds feature premium bedding. 50-cm flat-screen televisions come with digital channels. Guests can surf the web using the complimentary wireless Internet access. Business-friendly amenities include desks and phones. Additionally, rooms include hair dryers and blackout drapes\\/curtains. Housekeeping is offered daily and irons\\/ironing boards can be requested.','1 Rue Parrot','+33 1 43 43 11 00',90,4,3390,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_528834c7f8d0325069e44cb789babb88.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_01227192ee5beb1e51cd4718c2f4d25a.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_222dce437dc1bed018da626e7e177533.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_1fb5b8bb37ef910c4e90f950484329bc.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_673a18015ecf058f19d1969dc9ed8814.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_724baad913156cf2042b902cffea38b8.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_85416399822268f063dc0d8d930e605e.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_f67d061e68ebeeeb572bf170e2afe037.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_1040c7ff892d8ab242f6bdd661c731f9.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_2