 Viator - Gare de Lyon offers free Wi-Fi.\"},{\"question\":\"How far is Hotel Viator - Gare de Lyon from the airport?\",\"answer\":\"Hotel Viator - Gare de Lyon is 8.4 miles from Paris Orly.\"},{\"question\":\"How does KAYAK find such great Hotel Viator - Gare de Lyon hotel deals?\",\"answer\":\"KAYAK scours the web for all room deals available at Hotel Viator - Gare de Lyon in Paris and lets you compare them to find the best rate for your stay. Many different travel sites will offer discounts or deals at different times for rooms at Hotel Viator - Gare de Lyon and KAYAK will provide you with prices from a huge range of travel sites. That means that you can always find a great deal for Hotel Viator - Gare de Lyon.\"}]','{\"score\":8,\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":3390,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":1324},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":1060},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":565},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":171},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":126},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":51},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":93}],\"summary\":\"Most guests praised the hotel\'s excellent location near the train station, making it convenient for travel. The service was frequently described as friendly and helpful. Some reviewers mentioned small room sizes and dated decor, but overall value for price was considered good by many. Cleanliness received mixed feedback, with some positive remarks and some noting areas for improvement. Overall, the hotel is appreciated for its accessibility and welcoming staff.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":10},{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":8.5},{\"label\":\"Value for Price\",\"score\":7},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":5},{\"label\":\"Room Size\",\"score\":3}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8,\"reviews\":834},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":8.9,\"reviews\":8},{\"name\":\"HotelsCombined\",\"score\":8.1,\"reviews\":1}],\"mentions\":[\"location near gare\",\"room was small\",\"de lyon\",\"friendly staff\",\"train station\",\"good hotel\",\"bathroom were very clean\",\"breakfast\",\"bed was comfortable\",\"hotel close\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What can I expect from the hotel\'s location?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel is conveniently located near Gare de Lyon, making it easy to access the train station and various transportation options. Additionally, there are plenty of restaurants, cafes, and shops in the surrounding area.\"},{\"question\":\"How are the hotel\'s rooms and beds?\",\"answer\":\"The rooms are described as clean, comfortable, and soundproofed, with guests highlighting the good quality of the beds. However, a few reviews mentioned small room sizes and uncomfortable beds.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the dining options at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers breakfast in the room, and guests can also have food delivered to their accommodation. However, some guests noted the absence of coffee in the rooms and limited tea options.\"},{\"question\":\"Is parking available at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel provides street parking for guests, offering a convenient option for those traveling by car.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the cleanliness and customer service at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have praised the hotel for being clean and have appreciated the friendly and accommodating staff. However, a few reviews mentioned concerns about the cleanliness of the rooms and the attitude of some staff members.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with a Balcony\",\"text\":\"Some rooms offer a lovely little balcony, providing a pleasant surprise and a place to sit and enjoy the view.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Room Size\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the rooms were small, so if space is a priority, consider this when booking.\"},{\"title\":\"Check the Elevator Size\",\"text\":\"The elevator was noted to be small, so if you have mobility concerns or a lot of luggage, this is something to be aware of.\"},{\"title\":\"Location Convenience\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s proximity to Gare de Lyon and easy access to various transportation options was highlighted as a major advantage.\"},{\"title\":\"Noise Consideration\",\"text\":\"While the hotel is conveniently located, some guests noted that the rooms were quiet, providing a peaceful environment for a good night\'s sleep.\"},{\"title\":\"Bathroom Space\",\"text\":\"A few guests found the bathrooms to be cramped, so if bathroom space is important to you, it\'s worth considering.\"},{\"title\":\"Breakfast Options\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers a delicious breakfast, which was appreciated by several guests, making it a convenient option to start the day.\"},{\"title\":\"Staff Friendliness\",\"text\":\"Many guests praised the friendly and helpful staff, particularly noting their assistance with travel arrangements and accommodating service.\"},{\"title\":\"Accessibility Note\",\"text\":\"The hotel is accessible to many tourist spots and is within walking distance to the train station, making it a convenient choice for travelers.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Value for Money\",\"text\":\"Some guests found the hotel to be a good value for the price, especially considering its location and cleanliness.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:22:36\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(137,17,'Les Jardins Du Marais','les-jardins-du-marais','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_eb0e9f85cc0316b188d111dc8372db96.jpg','A restaurant, a health club, and a bar\\/lounge are available at this hotel. WiFi in public areas is free. Other amenities include a sauna, a rooftop terrace, and self parking. \\nLes Jardins du Marais offers 265 accommodations with safes and complimentary newspapers. Beds feature premium bedding. Plasma televisions come with satellite channels and pay movies. Refrigerators and coffee\\/tea makers are provided. Bathrooms include shower\\/tub combinations with deep soaking bathtubs, slippers, and hair dryers. This Paris hotel provides complimentary wi