,\"count\":211},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":124},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":131},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":51},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":75}],\"summary\":\"Guests frequently highlight the friendly and helpful staff, with many mentioning positive experiences at the reception and with service overall. Breakfast is generally appreciated for its variety and quality, though a few note it could be improved. The hotel offers convenient and secure parking, which is valued by guests. The pool is mentioned often, with mixed opinions: some enjoy it, while others find it too cold or crowded. Location is a common concern, as the hotel is far from city attractions and public transport, making it less ideal for those without a car.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":9},{\"label\":\"Breakfast\",\"score\":8},{\"label\":\"Parking\",\"score\":7.5},{\"label\":\"Pool\",\"score\":5},{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":3}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8,\"reviews\":201},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":7.3,\"reviews\":7}],\"mentions\":[\"breakfast was good\",\"staff were helpful\",\"front desk\",\"nice rooms\",\"everything was good\",\"colosseum spanish\",\"lovely hotel\",\"plesant\",\"serge\",\"shortcomings\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What can I expect from the hotel\'s dining options?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers a variety of dining options including a restaurant, bar/lounge, and the option to have food delivered to your accommodation. Additionally, special diet menus are available upon request.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the hotel\'s unique amenities?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel provides a fitness center, outdoor pool, and recreational activities such as table tennis and pool table. Additionally, there are facilities for children including babysitting services, cribs, kids meals, and a playground.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the hotel\'s cleanliness maintained?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel follows enhanced cleaning protocols and disinfects high-touch surfaces. Additionally, the property is cleaned by professional cleaning companies, and guests have the option to opt-out of accommodation cleaning.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the parking options at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers free parking and has an airport shuttle service available.\"},{\"question\":\"When is the best time to visit the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The high season at the hotel is in September, and the low season is in January. It\'s important to note that the hotel is situated quite far from the main city area, so planning your days early and being prepared to spend on taxi is advisable.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Consider Room Location\",\"text\":\"Some guests recommended requesting a room away from the train tracks to minimize noise disturbances.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan for Transportation\",\"text\":\"Be prepared to spend on taxi services as the hotel is situated quite far from the main city area and the last train back to the accommodation is very early.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Special Amenities\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers little gifts to children at reception, which can be a delightful surprise for families.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Location\",\"text\":\"The hotel is in a remote location with no nearby restaurants or shops, making it difficult to access basic amenities or find dining options.\"},{\"title\":\"Room Selection\",\"text\":\"If you prefer a quiet room, request a location away from the pool area to avoid potential noise.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Bringing a Car\",\"text\":\"To fully explore the area, it\'s recommended to have a car as the hotel\'s location may require it for convenience.\"},{\"title\":\"Dining Considerations\",\"text\":\"Some guests found the selection of food to be poor, so it\'s advisable to explore dining options in the surrounding area.\"},{\"title\":\"Connectivity Concerns\",\"text\":\"The Wi-Fi connection was reported to be unreliable, so guests reliant on internet access may want to consider this limitation.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Train Services\",\"text\":\"Note that there are limited train services on Sundays, which can complicate commuting plans.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel is close to attractions such as the Colosseum and the Spanish Steps, making it convenient for sightseeing.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:23:25\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(143,18,'Harry\'s Bar Trevi Hotel & Restaurant','harrys-bar-trevi-hotel-restaurant','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_0b40880e29389921215229c5c7b8a9ca.jpg','Along with a restaurant, this smoke-free hotel has a bar\\/lounge and a snack bar\\/deli. Free buffet breakfast and free WiFi in public areas are also provided. Other amenities include a rooftop terrace, a coffee shop\\/cafe, and valet parking. \\nHarry\'s Bar Trevi Hotel & Restaurant offers 16 accommodations with minibars and safes. Beds feature down comforters and premium bedding. A pillow menu is available. Flat-screen televisions come with satellite channels and pay movies. Bathrooms include showers with rainfall showerheads, bathrobes, slippers, and bidets. This Rome hotel provides complimentary wireless Internet access. Business-friendly amenities include desks and phones. Additionally, rooms include complimentary bottled water and coffee\\/tea makers. Housekeeping is offered daily and irons\\/ironing boards can be requested.','Via di San Vincenzo, 10','+39 066 994 0704',322,5,1672,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_0b40880e29389921215229c5c7b8a9ca.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_c968b8327db9415df710872b21ed9c80.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_3bbe550cf50febf815d7d2ee4e5ec527.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d64c796db6a0e0637e7eaeac0ded0502.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_c03d7dc8c28423f3ac4cc35ae51889f0.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_badcec4891ef8b75e613d189128ba9a5.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/asset