 offer discounts or deals at different times for rooms at Harry\'s Bar Trevi Hotel & Restaurant and KAYAK will provide you with prices from a huge range of travel sites. That means that you can always find a great deal for Harry\'s Bar Trevi Hotel & Restaurant.\"}]','{\"score\":9.3,\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":1672,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":1338},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":173},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":83},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":23},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":35},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":6},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":13}],\"summary\":\"Guests overwhelmingly praised the hotel\'s central location, describing it as excellent and convenient for exploring Rome, especially being close to the Trevi Fountain. The staff received high marks for their friendliness, helpfulness, and attentiveness, with several guests highlighting exceptional service. Breakfast was frequently mentioned as a positive, with guests appreciating both the quality and variety. Cleanliness was generally viewed positively, though a few reviews noted issues with room size and darkness, particularly in annex rooms. Some guests expressed disappointment with aspects such as value for money, room size, and accessibility, but overall, the positives far outweighed the negatives.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":10},{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":9.5},{\"label\":\"Breakfast\",\"score\":9},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":8.5},{\"label\":\"Room Size\",\"score\":3.5}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":9.3,\"reviews\":789},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":8.3,\"reviews\":10},{\"name\":\"Priceline\",\"score\":10,\"reviews\":1}],\"mentions\":[\"great location\",\"staff were very friendly\",\"great breakfast\",\"modern hotel\",\"rooms were very nice\",\"de trevi\",\"good nothing\",\"trevi fountain\",\"visiting rome\",\"bar and restaurant\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What can I expect from the hotel\'s restaurant?\",\"answer\":\"The on-site restaurant, Harry’s Bar Trevi, offers wine tasting and a range of cocktails. The food menu is simple and offers a taste of Italian using authentic flavors of the area. The restaurant is open for breakfast, lunch, and dinner and offers live piano bar music on Friday and Saturday evenings.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the highlights of the hotel\'s location?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel is perfectly located in the main tourist attraction and from there you can get all the tourist place by walk in distance. It is brightly lit even at night so it feels very safe and festive. There are cafes, shops, gelato places just along the street. Easy to get a snack, a meal, do some shopping within a stone throw.\"},{\"question\":\"How comfortable are the beds in the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Great hotel will return. Room clean well laid out. Bed super comfy.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the hotel\'s unique offerings?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel has a unique ancient architectural basement with original Roman water route construction, the flowing water it shares with the Trevi Fountain. The cuisine is truly first rate - dinner quality is superb and any cooked breakfast is cooked to order. A great chef!\"},{\"question\":\"What is the hotel\'s staff like?\",\"answer\":\"All the staff are very welcoming. Front of house, waitresses, cleaners. V nice people. Breakfast fresh and the coffee is lovely. Can not fault the hotel at all. Def stay if having a few days in Rome with your partner. Class.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Book a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the fountain comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Rooftop Terrace\",\"text\":\"Guests enjoyed the rooftop terrace with its fantastic view of the Fontana di Trevi. It\'s a great spot to relax and take in the surroundings.\"},{\"title\":\"Enjoy the Hotel\'s Central Location\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s proximity to the Trevi Fountain and other major attractions makes it convenient for exploring Rome on foot. Guests appreciated being able to walk to most of the main sights.\"},{\"title\":\"Try the Hotel\'s Restaurant\",\"text\":\"Guests praised the hotel\'s restaurant for its delicious food and wine tasting. Consider dining in and experiencing the authentic flavors of Italy.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider a Suite for Extra Comfort\",\"text\":\"Suites at the hotel offer additional amenities such as a whirlpool tub, walk-in closet, and a larger space. If you\'re looking for a more luxurious stay, a suite might be worth considering.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Hotel\'s Concierge Service\",\"text\":\"The concierge staff received high praise for being informative, helpful, and welcoming. Don\'t hesitate to seek their assistance for recommendations and bookings.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore the Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s location near the Trevi Fountain provides easy access to various attractions, including the Pantheon, Spanish Steps, and Piazza Navona. Take advantage of the central location to explore these iconic landmarks.\"},{\"title\":\"Enjoy the Hotel\'s Breakfast\",\"text\":\"Many guests raved about the breakfast, mentioning the fresh and varied options. Make sure to fuel up for a day of exploring with the hotel\'s fabulous breakfast offerings.\"},{\"title\":\"Experience the Hotel\'s Unique Basement\",\"text\":\"The hotel has a unique ancient architectural basement with original Roman water route construction, which guests found fascinating. Take some time to explore this hidden gem within the hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Engage with the Exceptional Staff\",\"text\":\"Numerous guests highlighted the exceptional service provided by the hotel staff, particularly mentioning specific staff members by name. Interacting with the friendly and helpful staff can enhance your overall experience.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:23:32\"}','0000-00