count\":97},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":48},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":32},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":14},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":18}],\"summary\":\"Guests consistently highlight the friendliness and helpfulness of the staff, the convenient and central location, the cleanliness of the hotel, and the comfort of the beds. Many also enjoyed the breakfast options. Some negative feedback was mentioned about noise between rooms, occasional issues with reception service, and minor complaints about amenities, but overall, the positive experiences far outweigh the negatives, making this hotel highly recommended by most reviewers.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":9},{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":9},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":8.5},{\"label\":\"Bed Comfort\",\"score\":8.5},{\"label\":\"Breakfast\",\"score\":7.5}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.5,\"reviews\":178},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":8.9,\"reviews\":1},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":9.7,\"reviews\":4}],\"mentions\":[\"staff was friendly\",\"comfortable room\",\"good breakfast\",\"hotel was very good\",\"hotel location\",\"great location\",\"city center\",\"public transport\",\"bit far\",\"villa borghese\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What are the hotel\'s standout amenities?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers a sauna, a restaurant with an open terrace, and a fitness center. Additionally, guests can enjoy private parking and a mini market on-site.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the cleanliness of the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have praised the hotel\'s cleanliness, with many highlighting the clean and comfortable rooms. However, some guests have mentioned concerns about the cleanliness of certain areas, such as the bathroom and the carpet in the rooms.\"},{\"question\":\"What can guests expect from the hotel\'s customer service?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel\'s staff has been described as very friendly, helpful, and welcoming. They are known for their excellent 