upermarket, offering convenience for travelers.\"},{\"title\":\"Note Room Cleanliness\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned issues with cleanliness, so it\'s advisable to check recent reviews regarding this aspect before booking.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Aware of Renovation Activities\",\"text\":\"Guests noted ongoing renovations, which may lead to noise disturbances, so it\'s worth checking the status of renovations before booking.\"},{\"title\":\"Inquire About Air Conditioning\",\"text\":\"Some guests reported issues with the effectiveness of the air conditioning, so it\'s advisable to confirm this aspect before booking, especially during warmer months.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:24:05\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(151,18,'AC Hotels by Marriott Clodio Roma','ac-hotels-by-marriott-clodio-roma','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_9c89ccc73e476e8ce017ee8f325b3683.jpg','Recently renovated and first AC Hotel in the city is located in the sophisticated and prestigious Prati neighborhood, 15 minutes away from the Rome\'s Olympic Stadium and 20 minutes away from Basilica di San Pietro. Discover this design hotel and experience all its services and facilities from the AC Lounge, a multifuntional spot perfect try the delicious dishes of the Italian cuisine or chat with friends with a signature cocktail, an outdoor terrace to enjoy the roman sunset, a Fitness Room and Free Wi-FI. It also boasts 103 beautifully designed rooms with anything you may need, comfortable beds, expresso coffee maker, kettle, in suite bathroom with special amenities and some of them feature stunning views. Check out 2 meeting rooms totally equipped in AC Hotel Clodio Roma. Its location and services make this AC Hotel in Rome the perfect lodging option for those who want to live as a true local in their business or leisure trips.','Via di Santa Lucia 10','+39 063 721 122',188,4,894,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_9c89ccc73e476e8ce017ee8f325b3683.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/m