,{\"label\":\"Room Size\",\"score\":4}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.5,\"reviews\":180},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":6.1,\"reviews\":2}],\"mentions\":[\"reception staff\",\"breakfast was very good\",\"room very clean\",\"bus stop\",\"hotel is very good\",\"bed was not comfortable\",\"morning early\",\"far from the city\",\"everything else\",\"good value for money\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What are the best nearby attractions to visit?\",\"answer\":\"You can explore attractions like Musei Vaticani, St. Peter\'s Square, Basilica di San Pietro, and Castel Sant\'Angelo, all within 1.5 miles of the hotel.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the quality of the beds at Hotel Clodio?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have mentioned that the beds are comfortable and the rooms are spacious, providing a good night\'s sleep.\"},{\"question\":\"Is parking available at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, the hotel offers free parking for guests, making it convenient for those traveling by car.\"},{\"question\":\"What can I expect from the breakfast at Hotel Clodio?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have praised the hotel\'s breakfast, mentioning a great selection of food, including fresh fruits, juices, and hot and cold options.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the cleanliness and customer service at Hotel Clodio?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have appreciated the cleanliness of the hotel and the friendly staff, although some have mentioned that the hotel needs refurbishment in certain areas.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the fountain comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Room Refurbishment\",\"text\":\"Some guests noted that the rooms are a little tired and in need of refurbishment. If modern decor is a priority, it may be worth inquiring about the most recently updated rooms.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Dining Options\",\"text\":\"While the hotel offers a restaurant, guests found it to be closed or not meeting their expectations. Consider exploring nearby restaurants and eateries for a wider variety of dining choices.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Breakfast\",\"text\":\"Many guests praised the breakfast selection, highlighting the variety and quality of the food. It\'s recommended to make the most of the complimentary breakfast during your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Check Room Amenities\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned that certain amenities, such as a TV, minibar, or kettle, did not meet their expectations based on the booking information. It may be helpful to confirm the availability of specific amenities before arrival.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"A few guests reported noise issues, such as loud water pipes and thin walls. Light sleepers may want to inquire about quieter room options or consider bringing earplugs for a more peaceful stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Utilize Nearby Transportation\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s proximity to bus stops and the metro makes it convenient for exploring Rome. Guests recommended using these transportation options for easy access to the city\'s attractions.\"},{\"title\":\"Inquire About Room Temperature\",\"text\":\"Some guests experienced issues with room temperature control, finding the radiators difficult to adjust. It may be helpful to inquire about room climate control options upon check-in.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Room Size\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the rooms were on the smaller side. If space is a priority, it may be beneficial to inquire about room size options or upgrades.\"},{\"title\":\"Manage Expectations for Decor\",\"text\":\"While some guests appreciated the hotel\'s decor, others found it to be outdated or not as advertised. It\'s advisable to set realistic expectations for the decor based on recent guest feedback.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:24:12\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(152,18,'Jo&joe Roma','jojoe-roma','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_51a3f8c44716baf3be4cdff8b9227037.jpg','JO&JOE Roma is a place open to all that combines the comfort of a hotel with the festive atmosphere of a youth hostel. Close to the Trevi Fountain and the Pantheon, it\'s the perfect place to explore the Italian capital. JO&JOE is also the perfect spot to drink great cocktails and enjoy Italian specialties, either in the inner courtyard with its fountain or in the restaurant.','113 Via Delle Quattro Fontane','+39 064 559 0522',118,4,3022,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_51a3f8c44716baf3be4cdff8b9227037.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_ef05e47893a2e1b1bce49c807a4049a8.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_95083ac00253ad82b2c338dcd9c8c983.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_0ef81b5031ff1b3e7ee358d60e6d56aa.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_a64d9370a489403f6b6b19f8955cc1e1.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_5b423a6a1aa7931c0a8266b7fb769838.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d87d5b90ea10ecac2e78a276d1f6818b.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_cd1aa69a1e3a70302eb60442f5211dbf.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_baeb5964b343021d0572d252e5f53cf5.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_1fedc5577db2d12e983fe9129be1af28.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_db2eea63beb38e522dae02e00e37f78f.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_027000917e56ab132ba8e0c0849b1d21.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_f1f1beae0cf44d3d90444363e307a747.jpg\"]',NULL,'https://www.kayak.com/Rome-Hotels-Jo-joe-Roma.133903.ksp','[\"Free Wi-Fi\",\"Mobile hotspot device\",\"Business center\",\"Reading light\",\"Pets allowed on request. Charges may apply.\",\"Wi-Fi available in all areas\",\"Internet\",\"Terrace/Patio\",\"Daily housekeeping\",\"Increased accessibility\",\"Fax/photocopying\",\"Family rooms\",\"Concierge service\",\"Towels\",\"Fire extinguisher\",\"Lau