tes. That means that you can always find a great deal for Jo&joe Roma.\"}]','{\"score\":8.7,\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":3022,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":2012},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":500},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":245},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":93},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":85},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":33},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":54}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.7,\"reviews\":798},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":10,\"reviews\":1}],\"mentions\":[\"room nice\",\"staff very helpful\",\"great location\",\"great and the breakfast\",\"air conditioning\",\"walking distance\",\"good value for the money\",\"termini station\",\"train station\",\"hotel is great\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"How is the cleanliness of the rooms and common areas?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have consistently praised the cleanliness of the rooms and common areas, noting that everything is new and extremely clean. Some guests have suggested providing earplugs as an extra amenity.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the highlights of the hotel\'s location?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel\'s location is highly praised, with guests mentioning that it is in the heart of Rome, within walking distance of major attractions like Trevi Fountain, Pantheon, and Spanish Steps. It is also close to Termini bus and train station, making it convenient for exploring the city.\"},{\"question\":\"How are the beds in the rooms?\",\"answer\":\"While some guests have mentioned that the beds are not good or that there was a lot of noise coming from the top bunk, others have highlighted the new modern showers and great breakfast. Some guests have suggested that the mattresses could be improved.\"},{\"question\":\"What can guests expect from the hotel\'s staff and customer service?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have consistently praised the staff for being friendly, helpful, and professional. Some specific staff members have been mentioned for their exceptional service, such as Sara and Marco. However, a few guests have mentioned concerns about check-out rules and a few instances of annoyance with luggage storage charges.\"},{\"question\":\"Are there any specific amenities or facilities that guests have particularly enjoyed?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have enjoyed the hotel\'s garden and common areas, noting that they are very nice and modern. The hotel also offers a restaurant and bar, and some guests have appreciated the wide range of facilities. However, a few guests have suggested adding shared showers/toilets for rooms with multiple occupants.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with a Terrace\",\"text\":\"Consider booking a room with a terrace for a more enjoyable and relaxing experience, as several guests appreciated the private terrace in their rooms.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Free Bicycle Rental\",\"text\":\"Make use of the hotel\'s free bicycle rental service to explore the nearby attractions conveniently, as it was positively mentioned by guests.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider the Noise Level\",\"text\":\"If you are a light sleeper, be mindful of potential noise disturbances, as some guests reported noise issues from other guests and the surrounding area.\"},{\"title\":\"Try the Hotel\'s Restaurant\",\"text\":\"Guests highly recommended trying the hotel\'s restaurant for delicious food and excellent service, particularly praising the pasta and tiramisu.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Check-Out Time\",\"text\":\"Note that the check-out time is at 10:00 AM, which some guests found to be early, so plan your departure accordingly.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore the Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"Take advantage of the hotel\'s proximity to popular attractions such as Trevi Fountain, Spanish Steps, and Colosseum, which are within walking distance.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider the Room Layout\",\"text\":\"Some guests found the beds in shared rooms to be too close to each other, potentially causing noise disturbances, so consider this when booking a room.\"},{\"title\":\"Utilize the Rooftop Terrace\",\"text\":\"Enjoy the spectacular views from the hotel\'s rooftop terrace, which was highlighted as a positive feature by several guests.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Aware of Noise from Beds\",\"text\":\"If staying in a shared room, be mindful that some guests reported noise issues related to the beds, so consider this when choosing your accommodation.\"},{\"title\":\"Engage with the Friendly Staff\",\"text\":\"Interact with the accommodating and friendly staff, who were praised by many guests for their helpfulness and welcoming attitude.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:24:20\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(153,18,'The Hive Hotel','the-hive-hotel','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_5fa33051c3f0cfefd7fdff04b426de37.jpg','This smoke-free hotel features a full-service spa, a restaurant, and a fitness center. WiFi in public areas is free. Additionally, a bar\\/lounge, self parking, and massage\\/treatment rooms are onsite. \\nThe Hive Hotel offers 189 air-conditioned accommodations with minibars and safes. Smart televisions are featured in guestrooms. Bathrooms include bathtubs or showers, slippers, bidets, and complimentary toiletries. Guests can surf the web using the complimentary wireless Internet access. Business-friendly amenities include desks and phones. Housekeeping is provided daily. \\nRecreational amenities at the hotel include a fitness center.','Via Torino 6','+39 064 041 2000',134,4,7127,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_5fa33051c3f0cfefd7fdff04b426de37.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_6c5c2f2ac2757d45cf6bacd3997614fa.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_302b259582b2bcea433a3b667160c215.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_8ae4deef65de6856f605a78e991974c8.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_ec22fdbd95363ef7531a00a5ae9f2fab.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_ba6e538fff5d7011f68cee21ef5e1816.jpg\",\"http://travelv