Wardrobe or closet\",\"24hr front desk\",\"Shuttle service\",\"Private parking\"]',0,'[{\"question\":\"What kind of accommodations does the Hive Hotel offer?\",\"answer\":\"At the Hive Hotel, guests can choose Suites or Junior Suites in order to enjoy a corner accommodation with breathtaking views, check in and out at any time, and complimentary breakfast on the 5th floor. Suites and Junior Suites also have their own soft bathrobes. The Hive offers three types of rooms, Deluxe, Executive, and Superior. Executive rooms are larger than Deluxe rooms and have a larger closet, a larger shower, and soundproofing. A Superior room is the largest room, a 20-square-meter space (about a 215-square-foot space).\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Hive Hotel have facilities for events?\",\"answer\":\"The Hive Hotel has an entire floor, separated into three large rooms, that is dedicated to larger events, whether it is a prestigious business conference or a more elegant private affair. The Hive Hotel also features nine large spaces appropriate for any event. Outdoors, the Hive Hotel offers the Rooftop. This venue is separated into an open-air terrace and a modular-covered structure that can seat up to 100 people. Seating and tables can also be situated in the open-air section under the sun or stars. Furthermore, the Hive Hotel offers flower arrangements, catering, and the services of an event manager.\"},{\"question\":\"What are some of the Hive Hotel’s signature dishes in their 5th-floor restaurant?\",\"answer\":\"At The Hive Hotel, guests enjoy shrimp cocktail in kataifi, endive in red turnip osmosis and pink sauce, and cuttlefish carbonara served with ham powder, a cooked egg, and pecorino fondue. Favorite entrées include egg pappardelle, vermicelli with local asparagus extract and clams, and saffron sauté rice with braised squid. Signature specials include Châteaubriand, sliced beef with balsamic reduction, and catch of the day with tzatziki sauce, dill, and cucumbers. You can enjoy a breakfast of delectable pastries, fruit, and Italian espresso at the 5th-floor restaurant or an express breakfast in the Lounge Bar.\"},{\"question\":\"What does paid admission to the spa at the Hive Hotel include?\",\"answer\":\"With a spa entry at the Hive Hotel, you can take advantage of showers with both hot and cold water jets with various lights and aromas, heated whirlpools, a tension-dispelling Finnish sauna, a revitalizing bio-sauna, a steam bath accented with menthol and eucalyptus, a relaxation area, and a tea shop. The spa at the Hive Hotel also features three private themed immersive spa suites: the Mediterranean, the Japanese, and the Arabian. With spa packages, you get all the benefits of an entry plus different types of massages depending on the package, such as neck-head-back massage, anti-stress massage, Persian rose soothing face massage, and foot reflexology.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I work with a trainer in the fitness boutique at the Hive Hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. The extra fee for a private lesson with a personal trainer depends on how long the lesson lasts—30 minutes or 50 minutes. You can also do group lessons with a personal trainer for a fee for fewer than four people in your group and another fee for more than four people. If you want to work out by yourself, a daily entrance fee to the fitness boutique will allow you access to cutting-edge TechnoGym machines. You can ride exercise bikes, use a treadmill, bench press, use free weights, and more.\"},{\"question\":\"Where is The Hive Hotel located?\",\"answer\":\"The Hive Hotel is located at Via Torino 6 in Historical Center, 0.6 miles from the center of Rome. Basilica di Santa Maria Maggiore is the closest landmark to The Hive Hotel.\"},{\"question\":\"When is check-in time and check-out time at The Hive Hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Check-in time is 2:00 PM and check-out time is 11:30 AM at The Hive Hotel.\"},{\"question\":\"Does The Hive Hotel offer free Wi-Fi?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, The Hive Hotel offers free Wi-Fi.\"},{\"question\":\"How far is The Hive Hotel from the airport?\",\"answer\":\"The Hive Hotel is 8.6 miles from Rome Ciampino.\"},{\"question\":\"How does KAYAK find such great The Hive Hotel hotel deals?\",\"answer\":\"KAYAK scours the web for all room deals available at The Hive Hotel in Rome and lets you compare them to find the best rate for your stay. Many different travel sites will offer discounts or deals at different times for rooms at The Hive Hotel and KAYAK will provide you with prices from a huge range of travel sites. That means that you can always find a great deal for The Hive Hotel.\"}]','{\"score\":8.7,\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":7127,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":4362},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":1413},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":711},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":249},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":185},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":77},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":131}],\"summary\":\"Most guests praised the hotel for its excellent central location, friendly and helpful staff, and high standards of cleanliness. Many found the rooms spacious and comfortable. However, some guests were disappointed by extra charges for amenities like the gym and spa, and several reviews mentioned that breakfast quality and value for price could be improved. Noise levels and communication from staff were occasional concerns, but overall, the positives outweighed the negatives for most visitors.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":10},{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":9},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":8.5},{\"label\":\"Value for Price\",\"score\":3},{\"label\":\"Breakfast\",\"score\":3}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.7,\"reviews\":2183},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":9.1,\"reviews\":65},{\"name\":\"Priceline\",\"score\":9.1,\"reviews\":5},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":9.3,\"reviews\":1}],\"mentions\":[\"great location\",\"modern hotel\",\"staff was friendly\",\"good breakfast\",\"termini station\",\"spacious room\",\"walking distance to termini\",\"close to the train\",\"one night\",\"roof top\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What can I expect from the hotel\'s breakfast and dinner offerings?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers sweet and savory dishes at breakfast, made fresh by the chefs, and dinner is an experience that will take you across different parts of Italy depending on how you order. Both meals are served on a fabulous terrace overlooking Santa Maria Maggiore Basilica.\"},{\"question\":\"What amenities are available in the hotel rooms?\",\"answer\":\"The rooms feature pure cotton sheets, soft pillows, a smart TV, free WiFi, modern showers, and a special courtesy line containing a mixture of honey and ginger. Guests can choose from four different room styles – superior, deluxe, executive, or a junior suite out of 189 rooms.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the nearby attractions to the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel is conveniently located near popular attractions such as the Colosseum, Fontana di Trevi, Basilica di San Clemente, Foro Romano, and many others, making it an ideal place to stay for exploring Rome.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the hotel\'s fitness and wellness offerings?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel has a fitness and wellness center, sauna, hydromassage, and outdoor jacuzzi whirlpool tub, providing guests with options to stay active or relax during their stay.\"},{\"question\":\"What are guests saying about the cleanliness of the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have consistently praised the hotel for being super clean, quiet, and in a safe area at the very city center near the railway station. The bathrooms are described as spacious, clean, and pretty.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with Natural Brightness\",\"text\":\"The original architecture of the hotel allows each room to enjoy natural brightness from high windows, providing a pleasant ambiance.\"},{\"title\":\"Enjoy Breakfast or Dinner on the Terrace\",\"text\":\"Head to the 5th floor to experience breakfast or dinner served on a fabulous terrace overlooking Santa Maria Maggiore Basilica, offering sweet and savory dishes made fresh by the chefs.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Fitness and Wellness Center\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers a fitness and wellness center, sauna, hydromassage, and outdoor jacuzzi whirlpool tub, providing options to stay active or relax during your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Room Selection Carefully\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned that the facilities were old and the bed not comfortable, so it may be beneficial to carefully consider room selection based on individual preferences.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel is conveniently located near various attractions such as the Colosseum, Fontana di Trevi, and the Spanish Steps, making it an ideal base for sightseeing.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"Some guests noted that the hotel\'s location in a noisy area detracted from the overall experience, so it may be helpful to consider noise levels when choosing a room.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Additional Charges\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned that additional charges for gym and spa services were not included in the price, so it\'s advisable to inquire about any additional costs for amenities.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Opting for a Superior Room\",\"text\":\"Several guests appreciated the modern design and good location of the hotel, indicating that a superior room may offer a more satisfying experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Hotel\'s Location\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s excellent location makes it convenient for exploring the area and accessing the main train and metro stations, providing easy access to various attractions.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Aware of Room Size and Noise\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned that certain rooms were small and noisy, so it may be beneficial to consider room size and location within the hotel.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:24:28\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(154,19,'Eurostars Grand Marina','eurostars-grand-marina','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_8cfaee2a6d752ea64d234cd7932b299f.jpg','This smoke-free hotel features a restaurant, a fitness center, and a bar\\/lounge. WiFi in public areas is free. Additionally, a poolside bar, a snack bar\\/deli, and a rooftop terrace are onsite. \\nHousekeeping is available on request. \\nEurostars Grand Marina offers 291 accommodations with minibars and safes. Each accommodation is individually furnished. Beds feature premium bedding. Smart televisions are featured in guestrooms. Bathrooms include showers with rainfall showerheads, bathrobes, slippers, and bidets. This Barcelona hotel provides complimentary wireless Internet access. Business-friendly amenities include desks and phones. Additionally, rooms include complimentary bottled water and coffee\\/tea makers. Hypo-allergenic bedding, irons\\/ironing boards, and change of towels can be requested. Housekeeping is provided daily. \\nRecreational amenities at the hotel include a fitness center and a seasonal outdoor pool. The recreational activities listed below are available either on site or nearby; fees may apply.','Moll de Barcelona Edifici Sud Of. 323','+34 936 039 000',81,4,6717,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_8cfaee2a6d752ea64d234cd7932b299f.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_55fc4d5b5921e0df45a2093d79864902.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d0cc6d336535f2737867be80cd4ca3a3.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_22090544f504fa96d8a7b3846b962059.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_e2f408eb1df59f3fdc121e88b67e9462.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_6a8b7fa4426bccdeb946fccdc4b68706.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_b1fdec033e8b086f51711886e1b7aa4e.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_2d6f3a4d3ec7ca4c2e0b21ba3071e8d6.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/asset