and Marina has a pool onsite.\"}]','{\"score\":8.5,\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":6717,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":3335},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":1176},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":821},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":427},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":392},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":236},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":330}],\"summary\":\"Guests consistently praised the hotel\'s excellent central location, making it convenient for exploring the city and accessing shops, restaurants, and attractions. Many appreciated the friendly and helpful service from staff, with special mentions for individuals at the reception. Cleanliness was also highlighted, with several guests noting fresh, well-maintained rooms. Spacious accommodations were appreciated by many, contributing to a comfortable stay. However, some guests reported issues such as poor internet, cold pool water, occasional maintenance problems, and concerns about value for price, but overall, positive experiences with location, service, and cleanliness stood out.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":10},{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":9.5},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":9},{\"label\":\"Room Size\",\"score\":8.5}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.5,\"reviews\":2385},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":8.3,\"reviews\":71},{\"name\":\"Priceline\",\"score\":7.8,\"reviews\":26},{\"name\":\"HotelsCombined\",\"score\":9,\"reviews\":1},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":8.7,\"reviews\":1}],\"mentions\":[\"friendly staff\",\"great location\",\"spacious room\",\"good hotel\",\"view from the room\",\"breakfast was good\",\"room service\",\"swimming pool\",\"star hotel\",\"cruise ships\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What are the hotel\'s unique offerings?\",\"answer\":\"Eurostars Grand Marina offers a rooftop pool with unique views of Port Vell, a fitness center, a sauna, and free Wi-Fi. The hotel also provides family facilities, meeting and event spaces, and on-site dining and bars.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the quality of the beds at Eurostars Grand Marina?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have mentioned the quality and cleanliness of the rooms and bedding, as well as the comfort of the beds. Some guests have also highlighted the spaciousness of the rooms and the luxury beds and bathrooms.\"},{\"question\":\"Is parking available at Eurostars Grand Marina?\",\"answer\":\"Eurostars Grand Marina offers parking and an airport shuttle service for guests\' convenience.\"},{\"question\":\"What can guests expect from the food quality at Eurostars Grand Marina?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have praised the excellent breakfast, the amazing restaurant, and the friendly staff. However, some guests have mentioned that the hotel breakfast is pricey, and others have expressed concerns about the limited hot vegetarian options.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the cleanliness and customer service at Eurostars Grand Marina?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have complimented the fantastic staff, the cleanliness of the hotel, and the helpful and friendly reception staff. However, some guests have raised concerns about inconsistent housekeeping and issues with room service and amenities.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the fountain comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Rooftop Pool\",\"text\":\"Guests enjoyed unwinding at the rooftop pool, offering unique views of Port Vell. Consider spending some leisure time here during your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider the Location\",\"text\":\"The hotel is close to well-known sightseeing attractions, nightlife, and shops, making it convenient for exploring the local area. It\'s also within walking distance of Port Vell and Drassanes Metro Station.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Family Facilities\",\"text\":\"The hotel provides family-friendly amenities, such as babysitting/child services, making it suitable for families traveling with children.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel is conveniently located near various attractions, including Palau Guell, Placa Reial, and La Rambla, offering plenty of options for nearby exploration.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned noise disturbances, such as sea gulls and noise from the central area. Consider this when selecting your room or if you are sensitive to noise.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Room Selection\",\"text\":\"While some guests praised the spacious and clean rooms, others mentioned that rooms overlooking the inner courtyard can be noisy at night. It may be beneficial to inquire about room location preferences.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Note of Breakfast Options\",\"text\":\"The breakfast buffet received positive feedback, but some guests suggested that the restaurant could offer more food options for lunch and dinner. Consider exploring nearby dining options for a variety of meals.\"},{\"title\":\"Utilize the Hotel Services\",\"text\":\"The staff are available 24 hours a day and can assist with booking tours, tickets, and provide concierge services. Take advantage of their local knowledge and expertise to enhance your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Special Packages\",\"text\":\"If you\'re considering a special package, it may be helpful to clarify the inclusions with the hotel in advance to ensure a seamless and enjoyable experience.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:24:36\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(155,19,'Hotel Tembo Barcelona','hotel-tembo-barcelona','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_b548a863778c87df09b0c97192cf4dc5.jpg','Along with an outdoor pool, this smoke-free hotel has a restaurant and a fitness center. WiFi in public areas is free. Additionally, a bar\\/lounge, a poolside bar, and a snack bar\\/deli are onsite. \\nChange of towels is available on request. \\nHotel Tembo Barcelona offers 27