indful of the Cleaning Policy\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned that the cleaning policy, which is done every 3 days, was a bit unusual. It\'s important to be aware of this policy, especially for those who prefer more frequent cleaning.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Transportation Options\",\"text\":\"The hotel is close to a metro station, making it easy to access different parts of the city. Additionally, there are shuttle services available for an additional charge, providing convenience for guests who may need transportation.\"},{\"title\":\"Enjoy the Quiet Neighborhood\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the quiet and safe neighborhood, providing a peaceful atmosphere for a comfortable stay. The location was described as ideal for those seeking a tranquil environment.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Gym\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers a gym, providing an opportunity for guests to maintain their fitness routine during their stay. This amenity was well-received by those who utilized it.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Mold in Bathrooms\",\"text\":\"A few guests mentioned encountering mold and a sewage smell in the bathrooms. It\'s advisable to inspect the bathroom upon check-in and report any issues to the staff promptly.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:26:08\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(170,20,'Asiana Grand Hotel','asiana-grand-hotel','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_a005979469c1ff7294a1e48c7c8a3d8d.jpg','2 restaurants, a full-service spa, and an outdoor pool are available at this hotel. Free WiFi in public areas and free self parking are also provided. Additionally, a fitness center, a bar\\/lounge, and a poolside bar are onsite. \\nChange of towels is available on request. \\nAsiana Grand Hotel offers 213 air-conditioned accommodations with minibars and safes. Accommodations offer separate sitting areas. Satellite television is provided. Bathrooms include separate bathtubs and showers with rainfall showerheads, bathrobes, slippers, and bidets. This Dubai h