{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":9},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":8.5},{\"label\":\"Room Size\",\"score\":7.5}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.4,\"reviews\":2328},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":8.9,\"reviews\":451},{\"name\":\"Priceline\",\"score\":7.7,\"reviews\":5},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":8.6,\"reviews\":2}],\"mentions\":[\"staff were friendly\",\"room was great\",\"great location\",\"hotel a good\",\"great view\",\"good breakfast\",\"excellent nothing\",\"room service\",\"overlooking the creek\",\"swimming pool\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What can I expect from the hotel\'s dining options?\",\"answer\":\"During your stay at Radisson Blu Hotel, Dubai Deira Creek, you can dine at The China Club and relax with a drink at Palm Grill & Bar. The hotel offers a wide selection of dining options, and there are also many other dining options in close proximity to the property.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the hotel\'s unique amenities?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers an on-site fitness center, a beauty salon, a sauna, and recreational activities such as a basketball court and squash courts. Additionally, the hotel provides an express check-in and check-out feature, an ideal base to discover nearby attractions, and an executive lounge access.\"},{\"question\":\"What practical information should I know about the hotel\'s location?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel is situated near Baniyas Square (Dubai Metro) and is within walking distance of Al Ghurair Centre and Al Ghurair City. It is also an ideal base to discover nearby Burj Khalifa and Dubai Creek. The metro station \'Union\' is just at the back of the hotel, making it easy to go anywhere much easier.\"},{\"question\":\"What are guests saying about the hotel\'s cleanliness?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have mentioned that the rooms are spacious and spotlessly clean. Additionally, the hotel offers daily housekeeping, and guest accommodation is disinfected between stays. The hotel also follows all safety protocols as directed by local authorities.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the options for transportation and parking at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel provides airport shuttle (surcharge), free parking, private parking, and valet parking. Additionally, the metro station \'Union\' is just at the back of the hotel, making it convenient for guests to go anywhere much easier.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Guests recommend choosing a room with a balcony facing the Dubai Creek for stunning views and a pleasant dining experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of Nearby Transportation\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s proximity to the Union Metro Station and bus station makes it convenient for exploring Dubai, with easy access to attractions and shopping areas.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Local Dining Options\",\"text\":\"Guests suggest exploring the nearby local restaurants and supermarkets for a diverse dining experience, offering a variety of cuisines and convenience for guests.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Executive Lounge Access\",\"text\":\"Guests enjoyed the benefits of the Executive Club lounge, highlighting the attentive service and pleasant atmosphere, making it a worthwhile option for a more exclusive stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Utilize the Hotel\'s Shuttle Service\",\"text\":\"The hotel provides a shuttle service to popular destinations such as Dubai Mall and Kite Beach, offering convenience for guests looking to explore these areas.\"},{\"title\":\"Check Room Amenities\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned the absence of an electric kettle for making tea or coffee in the room, so it\'s advisable to confirm this amenity if it is essential for your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan Around Traffic\",\"text\":\"Guests advise planning activities to avoid peak traffic hours in the area, and the concierge can provide helpful tips for navigating the city during busy times.\"},{\"title\":\"Enjoy the Fitness Facilities\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s well-equipped gym with professional equipment and the availability of squash courts provide opportunities for fitness enthusiasts to stay active during their stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Location\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s strategic location near the Dubai Creek and its proximity to attractions like the Gold Souq and Dubai Museum make it an ideal base for sightseeing and shopping.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Special Requests\",\"text\":\"Guests were pleased with the hotel\'s responsiveness to special requests, such as anniversary decorations, indicating that the hotel is accommodating for special occasions.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:27:00\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(177,20,'Elite Byblos Hotel','elite-byblos-hotel','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_87c5c260137cf7bcde48ab346dbf7144.jpg','This hotel features 2 restaurants, a full-service spa, and an outdoor pool. Free WiFi in public areas, free valet parking, and a free beach shuttle are also provided. Other amenities include a nightclub, a fitness center, and a bar\\/lounge. \\nElite Byblos Hotel offers 337 air-conditioned accommodations with minibars and laptop-compatible safes. These individually decorated and furnished accommodations include day beds. Beds feature premium bedding. A pillow menu is available. 42-inch plasma televisions come with premium satellite channels. Bathrooms include shower\\/tub combinations, bathrobes, slippers, and bidets. This Dubai hotel provides complimentary wireless Internet access. Business-friendly amenities include desks and complimentary newspapers. Additionally, rooms include complimentary bottled water and coffee\\/tea makers. Hypo-allergenic bedding and irons\\/ironing boards can be requested. A nightly turndown service is provided and housekeeping is offered daily. \\n2 hot tubs are on site along with an outdoor pool. Other recreational amenities include a sauna and a fitness center.','Al Barsha 1','+971 4455 4800',11,4,4180,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/m