iews\":16},{\"name\":\"HotelsCombined\",\"score\":7.2,\"reviews\":2},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":6.5,\"reviews\":2}],\"mentions\":[\"friendly staff\",\"spacious room\",\"nice hotel\",\"good location\",\"breakfast was good\",\"good nothing\",\"bed was comfortable\",\"star hotel\",\"excellent service\",\"swimming pool\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What can I expect from the hotel\'s dining options?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers a convenient dining experience at Jigsaw, and guests can also enjoy a range of sports in the on-site sports bar. Additionally, there are plenty of eating options in the surrounding area.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the cleanliness of the hotel rooms?\",\"answer\":\"Guests can expect clean and spacious rooms at Avani Deira Dubai Hotel. However, some reviews mentioned that the furniture is old, so it\'s recommended to check the room condition upon arrival.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the hotel suitable for families with children?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel is good for families with children, offering babysitting or child care, kids meals, and an indoor play area. However, some guests mentioned that the hotel is not ideal for families due to certain disturbances.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the hotel\'s unique amenities?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel provides a private beach, a rooftop pool, and a sauna, offering guests a variety of options for relaxation and leisure during their stay.\"},{\"question\":\"When is the best time to visit the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel is located in a good location near metro stations, making it convenient for guests to explore the city. However, some guests mentioned noise disturbances and other inconveniences, so it\'s advisable to consider these factors when planning a visit.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the fountain comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Room Soundproofing\",\"text\":\"Despite being close to the airport, guests noted that the soundproofing in the rooms is very effective, ensuring minimal disturbance from aircraft noise.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s proximity to Salah Al Din and Al Rigga Metro Stations makes it convenient for guests to explore nearby attractions such as the Gold Souq, BurJuman Mall, and Dubai Museum.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Room Upgrades\",\"text\":\"Some guests reported receiving room upgrades upon check-in, so it might be worth inquiring about this possibility at the reception.\"},{\"title\":\"Diverse Dining Options\",\"text\":\"While the hotel offers dining options, guests also highlighted the wide choice of eating options in the surrounding area, providing a variety of culinary experiences.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Transportation Options\",\"text\":\"Take advantage of the hotel\'s shuttle service, free parking, and proximity to public transport to explore Dubai conveniently.\"},{\"title\":\"Note Room Amenities\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the provision of prayer mats in the rooms, along with tea and coffee making facilities, and mini bars, enhancing their stay experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Breakfast Variety\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned that the breakfast variety could be improved, suggesting that the hotel consider offering a greater variety of food options.\"},{\"title\":\"Engage with the Multilingual Staff\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s multilingual staff received praise for being helpful and friendly, providing valuable local information and enhancing the overall guest experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan for Special Services\",\"text\":\"If you have specific needs or preferences, consider reaching out to the hotel in advance, as some guests reported receiving exceptional service and room upgrades based on their requests.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:27:17\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(179,20,'Voco Bonnington Dubai by IHG'