 location, attentive and friendly service, and high standards of cleanliness. Many found the rooms to be spacious and comfortable. However, several guests were disappointed with the breakfast quality and the lack of buffet options, and some mentioned that certain facilities like the gym, sauna, and pool were unavailable during their stay. Overall, the positive aspects of location, staff, and cleanliness stood out in the reviews.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":9.5},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":9},{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":9},{\"label\":\"Room Size\",\"score\":8},{\"label\":\"Breakfast\",\"score\":3}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8,\"reviews\":1382},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":8.7,\"reviews\":686},{\"name\":\"Priceline\",\"score\":8.3,\"reviews\":7},{\"name\":\"HotelsCombined\",\"score\":8.6,\"reviews\":1},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":7,\"reviews\":1}],\"mentions\":[\"staff are friendly\",\"room clean\",\"hotel is very nice\",\"everything was great\",\"good location\",\"breakfast is good\",\"good nothing\",\"great service\",\"value for money\",\"korean restaurant\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What can I expect from the hotel\'s customer service?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel\'s customer service is highly praised by guests, with many mentioning the amazing staff and the friendly and helpful reception team. Guests have also highlighted the professionalism and attentiveness of the staff, making for a pleasant and comfortable stay.\"},{\"question\":\"How are the beds at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have mentioned that the beds at the hotel are very comfortable, providing a good night\'s sleep. Some guests specifically praised the comfortable and clean beds, ensuring a restful stay.\"},{\"question\":\"Is parking available at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers free parking, making it convenient for guests who are driving. However, some guests have mentioned that parking can be a bit crowded, so it\'s advisable to plan accordingly.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the food quality like at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have generally praised the food quality at the hotel, describing the delicious foods and good breakfast. However, some guests have mentioned that the breakfast might become repetitive if staying for an extended period.\"},{\"question\":\"How clean are the rooms at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have consistently mentioned the cleanliness of the rooms, with many describing them as very clean and cozy. However, a few guests have noted specific issues, such as visible damage and paint marks on the tables.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with a City View\",\"text\":\"Guests recommend choosing a room with a city view for a pleasant stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider the Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned that the hotel can be noisy due to traffic and low-flying airplanes, so light sleepers may want to take this into account.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s proximity to various attractions such as Gold Souq, Dubai Museum, and Burjuman Mall makes it convenient for guests to explore the area.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Room Maintenance\",\"text\":\"Some guests noted issues with room maintenance, such as visible damage and paint marks on furniture, so it may be helpful to inspect the room upon arrival.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Express Check-in/Check-out\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the smooth and fast check-in and check-out process, so consider utilizing this service for added convenience.\"},{\"title\":\"Enjoy the Rooftop Pool\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s rooftop pool offers a relaxing experience, but be mindful of the noisy air-conditioning in that area.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Transportation Options\",\"text\":\"While the hotel offers an airport shuttle, guests driving to the hotel should be prepared for some congestion in the area.\"},{\"title\":\"Diverse Dining Options\",\"text\":\"Guests enjoyed the hotel\'s restaurants and nearby dining establishments, providing a variety of food choices for different preferences.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Deposit Policies\",\"text\":\"Some guests were surprised by the need for a security deposit, so it\'s advisable to clarify this policy in advance to avoid any inconvenience.\"},{\"title\":\"Engage with Friendly Staff\",\"text\":\"Many guests praised the hotel staff for their friendliness and helpfulness, so don\'t hesitate to engage with them for any assistance during your stay.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:27:33\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(181,20,'Swissôtel Al Ghurair','swissotel-al-ghurair','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_c57ffc37c66a8af1d01afe7a7c09dcc1.jpg','Live some of your best moments at Swissôtel Al Ghurair, a family-friendly, five-star hotel located in the heart of Deira, Dubai. Embrace an alternative way of travelling where the well-being of the mind, body, and soul is your top priority. Whether you are visiting for business or leisure, our central location, generous room sizes, and commitment to creating authentic moments of unique experiences are the perfect recipe for an unforgettable stay.','Umar Bin Al Kattab Road 42933166, 42933166','+971 4293 3000',58,4,5257,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_c57ffc37c66a8af1d01afe7a7c09dcc1.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d9c357eb83a840d7c4ba3ae37fe336bc.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_bb88f22fc4f47cf65bad775c6f0e5f69.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_fe5a1c7b2826313a414fe5fa0585e620.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_a7c16114c58b015e9c064b255f6fb670.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_33e67f40cf1375c4dff1362c8f1e88cf.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_1610b01e17588594b9277912219615fb.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_a94b9619b5b86e60b4d4e9a563563f42.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_bbaa5b644403a0d17aef412b204990a5.jpg\