location\",\"room was clean\",\"good hotel\",\"good breakfast\",\"everything was perfect\",\"shopping mall\",\"location nothing\",\"room service\",\"excellent service\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What can I expect from the hotel\'s breakfast options?\",\"answer\":\"Every morning, guests can enjoy breakfast at Liwan or Shayan. Room service is provided around the clock, and a wide selection of restaurants and cafés can also be found close by.\"},{\"question\":\"Are there any concerns about the cleanliness of the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The cleanliness of the hotel was impeccable, and staff were friendly and helpful. Great value for money. Highly recommend this property for a wonderful stay in the city.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the parking options available at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"There is free private parking on site for those with a car.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the customer service at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The staff were very friendly and helpful. The facilities were top-notch, especially the pool. Everything was kept clean and tidy throughout our stay.\"},{\"question\":\"When is the best time to visit the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel is conveniently located for transportation and has easy access to all the attractions. It is also a 20-minute walk from Baniyas Square (Dubai Metro).\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests recommended choosing a room with a view, particularly those facing the adjacent mall, for a more enjoyable stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Nearby Dining Options\",\"text\":\"Many guests appreciated the variety of restaurants around the property that offer delivery services, making it convenient for meals.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Convenient Location\",\"text\":\"Guests highlighted the hotel\'s location, with easy access to a nearby mall and the metro station, making it convenient for both shopping and transportation.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Room Cleanliness\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned issues with room cleanliness, such as unclean sofas and empty minibars, so it\'s advisable to check the room upon arrival.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Check-in Experience\",\"text\":\"A few guests reported less-than-friendly interactions during check-in, so it may be helpful to manage expectations for the check-in process.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore the Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s proximity to attractions like the Gold Souq, Dubai Museum, and Grand Mosque makes it an ideal base for sightseeing.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Parking Options\",\"text\":\"While the hotel offers free parking, some guests experienced issues related to parking, so it\'s advisable to inquire about the parking process upon arrival.\"},{\"title\":\"Utilize the On-site Facilities\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the hotel\'s facilities, including the swimming pool and easy access to shopping, making it convenient for leisure and entertainment.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Aware of Room Amenities\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned missing amenities like bath towels and lotion, so it\'s advisable to check the room amenities upon arrival.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Sauna and Steam Bath Functionality\",\"text\":\"A few guests reported issues with the sauna and steam bath, so it\'s advisable to inquire about the functionality of these facilities before use.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:27:41\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(182,20,'Grand Hyatt Dubai','grand-hyatt-dubai','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_19e1ce293134b26807bd613c2b9af9f6.jpg','9 restaurants, a full-service spa, and free water park access are available at this hotel. Free WiFi in public areas and free valet parking are also provided. Additionally, an indoor pool, an outdoor pool, and a health club are onsite. \\nChange of bedsheets is available on request. \\nGrand Hyatt Dubai offers 710 air-conditioned accommodations with minibars and laptop-compatible safes. Beds feature premium bedding. 40-inch flat-screen televisions come with premium satellite channels. Bathrooms include shower\\/tub combinations with deep soaking bathtubs, bathrobes, slippers, and bidets. Guests can surf the web using the complimentary wireless Internet access. Business-friendly amenities include desks and phones. Additionally, rooms include complimentary bottled water and coffee\\/tea makers. In-room massages, hypo-allergenic bedding, and irons\\/ironing boards can be requested. A nightly turndown service is provided and housekeeping is offered daily. \\nA health club and a complimentary water park with a lazy river and waterslides are featured at the hotel. An indoor pool and an outdoor pool are on site. Other recreational amenities include a sauna and a fitness center.','Riyadh Street Sheikh Rashid Road Po Box 7978','+971 4317 1234',111,4,6902,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_19e1ce293134b26807bd613c2b9af9f6.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_cec52e1f85e2d187b39496e8d689c599.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_21fdba62591c6607052d8ae5a67695c4.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_701afc78be5e08f72990d94fb734824c.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_8bda64f409c6e726714796548f60d318.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_72fd9251cd7e995bae8ea716a5127df9.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_dba2402ca31118e84d528bb2736a0b70.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_719e013b006e937bc72a252078999ad2.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_a85214e5c009dff5f3908dc6ab267f8f.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_959bf6b03eaf6802b5710186c2edf85b.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_196a981c12a8209941bb58dc5eec8149.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_a937b0620c3e4d7bd7a38c1ddea505a1.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_9929344381301cb69ef7060eb3cba183.jpg\"]',NULL,'https://www.kayak.com/Dubai-Hotels-Grand-Hyatt-Dubai.46347.ksp','[\"ATM on-site\",\"Business center\",\"Car rental\",\"Wake-up service\",\"Entire unit wheelchair accessible\",\"Wi-Fi available in all areas\",\"Internet\",\"Executive lounge access\",\"Daily housekeeping\",\"Fax/photocopying\",\"Family rooms\",\"Concierge service\",\"Cribs available\",\"Currency exchange on-site\",\"Feather pillow\",\"Grocery deliveries\",\"Fire extinguisher\",\"Gift shop\",\"Hammam (Turkish bath)\",\"Laundry facilities\",\"Ironing service\",\"Laundry service\",\"Flat-screen TV\",\"Meeting/Banquet facilities\",\"Mini-market on site\",\"Multi-lingual staff\",\"Fold-up bed\",\"Free toiletries\",\"Fruits\",\"Garden view\",\"Room service\",\"Smoke alarms\",\"Heating\",\"Special diet menus (on request)\",\"Tour desk\",\"Hypoallergenic\",\"Spa\",\"Hot tub\",\"Interconnected room(s) available\",\"Indoor pool\",\"Outdoor pool\",\"Key access\",\"Key card access\",\"CCTV in common areas\",\"Kids meals\",\"CCTV outside property\",\"Kid-friendly buffet\",\"Foot massage\",\"Restaurant\",\"Bar/Lounge\",\"Beauty salon\",\"Laptop safe\",\"Express check-out\",\"Hairdryer\",\"Fitness center\",\"Tennis\",\"Cable or satellite TV\",\"24-hour security\",\"Air-conditioned\",\"Non-feather pillow\",\"Airport shuttle (surcharge)\",\"Babysitting/child services (surcharge)\",\"Pants press\",\"Free parking\",\"Pool towels\",\"Pool view\",\"Playground\",\"Water park\",\"Coffee shop\",\"Privacy curtain\",\"Bathrobe\",\"Private bathroom\",\"Garden\",\"Private check-in/check-out\",\"24hr front desk\",\"Designated smoking area\",\"Steam room\",\"Shuttle service\",\"Night club\",\"Storage available\",\"Private parking\",\"Free valet parking\",\"Wedding services\",\"Free Wi-Fi\",\"Radio\",\"Non-smoking rooms available\",\"River view\",\"Terrace/Patio\",\"Increased accessibility\",\"Linens\",\"Towels\",\"Safety deposit box\",\"EV charging station\",\"Seating area\",\"Elevator\",\"Massage\",\"Shampoo\",\"Pool bar\",\"Shower\",\"Shower cap\",\"Accessible by elevator\",\"Accessible parking\",\"Adapted bath\",\"Adapter\",\"Slippers\",\"First-aid kit\",\"Snack bar\",\"Socket near the bed\",\"Sofa\",\"Alarm clock\",\"Soundproof rooms\",\"Bathtub\",\"Soundproofing\",\"Bidet\",\"Gym\",\"Body soap\",\"Flexible event space\",\"Bottle of water\",\"Breakfast in the room\",\"Tea/coffee maker\",\"Telephone\",\"Carpeted\",\"Tile/marble floor\",\"Toilet\",\"Toilet paper\",\"Safe\",\"Sauna\",\"Toothbrush\",\"City view\",\"Clothes rack\",\"Trash cans\",\"Coffee machine\",\"TV\",\"Upper floors accessible by elevator\",\"Conditioner\",\"Upper floors accessible by stairs\",\"Desk\",\"Shopping\",\"Wardrobe or closet\",\"Water slide\"]',0,'[{\"question\":\"What is the most convenient way to Grand Hyatt Dubai from Dubai Airport?\",\"answer\":\"If you’re travelling light, the most convenient way to Grand Hyatt Dubai from Dubai Airport is via RTS Bus 32C from Terminal 1, which stops just outside the hotel and takes about 10min from end to end for the cost of about AED 1 (GBP 0,20). If you’ve got several pieces of luggage a taxi is your best bet.\"},{\"question\":\"Why choose Grand Hyatt Dubai over other area hotels?\",\"answer\":\"Grand Hyatt Dubai is one of the signature buildings towering over the city centre and offers a host of award-winning facilities and services. These include 13 restaurants, bars and lounges; three outdoor temperature-controlled swimming pools, as well as one indoors, luxurious in-room accommodations and an avant-garde spa/wellness centre.\"},{\"question\":\"Which rooms are recommended at Grand Hyatt Dubai?\",\"answer\":\"All of the 682 rooms and suites at Grand Hyatt Dubai offer views of the city. Most of the hotel’s standard rooms overlook the city’s parklands and historic creek while premium rooms and suites welcome guests with spectacular views of the Dubai skyline.\"},{\"question\":\"What facilities and services does this hotel offer for families?\",\"answer\":\"Parents with children can book a family room and take advantage of the hotel’s baby-sitting and childcare services to enjoy an evening out on the town. Additional amenities include Kidz Club, kid meals and buffet, along with a dedicated children’s pool featuring slides and water games.\"},{\"question\":\"What sort of sports services does this hotel provide?\",\"answer\":\"Fitness buffs can enjoy a variety of sports services at Grand Hyatt Dubai from indoor tennis courts and table tennis equipment to an indoor 20-metre swimming pool. An ultra-modern fitness centre and health club also provides you with the latest in training equipment and physical therapies.\"},{\"question\":\"What facilities does Grand Hyatt Dubai offer to business travellers?\",\"answer\":\"In addition to 8,000 metres of combined event space for conferences, roadshows or presentations the hotel also offers corporate executives a business centre equipped with audio & video teleconferencing capabilities and office equipment, such as terminals with Wi-Fi, fax and photocopy machines.\"},{\"question\":\"Why should I eat at Grand Hyatt Dubai?\",\"answer\":\"Not many hotels worldwide can offer nine on-site restaurants each with their own speciality. Exotic fare at Grand Hyatt Dubai comes courtesy of authentic Lebanese cuisine and Singapore-styled seafood along with more traditional menus covering Japanese sushi, Indian tandoor dishes and NY steaks or Italian pasta favourites.\"},{\"question\":\"Are there any special lounges at this hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Grand Hyatt Dubai presents two distinctive lounges on the hotel’s premises: Cooz Bar and Lounge offers live contemporary jazz entertainment amid an intimate ambience with private table service. Al Nakheel Lounge located in the hotel’s grand lobby is a rendezvous point for guests and visitors to breakfast, lunch or dinner.\"},{\"question\":\"What services does Grand Hyatt Dubai provide for weddings?\",\"answer\":\"Grand Hyatt Dubai offers stylish event and banquet rooms, which can hold wedding parties from a few dozen to almost 2,000 guests. There’s a barber shop and beauty salon not to mention a premium wellness spa to prepare you for the big day and a luxury bridal suite to celebrate your big night.\"},{\"question\":\"Where is Grand Hyatt Dubai located?\",\"answer\":\"Grand Hyatt Dubai is located at Riyadh Street Sheikh Rashid Road Po Box 7978 in Bur Dubai, 3.9 miles from the center of Dubai. Oud Metha is the closest landmark to Grand Hyatt Dubai.\"},{\"question\":\"When is check-in time and check-out time at Grand Hyatt Dubai?\",\"answer\":\"Check-in time is 2:00 PM and check-out time is 12:00 PM at Grand Hyatt Dubai.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Grand Hyatt Dubai offer free Wi-Fi?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Grand Hyatt Dubai offers free Wi-Fi.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Grand Hyatt Dubai offer free parking?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Grand Hyatt Dubai offers free parking.\"},{\"question\":\"How far is Grand Hyatt Dubai from the airport?\",\"answer\":\"Grand Hyatt Dubai is 2.8 miles from Dubai Intl. Grand Hyatt Dubai is 13.4 miles from Sharjah.\"},{\"question\":\"How does KAYAK find such great Grand Hyatt Dubai hotel deals?\",\"answer\":\"KAYAK scours the web for all room deals available at Grand Hyatt Dubai in Dubai and lets you compare them to find the best rate for your stay. Many different travel sites will offer discounts or deals at different times for rooms at Grand Hyatt Dubai and KAYAK will provide you with prices from a huge range of travel sites. That means that you can always find a great deal for Grand Hyatt Dubai.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Grand Hyatt Dubai have a pool?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Grand Hyatt Dubai has a pool onsite.\"}]','{\"score\":8.7,\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":6902,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":4778},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":988},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":478},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":183},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":168},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":76},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":231}],\"summary\":\"Guests overall appreciated the hotel\'s friendly and helpful service, with several staff members receiving special mention for their hospitality. Cleanliness was consistently highlighted, and many guests found the rooms to be spacious and comfortable. The breakfast was frequently described as excellent, and the wide range of amenities, including the waterpark and pool, were popular with families. While a few reviews noted some issues with room comfort, staff responsiveness, or specific policies, the general sentiment was very positive, with many guests recommending the hotel and expressing intentions to return.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":9},{\"label\":\"Amenities\",\"score\":9},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":8.5},{\"label\":\"Room Size\",\"score\":8},{\"label\":\"Breakfast\",\"score\":7.5}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.7,\"reviews\":2829},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":9.3,\"reviews\":113},{\"name\":\"HotelsCombined\",\"score\":9.7,\"reviews\":8},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":10,\"reviews\":2}],\"mentions\":[\"staff were very friendly\",\"swimming pool\",\"spacious room\",\"great hotel\",\"good hotel\",\"amazing room\",\"breakfast buffet\",\"room service\",\"excellent service\",\"kids club\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What can I expect from the hotel\'s dining options?\",\"answer\":\"Grand Hyatt Dubai offers a variety of dining options, including Awtar and iZ Lounge, with an extensive drinks menu available at the on-site wine bar.\"},{\"question\":\"Are there any concerns about cleanliness at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Some guests have mentioned concerns about cleanliness, such as a dirty coffee machine and smelly sofa cushions. However, the hotel is committed to addressing such issues to ensure a comfortable stay for all guests.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the highlights of the hotel\'s amenities?\",\"answer\":\"Guests can enjoy the hotel\'s indoor pool, outdoor tennis courts, and day spa, as well as recreational activities like a playground and sauna. Additionally, the hotel offers free Wi-Fi and free private parking.\"},{\"question\":\"What are guests saying about the hotel\'s staff and customer service?\",\"answer\":\"Many guests have praised the exceptional staff and friendly service at Grand Hyatt Dubai, with special mentions for individual staff members who went out of their way to ensure a comfortable and memorable stay.\"},{\"question\":\"When is the best time to visit the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The high season at Grand Hyatt Dubai is in December, while the low season is in July. Visitors can plan their stay accordingly to make the most of their experience.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the fountain comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Enjoy the Breakfast\",\"text\":\"Many guests praised the breakfast, mentioning a great selection and quality. Consider booking a room with breakfast included to start your day off right.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s proximity to Zabeel Park, Burjuman Mall, and Emirates Towers makes it a convenient base for exploring these attractions. Consider planning your visit around these nearby places.\"},{\"title\":\"Family-Friendly Amenities\",\"text\":\"If traveling with children, take advantage of the hotel\'s family-friendly amenities such as the kids\' club, playground, and child pool for a more enjoyable stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Business Trips\",\"text\":\"Guests highlighted the hotel\'s suitability for business trips due to its proximity to the airport, business facilities, and attentive staff. It\'s worth considering for your next business trip.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Front Desk Service\",\"text\":\"While many guests praised the staff, some mentioned issues with the front desk. It\'s advisable to communicate your needs clearly and confirm any special requests to ensure a smooth check-in experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Special Events\",\"text\":\"If you\'re planning your stay around special events or holidays, it\'s recommended to confirm all costs and inclusions to avoid any surprises, as mentioned by some guests in their feedback.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Spa and Wellness Facilities\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the hotel\'s spa, sauna, and wellness center. Consider indulging in these facilities for a relaxing experience during your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Transportation Options\",\"text\":\"Some guests experienced challenges with taxi availability during rush hours. It might be beneficial to explore alternative transportation options or plan your travel outside of peak times.\"},{\"title\":\"Communicate Special Requests\",\"text\":\"If you have specific room preferences or requirements, it\'s advisable to communicate them clearly with the hotel to ensure a comfortable and satisfactory stay.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:27:49\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(183,20,'Hyatt Regency Dubai','hyatt-regency-dubai','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_cb0e36f2cee05166bae7803f0d83f1e0.jpg','A full-service spa, an outdoor pool, and a restaurant are available at this hotel. Free WiFi in public areas, free self parking, and a free beach shuttle are also provided. Other amenities include 4 bars\\/lounges, a 24-hour fitness center, and a poolside bar. \\nHyatt Regency Dubai offers 421 air-conditioned accommodations with minibars and espresso makers. Beds feature down comforters. Televisions come with premium satellite channels, pay movies, and Netflix. Bathrooms include separate bathtubs and showers, bathrobes, slippers, and bidets. This Dubai hotel provides complimentary wireless Internet access. Business-friendly amenities include desks, complimentary newspapers, and phones. Additionally, rooms include safes and complimentary bottled water. Housekeeping is offered daily and hypo-allergenic bedding can be requested. \\nAn outdoor pool, a children\'s pool, and a hot tub are on site. Other recreational amenities include outdoor tennis courts, a sauna, and a 24-hour fitness center. The recreational activities listed below are available either on site or nearby; fees may apply.','Deira Corniche Alkhaleej Road','+971 4209 1234',43,4,6716,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_cb0e36f2cee05166bae7803f0d83f1e0.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_bc2f046acc33da08e7359b6c2852816e.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_2e4cc87c69467ce5157c683b958d804d.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_3b7a56fa9d856e3acbf9e3dd0b143f5f.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_4d6261ba36ab94a3ec7fdb50c9f902b6.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_701eb1fa2b175f019cf0f7653b8c36c7.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_1b9237d43f8fa1e48790f2a0ec193574.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_c4c88527ff6825d52729e4c2cc98191f.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_764ec786b36e856ec87f554bd42f52ee.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_89cb612b067a50044f1a7bdc30f9a488.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_3e3a44f0fecfed0a5e600d0476764117.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d2e9b5de90a3a17115290a2938151ff9.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_27d152528a9cc22c6ac76c42167fa7af.jpg\"]',NULL,'https://www.kayak.com/Dubai-Hotels-Hyatt-Regency-Dubai.46350.ksp','[\"Computer use available\",\"ATM on-site\",\"Electric kettle\",\"Business center\",\"Car rental\",\"Wake-up service\",\"Entire unit wheelchair accessible\",\"Wi-Fi available in all areas\",\"Internet\",\"Executive lounge access\",\"Daily housekeeping\",\"Fax/photocopying\",\"Family rooms\",\"Fax\",\"Concierge service\",\"Cribs available\",\"Currency exchange on-site\",\"Feather pillow\",\"Grocery deliveries\",\"Fire extinguisher\",\"Gift shop\",\"Laundry facilities\",\"Ironing service\",\"Laundry service\",\"Flat-screen TV\",\"Meeting/Banquet facilities\",\"Mini-market on 