45eb.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_526330740580975fe5e6b336b930f68d.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_5b5d174dc23c92461d4b49d751e590cc.jpg\"]',NULL,'https://www.kayak.com/Dubai-Hotels-Atana-Hotel.2423447.ksp','[\"Shuttle service (free)\",\"Free Wi-Fi\",\"Electric kettle\",\"Business center\",\"Car rental\",\"Wake-up service\",\"Internet\",\"Terrace/Patio\",\"Daily housekeeping\",\"Increased accessibility\",\"Fax/photocopying\",\"Family rooms\",\"Linens\",\"Concierge service\",\"Towels\",\"Safety deposit box\",\"Cribs available\",\"Currency exchange on-site\",\"Fire extinguisher\",\"Gift shop\",\"Seating area\",\"Laundry facilities\",\"Elevator\",\"Ironing service\",\"Laundry service\",\"Flat-screen TV\",\"Meeting/Banquet facilities\",\"Massage\",\"Free toiletries\",\"Shampoo\",\"Room service\",\"Smoke alarms\",\"Shower\",\"Shower cap\",\"Tour desk\",\"Accessible parking\",\"Slippers\",\"First-aid kit\",\"Spa\",\"Interconnected room(s) available\",\"Child pool\",\"Outdoor pool\",\"Alarm clock\",\"Key card access\",\"CCTV in common areas\",\"CCTV outside property\",\"No smoking\",\"Bathtub\",\"Restaurant\",\"Bar/Lounge\",\"Bidet\",\"Beauty salon\",\"Body soap\",\"Hairdryer\",\"Fitness center\",\"Bottle of water\",\"Tea/coffee maker\",\"Cable or satellite TV\",\"Telephone\",\"Carpeted\",\"Tile/marble floor\",\"24-hour security\",\"Kids\' club\",\"Air-conditioned\",\"Newspapers\",\"Toilet\",\"Toilet paper\",\"Safe\",\"Sauna\",\"Toothbrush\",\"Airport shuttle (surcharge)\",\"Continental breakfast\",\"Clothes rack\",\"Pants press\",\"Trash cans\",\"Food can be delivered to guest accommodation\",\"Coffee machine\",\"TV\",\"Free parking\",\"Pool towels\",\"Desk\",\"Coffee shop\",\"Bathrobe\",\"Private bathroom\",\"Wardrobe or closet\",\"24hr front desk\",\"Designated smoking area\",\"Storage available\",\"Private parking\"]',0,'[{\"question\":\"What’s the best way to get from the airport to Atana Hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The journey from Dubai International Airport (DXB) to Atana hotel is usually around 30min by car and closer to 1h by transit, including a roughly 10min walk from Dubai Internet City Metro Station 2 to Atana Hotel. If travelling with luggage, it may be a better choice to travel by vehicle. Atana Hotel does not offer a complimentary airport shuttle, but they can arrange an airport pick-up or drop-off service if given at least 24-hours notice.\"},{\"question\":\"Why would Atana Hotel be good for event bookings?\",\"answer\":\"Atana Hotel has a dedicated staff for functions ranging from corporate events to weddings. There’s state-of-the-art board rooms and training rooms, fully equipped for business needs. They also offer a ballroom for larger events and an option to book intimate events on the terrace, and they can even arrange pool parties.\"},{\"question\":\"What’s the easiest way to access the beach from Atana Hotel?\",\"answer\":\"While public transit is available from Atana Hotel to the beachfront, the journey is not direct, making travel by car a preferable choice. Atana Hotel offers its guests a complimentary daily shuttle to and from Umm Suqeim Beach, so your plan to hit the sand is made a lot easier.\"},{\"question\":\"What kinds of facilities are available for families with young children?\",\"answer\":\"Atana Hotel offers multiple room options, which include two family rooms. The Family Interconnecting Room offers two bedrooms and bathrooms; it’s private but conjoined. The Family Quad Room is one spacious room with a central divider that offers a king-size bed and two large twin beds. Both family rooms can provide a baby cot on request free of charge. The hotel also offers a kids’ club for children aged 4-8 years, open every day for an additional hourly rate.\"},{\"question\":\"What services does Atana Hotel’s spa offer?\",\"answer\":\"The Atana Spa offers a varied menu of massage from around the world, some including reflexology and aromatherapy; there’s an Ultimate Head to Toe treatment including a full body scrub and scalp massage. The hotel also offers a fully equipped gym, a sauna and a pool to finish off your fitness or pampering routine.\"},{\"question\":\"What kinds of facilities does Atana Hotel have for business travellers?\",\"answer\":\"All rooms at Atana Hotel provide a work desk and IPTV with reliable Wi-Fi connection. This hotel is a great choice for business travellers as you also have amenities on site to make your business trip easier, including a laundry service, 24/7 room service, complimentary valet parking, car hire, a fitness centre and even a shoe-shining service. There is also a gents’ salon on site, just in case you’re needing a quick trim before business meetings in Dubai.\"},{\"question\":\"What activities around Dubai does Atana Hotel offer?\",\"answer\":\"Atana Hotel has its own travel desk, with staff dedicated to booking experiences for you and your family or guests around Dubai. From booking the best restaurants to the biggest attractions, or more unique experiences like helicopter rides and safaris, the staff will ensure they understand your needs to help create lasting memories.\"},{\"question\":\"Where is Atana Hotel located?\",\"answer\":\"Atana Hotel is located at Tecom, Hessa Street, Al Barsha South, 1 in Barsha Heights, 8.9 miles from the center of Dubai. Dubai Media City is the closest landmark to Atana Hotel.\"},{\"question\":\"When is check-in time and check-out time at Atana Hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Check-in time is 2:00 PM and check-out time is 12:00 PM at Atana Hotel.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Atana Hotel offer free Wi-Fi?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Atana Hotel offers free Wi-Fi.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Atana Hotel offer free parking?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Atana Hotel offers free parking.\"},{\"question\":\"How far is Atana Hotel from the airport?\",\"answer\":\"Atana Hotel is 14.2 miles from Dubai Al Maktoum Intl. Atana Hotel is 15.6 miles from Dubai Intl.\"},{\"question\":\"How does KAYAK find such great Atana Hotel hotel deals?\",\"answer\":\"KAYAK scours the web for all room deals available at Atana Hotel in Dubai and lets you compare them to find the best rate for your stay. Many different travel sites will offer discounts or deals at different times for rooms at Atana Hotel and KAYAK will provide you with prices from a huge range of travel sites. That means that you can always find a great deal for Atana Hotel.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Atana Hotel have a pool?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Atana Hotel has a pool onsite.\"}]','{\"score\":8.1,\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":21695,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":11987},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":3949},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":2681},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":1020},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":826},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":425},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":807}],\"summary\":\"Most guests appreciated the hotel\'s friendly and helpful staff, clean and spacious rooms, and convenient location close to attractions and amenities. Several reviews highlighted good value for money and comfortable beds. Some guests also enjoyed the pool and gym facilities. However, a few mentioned issues with slow service, noise, outdated room facilities, and limited breakfast variety.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":8.5},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":8},{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":8},{\"label\":\"Value for Price\",\"score\":7}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.1,\"reviews\":4033},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":8.4,\"reviews\":720},{\"name\":\"Priceline\",\"score\":8.6,\"reviews\":7},{\"name\":\"HotelsCombined\",\"score\":8.4,\"reviews\":3},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":8.1,\"reviews\":8}],\"mentions\":[\"staff very friendly\",\"nice hotel\",\"breakfast buffet\",\"great location\",\"swimming pool\",\"free shuttle\",\"metro station\",\"food was good\",\"good value for money\",\"room was clean\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What dining options are available at Atana Hotel?\",\"answer\":\"At Atana Hotel, guests can enjoy dining at the Garden Restaurant, which offers international cuisine in a buffet-style setting. Additionally, there\'s Olives Restaurant serving Mediterranean food, a 24-hour Piano Lounge, and Shisha Terrace for cocktails and light fare. Room service is also available.\"},{\"question\":\"Are there any unique room options at Atana Hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Atana Hotel offers unique room options such as the Standard Triple Rooms and the Family Quad Room, providing comfortable and spacious accommodations for larger groups or families.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the nearby attractions to Atana Hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Atana Hotel is conveniently close to attractions such as the largest mall in the world, the tallest building in the world, Madinat Jumeirah, Dubai Marina for skydiving, and offers a shuttle service for easy access to these attractions.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the cleanliness and customer service at Atana Hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have praised the cleanliness and customer service at Atana Hotel, with special mentions of the very friendly and helpful staff, exceptional customer service, and the cleanliness of the rooms.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the best times to visit Atana Hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The high season at Atana Hotel is in December, offering a great time to visit and enjoy the hotel\'s beautiful design, comfortable rooms, and easy access to the city’s greatest attractions. Additionally, the hotel provides a sophisticated style and is an ideal place to stay for both business and leisure travelers.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the city or surrounding area comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Upgrading to a Suite\",\"text\":\"Guests have praised the spacious and comfortable suites at Atana Hotel. If you\'re looking for extra space and luxury, consider upgrading to a suite for a more indulgent experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Shuttle Service\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers a convenient shuttle service to nearby attractions, making it easier for guests to explore the city. Be sure to inquire about the shuttle schedule and destinations at the concierge desk.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"With its proximity to the largest mall and the tallest building in the world, guests can easily explore these iconic landmarks. Additionally, the hotel\'s close proximity to the Dubai Marina offers adventurous activities like skydiving.\"},{\"title\":\"Check Out the Dining Options\",\"text\":\"Guests have praised the diverse dining options at the hotel, particularly the Garden Restaurant\'s buffet-style international cuisine and the Mediterranean fare at Olives Restaurant. Don\'t miss the opportunity to try the cocktails at the 24-hour Piano Lounge or Shisha Terrace.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Breakfast Timing\",\"text\":\"Some guests have noted that the breakfast area can get crowded, with food and drinks being removed before the end of breakfast. To avoid the rush, consider arriving earlier for breakfast.\"},{\"title\":\"Inquire About Room Upgrades\",\"text\":\"Several guests have mentioned receiving complimentary room upgrades, so it\'s worth inquiring about the possibility of an upgrade upon check-in for an enhanced stay experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Metro Access\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s location near the metro station provides easy access to various attractions and facilities in Dubai. Consider utilizing the metro for convenient and cost-effective transportation.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Room Selection for Families\",\"text\":\"If traveling with family, consider the Family Quad Room or Standard Triple Rooms, which have been praised by guests for their suitability and comfort for families.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan for Spa Services\",\"text\":\"While the hotel offers a spa and wellness center, guests have reported discrepancies in pricing for spa services. It\'s advisable to confirm the prices and details of spa treatments before booking to avoid any misunderstandings.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:28:16\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(186,21,'Premier Inn Doha Airport','premier-inn-doha-airport','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_c7f649b63535bbe9b8f67053fd0caceb.jpg','Located in Doha, Premier Inn Doha Airport offers a shared lounge. With a fitness centre, the 3-star hotel has air-conditioned rooms with free WiFi, each with a private bathroom. There is a restaurant serving international cuisine, and free private parking is available. At the hotel, the rooms have a desk. Every room is equipped with a safety deposit box and selected rooms include city views. All units in Premier Inn Doha Airport are equipped with a flat-screen TV and a hairdryer. A Full English\\/Irish breakfast is available at the accommodation. Speaking Arabic, English, French and Hindi at the 24-hour front desk, staff are always on hand to help.','Saeed Bin Al Aas Street, C Ring Road, Doha, Qatar, 950','+974 4009 5222',32,4,4412,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_c7f649b63535bbe9b8f67053fd0caceb.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_750a668d1f56c52a5f94ba901cc2be89.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_842f984e78a2a8b5e6a1a0507cbb5850.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_4ee42c8dfc98244103688338326e4400.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_5b20289bdc74a8470f0895fa48c6f780.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_61a205437f300b089f78663ce67fd67b.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_ca2c115721e5308e1b466c7fb6878b46.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_e90251fd99f8e21f27abd2ad36e0163e.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_ca37fea2f74e5fd9c56d04a2db6b60df.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_7915a204842135528d3df27d82ae4cb9.jpg\",\