Premier Inn Doha Airport offers free parking.\"},{\"question\":\"How far is Premier Inn Doha Airport from the airport?\",\"answer\":\"Premier Inn Doha Airport is 4.2 miles from Doha Hamad Intl. Premier Inn Doha Airport is 89 miles from Manama Bahrain Intl.\"},{\"question\":\"How does KAYAK find such great Premier Inn Doha Airport hotel deals?\",\"answer\":\"KAYAK scours the web for all room deals available at Premier Inn Doha Airport in Doha and lets you compare them to find the best rate for your stay. Many different travel sites will offer discounts or deals at different times for rooms at Premier Inn Doha Airport and KAYAK will provide you with prices from a huge range of travel sites. That means that you can always find a great deal for Premier Inn Doha Airport.\"}]','{\"score\":8.5,\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":4412,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":2740},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":937},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":349},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":134},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":92},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":53},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":107}],\"summary\":\"Guests consistently praised the hotel\'s excellent location near the airport, making it ideal for layovers and short stays. Many reviews highlighted the friendly and accommodating staff, as well as the overall cleanliness and comfort of the rooms. While some guests mentioned issues such as lack of shuttle service, occasional maintenance problems, and minor cleanliness lapses, the majority found the hotel to be a great value for its price, with convenient amenities and a pleasant atmosphere.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":10},{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":9.5},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":9}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.5,\"reviews\":1478},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":9,\"reviews\":447}],\"mentions\":[\"staff was very helpful\",\"free shuttle to the airport\",\"close to airport\",\"free shuttle\",\"room was clean\",\"new hotel\",\"doha\",\"great value for money\",\"new and clean\",\"walking distance\"],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:28:22\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(188,21,'DoubleTree by Hilton Doha - Al Sadd','doubletree-by-hilton-doha-al-sadd','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_998b9108b3ea67387ea20b32639f437f.jpg','Come and experience the modern and welcoming environment of DoubleTree by Hilton Doha – Al Sadd. From the moment you arrive, the beautiful stone finishes, floor-to-ceiling windows, and contemporary design set the tone for an unforgettable stay. Our spacious hotel is perfectly located—just a short taxi ride from West Bay, close to Souq Waqif, Doha’s traditional market, and a mere five-minute walk from the metro station, making it easy to explore the city.\\nAt check-in, you’ll be greeted with our signature warm DoubleTree Chocolate Chip Cookie and have access to complimentary Wi-Fi, ideal for both work and personal use. Each room is equipped with a work desk, minibar, and ample space to relax. Upgrade your stay for even more space, a pool view, and additional complimentary amenities.\\nIndulge in a diverse range of dining experiences at our esteemed outlets. Silk Road Restaurant offers a culinary journey, with dishes inspired by the historic Silk Road, bringing together flavors from Asia, the Middle East, and the Mediterranean. For a more casual yet vibrant experience, StrEAT Culture serves street food from around the world in an energetic atmosphere, perfect for sports fans with live screenings. If you’re looking to unwind by the pool, head to Blu Terrace, where you can enjoy Arabic grills, BBQ delights, and refreshing drinks. For a lively night out, SeñorRitas Tex Mex offers Southern cuisine paired with cocktails inspired by music icons and live performances. Lastly, EspressoLab Cafe is perfect for those who crave freshly brewed coffee and delectable pastries in a cozy setting.\\nTo complete your perfect stay, take advantage of our exceptional amenities. Relax at our outdoor pool or enjoy a refreshing swim. Stay active in our fully-equipped gym or take care of any work needs at our business center. Our five meeting rooms and a boardroom provide versatile spaces for business events or special gatherings. At DoubleTree by Hilton Doha – Al Sadd, we offer the ideal balance of luxury, convenience, and exceptional service for both business and leisure travelers.','Mohammed Bin Al Qasim Street 65','+974 4004 7400',51,4,1656,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_998b9108b3ea67387ea20b32639f437f.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_6c8b2b49b7f82a8a7e590b382dd2e5c6.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_9b3384e86ce0110d6b751b9efb588ed9.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_cdc65840a03ed0f6be19421062728661.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_4fdb3bd5c3bda2b30c873b1353c08efb.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_c4c6b559eff3d9964173f41c1421e549.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_80a42bcd0249752df5a600804d5a9646.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_f7c17d349cc14f7d3c95b4d8a352eefe.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_768e09c647f1b329e481db765c7f9a02.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_7b59ab89594b15b8bc02d3391e9eb027.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_7f7b79fdd1f4add38dc97d35f42d8884.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_7c8c13f406e3f180ac129e09d1e9bc4a.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_5c5843caf1682112c9e13c6f6a42d4fe.jpg\"]',NULL,'https://www.kayak.com/Doha-Hotels-DoubleTree-by-Hilton-Doha---Al-Sadd.5938101.ksp','[\"Free Wi-Fi\",\"Radio\",\"Business center\",\"Wake-up service\",\"Wi-Fi available in all areas\",\"Internet\",\"Terrace/Patio\",\"Daily housekeeping\",\"Beach chairs\",\"Family rooms\",\"Linens\",\"Concierge service\",\"Towels\",\"Safety deposit box\",\"Cribs available\",\"Currency exchange on-site\",\"Feather pillow\",\"Fire extinguisher\",\"Gift shop\",\"Sea