le\":\"Consider Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"Some guests reported noise disturbances, particularly from the pool area, so consider requesting a room away from potential sources of noise.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel is conveniently located near several attractions, such as Souq Waqif and the Museum of Islamic Art, making it ideal for exploring the local area.\"},{\"title\":\"Request Updated Rooms\",\"text\":\"A few guests mentioned that the rooms felt outdated, so consider requesting information about the most recently updated rooms when making a reservation.\"},{\"title\":\"Confirm Breakfast Quality\",\"text\":\"While some guests enjoyed the breakfast, others found it lacking in variety, so it\'s advisable to confirm the current breakfast offerings before booking.\"},{\"title\":\"Inquire About Wi-Fi Speed\",\"text\":\"Some guests reported slow Wi-Fi speeds, so it\'s recommended to inquire about the current Wi-Fi quality if reliable internet access is important for your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Room Upgrades\",\"text\":\"A few guests mentioned that their room was upgraded, so it may be worth inquiring about potential upgrades or special offers when making a reservation.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Special Services\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers special services such as private check-in/check-out and free babysitting/child services, so consider taking advantage of these offerings if needed during your stay.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:28:30\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(189,21,'Hyatt Regency Oryx Doha','hyatt-regency-oryx-doha','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d99b0db968f5f966109465a3eef8030f.jpg','This hotel features 3 restaurants, an outdoor pool, and a 24-hour fitness center. Free WiFi in public areas and free valet parking are also provided. Additionally, a bar\\/lounge, a poolside bar, and a snack bar\\/deli are onsite. \\nChange of towels is available on request. \\nHyatt Regency Oryx Doha offers 400 accommodations with minibars and espresso makers. 43-inch LED televisions come with satellite channels. Bathrooms include showers with rainfall showerheads, bathrobes, slippers, and bidets. Guests can surf the web using the complimentary wireless Internet access. Business-friendly amenities include desks, desk chairs, and phones. Additionally, rooms include safes and complimentary bottled water. Change of towels and change of bedsheets can be requested. A nightly turndown service is provided and housekeeping is offered daily. \\nRecreational amenities at the hotel include an outdoor pool, a sauna, and a 24-hour fitness center. The recreational activities listed below are available either on site or nearby; fees may apply.','Al Matar Street','+974 4141 1234',59,4,2728,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d99b0db968f5f966109465a3eef8030f.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_87b60033c56fc99c3f2d883eb452fc3c.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_f07f08a3c101a0342234abb5c153dbd2.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_b9baa5ac998b5f9b631aea7ee9f60c51.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_585154cc33be930ceb079d41919af699.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_db14fe0392fe7c8e8600fcd1932d01d2.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_663ca2ee6b09ab876b8e11c35f786219.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_b8f93f9506be125e71af660ba338c5f8.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_9c4ea56f88bb28db06b8e92123ecf21d.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_bd5225eee76269b37c78b111807ff605.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d048044971536cccb15c804459c47b63.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_6ed8f0dd4527ad2b8ed2fa8e89816532.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_7267326476431c1d2725c82f31abe0be.jpg\"]',NULL,'https://www.kayak.com/Doha-Hotels-Hyatt-Regency-Oryx-Doha.349191.ksp','[\"ATM on-site\",\"Electric kettle\",\"Business center\",\"Car rental\",\"Wake-up service\",\"