"summary\":\"Guests praised the hotel\'s excellent location near the airport, making it convenient for transit and city exploration. The staff were consistently described as friendly, helpful, and professional, contributing to a welcoming atmosphere. Many reviewers highlighted the comfort of the beds and the overall cleanliness of the rooms. Breakfast was frequently mentioned as varied and enjoyable. While there were some negative remarks about noise, pool experience, and certain amenities, the overall impression was very positive, especially regarding location, service, and comfort.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":10},{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":9.5},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":9},{\"label\":\"Bed Comfort\",\"score\":9},{\"label\":\"Breakfast\",\"score\":8.5}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.9,\"reviews\":1580},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":8.9,\"reviews\":63}],\"mentions\":[\"friendly staff\",\"nice hotel\",\"close to the airport\",\"food was good\",\"everything was great\",\"great location\",\"room service\",\"swimming pool\",\"excellent service\",\"excellent nothing\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What dining options are available at Hyatt Regency Oryx Doha?\",\"answer\":\"Hyatt Regency Oryx Doha provides a variety of in-house dining options with Choices and Jazz Club. Sky Lounge offers Indian, fusion and Halal dishes and is available for lunch, afternoon tea, dinner and supper. For those spending the day out, the hotel provides packed lunches.\"},{\"question\":\"What are some of the amenities provided by Hyatt Regency Oryx Doha?\",\"answer\":\"Hyatt Regency Oryx Doha offers amenities such as a sauna, swimming pool, complimentary Wi-Fi, 24-hour room service, and an all-inclusive meal plan. Additionally, there is free private parking on site for guests traveling with a car.\"},{\"question\":\"What can guests expect from the staff at Hyatt Regency Oryx Doha?\",\"answer\":\"Guests can expect amazing and courteous staff at Hyatt Regency Oryx Doha. The staff is known for being kind, attentive, and polite, making guests feel like VIPs.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the nearby attractions to Hyatt Regency Oryx Doha?\",\"answer\":\"Nearby attractions to Hyatt Regency Oryx Doha include Qatar National Library, Qatar National Museum, Souq Waqif, Museum of Islamic Art, and Doha Corniche, providing guests with various options for exploration and leisure.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the best time to visit Hyatt Regency Oryx Doha?\",\"answer\":\"The low season at Hyatt Regency Oryx Doha is in May, while the high season is in November. Visitors can plan their stay accordingly to make the most of their experience.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the fountain comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Rooftop Pool\",\"text\":\"Guests enjoyed the rooftop pool for a night swim after being out in the hot weather of Doha. It\'s a great way to relax and cool off.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider the All-Inclusive Meal Plan\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers an all-inclusive meal plan, which can be convenient for guests who prefer to have their meals within the hotel premises.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Tourist Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel is not far from the airport and other tourist attractions. Consider asking the front desk for tips on where to go while in Doha.\"},{\"title\":\"Enjoy the In-House Dining Options\",\"text\":\"The hotel provides a variety of dining options, including Indian, fusion, and Halal dishes. Guests particularly enjoyed the choices available at the Jazz Club and Sky Lounge.\"},{\"title\":\"Utilize the Complimentary Airport Shuttle\",\"text\":\"The hotel is situated within a 10-minute drive from Hamad International Airport. Take advantage of the airport shuttle service for added convenience.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Spa Facilities\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the complimentary spa facilities, including the warm Jacuzzi, sauna, steam room, and outdoor pool. It\'s a great way to unwind and relax.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Packed Lunches\",\"text\":\"For those spending the day out, the hotel provides packed lunches, which can be convenient for guests planning to explore nearby attractions.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Special Occasion Surprises\",\"text\":\"Some guests were pleasantly surprised with special gestures from the hotel staff, such as receiving a cake in their room for special occasions like a wedding.\"},{\"title\":\"Inquire About Late Check-Out\",\"text\":\"Guests were given complementary late check-out, providing added flexibility for those with later flights.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:28:38\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(190,21,'DoubleTree by Hilton Hotel Doha - Old Town','doubletree-by-hilton-hotel-doha-old-town','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_4222a0f05386adb2a9de96d356484b1b.jpg','Our hotel is located near some of the most attractive destinations in Doha, such as the Museum of Islamic Art, the National Museum, and Souq wakif. It is 12 kilometers from Hamad International Airport, and one kilometer from the metro station and the corniche. The surrounding area is being fully developed as part of the Musheireb Downtown Doha Masterplan and Doha Grand Park project, which will change the face of the district and much of the city. \\nYou can also enjoy a warm DoubleTree Cookie at check-in and use your Digital Key to check in into our bright, spacious guest rooms offering wonderful views through floor-to-ceiling windows. Relax in the comfortable seating area and stay connected with complimentary WiFi at the desk. At our hotel, we also offer luxurious suites, which feature kitchenettes and separate living and dining areas. \\nEnergize in the complimentary 24-hour fitness center or refresh in the rooftop swimming pool, as you take in 