and variety. Some guests noted minor issues such as noise, limited facilities, or room size, but overall, the feedback was overwhelmingly positive, especially regarding service and hospitality.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":10},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":9.5},{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":9.5},{\"label\":\"Breakfast\",\"score\":9}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.8,\"reviews\":1449},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":9.1,\"reviews\":128},{\"name\":\"HotelsCombined\",\"score\":5.3,\"reviews\":2},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":9.8,\"reviews\":1}],\"mentions\":[\"staff very friendly\",\"room was clean\",\"great location\",\"swimming pool\",\"room service\",\"breakfast was good\",\"rooftop bar\",\"late check\",\"nice view\",\"top floor\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"How is the cleanliness of the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have consistently praised the hotel\'s cleanliness, mentioning that the rooms are clean and comfortable, and the staff is attentive to maintaining a high standard of cleanliness throughout the hotel.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the highlights of the hotel\'s location?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel\'s location is highly praised, with guests mentioning its proximity to popular attractions such as Souq Waqif, Qatar National Museum, and the Doha Corniche. It\'s also noted as a comfortable and convenient base for exploring the city.\"},{\"question\":\"How are the beds at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have consistently mentioned that the beds are comfortable and the rooms are spacious, providing a relaxing and restful environment for a comfortable stay.\"},{\"question\":\"Is parking available at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers free parking and valet parking, providing convenient options for guests who are driving or renting a car during their stay.\"},{\"question\":\"What can guests expect from the hotel\'s customer service?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have consistently praised the friendly and helpful staff, noting their willingness to accommodate requests and provide a warm and welcoming atmosphere throughout the hotel.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the fountain comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Location\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s proximity to popular attractions such as Souq Waqif, Qatar National Museum, and the Museum of Islamic Art makes it an ideal base for exploring Doha.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Pool Maintenance\",\"text\":\"Some guests reported that the swimming pool was under maintenance during their stay. It may be advisable to check the pool\'s availability before booking if this amenity is important to you.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"A few guests noted that the hotel can be noisy, especially due to the club located nearby. Light sleepers may want to consider this before booking.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Room Cleanliness\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned issues with carpet cleanliness in certain areas of the hotel. It may be worth requesting a room on a higher floor to avoid this concern.\"},{\"title\":\"Verify Air Conditioning Functionality\",\"text\":\"Several guests reported issues with the air conditioning system, including inconsistent temperature control and noisy operation. It may be helpful to inquire about this before booking, especially during the hotter months.\"},{\"title\":\"Appreciate the Staff\",\"text\":\"Many guests praised the friendly and helpful staff, particularly at the reception. Their professionalism and dedication to providing outstanding service left a positive impression on numerous guests.\"},{\"title\":\"Enjoy the Breakfast\",\"text\":\"Multiple guests highlighted the quality of the breakfast, with some describing it as amazing. It\'s worth taking advantage of this meal during your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Note of Bathroom Amenities\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned specific bathroom amenities, such as the availability of a spa bath and the provision of toiletries. These details could enhance the overall experience for certain guests.\"},{\"title\":\"Utilize the Hotel\'s Services\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the valet parking services and the convenience of having an ATM on-site. These services can add to the overall comfort and ease of your stay.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:28:47\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(191,21,'Grand Regency Doha, Trademark Collection','grand-regency-doha-trademark-collection','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d15aeaf0bb16a6972e9dfed0c1d91e80.jpg','Located in the vibrant Al Sadd district, Grand Regency Doha, Trademark Collection by Wyndham is a sophisticated five-star boutique hotel that combines timeless elegance, exceptional hospitality, and modern convenience in the heart of Qatar\'s capital. Ideally positioned just minutes from Doha\'s major business districts, government offices, Hamad Medical Corporation, Doha Exhibition and Convention Center (DECC), Souq Waqif, Aspire Zone, and the city\'s most popular shopping destinations, the hotel offers an ideal base for both business and leisure travelers. It is also conveniently accessible from Hamad International Airport, making arrivals and departures seamless for international guests.The hotel features **246 elegantly appointed guest rooms and suites**, thoughtfully designed to provide comfort, functionality, and a relaxing atmosphere. Whether traveling for business, conferences, corporate assignments, medical visits, or family vacations, guests enjoy spacious accommodations equipped with contemporary amenities, complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi, premium bedding, workspaces, and personalized service that reflects the renowned standards of Wyndham Hotels & Resorts.Grand Regency Doha is a preferred destination for meetings, conferences, exhibitions, corporate training, gala dinners, weddings, social celebrations, and government events. The hotel offers **855 square meters (9,200+ square feet) of flexible event space**, including the magnificent **Al Qasr Ballroom** and multiple meeting rooms that can accommodate intimate board meetings as well as large-scale events. Supported by experienced event planners, modern audiovisual technology, customized catering options, and dedicated banquet services, every event is executed with professionalism and attention to detail.Guests can enjoy a diverse culinary experience through the hotel\'s restaurants and lounges, offering international buffets, authentic Arabic and Mediterranean cuisine, freshly brewed coffee, pastries, and stylish evening dining. Whether hosting a business lunch, networking reception, executive dinner, or simply enjoying a relaxing meal, Grand Regency Doha delivers memorable dining experiences complemented by attentive service.For relaxation and wellness, the hotel offers an outdoor swimming pool, a fully equipped fitness center, spa facilities, beauty salon, and a range of recreational amenities designed to help guests unwind after a productive day. Guests can also enjoy **complimentary access to Doha Sands Beach in West Bay**, providing the perfect opportunity to experience Doha\'s beautiful coastline, beachside relaxation, and leisure activities during their stay. Additional conveniences include complimentary parking, concierge services, business support, airport transportation arrangements, laundry services, and 24-hour room service, ensuring a comfortable and hassle-free stay.As part of the prestigious Trademark Collection by Wyndham, Grand Regency Doha is committed to delivering distinctive experiences with personalized service, exceptional value, and genuine Qatari and international hospitality. Whether welcoming international conference delegates, corporate groups, airline crews, government organizations, sports teams, medical travelers, or leisure guests, the hotel consistently provides an outstanding combination of comfort, convenience, and world-class service.At Grand Regency Doha, every stay is thoughtfully designed to exceed expectations—making it the ideal destination for business, meetings, celebrations, and unforgettable experiences in the heart of Doha.','Jawaan Street, Al Sadd, P.O. Box 22606','+974 4434 3333',48,4,3148,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d15aeaf0bb16a6972e9dfed0c1d91e80.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_b1f0f76b7a998115eca1ec8d8bab6b9a.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_030f740227ec18cbb36840ef25dff199.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_2b58e98c0d7e8e70355ded9e7b809f77.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_416245bfff712111098e937af28ddf0f.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_cb215165880ec93db1cf5c00c834b947.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_aea456b0276304177f229252b41ed4f6.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_f622f7e07465b0986601fcdf9cd7ab44.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_4d6c8b5fbed949b94e3eb9adbe6c39bc.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_eebebede9992753a44ddc28968d790b3.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_c5894d956b30b87a5631e13788e53def.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_0b6dc92744f0ea8a1da4487ebb23723b.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_6bd6fa910fe8c347e51d7aa6696910cf.jpg\"]',NULL,'https://www.kayak.com/Doha-Hotels-Wyndham-Grand-Regency-Doha.131375.ksp','[\"Computer use available\",\"Electric kettle\",\"Business center\",\"Car rental\",\"Wake-up service\",\"Entire unit wheelchair accessible\",\"Wi-Fi available in all areas\",\"Internet\",\"Daily housekeeping\",\"Extra-long beds (> 2 meters)\",\"Fax/photocopying\",\"Family rooms\",\"Concierge service\",\"Cribs available\",\"Currency exchange on-site\",\"Fire extinguisher\",\"Gift shop\",\"Laundry facilities\",\"Ironing service\",\"Laundry service\",\"Flat-screen TV\",\"Meeting/Banquet facilities\",\"Mul