 upon arrival and promptly report any issues for quick resolution.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Pool\",\"text\":\"Guests enjoyed the pool under the stars, providing a relaxing and enjoyable experience. Consider planning some leisure time by the pool during your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Appreciate the Friendly Staff\",\"text\":\"Many guests praised the polite and helpful staff, particularly mentioning individuals like Miss Nirmeen, Mr. Yaseen, and Mr. Rintu for their exceptional service.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Transportation Options\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers shuttle services and is close to a metro station, making it convenient for exploring the city. It\'s worth considering these transportation options for ease of travel.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Peak Season Rates\",\"text\":\"Guests noted that rates may increase during peak seasons, so it\'s advisable to be mindful of this when planning your stay.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:28:57\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(192,21,'dusitD2 Salwa Doha','dusitd2-salwa-doha','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_f813caa9bbb71baa723ccc33a9038bc6.jpg','Along with 5 restaurants, this hotel has a full-service spa and an outdoor pool. Free WiFi in public areas and free valet parking are also provided. Additionally, a health club, a bar\\/lounge, and a snack bar\\/deli are onsite. \\nDusitD2 Salwa Doha offers 235 air-conditioned accommodations with minibars and safes. Each accommodation is individually furnished and decorated. Select Comfort beds feature down comforters and premium bedding. 49-inch flat-screen televisions come with premium satellite channels. Bathrooms include separate bathtubs and showers with deep soaking bathtubs, bathrobes, slippers, and bidets. This Doha hotel provides complimentary wired and wireless Internet access, with a WiFi speed of 50+ Mbps. Business-friendly amenities include desks and complimentary newspapers, as well as phones; free local calls are provided (restrictions may a