verages. If you like coffee, the Empire Coffee. shop in the hotel lobby offers several coffee-based drinks and also a good selection of beverages and snacks. They also have a 24-hour reception desk and ample free parking. Premier Inn Doha Education City is only 5-minutes from Doha Expressway and a 12-minute drive from West Bay, the city’s main financial district. The hotel’s location is 35 minutes from Doha’s Hamad International Airport. The newly opened Mall of Qatar and Doha Festival City Mall are 10-12 minute drive away. Qatar Foundation Headquarters, Sidra Hospital, Qatar National Convention Centre (QNCC) and Qatar Science and Technology Park (QSTP) are all within a radius of one kilometer. Local attractions in Doha include Gulf Mall, Souq Waqif, Corniche, Katara Cultural Village and Museum of Islamic Art.','Off Al- Luqta Street, P.O Box No: 17128 Education City Doha, Qatar','+974 4007 8333',31,4,3297,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_8741799c0f27a895979e56b5e1b8b4dd.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_484d3f09da602bbcd6fccb387ef92194.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_7f0b0e7202586d0773f036140a886020.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_b1f3042fdf817d3e138ff91623d00715.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_0e7c51ce7f4c8f12bbb6abec85d02dfb.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_85fddf5147d4e0464e99a387af73dcca.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_3f58143371e23d2b577e3f90ecc69290.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_dea667f1b637a2c47be504bda5de60c0.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_00b8c3df9001b284127d140074cb37cb.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_1d51f6d37d582484cd457b29ec026c43.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_776958bf87e5c6d1f197456f2cb3285a.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_962a2195d240c7b170d12abeb8c09500.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_76103d2a395d86d91a9d0574c739886c.jpg\"]',NULL,'https://www.kayak.