een cleaned a little better, suggesting that more attention to detail is needed. However, overall, guests have praised the hotel\'s cleanliness and the extensive cleaning protocols in place.\"},{\"question\":\"What can guests expect from the hotel\'s staff?\",\"answer\":\"The staff at Al Najada Doha Hotel by Tivoli are described as very welcoming, friendly, and helpful. Some guests specifically mentioned staff members like Sharif and Mars for their exceptional service and attentiveness to guests\' needs.\"},{\"question\":\"Is parking available at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Al Najada Doha Hotel by Tivoli offers free on-site parking and valet parking services, although one guest mentioned that the valet service could be time-consuming. However, the hotel\'s convenient location and proximity to the metro station make it easy for guests to explore the city without relying on a car.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the best times to visit the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The high season for visiting Al Najada Doha Hotel by Tivoli is in April, while the low season is in July. Guests can take advantage of the hotel\'s ideal location, close to popular attractions such as Souq Waqif and the Qatar National Library, regardless of the season.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests recommended booking a room with a balcony to enjoy the views of the fountain and the city skyline.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Location\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s proximity to the vibrant Souq Waqif market and the metro station makes it an ideal choice for exploring local culture and easy access to transportation.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Early Check-in Requests\",\"text\":\"Some guests experienced delays in early check-in despite prior requests, so it may be helpful to confirm early check-in arrangements in advance.\"},{\"title\":\"Enjoy the Breakfast Variety\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the extensive and diverse breakfast options offered at the hotel, catering to both local and international tastes.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Room Selection\",\"text\":\"Some guests suggested confirming specific room features, such as balconies, to ensure that the room provided aligns with the booking preferences.\"},{\"title\":\"Utilize the Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s location near the Souq Waqif market and close to Doha\'s downtown skyscrapers provides easy access to local attractions and stunning city views.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Note of Service Excellence\",\"text\":\"Multiple guests praised the helpful and attentive staff, particularly mentioning individuals like Sharif and Mars for their exceptional service.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Aware of Potential Room Cleanliness Issues\",\"text\":\"A few guests mentioned minor cleanliness issues in the rooms, such as broken items and delayed cleaning, so it may be helpful to communicate any concerns promptly to the staff.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Special Dietary Requests\",\"text\":\"The hotel was commended for accommodating special dietary requests, including gluten-free options, upon request, ensuring a pleasant dining experience for all guests.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan for Parking Arrangements\",\"text\":\"While parking is available, guests noted that the valet service for parking off-site could be time-consuming, so it may be beneficial to plan for potential delays.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:29:25\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(195,21,'Aleph Doha Residences, Curio Collection by Hilton','aleph-doha-residences-curio-collection-by-hilton','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_2dab8df58afd5fab2ef9fddacf013944.jpg','Located in the diplomatic district of West Bay, Doha, our hotel residences are close to the Doha Exhibition and Convention Centre and City Centre Mall. Our suites feature sweeping views of the Arabian Gulf and West Bay skyline. Guests enjoy complimentary access to Doha Sands Beach, the highest indoor pool in Qatar on the 52nd floor, and a modern fitness cen