with mobility needs.\"},{\"title\":\"Family-Friendly Amenities\",\"text\":\"Families appreciated the availability of kids\' meals, indoor play areas, and a kids\' club, making it a great choice for those traveling with children.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"Some guests noted noise from construction, particularly for rooms with a view, so it may be worth inquiring about potential noise disruptions.\"},{\"title\":\"Breakfast Experience\",\"text\":\"Guests praised the breakfast, describing it as exceptional and comparable to fine dining, making it a highlight of the stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Room Upgrades\",\"text\":\"Some guests were pleasantly surprised by complimentary room upgrades, so it may be worth inquiring about this option during booking.\"},{\"title\":\"Staff Friendliness\",\"text\":\"Multiple guests highlighted the friendly and helpful nature of the staff, contributing to a positive overall experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Public Transport\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s proximity to the Qatar Metro, mentioned in a review, could be a convenient transportation option for exploring the city.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:29:51\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(198,21,'Centara West Bay Hotel & Residences Doha','centara-west-bay-hotel-residences-doha','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_7975da7420b2e0f03f0f5cec649c68bb.jpg','This aparthotel features 3 restaurants, an indoor pool, and a health club. Free WiFi in public areas and free valet parking are also provided. Additionally, a bar\\/lounge, a snack bar\\/deli, and a sauna are onsite. \\nEach apartment provides a kitchen with a refrigerator, an oven, a stovetop, and a microwave. Conveniences include a washer\\/dryer and an electric kettle, and guests will appreciate thoughtful touches like bathrobes and slippers. Housekeeping is available on request. \\nCentara West Bay Hotel & Residences Doha offers 292 air-conditioned accommodations with washers\\/dryers and laptop-compati