endly\",\"room was amazing\",\"swimming pool\",\"good view\",\"everything is good\",\"great location\",\"good if the hotel\",\"room service\",\"food was not good\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What are the highlights of the hotel\'s amenities?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers a range of amenities including daily housekeeping, physical distancing in dining areas, and an indoor pool and sauna for guests to enjoy.\"},{\"question\":\"Is parking available at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, the hotel provides free parking and a shuttle service for guests\' convenience.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the food quality at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have praised the delicious and calm food, and the availability of food delivery to guest accommodations.\"},{\"question\":\"What are guests saying about the cleanliness of the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have appreciated the cleanliness of the accommodation and the prompt check-in service provided by friendly staff.\"},{\"question\":\"When is the best time to visit the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel experiences high season in April and low season in July, offering guests the opportunity to plan their visit accordingly.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests highly recommended booking a room with a view, especially for the fantastic and breathtaking views from the higher floors.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Room Maintenance\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned that certain rooms may require maintenance, so it might be beneficial to inquire about the room\'s condition before finalizing the booking.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Noise-Free Rooms\",\"text\":\"A few guests reported noisy air conditioning units, so it\'s advisable to request a room with a quieter AC system if noise is a concern.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s proximity to attractions like Doha Corniche, Souq Waqif, and the Museum of Islamic Art makes it convenient for guests to explore the city\'s key landmarks.\"},{\"title\":\"Inquire About Breakfast Variety\",\"text\":\"While some guests praised the breakfast, others suggested that the breakfast options could have more variety, so it\'s worth checking the current breakfast offerings.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Housekeeping Quality\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the cleanliness and thoroughness of the housekeeping staff, but a few mentioned minor lapses, so it\'s advisable to communicate any specific preferences or concerns with the housekeeping team.\"},{\"title\":\"Request Higher Floor Rooms\",\"text\":\"Guests recommended requesting rooms on higher floors for better views and a quieter environment.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Pool Access\",\"text\":\"Some guests experienced limitations with pool access and additional charges, so it\'s advisable to clarify pool usage policies and any associated fees upon check-in.\"},{\"title\":\"Inquire About Outdoor Pool Availability\",\"text\":\"Guests expressed a desire for an outdoor pool, so if this is a priority, it\'s recommended to inquire about the availability of an outdoor pool.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Room Upgrade Possibility\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned receiving room upgrades, so it might be worthwhile to inquire about upgrade options during the booking process or at check-in.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:30:02\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(199,21,'Intercontinental Hotels Doha - The City By IHG','intercontinental-hotels-doha-the-city-by-ihg','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_de09f2a8a1e2138e65696c197adb980c.jpg','Step into the vibrant heart of Doha at InterContinental Doha The City, a 58-story icon where business and leisure converge. Relax by the serene 46th-floor pool with breathtaking skyline views, and savor global cuisine crafted to delight discerning palates. Choose from diverse accommodations, from chic studios to luxurious suites, each designed for comfort and elegance. With modern luxury and exceptional service, every stay promise