\"Fair\",\"count\":111},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":58},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":82}],\"summary\":\"Guests consistently praise the hotel\'s excellent location, modern and clean facilities, and high-quality breakfast. Many highlight the attentive and friendly staff, though some report negative experiences with service, including issues with staff behavior and lost items. The amenities, such as the pool and beach access, are generally appreciated, but there are occasional complaints about maintenance, noise, and the gym. Overall, guests enjoy the comfort and atmosphere but expect improvements in service consistency and some facilities.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":9},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":8},{\"label\":\"Breakfast\",\"score\":7.5},{\"label\":\"Amenities\",\"score\":6},{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":1.5}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":9.1,\"reviews\":474},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":7.7,\"reviews\":3},{\"name\":\"Priceline\",\"score\":10,\"reviews\":1},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":9.9,\"reviews\":1}],\"mentions\":[\"nice hotel\",\"great staff\",\"swimming pool\",\"room service\",\"private beach\",\"great service\",\"location was far\",\"breakfast\",\"spa and gym\",\"amazing view\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What are the main amenities offered at Grand Hyatt Rio de Janeiro?\",\"answer\":\"Grand Hyatt Rio de Janeiro offers a wide range of amenities including daily housekeeping, contactless check-in/check-out, physical distancing in dining areas, airport shuttle, outdoor pool, spa, fitness center, and more.\"},{\"question\":\"What are guests saying about the food quality at Grand Hyatt Rio de Janeiro?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have praised the food quality at Grand Hyatt Rio de Janeiro, particularly the breakfast buffet, the Japanese restaurant Shiso, and the seafront dining at Canto Gastro e Lounge.\"},{\"question\":\"When is the best time to visit Grand Hyatt Rio de Janeiro?\",\"answer\":\"The low season at Grand Hyatt Rio de Janeiro is in March, while the high season is in November. It\'s advisable to avoid July/August due to school break and potential overcrowding.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the cleanliness at Grand Hyatt Rio de Janeiro?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have consistently praised the cleanliness at Grand Hyatt Rio de Janeiro, with many highlighting the beautiful and clean property, as well as the professional and friendly staff.\"},{\"question\":\"What are guests saying about the quality of beds at Grand Hyatt Rio de Janeiro?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have enjoyed the quality of the rooms and beds at Grand Hyatt Rio de Janeiro, with some mentioning the large and modern rooms, and the option to upgrade to Club Level for access to the Grande club.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Consider Upgrading to a Club Level Room\",\"text\":\"Guests recommend upgrading to a Club Level room for access to the Grande Club, which offers breakfast, tea, and drinks, along with a large and modern room.\"},{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the beach comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Utilize the WhatsApp Service\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers a WhatsApp service for guests to request any needs they may have, and guests reported that their requests were attended to promptly.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Potential Noise Disturbances\",\"text\":\"Some guests reported noise disturbances due to construction work and loud music at the pool. It may be beneficial to inquire about potential disturbances before booking.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Beach Facilities\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the structure at the beach, including beach chairs and sun shades, making it a great spot to relax and enjoy the beach.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel is located near several attractions, such as Pedra da Gávea, Floresta da Tijuca, and Leblon Beach, providing opportunities for exploration and outdoor activities.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Prepared for Crowded Breakfast\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned that the breakfast area could get crowded, and there were not enough staff to manage the crowd effectively.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Pool Availability\",\"text\":\"Before booking, it\'s advisable to check if the pool is fully operational, as some guests were disappointed to find part of the pool closed for repairs during their stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Avoiding Peak Seasons\",\"text\":\"Guests recommended avoiding peak seasons like July/August due to potential overcrowding and noise from school break guests.\"},{\"title\":\"Address Allergies and Sensitivities in Advance\",\"text\":\"If you have allergies or sensitivities, it\'s advisable to communicate this to the hotel in advance to ensure a comfortable stay.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:30:46\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(204,22,'Ibis Copacabana Posto 5','ibis-copacabana-posto-5','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_a1c16b827a036b87626fb966273eecd1.jpg','Ibis Copacabana Posto 5 is a budget hotel in an excellent location in Rio de Janeiro, just 5 minutes from Copacabana Beach and 1 km from the Rodrigo de Freitas Lagoon. Just 86 meters from Cantagalo Metro Station and 8 km from Santos Dumont Airport. Rooms have cable TV, AorC and WiFi. Safe room available on the ground floor and hallway. Breakfast includes bread, cold cuts, jam, juice, tea and more.','Rua Xavier Da Silveira 82','+55 213 721 2900',67,4,3441,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_a1c16b827a036b87626fb966273eecd1.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_5cebdd691a531390eeaed83f93d1fe9c.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_f107716c5a1468b414e5de6a93a39fcb.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d74a1eb7a0f77c03dc2868c3cbd30943.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_862b6ea10a45b2bee15370de7bd20ad9.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.