19 23:31:28\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(209,22,'Hilton Copacabana Rio de Janeiro','hilton-copacabana-rio-de-janeiro','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_a8b0bd97f91de1d53a7048770f01e73a.jpg','2 outdoor pools, a full-service spa, and a restaurant are available at this hotel. WiFi in public areas is free. Other amenities include 2 poolside bars, a 24-hour fitness center, and a bar\\/lounge. \\nChange of towels is available on request. \\nHilton Copacabana Rio de Janeiro offers 545 accommodations with minibars and safes. Each accommodation is individually furnished and decorated. LCD televisions are featured in guestrooms. Bathrooms include bathrobes, bidets, complimentary toiletries, and hair dryers. This Rio de Janeiro hotel provides complimentary wireless Internet access. Business-friendly amenities include desks and phones. Additionally, rooms include coffee\\/tea makers and blackout drapes\\/curtains. Hypo-allergenic bedding and change of towels can be requested. Housekeeping is provided daily. \\n2 outdoor swimming pools are on site along with a children\'s pool. Other recreational amenities include a sauna and a 24-hour fitness center. Children under 16 years old are not allowed in the fitness facility without adult supervision. The recreational activities listed below are available either on site or nearby; fees may apply.','Avenida Atlantica, 1020','+55 213 501 8000',145,4,3958,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_a8b0bd97f91de1d53a7048770f01e73a.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_989625c4d9f34655a66cd3e956ba59a0.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_5609e7d926f601dbe368811aac438600.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d8a599d86d82a6b5bcd766223f75ee66.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_1e61557ba5fd04581fc0f8b90c527e83.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_e3db8c9648798cf21ef926898a2679f3.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_7f8601fc4685c77cbc25db52c556558f.jpg\",\"http://trave