"Seating area\",\"Elevator\",\"Massage\",\"Pool bar\",\"Shower\",\"Shower chair\",\"Accessible parking\",\"Slippers\",\"First-aid kit\",\"Additional bathroom\",\"Alarm clock\",\"Soundproof rooms\",\"Bathtub\",\"Soundproofing\",\"Bidet\",\"Spa bath\",\"Flexible event space\",\"Breakfast in the room\",\"Tea/coffee maker\",\"Telephone\",\"Carpeted\",\"Toilet\",\"Safe\",\"Sauna\",\"Toothbrush\",\"City view\",\"Coffee machine\",\"TV\",\"Valet parking\",\"Desk\",\"Wardrobe or closet\"]',0,'[{\"question\":\"Where is Hilton Copacabana Rio de Janeiro located?\",\"answer\":\"Hilton Copacabana Rio de Janeiro is located at Avenida Atlantica, 1020 in Leme, 4 miles from the center of Rio de Janeiro. Copacabana Beach is the closest landmark to Hilton Copacabana Rio de Janeiro.\"},{\"question\":\"When is check-in time and check-out time at Hilton Copacabana Rio de Janeiro?\",\"answer\":\"Check-in time is 3:00 PM and check-out time is 12:00 PM at Hilton Copacabana Rio de Janeiro.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Hilton Copacabana Rio de Janeiro offer free Wi-Fi?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Hilton Copacabana Rio de Janeiro offers free Wi-Fi.\"},{\"question\":\"How far is Hilton Copacabana Rio de Janeiro from the airport?\",\"answer\":\"Hilton Copacabana Rio de Janeiro is 3.8 miles from Rio de Janeiro Santos Dumont.\"},{\"question\":\"How does KAYAK find such great Hilton Copacabana Rio de Janeiro hotel deals?\",\"answer\":\"KAYAK scours the web for all room deals available at Hilton Copacabana Rio de Janeiro in Rio de Janeiro and lets you compare them to find the best rate for your stay. Many different travel sites will offer discounts or deals at different times for rooms at Hilton Copacabana Rio de Janeiro and KAYAK will provide you with prices from a huge range of travel sites. That means that you can always find a great deal for Hilton Copacabana Rio de Janeiro.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Hilton Copacabana Rio de Janeiro have a pool?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Hilton Copacabana Rio de Janeiro has a pool onsite.\"}]','{\"score\":8.2,\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":3958,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":2074},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":676},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":502},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":255},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":184},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":94},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":173}],\"summary\":\"Guests consistently praised the hotel\'s excellent location, with many highlighting its proximity to the beach, attractions, and convenient amenities. The service from staff was often described as friendly and helpful, especially at the front desk. However, several guests noted that the rooms and some facilities were dated and in need of renovation, and cleanliness was a recurring concern in both rooms and public areas. The rooftop pool and views received mixed feedback, with some enjoying the amenities and others finding them underwhelming or too small. Overall, while the location and staff stood out positively, improvements in cleanliness and room updates were suggested.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":10},{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":8.5},{\"label\":\"Pool\",\"score\":4},{\"label\":\"Room Size\",\"score\":3},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":2}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.2,\"reviews\":821},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":8.5,\"reviews\":28},{\"name\":\"Priceline\",\"score\":8.5,\"reviews\":25},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":8.5,\"reviews\":1}],\"mentions\":[\"great location\",\"great breakfast\",\"friendly staff\",\"ocean view\",\"hotel great\",\"room was amazing\",\"copacabana beach\",\"rooftop pool\",\"early check\",\"hilton standards\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What are the highlights of the hotel\'s amenities?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers a rooftop terrace, outdoor pool, Jacuzzi, Turkish steam bath, sauna, and a kids pool. Additionally, guests can enjoy the on-site restaurant and bar, as well as the beauty salon and fitness center.\"},{\"question\":\"What practical information can you provide about parking and transportation options?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel provides parking, valet parking, and shuttle services for an additional charge. Additionally, there is a private parking option available. Guests can also access airport shuttle services for a surcharge.\"},{\"question\":\"What can guests expect from the hotel\'s food quality and dining options?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers excellent breakfast options, a variety of dining choices, and a rooftop bar. Guests can enjoy packed lunches, special diet menus, and room service. However, some guests have mentioned limited vegan options for breakfast.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the common concerns about the hotel\'s cleanliness and customer service?\",\"answer\":\"Some guests have expressed concerns about the cleanliness of the bathrooms and the need for renovations. Additionally, there have been comments about the hotel being rather old and in need of refurbishment. However, many guests have praised the friendly and helpful staff.\"},{\"question\":\"When is the best time to visit the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The high season is in February, and the low season is in June. Visitors can expect a convenient base when visiting Rio de Janeiro, with the hotel\'s location offering easy access to Copacabana Beach and various shopping, dining, and nightlife options.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests recommended choosing a room with a sea view or a front sea view for a stunning experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Room Upgrade\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned receiving complimentary room upgrades, so it might be worth inquiring about this option during check-in.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Room Cleanliness\",\"text\":\"A few guests reported issues with room cleanliness, particularly in the bathrooms, so it\'s advisable to check the room thoroughly upon arrival and promptly report any concerns to the staff.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Early Check-in\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated being able to check in early, so if you have an early arrival, it\'s worth requesting this option in advance.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Aware of Surroundings\",\"text\":\"While the hotel offers a great location, some guests noted the presence of homeless individuals in the vicinity, so it\'s advisable to be mindful of the surroundings, especially when venturing out at night.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Alternative Dining Options\",\"text\":\"While the hotel\'s restaurant received mixed reviews, guests recommended exploring nearby dining options for a varied culinary experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Inquire About Complimentary Amenities\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned receiving complimentary amenities for special occasions, such as a piece of cake for a birthday, so it might be worth inquiring about such gestures for celebrations.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Room Upkeep\",\"text\":\"A few guests reported issues with room maintenance, such as outdated facilities and a need for renovations, so it\'s advisable to check for recent updates or refurbishments.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s proximity to attractions like Copacabana Beach and Pão de Açúcar makes it convenient for sightseeing, so consider planning visits to these nearby landmarks.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Cautious with Additional Charges\",\"text\":\"Some guests reported unexpected additional charges, such as higher-than-expected rates and pricey shuttle services, so it\'s advisable to clarify all costs upfront to avoid surprises.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:31:33\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL);
INSERT INTO `hotels` VALUES (210,22,'Windsor Oceanico','windsor-oceanico','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_5535d732a2f9b3ca5bfb955523a093f4.jpg','Along with an outdoor pool, this hotel has a restaurant and 2 bars\\/lounges. WiFi in public areas is free. Additionally, a fitness center, a poolside bar, and a sauna are onsite. \\nChange of towels is available on request. \\nWindsor Oceanico offers 447 air-conditioned accommodations with minibars and safes. 42-inch LCD televisions come with cable channels. Bathrooms include complimentary toiletries and hair dryers. Guests can surf the web using the complimentary wireless Internet access. Business-friendly amenities include desks and phones. Irons\\/ironing boards, change of towels, and change of bedsheets can be requested. Housekeeping is provided daily. \\nRecreational amenities at the hotel include an outdoor pool, a sauna, and a fitness center. The recreational activities listed below are available either on site or nearby; fees may apply.','Rua Martinho de Mesquita 129','+55 212 195 9950',87,4,6458,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_5535d732a2f9b3ca5bfb955523a093f4.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_4fe1bdbe7a13cd9ae893351f491fe3fc.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_7417a08e552b7f138a2daebf2d29ec89.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_10d9415a8abcf5ccdbb59d295da42e11.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d7413d93a0322c1f511f749d4be2c6d0.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_1ac53291cbd9546a4bde8ddb028032c2.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_221b90ce6158392c56b8801aeb14a702.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_5b8d5ef9f73e492682f9c4b1eaa17493.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_aa54d1128eb5041e4c535cbfe058cfe5.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_df1427ed1d15d87cce111a09c7a3f8e5.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_92487ea0e36573c8429b5300376d57b7.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/medi