,\"Sauna\",\"City view\",\"Trash cans\",\"TV\",\"Upper floors accessible by elevator\",\"Conditioner\",\"Valet parking\",\"Desk\",\"Dining area\",\"Dining table\",\"Wardrobe or closet\"]',0,'[{\"question\":\"Where is Windsor Oceanico located?\",\"answer\":\"Windsor Oceanico is located at Rua Martinho de Mesquita 129 in Barra da Tijuca, 11.3 miles from the center of Rio de Janeiro. Floresta da Tijuca is the closest landmark to Windsor Oceanico.\"},{\"question\":\"When is check-in time and check-out time at Windsor Oceanico?\",\"answer\":\"Check-in time is 3:00 PM and check-out time is 12:00 PM at Windsor Oceanico.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Windsor Oceanico offer free Wi-Fi?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Windsor Oceanico offers free Wi-Fi.\"},{\"question\":\"How far is Windsor Oceanico from the airport?\",\"answer\":\"Windsor Oceanico is 12.3 miles from Rio de Janeiro Santos Dumont.\"},{\"question\":\"How does KAYAK find such great Windsor Oceanico hotel deals?\",\"answer\":\"KAYAK scours the web for all room deals available at Windsor Oceanico in Rio de Janeiro and lets you compare them to find the best rate for your stay. Many different travel sites will offer discounts or deals at different times for rooms at Windsor Oceanico and KAYAK will provide you with prices from a huge range of travel sites. That means that you can always find a great deal for Windsor Oceanico.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Windsor Oceanico have a pool?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Windsor Oceanico has a pool onsite.\"}]','{\"score\":8.7,\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":6458,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":3997},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":1191},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":622},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":252},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":179},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":81},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":136}],\"summary\":\"Guests consistently praised the hotel\'s excellent location, making it convenient for both business and leisure travelers. The breakfast was frequently highlighted as varied and delicious. Many guests found the beds to be comfortable, contributing to a restful stay. However, some reviews mentioned issues with service responsiveness and cleanliness, particularly in bathrooms and room maintenance. While the atmosphere and amenities were generally appreciated, a few guests felt the value for price could be improved and noted occasional problems with Wi-Fi and gym facilities.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":10},{\"label\":\"Breakfast\",\"score\":9.5},{\"label\":\"Bed Comfort\",\"score\":8.5},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":5},{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":5}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.7,\"reviews\":493},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":8.8,\"reviews\":27},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":10,\"reviews\":1}],\"mentions\":[\"breakfast was good\",\"room was excellent\",\"rooftop pool\",\"barra beach\",\"friendly staff\",\"nice hotel\",\"great location\",\"ocean view\",\"free water\",\"tijuca\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What are the hotel\'s unique offerings?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers a rooftop pool with a panoramic view of the ocean, a hammam, and a location just a few minutes\' walk from the beach. Additionally, the hotel provides beach access and beach towels for guests.\"},{\"question\":\"Is parking available at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, the hotel offers parking and valet parking services for guests, providing convenience and security for those traveling by car.\"},{\"question\":\"What can guests expect from the breakfast?\",\"answer\":\"Guests can expect a good buffet breakfast with a variety of options, including multiple breakfast choices, comfortable and clean rooms, and helpful staff who speak Spanish when needed.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the cleanliness of the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel is described as new, clean, and tidy, with spacious rooms, a great shower, and exceptional staff who are helpful and friendly. Additionally, the hotel provides daily housekeeping and follows enhanced cleaning and disinfection protocols.\"},{\"question\":\"When is the best time to visit the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel is well-suited for low season visits in June, offering a modern and well-located experience. However, guests should be aware that the pool area may be overcrowded during busy times, and the hotel may experience long check-in times.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the ocean comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Low Season Visits\",\"text\":\"June is mentioned as the low season, which could be a great time to visit for a more relaxed experience with fewer crowds.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel is conveniently located near various attractions such as Pedra da Gávea, Floresta da Tijuca, and Leblon Beach, providing ample opportunities for exploration.\"},{\"title\":\"Check Room Amenities\",\"text\":\"Some guests noted that the rooms were well-equipped with amenities such as spacious bathrooms, comfortable beds, and clean facilities, ensuring a pleasant stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Check-in Time\",\"text\":\"A few guests mentioned that the check-in process took longer than expected, so it might be helpful to anticipate potential delays during check-in.\"},{\"title\":\"Utilize the Rooftop Pool\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the rooftop pool with its panoramic ocean view, making it a great spot for relaxation and enjoying the scenery.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Transportation\",\"text\":\"While the hotel provides beach access and bicycle rental, it\'s advisable to consider transportation options for exploring attractions further away from the immediate vicinity.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Gym\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers a fitness center, which could be a convenient option for guests looking to maintain their workout routine during their stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan for High Season\",\"text\":\"February is highlighted as the high season, so guests planning to visit during this time should be prepared for potentially larger crowds and higher activity levels.\"},{\"title\":\"Communicate Room Preferences\",\"text\":\"Some guests experienced issues with room allocation, so it might be beneficial to communicate specific room preferences in advance to ensure a satisfactory accommodation.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:31:39\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(211,22,'ibis Rio de Janeiro Shopping Nova America','ibis-rio-de-janeiro-shopping-nova-america','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_eb1e66fd440ef09ff0ac1d0bc3f700b8.jpg','Ibis Shopping Nova America is the ideal choice for guests looking for comfort, great value and a strategic location in Rio de Janeiro, whether traveling for work or leisure. Connected to Shopping Nova America, it offers the convenience of having a wide range of shops, restaurants and services nearby. It is also next to Del Castilho metro station, providing quick and easy access to the city center, the main sights and different parts of the capital.','Av. Pastor Marthin Luther King Jr, 126','+55 213 282 2300',52,4,2537,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_eb1e66fd440ef09ff0ac1d0bc3f700b8.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_0bad8abf8560634241f1341ee46f73b0.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_60af7d480ebbe53101aa9025cd3b0390.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_eadff1c9556fab206b834ddd470eb2b7.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_13b8151b5d77353f176320f8f93e2bd6.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_4f21630fa95d12b577bbe72a7557ea86.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_c2087d12ff030c2e413048351fd22eec.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_635903ec322a39811ac5a1a849d9febd.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_e2f0fd081445d25a5fb511eea121217b.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.te