e is a priority, it\'s advisable to consider this aspect when booking.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan for Early Check-In\",\"text\":\"Some guests appreciated the option for early check-in, so if you have specific arrival time requirements, it\'s worth inquiring about this service in advance.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"While the hotel offers soundproof rooms, a few guests mentioned that noise from neighboring rooms or the street could still be audible. Light sleepers may want to take this into account.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Free Breakfast\",\"text\":\"Many guests praised the complimentary breakfast, highlighting it as a convenient and cost-saving perk. It\'s recommended to take advantage of this offering during your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Inquire About Room Cleaning\",\"text\":\"A few guests reported issues with room cleanliness. It may be beneficial to inquire about the hotel\'s cleaning protocols and frequency during your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Dining Options\",\"text\":\"The hotel has several eateries on-site and nearby, offering a variety of dining choices. Guests can explore options such as Amadai Sushi, Le Bel Noir, Rio Vegano, Ziza, and Panda’s for a diverse culinary experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Utilize the 24-Hour Reception\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s 24-hour reception and multilingual staff were praised by guests for their helpfulness and responsiveness. Take advantage of this service for any assistance or inquiries during your stay.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:32:42\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(219,23,'Exe Hotel Colón','exe-hotel-colon','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_e7643193e55d23ac238d1fd49b2be46a.jpg','A health club, a conference center, and a business center are available at this hotel. WiFi in public areas is free. Other amenities include conference space, concierge services, and dry cleaning. \\nHousekeeping is available on request. \\nExe Hotel Colón offers 173 accommodations with minibars and saf