e rooms to be smaller than expected and encountered issues with amenities such as the shower and air conditioning. It may be helpful to consider room size and facilities based on personal preferences and needs.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:33:24\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(224,23,'NH Buenos Aires City','nh-buenos-aires-city','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_087af253886225d4436d1b12ed04ba09.jpg','The 5-star NH Buenos Aires City is in the center of historic Buenos Aires and close to the Puerto Madero waterfront. Its 1930s art deco façade fits in beautifully with its surroundings, with the Plaza de Mayo, Cabildo and Casa Rosada all nearby. There are plenty of other cultural attractions just a short walk away too, like the Museo Histórico Nacional and Catedral Metropolitana. Head for the shopping along Florida Street or walk on just a little further to the pretty cobbled streets of San Telmo. Just outside the NH Buenos Aires City you will find public transport to take you to all corners of the city. Take your pick from one of our 369 rooms, presented in modern décor or traditional style. Our 24-hour gym is free to use and after a workout you can enjoy a cool dip in our stylish rooftop pool during the summer months. The NH Buenos Aires City restaurant offers an innovative menu of international and Spanish cuisine, and The Lobby bar is open 24 hours a day. Our function and meeting rooms hold up to 500 people. And there’s scope for a beautiful wedding in a modern space filled with natural light with up to 350 guests.','Bolivar 160','+54 114 121 6464',73,4,3763,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_087af253886225d4436d1b12ed04ba09.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_0cbbd7bb32a27f83174eec93d701b456.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_df927629769beb10094619340045d56f.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_f192c79824c0c9783d8e203f26cf6aaa.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_c07316ba89f56180015a92d878f3335b.