uests have praised the hotel\'s breakfast for its great options and delicious coffee, making it a delightful start to the day.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the common concerns about the hotel\'s rooms?\",\"answer\":\"Some guests have mentioned that the rooms felt outdated and in need of renovation, with concerns about cleanliness, outdated decor, and noisy air conditioning.\"},{\"question\":\"What practical amenities does the hotel offer for business travelers?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel provides superb facilities for business meetings and events, as well as a business center, meeting/banquet facilities, and fax/photocopying services.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the hotel\'s rooftop pool area a popular feature?\",\"answer\":\"While the rooftop pool is a notable feature, some guests have expressed disappointment about its size and availability, mentioning that it was closed on certain days.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the nearby attractions such as Plaza de Mayo and Casa Rosada comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Room Selection Carefully\",\"text\":\"Some guests experienced issues with room allocation, particularly when specific room types were requested in advance. It may be beneficial to reconfirm room preferences closer to the check-in date to avoid any inconveniences.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Rooftop Pool\",\"text\":\"While some guests found the rooftop pool to be small, many appreciated the opportunity to relax and enjoy the views. Consider visiting the pool during less busy times for a more peaceful experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Check-in Times\",\"text\":\"Several guests encountered delays during the check-in process, especially during peak times. Arriving at the hotel with the expectation of potential wait times can help manage any inconvenience.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s proximity to Plaza de Mayo, Casa Rosada, and other notable landmarks makes it an ideal base for sightseeing. Take advantage of the convenient location to explore the city\'s rich history and architecture.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Alternative Dining Options\",\"text\":\"While the hotel offers dining facilities, some guests found the prices to be on the higher side. Exploring nearby dining options may provide a more cost-effective and diverse culinary experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Communicate Special Requests in Advance\",\"text\":\"Based on guest feedback, it\'s advisable to communicate any special requests, such as room preferences or early check-in, directly with the hotel in advance to ensure a smoother experience upon arrival.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Room Conditions\",\"text\":\"Some guests reported issues with room cleanliness and maintenance. It may be beneficial to inspect the room upon arrival and promptly notify the staff of any concerns to ensure a comfortable stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Utilize the Hotel\'s Business Facilities\",\"text\":\"For guests visiting for business purposes, the hotel offers a range of business facilities and meeting spaces. Take advantage of these amenities for a productive and convenient stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Manage Expectations for Service\",\"text\":\"While many guests praised the friendly and helpful staff, others reported instances of slow or unsatisfactory service. Keeping an open mindset and managing expectations for service may contribute to a more positive overall experience.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:33:35\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(225,23,'Midtown Boutique Hotel','midtown-boutique-hotel','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d1a00755487414de9e822ea9a380c923.jpg','Along with concierge services, this smoke-free hotel has a 24-hour front desk and tour\\/ticket assistance. WiFi in public areas is free. Other amenities include a front-desk safe and multilingual staff assistance. \\nMidtown Boutique Hotel offers 81 accommodations with laptop-compatible safes and hair dryers. Each accommodation is individually furnished and decorated. Pillowtop beds feature down comforters. 32-inch LCD televisions come with premium cable channels and pay movies. Bathrooms include shower\\/tub combinations with rainfall showerheads, bidets, and complimentary toiletries. This Buenos Aires hotel provides complimentary wireless Internet access. Business-friendly amenities include desks and phones. A nightly turndown service is provided and housekeeping is offered daily. Amenities available on request include irons\\/ironing boards.','Diagonal R. Saenz Pena 1174','+54 112 078 5140',36,4,7357,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d1a00755487414de9e822ea9a380c923.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_9a22cd7d2c7c45e0b0aa1f839e9d9416.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_9af30cd062fafefa76f0ae202928e2ed.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_f20696727ce65e10de0c161118a5b019.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_4cc37f8b6060c1e7c1b173535786adc8.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_89f41944307af6241f9293ebcf79ebee.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_6a70fe1d0c618bfed763cf5e9305c4e3.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_47f0e3ea2a5c3f4b606c79b133b910d7.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_751ad7ff23bf2b5c04d6c7d59c48aac6.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_5a857a013d504cc32b7f48d513b21026.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_4890afbf7824f257bf83c4aa98c91c17.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_bdbd96f7091a6c94379b79f04d090230.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_63c5fc093e1165dbe907c28f37b65251.jpg\"]',NULL,'https://www.kayak.com/Buenos-Aires-Hotels-Unique-Executive-Central.96210.ksp','[\"Quiet street view\",\"Free Wi-Fi\",\"Babysitting or child care\",\"Wake-up service\",\"Wi-Fi available in all areas\",\"Internet\",\"Daily housekeep