K find such great Midtown Boutique Hotel hotel deals?\",\"answer\":\"KAYAK scours the web for all room deals available at Midtown Boutique Hotel in Buenos Aires and lets you compare them to find the best rate for your stay. Many different travel sites will offer discounts or deals at different times for rooms at Midtown Boutique Hotel and KAYAK will provide you with prices from a huge range of travel sites. That means that you can always find a great deal for Midtown Boutique Hotel.\"}]','{\"score\":8.1,\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":7357,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":2747},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":1181},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":1109},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":626},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":697},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":341},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":656}],\"summary\":\"Most guests highly appreciate the hotel\'s central location, making it convenient for exploring the city. The breakfast receives positive remarks for its variety and quality. However, many reviews mention discomfort with the beds, noting old or worn mattresses. Cleanliness and maintenance are also recurring concerns, with several guests reporting issues in rooms and bathrooms. Room sizes are often described as small or cramped, especially for triple accommodations. Despite these drawbacks, the location and breakfast stand out as the hotel\'s main strengths.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":10},{\"label\":\"Breakfast\",\"score\":8.5},{\"label\":\"Room Size\",\"score\":2.5},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":2},{\"label\":\"Bed Comfort\",\"score\":1.5}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.1,\"reviews\":400},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":7.8,\"reviews\":19},{\"name\":\"Priceline\",\"score\":5,\"reviews\":1},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":7.8,\"reviews\":1}],\"mentions\":[\"good location\",\"nice room\",\"hotel is old\",\"staff was very helpful\",\"good about this hotel\",\"breakfast was good\",\"obelisco\",\"bad service\",\"front desk\",\"extra bed\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What are the pros of staying at Unique Executive Central?\",\"answer\":\"Excellent location and good value. Very friendly, helpful staff. Comfortable hotel and kind staff. Localization and facilities. Breakfast was one of the best ones in Argentina. Really central!\"},{\"question\":\"What are the cons of staying at Unique Executive Central?\",\"answer\":\"Old and dirty facilities. Faucets are very old and falling apart. Very old hotel not well refurbished. Bathroom with broken flush and non-working hairdryer. Elevator was old and not very spacious. Dodgy electrics, leaking valves, and old falling apart facilities. Mattress extremely old, very old building, and very Edgar Allan Poe look. The hotel was a hoax, old, in poor condition, and a disaster. Dripping faucets and view. The uncomfortable bed.\"},{\"question\":\"What practical information should I know about Unique Executive Central?\",\"answer\":\"Check-in anytime after 3:00 PM, check out anytime before 12:00 PM. Cancellation/prepayment policies vary by room type and provider. Low season in March, high season in July.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the nearby attractions to Unique Executive Central?\",\"answer\":\"Obelisco de Buenos Aires, 9 de Julio Avenue, Teatro Colon, Plaza Libertad, Plaza de Mayo, Plaza San Martín, Casa Rosada, Museo de Arte Hispanoamericano Isaac Fernández Blanco, Cementerio de la Recoleta, Centro Cultural Recoleta, Museo Casa Carlos Gardel, Museo Nacional de Bellas Artes.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the parking and transportation options at Unique Executive Central?\",\"answer\":\"Parking available. Airport shuttle (surcharge) and shuttle service (additional charge).\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room Away from Diagonal\",\"text\":\"Some guests reported noise issues due to the hotel\'s location on Diagonal, so consider requesting a room away from this area for a quieter stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Check Room Amenities\",\"text\":\"Before arrival, ensure that the room includes essential amenities such as a hairdryer, as some guests reported issues with missing or inadequate in-room facilities.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Payment Methods\",\"text\":\"If planning to pay in local currency, it\'s advisable to confirm the payment method in advance to avoid unexpected currency conversion issues at check-in.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Dining Options\",\"text\":\"While the hotel\'s breakfast received mixed reviews, guests recommended exploring nearby cafes and restaurants for a more satisfying dining experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"Some rooms may face a service area or experience noise from external sources, so it\'s worth inquiring about room locations to ensure a peaceful stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Verify Room Expectations\",\"text\":\"Manage expectations regarding room conditions, as some guests found discrepancies between the hotel\'s advertised images and the actual state of the rooms.\"},{\"title\":\"Request Early Check-in\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the flexibility of early check-in, so consider requesting this option in advance if arriving before the standard check-in time.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Cautious with Valuables\",\"text\":\"Exercise caution with personal belongings, as a few guests reported issues with missing items and malfunctioning in-room safes.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan for Transportation\",\"text\":\"If in need of transportation assistance, it\'s advisable to arrange for taxis in advance, especially if traveling with luggage, as no bellboy service was available for some guests.\"},{\"title\":\"Manage Payment Discrepancies\",\"text\":\"To avoid potential billing discrepancies, ensure that all charges, including additional fees, are clearly communicated and confirmed prior to check-out.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:33:41\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(226,23,'NH Buenos Aires Latino','nh-buenos-aires-latino','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_a063ae74cb93af003d08ab5ecd63206c.jpg','The NH Buenos Aires Latino hotel is conveniently located in the vibrant San Nicolas neighborhood. The Obelisco and the Avenida Corrientes, where guests will find lively restaurants and theatres, are only steps away. Also within walking distance are the Colón Opera House, Casa Rosada, and Plaza de Mayo. The subway stop is 50 meters from the hotel and provides great connections to the rest of the city, plus the Sheraton Convention Center is 20 minutes away on foot. There are 100 contemporary rooms at NH Buenos Aires Latino. Each comes with polished hardwood floors, while some of the suites have panoramic views over the bustling city. All rooms are equipped with free Wi-Fi. For breakfast there is an extensive buffet including cold cuts, cheeses, fruit, cereals, yogurt, and eggs cooked-to-order which can be enjoyed with freshly brewed coffee and tea. Guests can enjoy our tasty international cuisine at the hotel’s ground floor restaurant with its stylish understated atmosphere. There is a lobby bar if you prefer a casual drink. Stay on top of your workout and enjoy stunning views of the city at our top-floor gym and later unwind at the sauna. The hotel also has two compact meeting rooms for up to 30 people.','Suipacha 309','+54 114 321 6700',64,4,2505,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_a063ae74cb93af003d08ab5ecd63206c.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_e63be7316758d2823c302dbfe8af0643.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_8b0d81d8fce9c3e91367cc0acdcd1875.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_fee56d74038d3bad0e993bf0864cd911.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_0d9ff1fd5554f319669f4d1c88db3c11.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_2901d43b3f122d54ad82828dd05e7931.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_9c10a8416bde271aeb89f8607f8b6314.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_9a779479b1082831b13c2289b50441a4.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/