all Hotel offer?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers daily housekeeping, contactless check-in/check-out, physical distancing rules, hand sanitizer in guest accommodation and key areas, and use of cleaning chemicals that are effective against coronavirus. Guests can opt-out of accommodation cleaning, and the staff follows all safety protocols as directed by local authorities.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the nearby attractions to 1253 Recoleta Small Hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Plaza Libertad, Museo de Arte Hispanoamericano Isaac Fernández Blanco, Teatro Colon, Centro Cultural Recoleta, Cementerio de la Recoleta, Plaza San Martín, 9 de Julio Avenue, Obelisco de Buenos Aires, Museo Nacional de Bellas Artes, and Biblioteca Nacional de la República Argentina.\"},{\"question\":\"When is the best time to visit 1253 Recoleta Small Hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The high season is in January, and the low season is in March.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room on Higher Floors\",\"text\":\"Some guests reported noise issues on lower floors due to old elevators and street-facing rooms. Choosing a room on a higher floor might help avoid these disturbances.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Bringing Earplugs\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned noise-related issues, such as elevator noise and street noise. Packing earplugs could help ensure a peaceful night\'s sleep.\"},{\"title\":\"Check Room Amenities\",\"text\":\"Some guests found the rooms lacking in certain amenities, such as a hairdryer or a safe. It\'s advisable to check with the hotel about the availability of these amenities before arrival.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s location in Recoleta offers easy access to various attractions, including Plaza Libertad, Teatro Colon, and Museo Nacional de Bellas Artes, making it convenient for sightseeing.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Pricing\",\"text\":\"Some guests felt that the hotel was overpriced for the quality of service and amenities provided. It may be worth comparing prices with other similar hotels in the area before booking.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"Guests reported noise issues, including from the elevator and street, which affected their stay. Being aware of potential noise disturbances and choosing a suitable room location could enhance the overall experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Inquire About Breakfast Inclusion\",\"text\":\"While some guests expected breakfast to be included based on their booking confirmation, it was not provided. It\'s advisable to clarify this with the hotel before arrival to avoid any misunderstandings.\"},{\"title\":\"Verify Internet Reliability\",\"text\":\"Some guests experienced issues with the hotel\'s internet, particularly on higher floors. It\'s recommended to inquire about the reliability of the internet connection, especially if it\'s essential for your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Request Room with Updated Facilities\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the rooms appeared outdated and in need of refurbishment. Requesting a room with updated facilities might contribute to a more comfortable stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Alternative Accommodation\",\"text\":\"For guests seeking a higher standard of accommodation, it may be worth exploring other options in the area, as some visitors felt that the hotel did not meet the standards expected of a 4-star establishment.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:33:57\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(228,23,'Savoy Hotel','savoy-hotel','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_4918fb9341cb71028e7307746002a786.jpg','Savoy Hotel Buenos Aires has a palatial format of 5 floors, in which the 164 luxurious rooms are distributed. Framed in an early 20th-century style of construction and European details, it presents its categories: Classic, Deluxe, Executive, Junior Suite and Corner Suites.','Av. Callao 181','+54 114 370 8000',78,4,2494,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_4918fb9341cb71028e7307746002a786.jpg\",\"http://trave