 expectations, especially if you require specific items such as a water-boiling kettle or body wash in the bathroom.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Business Center\",\"text\":\"Executive guests can make use of the 24-hour business center, equipped with work desks, computers, and a printer for added convenience during their stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Room Size and Layout\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned variations in room size and layout, so it may be beneficial to inquire about these aspects when making a reservation, especially for larger groups or extended stays.\"},{\"title\":\"Relax in the Elegant Lounge Area\",\"text\":\"Spend time in the hotel\'s elegant lounge area, which many guests found to be a perfect spot for relaxation between outings.\"},{\"title\":\"Engage with Helpful Staff\",\"text\":\"The staff received numerous positive mentions for their helpfulness and friendliness, so don\'t hesitate to seek their assistance for a more enjoyable stay.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:34:06\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(229,23,'Dorá Hotel Buenos Aires','dora-hotel-buenos-aires','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_fd3dcb883e16c52084138249cf25b315.jpg','A restaurant, a bar\\/lounge, and a snack bar\\/deli are available at this smoke-free hotel. Free buffet breakfast and free WiFi in public areas are also provided. Other amenities include a coffee shop\\/cafe, a business center, and a meeting room. \\nDorá Hotel Buenos Aires offers 94 air-conditioned accommodations with minibars and safes. Each accommodation is individually furnished and decorated. Beds feature premium bedding. Televisions come with cable channels. Bathrooms include shower\\/tub combinations with deep soaking bathtubs and rainfall showerheads. Bathrooms are also outfitted with bidets, complimentary toiletries, and hair dryers. This Buenos Aires hotel provides complimentary wireless Internet access. Business-friendly amenities include desks and phones. Housekeeping is provided