ired and wireless Internet access. Business-friendly amenities include desks and laptop-compatible safes, as well as phones; free local calls are provided (restrictions may apply). Additionally, rooms include espresso makers and blackout drapes\\/curtains. In-room massages, irons\\/ironing boards, and change of towels can be requested. A nightly turndown service is provided and housekeeping is offered daily. \\nRecreational amenities at the hotel include complimentary bicycles.','Suipacha 1015','+54 114 312 5000',64,4,1052,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_64a93b1642e69cc7908e65b9b18a7718.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_20b075685907269c7baf831753d8a14b.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_417b96f2582261161614a43bbb2069b9.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_6f0a3104c421124313ed14446945d6ec.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_f26c3bb49e2dad6ea7e33125c42a4553.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_0e7a041b5315411eb0a0facc44f79872.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_0f53e48017f59229dca33fe24f090bff.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_9ef44a7b0c7ca76b48377022572d16a5.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_2e1ddace97345194ec1789eb031f4e68.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_093d2bd8a73fcd30c3abe245f57a278a.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_fae3f4faad4cb92380841de1268e2a4a.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_aac1913973cd688a6a4c949d9cb9390b.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_5098d92acfd69148c1e390824d0d6ce0.jpg\"]',NULL,'https://www.kayak.com/Buenos-Aires-Hotels-CasaCalma-Hotel.345352.ksp','[\"Window\",\"Babysitting or child care\",\"Electric kettle\",\"Car rental\",\"Wake-up service\",\"Entire unit wheelchair accessible\",\"Wi-Fi available in all areas\",\"Internet\",\"Daily housekeeping\",\"Concierge service\",\"Cribs available\",\"Feather pillow\",\"Fire extinguisher\",\"Laundry facilities\",\"Laundry service\",\"Flat-