 accommodating, providing great communication and helpfulness. However, some guests have mentioned that the staff could be more attentive and trained.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the hotel\'s unique amenities?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers a fantastic outdoor pool, a great fitness center, and a beautiful terrace/patio area. Additionally, the hotel provides board games/puzzles for entertainment.\"},{\"question\":\"When is the best time to visit the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The high season is in March, offering a great opportunity to experience the hotel\'s excellent location and facilities. However, the low season in May can also provide a more relaxed and enjoyable stay.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the fountain comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel is conveniently located near several attractions such as Plaza San Martín, Teatro Colon, and Casa Rosada, making it a great base for exploring the city.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Room Renovations\",\"text\":\"Some guests noted that while some rooms have been renovated and are modern, others appear to be older and in need of updates. It may be worth inquiring about the renovated rooms when making a reservation.\"},{\"title\":\"Request a Quiet Room\",\"text\":\"If you\'re a light sleeper, consider requesting a room away from potential noise disturbances, as some guests reported issues with noise from neighboring rooms.\"},{\"title\":\"Check Pool Hours\",\"text\":\"If you\'re interested in using the pool, it\'s advisable to confirm the opening hours with the staff, as some guests mentioned that the opening hours were not clearly communicated.\"},{\"title\":\"Inquire About Check-in Process\",\"text\":\"Some guests experienced slow check-in processes, so it might be helpful to inquire about this when making a reservation, especially if you have time constraints upon arrival.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Dining Options\",\"text\":\"While many guests praised the breakfast, some mentioned that the breakfast buffet had limited offerings. It might be worth exploring nearby dining options for a varied culinary experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Transportation Options\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers convenient access to the airport and provides shuttle services. It\'s advisable to inquire about these services in advance to plan your transportation effectively.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Room Amenities\",\"text\":\"Some guests noted the absence of certain room amenities such as a kettle or coffee machine. If these amenities are important to you, it may be beneficial to confirm their availability before your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Engage with the Concierge\",\"text\":\"Guests spoke highly of the concierge team, particularly mentioning a staff member named Anthony. Engaging with the concierge for recommendations and assistance can enhance your overall experience.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:34:43\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(234,23,'Hotel Plaza Central Canning','hotel-plaza-central-canning','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_aa7784f3c6ee1841674180eff8f00e81.jpg','4 restaurants, a health club, and 3 coffee shops\\/cafes are available at this hotel. Free on-the-go breakfast, free WiFi in public areas, and free self parking are also provided. Other amenities include a snack bar\\/deli, a business center, and a meeting room. \\nHotel Plaza Central Canning offers 51 accommodations with minibars and laptop-compatible safes. These individually decorated and furnished accommodations have separate dining areas. Pillowtop beds feature down comforters and premium bedding. A pillow menu is available. 32-inch LCD televisions come with premium cable channels. Bathrooms include showers with rainfall showerheads, bathrobes, bidets, and complimentary toiletries. This Ezeiza hotel provides c