nds, insulated windows, a mini refrigerator, and a coffee maker. Otherwise, consider the Standard Queen Room, which is slightly more affordable with more amenities. The Standard Twin Room features double beds and can accommodate up to 3 people. If you’re traveling with your pet, the Pet-Friendly Room offers a comfortable and welcoming space for your furry friend.\"},{\"question\":\"What dining options are available at ibis budget Sydney Airport?\",\"answer\":\"ibis budget Sydney Airport features an on-site restaurant, Ibis Kitchen & Bar. The restaurant has an all-day menu serving a range of delectable dishes, catering to various culinary preferences and offering a diverse dining experience. A breakfast buffet is served daily from 5:30 am to 10:30 am, and an a-la-carte dinner is available from 5:30 pm to 10 pm. The hotel offers a Grab n Go menu 24 hours a day. A small bar adjacent to the reception sells wine and beer. Meals are prepared from fresh, locally sourced ingredients. ibis budget Sydney Airport is also close to various restaurants and eateries, including Krispy Kreme, La Boca Bar and Grill, and Coward Corner Café.\"},{\"question\":\"What amenities does ibis budget Sydney Airport have for business travelers?\",\"answer\":\"If you wish to work or finalize some business deals during your stay at ibis budget Sydney Airport, you can access several amenities to simplify your work. The hotel offers business services such as fax and photocopying, which can be vital if you want to manage your work-related tasks during your stay. There is a computer station that you can use to check your email or work. Free Wi-Fi is available throughout the facility to ensure you stay connected while on the road.\"},{\"question\":\"What family-friendly amenities does ibis budget Sydney Airport offer?\",\"answer\":\"ibis budget Sydney Airport offers a range of family-friendly amenities to accommodate families with children and pets. You’ll find spacious family rooms with double beds that can accommodate up to four guests. These rooms have enough storage options for all your items. Laundry facilities at the hotel offer a convenient and efficient solution for parents traveling with children. The laundry room features an ironing board, a sink, free detergent, a dryer, and a coin-operated washer. Other family-friendly amenities include TVs, free Wi-Fi, and a vending machine that offers snacks and drinks.\"},{\"question\":\"Where is ibis budget Sydney Airport located?\",\"answer\":\"ibis budget Sydney Airport is located at 5 Ross Smith Avenue, 4 miles from the center of Sydney. Moore Park is the closest landmark to ibis budget Sydney Airport.\"},{\"question\":\"When is check-in time and check-out time at ibis budget Sydney Airport?\",\"answer\":\"Check-in time is 2:00 PM and check-out time is 10:00 AM at ibis budget Sydney Airport.\"},{\"question\":\"Does ibis budget Sydney Airport offer free Wi-Fi?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, ibis budget Sydney Airport offers free Wi-Fi.\"},{\"question\":\"How far is ibis budget Sydney Airport from the airport?\",\"answer\":\"ibis budget Sydney Airport is 0.9 miles from Sydney Kingsford Smith. ibis budget Sydney Airport is 27 miles from Western Sydney Intl (Nancy-Bird Walton).\"},{\"question\":\"How does KAYAK find such great ibis budget Sydney Airport hotel deals?\",\"answer\":\"KAYAK scours the web for all room deals available at ibis budget Sydney Airport in Sydney and lets you compare them to find the best rate for your stay. Many different travel sites will offer discounts or deals at different times for rooms at ibis budget Sydney Airport and KAYAK will provide you with prices from a huge range of travel sites. That means that you can always find a great deal for ibis budget Sydney Airport.\"}]','{\"score\":7.1,\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":9901,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":2026},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":2014},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":2010},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":1207},{\"label