s have praised the staff for being very friendly and helpful, ensuring a positive and welcoming experience during their stay.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the hotel conveniently located for transportation?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel\'s central location provides easy access to the metro station, making it convenient for guests to explore the city and its surroundings.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the fountain comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"Some guests noted that the hotel can be noisy at times, especially at night. Light sleepers may want to request a room away from potential sources of noise.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Free Breakfast\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the free breakfast buffet offered in the on-site restaurant. It\'s a convenient and cost-effective way to start the day.\"},{\"title\":\"Request an Early Check-in\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the staff accommodated early check-in requests, which can be especially helpful for travelers arriving in the morning.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Dining Options\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s proximity to various dining options, including a cafe and bar, was highlighted by guests. It\'s worth exploring these nearby choices for additional dining variety.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Room Size\",\"text\":\"Some guests found the rooms to be on the smaller side, so it may be beneficial to manage expectations regarding space.\"},{\"title\":\"Check Room Amenities\",\"text\":\"Guests recommended checking the room amenities upon arrival, as some mentioned issues with outdated or non-functional facilities such as TVs and air conditioning.\"},{\"title\":\"Utilize the Convenient Location\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s location near public transport, Central Station, and various attractions was praised by many guests. Take advantage of this convenience for easy exploration of Sydney.\"},{\"title\":\"Inquire About Room Upgrades\",\"text\":\"Some guests suggested inquiring about room upgrades for a more comfortable stay, especially for those with specific preferences or requirements.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"Some guests noted that the hotel can be noisy at times, especially at night. Light sleepers may want to request a room away from potential sources of noise.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:35:09\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(238,24,'Hilton Sydney','hilton-sydney','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_7c58184d2c0565864f77cceb816d0535.jpg','At Hilton Sydney, one address unlocks infinite possibilities.\\nLocated in the heart of Sydney, the hotel places you at the centre of the city\'s culture, dining and shopping. George Street is at your doorstep and the harbour is within easy reach.\\nEvery stay moves at your pace. Wake to skyline views in a room designed for focus or retreat. Bring the family in confirmed interconnecting rooms, made for holidays that everyone remembers. Host your event across more than 4,000 sq. m. of purpose-built space, flexible enough to accommodate everything from intimate boardrooms to grand celebrations. Train at Fitness First Platinum Pitt Street, then restore at Alysium Day Spa, two of the city\'s best wellness experiences, both within steps.\\nDine at Glass Brasserie, where European grace meets Sydney\'s pace. Head up to Zeta Bar for cocktails with a city view. Descend into Marble Bar, a heritage venue where live music and atmosphere run deep into the night.\\nFrom morning meetings to late night celebrations, business and leisure, energy and ease, all at one address.','488 George Street','+61 292 662 000',99,4,4478,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_7c58184d2c0565864f77cceb816d0535.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_3caf5525cef014e684001a7909528d73.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_960b30