://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_c5d7eb4c63e37d7442b48b0ffde77215.jpg','An indoor pool, a restaurant, and a fitness center are available at this smoke-free hotel. WiFi in public areas is free. Other amenities include a sauna, a rooftop terrace, and self parking. \\nThe Grace Hotel offers 387 accommodations with minibars (stocked with some free items) and safes. Beds feature Egyptian cotton sheets and premium bedding. 49-inch LED televisions come with satellite channels and pay movies. Refrigerators and coffee\\/tea makers are provided. Bathrooms include slippers, designer toiletries, complimentary toiletries, and hair dryers. This Sydney hotel provides complimentary wireless Internet access. Business-friendly amenities include desks and phones. Additionally, rooms include complimentary bottled water and irons\\/ironing boards. Housekeeping is provided daily. \\nRecreational amenities at the hotel include an indoor pool, a sauna, and a fitness center. Children under 12 years old are not allowed in the swimming pool or fitness facility without adult supervision.','77 York Street','+61 292 726 888',168,5,10722,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_c5d7eb4c63e37d7442b48b0ffde77215.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_a7dd6383b30fa22f351b0ee6a3537f20.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_1c36618eca11198ed68e427eb8f12e21.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_200b36cbf8ee6f6b0b63b26a60de989a.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_42dac1aababd6d2cba23120661abd669.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_efc5b2423fe8a0691e904213e956faab.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_dca5492187ace3a424546830f8626698.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_350b89e236a75a33bf95d887bab6ff13.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_c149cb8444b75d9d2146a63a724fa545.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_5ba0c394ed0067c75985e905fc5c868c.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d11b180fe78f6a0f63