nd the building\'s charm. However, a few mentioned noise issues, occasional unfriendly staff, and minor inconveniences with parking and facilities, but these did not overshadow the many positives.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":10},{\"label\":\"Bed Comfort\",\"score\":9},{\"label\":\"Room Size\",\"score\":8.5},{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":8},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":7.5}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":9,\"reviews\":9182},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":9.2,\"reviews\":220},{\"name\":\"Priceline\",\"score\":9,\"reviews\":34},{\"name\":\"HotelsCombined\",\"score\":9.2,\"reviews\":29},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":8.6,\"reviews\":2}],\"mentions\":[\"great location\",\"room was very comfortable\",\"staff were very friendly\",\"comfortable bed\",\"art deco building\",\"grace\",\"sydney cbd\",\"beautiful hotel\",\"room service\",\"darling harbour\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What are the amenities offered at The Grace Hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The Grace Hotel offers a wide range of amenities including daily housekeeping, an indoor pool, room service, concierge service, and an indoor lap pool.\"},{\"question\":\"What can I expect from the guest rooms at The Grace Hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Guest rooms at The Grace Hotel feature in-room climate control, flat-screen TVs with satellite channels, a minibar, coffee and tea service, and 220-volt electrical ports. The rooms also have floor-to-ceiling windows with stunning views of downtown Sydney.\"},{\"question\":\"When is the best time to visit The Grace Hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The low season at The Grace Hotel is in April, while the high season is in September. Both periods offer unique experiences and are ideal for different preferences.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the customer service at The Grace Hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The customer service at The Grace Hotel is excellent, with staff being described as efficient, polite, friendly, and helpful. The hotel also offers 24-hour front desk service for guests\' convenience.\"},{\"question\":\"What are guests saying about the cleanliness at The Grace Hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Guests have consistently praised the cleanliness of The Grace Hotel, describing it as very clean, modern, and well-maintained. The hotel\'s rooms are also highlighted for their cleanliness and comfort.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the fountain comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Complimentary Mini Bar\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the complimentary mini bar stocked with non-alcoholic beverages, providing a nice touch and added value to the stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Early Check-In\",\"text\":\"Some guests found that early check-in was available for a minimal fee, which allowed them to access their rooms ahead of the standard check-in time.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"A few guests noted that noise from nearby clubs and other guests could be a potential issue, so light sleepers may want to consider this when booking.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Dining Options\",\"text\":\"While the hotel offers an on-site restaurant, guests recommended exploring the variety of eateries in the surrounding area for more dining choices.\"},{\"title\":\"Utilize the Rooftop Recreation Center\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s rooftop recreation center with an indoor lap pool, gym, sauna, and steam room was highlighted as a great facility to take advantage of during the stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Room Refurbishments\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned that the refurbished rooms were particularly impressive, so it may be worth inquiring about the availability of these updated accommodations.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Note of Valet Parking\",\"text\":\"Guests found the valet parking service convenient, but it\'s important to be aware that there may be limit