\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":7.9,\"reviews\":313},{\"name\":\"HotelsCombined\",\"score\":8.2,\"reviews\":9},{\"name\":\"Priceline\",\"score\":8.8,\"reviews\":5},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":8.2,\"reviews\":1}],\"mentions\":[\"great location\",\"staff were friendly\",\"darling harbour\",\"bed was very comfortable\",\"view from our room\",\"buffet breakfast\",\"room was small\",\"value for money\",\"one night\",\"small shower\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What are the room types available at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel offers five different room types, including standard rooms with two single beds, a room with one queen bed, superior rooms with a queen bed and view of the harbour, superior rooms with two single beds, and a superior skyline view room with a double and single bed included.\"},{\"question\":\"What dining options are available at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel features the ibis Kitchen, a bistro serving international cuisine for breakfast each day, and offers dinner specials throughout the week. Guests can also enjoy cocktails at the iBar on the outdoor terrace.\"},{\"question\":\"What can guests expect from the hotel\'s location?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel is situated in the middle of all that Darling Harbour has to offer, with many attractions, restaurants, bars, and shops just steps away. It is also conveniently located near popular landmarks and attractions such as SEA LIFE Sydney Aquarium, Madame Tussaud’s Sydney, and Australian National Maritime Museum.\"},{\"question\":\"Is parking available at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, the hotel offers parking facilities, providing guests with convenient access to private parking and an airport shuttle service.\"},{\"question\":\"What are some common concerns about the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Some guests have expressed concerns about the cost of parking, outdated accommodations, and the need for renovations in certain areas of the hotel.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Book a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Sev