 options convenient and diverse.\"},{\"title\":\"Check Room Type Before Booking\",\"text\":\"Some guests were surprised by the room type they received, which did not match their expectations. It\'s advisable to double-check the room type before booking to ensure it meets your preferences.\"},{\"title\":\"Inquire About Balcony Locks\",\"text\":\"If staying in a room with a balcony, it may be wise to inquire about the functionality of the balcony locks, especially for families with children, to ensure safety.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Transportation Options\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s proximity to transportation options such as the light rail and trains makes it convenient for exploring the city. Consider utilizing these options for easy access to various attractions.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Renovation Noise\",\"text\":\"As the hotel is undergoing refurbishment, guests reported some noise disturbances. It\'s advisable to be mindful of potential noise during the renovation period.\"},{\"title\":\"Confirm Room Facilities\",\"text\":\"Some guests encountered issues with room facilities such as the air conditioning and kitchen amenities. It\'s recommended to confirm the functionality of these facilities upon check-in.\"},{\"title\":\"Utilize the On-Site Café\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers a convenient on-site café, which can be a great option for a quick meal or a relaxing coffee experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Updated Photos\",\"text\":\"Due to ongoing renovations, the appearance of the rooms may differ from the photos. It\'s advisable to check for updated photos to have a more accurate representation of the accommodations.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:36:34\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(249,24,'Rydges Sydney Airport Hotel','rydges-sydney-airport-hotel','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_92e4dd803d718068f587b2cff1cb1373.jpg','Along with 2 restaurants, this smoke-free hotel has 2 bars\\/lounges and a 24-hour fitness center. WiFi in public areas is free. Additionally, a snack bar\\/deli, a rooftop terrace, and a 24-hour business center are onsite. \\nHousekeeping is available on request. \\nRydges Sydney Airport Hotel offers 318 air-conditioned accommodations with minibars and safes. Beds feature down comforters. A pillow menu is available. 42-inch LCD televisions come with cable channels. Bathrooms include showers with rainfall showerheads, complimentary toiletries, and hair dryers. Guests can surf the web using the complimentary wireless Internet access. Business-friendly amenities include desks and phones. Additionally, rooms include coffee\\/tea makers and irons\\/ironing boards. Change of towels and change of bedsheets can be requested. Housekeeping is provided daily. Renovation of all guestrooms was completed in May 2023. \\nRecreational amenities at the hotel include a 24-hour fitness center.','8 Arrival Court','+61 293 132 500',42,4,7813,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_92e4dd803d718068f587b2cff1cb1373.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_0b78465fd63dd0aa239ffb46b655f0e4.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_4d4d760d3b07b3dde89a7235f401ad8a.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_ccb051576b899ff99a93d2de42a6c396.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_4fee4e5f8edffb589292092fadf80c12.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_a38925a0c6f0c38c7aa119d30e5cc915.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_6cc341cf6e721414286fbedabebe4f75.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_3dae8cd908a89b8ec808f507b9069640.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_36ec672e73f1d4fb257707d1f29b4dd5.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_8ffba8b94b6f7e613de0f0deee2cdcf5.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_66a578498ac3927973e29bea6753a702.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_6405a4c16b266af707f3b8a8317056c7.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_5195f88c1542bebf79e41052786de941.jpg\"]',NULL,'https://www.kayak.com/S