traditional American food and a large selection of craft beers, go to Rocks Brewing Co, a restaurant that is only a 10m drive from the Rydges Sydney Airport Hotel. If you’re interested in having a coffee-based drink or a gluten-free sweet treat, head to Black Star Pastry Rosebery, which can be reached by car in 13m, or by public transportation in 30m. Mary’s is a 15m drive from the hotel, and it has become known for its delicious burgers and rustic bar atmosphere.\"},{\"question\":\"What interesting activities are near the Rydges Sydney Airport Hotel?\",\"answer\":\"For those that would like to go on a relaxing walk and enjoy some of the city’s greenery, pay a visit to Sydney Park, a large area that is a 9m drive from the Rydges Sydney Airport Hotel. To see a concert or stand-up performance, there is the Enmore Theatre, a popular venue that can be reached by car in less than 20m and hosts nightly performances. To stay closer to the hotel, you can visit the Qantas Heritage Collection, a museum that is located directly inside of the Domestics Terminal of Sydney International Airport and contains artifacts and exhibits related to the airline’s history. (Prices checked 20/06/19).\"},{\"question\":\"Where is Rydges Sydney Airport Hotel located?\",\"answer\":\"Rydges Sydney Airport Hotel is located at 8 Arrival Court, 4.6 miles from the center of Sydney. University of Sydney is the closest landmark to Rydges Sydney Airport Hotel.\"},{\"question\":\"When is check-in time and check-out time at Rydges Sydney Airport Hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Check-in time is 3:00 PM and check-out time is 11:00 AM at Rydges Sydney Airport Hotel.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Rydges Sydney Airport Hotel offer free Wi-Fi?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Rydges Sydney Airport Hotel offers free Wi-Fi.\"},{\"question\":\"How far is Rydges Sydney Airport Hotel from the airport?\",\"answer\":\"Rydges Sydney Airport Hotel is 0.6 miles from Sydney Kingsford Smith. Rydges Sydney Airport Hotel is 25.8 miles from Western Sydney Intl (Nancy-Bird Walton).\"},{\"question\":\"How does KAYAK find such great Rydges Sydney Airport Hotel hotel deals?\",\"answer\":\"KAYAK scours the web for all room deals available at Rydges Sydney Airport Hotel in Sydney and lets you compare them to find the best rate for your stay. Many different travel sites will offer discounts or deals at different times for rooms at Rydges Sydney Airport Hotel and KAYAK will provide you with prices from a huge range of travel sites. That means that you can always find a great deal for Rydges Sydney Airport Hotel.\"}]','{\"score\":8.3,\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":7813,\"histogram\":[{\"label\":\"Wonderful\",\"count\":3813},{\"label\":\"Very good\",\"count\":1938},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"count\":1031},{\"label\":\"Okay\",\"count\":402},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"count\":305},{\"label\":\"Mediocre\",\"count\":132},{\"label\":\"Poor\",\"count\":192}],\"summary\":\"Guests overwhelmingly praised the hotel\'s location, especially its proximity to the airport, making it ideal for early flights or layovers. Many found the beds comfortable and the rooms clean and well-maintained. The breakfast and food options received positive mentions, though a few guests noted service inconsistencies, particularly at the bar and with amenities like towels. Some minor issues with noise and room features were mentioned, but overall, guests appreciated the convenience, comfort, and cleanliness offered by the hotel.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":10},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":8.5},{\"label\":\"Bed Comfort\",\"score\":8.5},{\"label\":\"Breakfast\",\"score\":7},{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":5}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":8.3,\"reviews\":4961},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":8.6,\"reviews\":628},{\"name\":\"Priceline\",\"score\":8.5,\"reviews\":45},{\"name\":\"HotelsCombined\",\"score\":8.9,\"reviews\":15},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":8.6,\"reviews\":14}],\"mentions\":[\"close to the airport\",\"great location\",\"great room\",\"bed was comfortable\",\"international departure\",\"early flight\",\"international terminal\",\"staff very helpful\",\"early morning\",\"sports bar\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What are the hotel\'s unique offerings?\",\"answer\":\"Rydges Sydney Airport Hotel offers luxurious, modern accommodations for leisure and business travelers, with free transfers to domestic terminals, a fitness center, 24-hour services, a rooftop bar, and 9 event rooms for conferences and special events.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the quality of the beds at Rydges Sydney Airport Hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The guest rooms and suites at Rydges Hotel are well-appointed with Rydges Dream Beds for a restful night’s sleep, ensuring comfort and relaxation for guests.\"},{\"question\":\"Is parking available at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, the hotel offers free airport shuttle service, providing convenient parking options for guests.\"},{\"question\":\"What can guests expect from the food quality at the hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel includes its own restaurant and rooftop bar, offering amazing views and good food options for guests to enjoy during their stay.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the cleanliness and customer service at Rydges Sydney Airport Hotel?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel provides daily housekeeping, professional cleaning, and staff follow all safety protocols as directed by local authorities, ensuring a clean and safe environment for guests. Additionally, the staff are extremely helpful and friendly, providing excellent customer service.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Book a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the airport runway and the Sydney skyline comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Joining IHG Rewards\",\"text\":\"Joining the IHG Rewards program before staying at the hotel can provide discounts on food and drinks, making the rooftop bar a more appealing option.\"},{\"title\":\"Opt for Early Check-In\",\"text\":\"If you have an early flight, consider opting for early check-in to avoid additional charges and ensure a smooth transition from the hotel to the airport.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"Some guests reported issues with noise disturbances, particularly from housekeeping in the early morning. Consider this when planning your rest and sleep schedule.\"},{\"title\":\"Utilize the Touch&Go Cafe\",\"text\":\"The Touch&Go Cafe opens daily at 4 AM and provides live flight information, making it a convenient spot for a quick bite before catching a flight.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Transportation Options\",\"text\":\"While the hotel offers a free airport shuttle, guests suggested considering Uber as a more cost-effective and convenient option for traveling to downtown Sydney.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Dining Options\",\"text\":\"While the hotel has its own restaurant and rooftop bar, guests recommended exploring dining options in the nearby airport terminals for a wider variety of choices.\"},{\"title\":\"Join IHG Rewards for Discounts\",\"text\":\"Joining the IHG Rewards program before your stay can provide discounts on food and drinks, making the rooftop bar a more appealing option.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Aware of Additional Charges\",\"text\":\"Some guests reported additional charges for early check-in and outlets for CPADS machines. It\'s advisable to clarify any potential extra costs before your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Security and Convenience\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s location within the airport terminal provides a high level of security and convenience for travelers with early or late flights.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:36:45\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(250,24,'Intercontinental Hotels Sydney by IHG','intercontinental-hotels-sydney-by-ihg','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_838947629ea9183bd40507408a88f79f.jpg','Nestled in the dress circle of Circular