 dining options received positive remarks for variety and quality. Room size and comfort, especially the beds, were also appreciated. However, some guests noted issues with cleanliness, inconsistent service, and understaffing. While many staff interactions were excellent, others were less satisfactory. Overall, the positives of location, breakfast, and spacious rooms stood out, making it a popular choice despite some shortcomings.\",\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"Location\",\"score\":10},{\"label\":\"Breakfast\",\"score\":8.5},{\"label\":\"Room Size\",\"score\":8},{\"label\":\"Service\",\"score\":6},{\"label\":\"Cleanliness\",\"score\":5}],\"providers\":[{\"name\":\"Booking.com\",\"score\":9,\"reviews\":2903},{\"name\":\"Agoda.com\",\"score\":9.2,\"reviews\":254},{\"name\":\"Priceline\",\"score\":9.5,\"reviews\":19},{\"name\":\"HotelsCombined\",\"score\":9.1,\"reviews\":8},{\"name\":\"KAYAK\",\"score\":9.2,\"reviews\":5}],\"mentions\":[\"great location\",\"staff were friendly\",\"room with a good\",\"view from our room\",\"buffet breakfast\",\"great hotel\",\"bed was very comfortable\",\"harbour bridge\",\"roof top bar\",\"circular quay\"],\"qa\":[{\"question\":\"What are the highlights of the hotel\'s location?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel is located in Sydney CBD, within walking distance of Martin Place, The Rocks, and Sydney Opera House. It is steps from Circular Quay, eateries, and nightlife options.\"},{\"question\":\"What can guests expect from the hotel\'s dining options?\",\"answer\":\"Dinner is served daily at 117 Dining, offering local and Asian specialties. The hotel also has a comfortable lounge bar for guests to wind down in the evenings.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the common compliments about the hotel\'s rooms?\",\"answer\":\"Guests often praise the comfortable beds, spacious and modern rooms, and the excellent view from the hotel, especially from the Harbour view rooms.\"},{\"question\":\"What practical amenities does the hotel offer for guests?\",\"answer\":\"The hotel provides a variety of facilities, including a sauna, heated pool, and car hire. Multilingual staff can assist with organizing tours and activities, and there is an express check-in/check-out feature.\"},{\"question\":\"What are some common concerns about the hotel\'s services?\",\"answer\":\"Some guests have mentioned issues with the cleanliness of the rooms and public areas, as well as slow service at the hotel\'s dining and bar areas.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Book a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the views from the rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the botanical gardens or the harbor comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Location\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s proximity to Circular Quay and the Opera House makes it an ideal base for exploring Sydney\'s main attractions. Guests appreciated the convenience of being within walking distance of transportation hubs and key landmarks.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Check-in Time\",\"text\":\"Some guests found the 3 pm check-in time to be late and inconvenient. Plan your arrival accordingly and consider contacting the hotel in advance to request an early check-in if needed.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Rooftop Bars\",\"text\":\"While the hotel\'s rooftop bar offers a nice experience, guests suggested exploring other rooftop bars in the area for potentially better options and variety.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Room Selection Carefully\",\"text\":\"Some guests found the bed mattresses to be too soft for their liking. If you have specific preferences for mattress firmness, it may be worth inquiring about available options or upgrades.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Mini Bar Prices\",\"text\":\"Some guests had difficulty finding the prices of items in the mini bar. It\'s advisable to inquire about this upon check-in to avoid any confusion or unexpected charges.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Prepared for Deposit Hold\",\"text\":\"Guests reported delays in receiving the deposit hold back into their accounts after checkout. Consider discussing this with the hotel staff upon arrival to understand the process and timeline for releasing the hold.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan for Breakfast\",\"text\":\"While many guests enjoyed the breakfast options, some found it to be average compared to their expectations. Consider exploring nearby breakfast alternatives for a varied experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Utilize the Gym Facilities\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the well-equipped gym, so if fitness is important to you, take advantage of the gym during your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Enjoy the Rooftop Pool\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s rooftop pool offers breathtaking views, making it a worthwhile experience. Take some time to relax and enjoy the stunning cityscape from this vantage point.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:36:53\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(251,25,'Cordis, Auckland by Langham Hospitality Group','cordis-auckland-by-langham-hospitality-group','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_c4f9a9c9c565b8f30e54129b44463eed.jpg','Along with a full-service spa, this smoke-free hotel has an outdoor pool and a restaurant. WiFi in public areas is free. Additionally, a health club, a bar\\/lounge, and a sauna are onsite. \\nCordis, Auckland by Langham Hospitality Group offers 640 accommodations with safes and complimentary bottled water. Beds feature premium bedding. A pillow menu is available. 55-inch LED televisions come with cable channels. Bathrooms include bathrobes, slippers, designer toiletries, and hair dryers. This Auckland hotel provides complimentary wireless Internet access. Business-friendly amenities include desks and phones. Additionally, rooms include coffee\\/tea makers and irons\\/ironing boards. Housekeeping is provided daily. \\nAn outdoor pool and a hot tub are on site. Other recreational amenities include a health club and a sauna. The recreational activities listed below are available either on site or nearby