ions\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s central location makes it convenient for exploring nearby attractions such as Sky Tower, Aotea Square, and the Queen Street Shopping District.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Special Offers\",\"text\":\"Guests were pleased with the proactive staff who provided discount vouchers and directions for local attractions. Inquire about any available offers or complimentary services at the front desk.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Parking\",\"text\":\"Several guests found the valet parking difficult to access. Consider exploring alternative parking options in the area to avoid inconvenience.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Spa and Wellness Facilities\",\"text\":\"Guests appreciated the spa, sauna, and indoor pool. Consider incorporating these facilities into your stay for a relaxing experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Dining Options\",\"text\":\"While the on-site dining received mixed reviews, the hotel\'s location offers access to numerous dining options nearby, providing flexibility for guests.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan for High Season\",\"text\":\"If visiting in December, consider booking activities and dining in advance due to the high season. This can help secure reservations and avoid disappointment.\"},{\"title\":\"Inquire About Accessibility\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers increased accessibility and wheelchair-accessible units. Guests with specific accessibility needs can inquire about these facilities during the booking process.\"},{\"title\":\"Utilize the Business Center\",\"text\":\"For guests traveling for work, the hotel\'s business center and meeting facilities provide convenient amenities for business-related activities.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:37:18\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(254,25,'Grand Millennium Auckland','grand-millennium-auckland','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_e4bd50a39839d78b3cba751f72ef48f7.jpg','2 restaurants, an indoor pool, and 2 bars\\/lounges are available at this smoke-free hotel. WiFi in p