nce of the airport shuttle, especially for early or late flights, so consider using this service for seamless travel.\"},{\"title\":\"Check Out the Nearby Dining Options\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s location near restaurants and a supermarket provides convenient dining choices, making it easy to grab a meal or snacks during your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"Some guests experienced noise from other guests, so it may be helpful to keep this in mind and consider requesting a quieter room location if noise is a concern.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Play Corner\",\"text\":\"Families with children can make use of the hotel\'s play corner, which offers entertainment for kids and a chance for parents to relax.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Walking to the Airport\",\"text\":\"For guests who don\'t mind a short walk, it\'s possible to reach the airport on foot, providing an alternative to the shuttle service.\"},{\"title\":\"Request Late Checkout if Needed\",\"text\":\"Several guests appreciated the option for late checkout, so if you have a later departure, it may be worth inquiring about this service.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:37:36\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(256,25,'Novotel Auckland Airport','novotel-auckland-airport','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_db1bf8d313663ca01407146fa1ca60e4.jpg','Enjoy 4.5 star comfort and convenience at Novotel Auckland Airport, located at the doorstep of the International terminal. Full-length soundproof windows give your stylish room natural light plus peace and quiet. Experience THIRTEEN50 Kitchen & Bar, a modern open space that welcomes both hotel guests and local visitors. Touches of tradition blend naturally with contemporary flair to create a space that evokes classic Kiwi fare with a twist of local, fresh and comfort.','35 Tom Pearce Drive','+64 9257 7200',138,4,5683,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_db1bf8d313663ca01407146fa1ca60e4.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/medi