tel.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s proximity to Aotea Square, Albert Park, and Sky Tower makes it convenient for exploring popular attractions in Auckland.\"},{\"title\":\"Check Room Amenities\",\"text\":\"Some guests found the rooms to be well-equipped with amenities such as a refrigerator, microwave, and tea/coffee making facilities, ensuring a comfortable stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Noise\",\"text\":\"Guests noted that the street noise could be disruptive due to thin walls, so light sleepers may want to consider this when booking.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan for Parking\",\"text\":\"If you\'re arriving by car, be aware that parking on-site is limited, and some guests found it challenging to secure a spot.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Room Size\",\"text\":\"Several guests mentioned that the rooms are compact, so if you prefer more space, it\'s advisable to inquire about room size options.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Aware of Shared Facilities\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers shared bathrooms, which were found to be clean by some guests, but others found them to be a downside.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Location\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s location was praised by many guests for its proximity to the city center, making it convenient for exploring cafes, restaurants, and nearby attractions.\"},{\"title\":\"Inquire About Wi-Fi\",\"text\":\"Some guests experienced poor Wi-Fi connection, so if this is important to you, it\'s advisable to inquire about the Wi-Fi quality before booking.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:37:53\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(258,25,'Lylo Auckland','lylo-auckland','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_fef33f052bf29df26e89b9e9760f686b.jpg','This smoke-free hostel features a restaurant, a bar\\/lounge, and laundry facilities. WiFi in public areas is free. Additionally, a 24-hour front desk, express check-in, and express check-out are onsite. \\nLyLo Auckland offers 297 accommodations. Guests can surf the