mended.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Free Shuttle\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers a complimentary shuttle service to and from the airport, which many guests found convenient. Be sure to inquire about the shuttle schedule upon booking.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Low Season Visits\",\"text\":\"If you prefer to avoid crowds, consider visiting in August, which is considered the low season. This could result in a quieter and more relaxed stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel is located near various attractions such as Cornwall Park, Auckland War Memorial Museum, and Auckland Zoo. Consider planning a visit to these places during your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Check Room Amenities\",\"text\":\"Some guests found the rooms to be on the smaller side, so it\'s advisable to check the room size and amenities offered before making a reservation, especially if you require extra space.\"},{\"title\":\"Inquire About Early Morning Coffee\",\"text\":\"If you\'re an early riser in need of a caffeine fix, it\'s advisable to inquire about the availability of coffee facilities in the morning, as some guests mentioned a lack of early morning coffee options.\"},{\"title\":\"Request Assistance Promptly\",\"text\":\"If you encounter any issues during your stay, it\'s recommended to seek assistance promptly, as some guests mentioned challenges in finding immediate help when needed.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"Some ground floor rooms were noted to be near the bar and shuttle bus entrance, leading to noise disturbances. Consider requesting a room away from these areas if you are sensitive to noise.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Note of Room Layout\",\"text\":\"Some guests found the bathroom layout to be less than ideal, with limited counter space and small sinks. Consider this aspect if you prioritize bathroom space and functionality.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Special Offers\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers various services such as room service, a business center, and tour desk facilities. It\'s worth checking for any special packages or offers that include these services to enhance your stay.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:38:11\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(260,25,'Edit Auckland Central','edit-auckland-central','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_1460fa781dce120fe05be81720448853.jpg','Discover the best of Auckland city by staying at Mercure Auckland Central. Strategically located in the heart of the Auckland CBD, our modern hotel features affordable downtown accommodation just steps from the Sky Tower, Britomart and the Viaduct Harbour. Whether you travel for business or a weekend escape, our versatile rooms blend style and total convenience so you can explore the very best of Auckland.','27-35 Victoria Street West','+64 9303 1333',51,4,7074,'[\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_1460fa781dce120fe05be81720448853.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_4b1618c30e59c12eab329013fd669f20.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_9a6561bfe83c7d38589c39bf2e434fe9.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_ae9c8d62a22adbcbb9bb5bd48d098d42.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_561cc4e6802f1044101be4e180139cfb.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_5880f38f62a7ffc9502e28c1b7555f61.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_beeb6097edc331574b55cfaed1be21d9.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_f0781a0bd71e713b96b26ce22c982637.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_4792834f8ade7a24f6817a4ae974ba69.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_78c3e2ae70b617fc32e19d13e7c9663d.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_d2b4060ffda1861d5e27549d52b4557c.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_835db0effe99df9aeb9921172cb32264.jpg\",\"http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_23fc866f77fe8d459a63b7cc61d620ec.jpg\"]',NULL,'https://www.kayak.com/Auckland-Hotels-President-Hotel.59281.ksp','[\"Window\",\"Wine glasses\",\"Babysitting or chi