shment and that the air conditioning in the rooms could be more efficient.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the hotel\'s unique offerings?\",\"answer\":\"President Hotel Auckland provides a convenient and central location, friendly staff, and spacious rooms. Additionally, the hotel offers a complimentary buffet breakfast, making it a good value for money option for exploring Auckland\'s CBD area.\"}],\"tips\":[{\"title\":\"Opt for a Room with a View\",\"text\":\"Several guests recommended choosing a room with a city view, especially one facing the Sky Tower, for a more enjoyable stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Noise Levels\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned that the hotel\'s location can be noisy due to roadworks and construction, so light sleepers may want to take this into account when booking.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Complimentary Breakfast\",\"text\":\"Many guests appreciated the included breakfast, describing it as delicious and substantial, making it a valuable perk of staying at the hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Room Maintenance\",\"text\":\"A few guests reported issues with room amenities, such as noisy air conditioning and malfunctioning fridges, so it may be beneficial to ensure that all room facilities are in good working order upon check-in.\"},{\"title\":\"Central Location for Sightseeing\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s central location was praised by several guests, making it convenient for exploring nearby attractions like the Sky Tower, restaurants, and shops.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Construction\",\"text\":\"Guests noted that the surrounding area is undergoing construction, which can impact access and noise levels, so it\'s advisable to consider this when planning your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Friendly and Helpful Staff\",\"text\":\"Many guests highlighted the friendly and accommodating nature of the hotel staff, providing a positive and welcoming experience during their stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Parking Options\",\"text\":\"Some guests mentioned challenges with the hotel\'s parking situation, so if traveling by car, it\'s recommended to inquire about parking arrangements in advance.\"},{\"title\":\"Spacious Rooms\",\"text\":\"Several guests appreciated the spaciousness and cleanliness of the rooms, making it a comfortable accommodation choice, especially for longer stays.\"},{\"title\":\"Accessibility and Nearby Amenities\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s proximity to supermarkets, dining options, and key attractions like the Sky Tower was praised by guests, adding to the overall convenience of the location.\"}],\"crawled_at\":\"2026-11-19 23:38:15\"}','0000-00-00 00:00:00',NULL),(261,25,'Horizon by SkyCity','horizon-by-skycity','http://travelvn.test/assets/media/kayak_6c44c425fa7fcd4af00d1ef8b2217d76.jpg','Horizon by SkyCity is a five-star 303 room hotel located in the heart of Auckland. Perfect for business and or leisure travellers who expect comfort, highly informed staff and modern and contemporary rooms.Imagine a place where glass blends into the sky, where technology knows what you need before you need it, where staff welcome returning friends. A place where business and pleasure walk hand in hand, where one switch turns everything off, where tried and true meets novel and new. A comfortable place where you can be with friends for a night out. or just simply be.Looking out, youll get lost in views of the worlds most liveable city, where cityscapes turn to landscapes in seconds. While inside, hints of Aotearoa can be found in every corner of your spacious room, from locally crafted furnishings, through to fresh New Zealand milk in the fridge.Whether youre taking care of business or taking care of you, youll find convenience, connection and comfort are all high on the menu.Weve left no stone unturned, so you have no questions unanswered. Because we understand that sometimes the small things are the big things. And weve taken care of them all.','85-93 Hobson Street','+64 9363 6000',86,5,1045,'[\"http