 rooms were spectacular. Opting for a room with a balcony facing the fountain comes highly recommended.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Room Location\",\"text\":\"Some guests suggested requesting a room away from the pool area if you prefer a quieter stay, as the pool can get lively during the day.\"},{\"title\":\"Take Advantage of the Airport Shuttle\",\"text\":\"The hotel offers a convenient shuttle service to and from the airport, making it a stress-free option for travelers with early or late flights. However, be prepared for potential delays due to picking up passengers from other hotels.\"},{\"title\":\"Check for Maintenance Notices\",\"text\":\"Before booking, it\'s advisable to check if any facilities such as the pool or gym are undergoing maintenance, as some guests were disappointed by unexpected closures.\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Nearby Attractions\",\"text\":\"The hotel\'s proximity to attractions like Auckland Zoo and Cornwall Park makes it a great base for exploring the area. Consider planning a visit to these attractions during your stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Be Mindful of Room Temperature\",\"text\":\"Some guests found the rooms to be quite warm, especially when the sun was shining directly into the room. If you\'re sensitive to heat, it\'s worth considering this aspect and possibly requesting a room with adequate shading.\"},{\"title\":\"Consider Dining Options\",\"text\":\"While the on-site restaurant received mixed reviews, guests found the bar food to be great. It might be worth trying the bar menu as an alternative to the buffet or a la carte options.\"},{\"title\":\"Utilize the Hotel\'s Family-Friendly Features\",\"text\":\"If traveling with children, take advantage of the hotel\'s kid-friendly amenities, such as the outdoor play equipment and swimming pool toys, which were appreciated by families.\"},{\"title\":\"Request Additional Towels\",\"text\":\"Some guests noted that there were only two towels provided in rooms booked for four people. It may be wise