at is perfect for couples, as well as several different dining options. The Secrets St. James is an adults-only resort with five stars, located on a large property overlooking the ocean.\n\nWhich hotels in Montego Bay have a good spa?\nLooking to pamper yourself during your vacation? Book a hotel that has an onsite spa, such as the Hotel Gloriana and Spa. The Hotel Gloriana is close to the airport, only a 12-minute walk from the beach, and offers rooms with balconies. The Breathless Montego Bay Resort & Spa is another choice that is all-inclusive and has a private beach club.\n\nWhich hotels in Montego Bay are particularly kid friendly?\nThe Sunscape Splash is a great choice for families, complete with water-park access and three different private beaches. The Hotel Riu is an all-inclusive choice that has both a pool and a playground specifically for kids. The Royal Decameron offers beautiful views of the ocean and has an onsite kids’ club.\n\nWhich hotels in Montego are ideal for a family trip?\nIf you\'re planning a vacation in Montego Bay with your family, you will love staying at Half Moon. You and your loved ones will feel right at home in the hotel\'s spacious interconnected rooms. Also, if you have a toddler traveling with you, the rooms have cribs available. The hotel also has a playground, a kids\' club, an indoor play area, and kids\' outdoor play equipment that will surely keep the young ones busy.\n\nWhich hotels in Montego Bay have a spa?\nIf you want to be pampered during your vacation, you should consider a hotel with an onsite spa. One such hotel is RIU Montego Bay. This hotel has a luxurious spa where guests can receive body scrubs, waxing, tanning, and aromatherapy. Guests can also cool off at the hotel sauna, once their done with the spa session.\n\nWhich hotels in Montego Bay are suitable for couples?\nLovebirds planning a romantic escape to Montego Bay will love staying at Secret Wild Orchid Montego Bay – Adults Only Unlimited Luxury. This adult