rhood.\n\nWhich hotels in Panama City are located in quiet areas?\nEl Cangrejo is located in the center of Panama City but has more of a residential feel and is generally a peaceful area of the city. The Hotel El Parador is in this neighborhood. Amador is a neighborhood made up of three islands, located off the coast of the city center and reachable by the Amador Causeway. Here, the Beach House or Amador Ocean View offer a quiet vacation within easy reach of the city.\n\nAre there any hotels in Panama City with free parking?\nThere are plenty of hotels offering free car parking in Panama City. Consider booking a stay at Occidental Panama City, which is close to major shopping areas. Another options is the Sheraton Grand Panama, with a casino, swimming pool, tennis court and business services onsite.\n\nWhich is the best hotel to stay with kids in Panama City?\nFamilies on vacation in Panama City with kids should consider staying at Bristol Panama, a Registry Collection Hotel. The hotel features spacious family rooms with at least five members with two beds. The hotel is conducive to the child\'s well-being, for it features a designated smoking area. Cribs are available for parents with toddlers, and other amenities include an outdoor pool, sauna, terrace, and indoor playing ground for the kids.\n\nWhere can I stay for an exciting golf experience in Panama City?\nIf you need an exciting golf experience in Panama City, consider booking a room at The Santa Maria, a Luxury Collection Hotel & Golf Resort. This hotel is around 8 miles from downtown and a 2-minute walk to Jack Nicklaus-designed golf course where you can attend golf classes comfortably. The hotel also features a golf yard, outdoor pool, hot tub, and city view.\n\nWhere can I stay for an exciting hiking experience in Panama City?\nVisitors on vacation with friends and family should consider staying at Holiday Inn Panama City, an IHG Hotel. This hotel is an 11-minute drive to St. Andrews State Park, an outdoor sanctuary with beaches and nature trails where you can have an exciting hike. The hotel features a heated indoor pool, hot tub, and local shuttle at a surcharge.\n\nAre there budget-friendly hotels in Panama City?\nTryp By Wyndham Panama Centro is a place you should consider staying for pocket friend fees. It features furniture rooms with excellent ventilation. You won\'t spend even a single coin on your breakfast meals once you stay in this hotel. It features an outdoor pool, hot tub, fitness center, and city view.\n\nWhich freebies do KAYAK users look for when booking a hotel in Panama City?\nKAYAK users look for a hotel in Panama City with free breakfast. Hotels with free breakfast in Panama City include Hotel La Compañía Casco Antiguo, The Santa Maria, a Luxury Collection Hotel & Golf Resort, Panama City, and Ramada Plaza Panama Punta Pacifica.\n\nHow do I find a hotel in central Panama City?\nAfter you launch a hotel search on KAYAK, you can refine your research by neighborhood, which allows you to pick the central Panama City districts. You can also do a search using the city map to choose a specific location, like Panama City city center.\n\nHow can I find hotels near me?\nTake a look at our extensive hotel map to find the best hotels near you.\n\nAre there Panama City hotels with free parking?\nThere are many hotels in Panama City that offer both parking and free parking. Popular choices among KAYAK users include Principe Hotel and suites, Hospedium Princess Hotel Panamá and Riande Aeropuerto Hotel & Casino.',NULL,0,'https://www.kayak.com/Panama-City-Hotels.18478.hotel.ksp','Nguồn: KAYAK','2026-11-19 15:42:56','2026-11-19 15:43:01'),(17,NULL,11,'Paris','paris','Paris, France','kayak_5099f30d3a63e86dcc121b995b155a1d.jpg','Where to stay in Paris?\nHotels adjacent to Eiffel Tower and in Le Marais or Clignancourt are usually very popular with KAYAK users.\n\nWhat are the best hotels near Eiffel Tower?\nEiffel Tower being one of the most popular landmarks in Paris, many travelers enjoy staying close by. Pullman Paris Tour Eiffel, Hôtel Mercure Paris Centre Tour Eiffel and Hôtel Eiffel Trocadéro are recommended hotels on KAYAK within walking distance.\n\nWhat are good hotels near Disneyland Paris?\nIf you are visiting Paris with your family, or simply love Disney, consider staying at one of the hotels in Disneyland Paris. The Disneyland Hotel is a great choice, as it is located next to the park, restaurants, and shops. The Campanile Val De France is about 3-miles away from all of the Disney attractions, but it is generally a more affordable option.\n\nWhat hotels in Paris have a good indoor or rooftop pool?\nThe Hotel & Spa La Belle Juliette is a popular choice that features an indoor pool and extensive spa. The Hotel Square Louvois is another great option with an indoor pool, and it is located close to the famous Louvre Museum. For a rooftop pool, take a look at the Hotel Molitor Paris - MGallery, which is a 5-star hotel near the Eiffel Tower.\n\nWhat are good hotel areas for young adults in Paris?\nThere are many hotel and neighborhood options for young adults in Paris, as youth hostels are very popular. The Montparnasse area is generally affordable and provides many options for nightlife. The Enjoy Hostel is a stylish yet affordable option that is conveniently located in the 14th arrondissement, not far from the famous Luxembourg garden.\n\nWhat hotel area is good for a romantic stay in Paris?\nIf you are planning a romantic visit to Paris, look at the many hotels located in the Montmartre neighborhood. This area is known for being charming, romantic and full of fun sightseeing spots. B Montmartre is a chic hotel located near Sacre Coeur and Parc Monceau. Hotel Des Arts is a reasonable choice that isn’t far from the famous sites of Montmartre.\n\nAre there hotels that offer free cancellation?\nYes, there are accommodations in Paris that provide free cancellation. They include Courtyard by Marriott Paris Roissy Charles de Gaulle Airport, the ibis Styles Paris Charles-de-Gaulle Airport, or the ibis Paris CDG Airport. If your plans are likely to change while in Paris, these are the hotels you should look into.\n\nWhich accommodations are suggested for travelers on a budget?\nSeveral accommodations in Paris can accommodate travelers on a tight budget. If you’re such a traveler, you should check out the Residence Banlieue Parisienne Neully, Adonis Paris Sud, Hotel Campanile Les Ulis, and Hotel Campanile Villepinte. At any of these hotels, you’ll get value for money. This is because although these hotels are quite affordable, they boast outstanding amenities. It’s worth noting that while staying at any of these hotels, you can visit attractions such as the Sacred Gardens and The Petit Palais.\n\nWhich hotels are suggested for trips to museums?\nIf you’d like to visit the Louvre Museum or the Jacquemart Andre Museum, you should consider selecting a hotel nearby, such as the La Villa Haussmann. The hotel boasts a bar/lounge, a restaurant, and an indoor pool. Alternatively, you can choose to stay at the Grand Pigalle Hotel, Hôtel Belloy Saint Germain, and Hotel Saint Dominique.\n\nWhat lodging options are there near Avenue Montaigne?\nTravelers intending to visit Avenue Montaigne for its dining options, its nightlife, or for the Eiffel tower\'s breathtaking views should consider staying in hotels close to Avenue Montaigne like Amastan, Hôtel Artus, \nCOQ Hotel Paris, or the Charles V hotel.\n\nWhich freebies do KAYAK users look for when booking a hotel in Paris?\nKAYAK users look for a hotel in Paris with free breakfast. Hotels with free breakfast in Paris include Relais12bis Bed & Breakfast By Eiffel Tower, J.K. Place Paris, and Hôtel Confidentiel.\n\nHow do I find a hotel in central Paris?\nAfter you launch a hotel search on KAYAK, you can refine your research by neighborhood, which allows you to pick the central Paris districts. You can also do a search using the city map to choose a sp