 NH Sants Barcelona is located in the same area and has a stylish cocktail bar.\n\nAre there good hotels near Barcelona Airport?\nIf you are looking to stay at a hotel right near the Barcelona Airport, you have several options. Both the Barcelona Airport Hotel, located only 1.5 miles from the airport, and the Tryp Barcelona Aeropuerto Hotel, approximately one mile from the airport, provide a complimentary shuttle service.\n\nWhich Barcelona hotels offer professional spa services?\nIf you\'re visiting Barcelona and want to take advantage of top-notch spa services, think about booking a stay at one of the spa hotels. These include Sunotel Central, Eurostars Grand Marina, and the NH Collection Barcelona Gran Hotel Calderón Resorts. You can make use of massages, manicures, pedicures, steam rooms, and haircuts, among other spa services.\n\nWhere is the best place to stay in Barcelona while in town on a business trip?\nFor business travelers visiting the city, one of the suggested hotels is the Travelodge Barcelona Poblenou. The hotel offers a business center with printing, copying, and binding services, and inviting rooms with a desk. From this hotel, you can productively work on your assignment.\n\nIs there any hotel in Barcelona ideal to stay in with children?\nFamilies visiting Barcelona with kids might think about lodging at Generator Barcelona or Hotel Barcelona Princess. These luxurious hotel has plenty of parking, a hot tub, a pool, huge outdoor areas with beautiful views, laundry facilities, and flat-screen TVs. Children will therefore have a variety of entertainment choices during their visit.\n\nWhich Barcelona hotels are pet friendly?\nThere are many hotels in Barcelona that accept pets. Consider staying at the NH Collection Barcelona Gran Hotel Calderón, Travelodge Barcelona Poblenou and Catalonia Atenas, or Novotel Barcelona City if you\'re visiting the city with your canine companion. The hotels offer dog food for an additional cost and provide all pet services.\n\nWhich freebies do KAYAK users look for when booking a hotel in Barcelona?\nKAYAK users look for a hotel in Barcelona with free breakfast. Hotels with free breakfast in Barcelona include Hotel Club 29, Hotel Font de la Canya, and Hotel Primero Primera.\n\nHow do I find a hotel in central Barcelona?\nAfter you launch a hotel search on KAYAK, you can refine your research by neighborhood, which allows you to pick the central Barcelona districts. You can also do a search using the city map to choose a specific location, like Barcelona city center.\n\nHow can I find hotels near me?\nTake a look at our extensive hotel map to find the best hotels near you.',NULL,0,'https://www.kayak.com/Barcelona-Hotels.22567.hotel.ksp','Nguồn: KAYAK','2026-11-19 16:10:07','2026-11-19 16:10:08'),(20,NULL,14,'Dubai','dubai','Dubai, United Arab Emirates','kayak_93a77a466d68b5fa38b44f7f60b77f66.jpg','Where to stay in Dubai?\nDeira and Dubai Marina are the most popular neighborhoods on KAYAK for users looking for a hotel in Dubai. You should also consider staying close to Burj Khalifa.\n\nWhat are the best hotels near Burj Khalifa?\nBurj Khalifa being one of the most popular landmarks in Dubai, many travelers enjoy staying close by. Rove Downtown Dubai, Swissôtel Al Murooj Dubai and Sofitel Dubai Downtown are recommended hotels on KAYAK within walking distance.\n\nWhat are good spa hotels in Dubai?\nDubai has many good options for spa hotels. The Waldorf Astoria Dubai Palm Jumeirah provides luxury spa services from its beachfront resort. The Raffles Dubai is also highly regarded as a wellness hotel, with 5-star spa services, and is located close to the Dubai metro, making it a convenient choice.\n\nWhat are good hotels in Dubai near the Mall of the Emirates?\nThe DoubleTree by Hilton Hotel and Residences Dubai Al Barsha is one nice, low-cost option about a fifteen-minute walk from the Mall of the Emirates, while the Novotel Suites Mall of the Emirates is right across the road from the 