reathtaking views of Pearl Island encircled by sand dunes, the Arabian Gulf, West Bay, and Doha’s charming, ancient architecture.\n\nWhich hotel in Doha is great for families with kids?\nA good selection of spacious suites with infant beds makes the Sheraton Grand Doha Resort & Convention Centre a smart choice for families carting to Doha with their youngsters. Additionally, the family-friendly resort features a shaded kids’ pool, watersports, an outdoor playground, several padel courts, and special pricing on dining.\n\nWhich hotel in Doha is suitable for a romantic getaway?\nIf you want to create indelible memories in Doha with your significant other, consider staying at the Ritz-Carlton Doha. Unwind in their lavish suites with wall-to-wall windows as you take in the sea and Doha skyline views, or head down to the private beach with complimentary umbrellas and sunbeds for a respite. Alternatively, you could go for a splash at their outdoor pool or relish live piano music while sipping on the afternoon tea at the Lobby Lounge. Later, you could enjoy poolside dining at the hotel’s Flamingo Restaurant.\n\nAre there hotels in Doha with services for those with limited mobility?\nLook no further than Radisson Blu Hotel, Doha, if you or someone you are touring with needs accessible services and adapted amenities. The property features increased accessibility as it has lowered sinks, walk-in showers, toilets with grab rails, wheelchair-accessible units, lifts, and bathrooms with emergency cords. Another mobility-friendly accommodation is the Millenium Hotel Doha, whose upper floors are accessible by elevator.\n\nWhich freebies do KAYAK users look for when booking a hotel in Doha?\nKAYAK users look for a hotel in Doha with free breakfast. Hotels with free breakfast in Doha include The Ned Doha, 21 High Street Residence By The Torch, and Ezdan Palace Hotel.\n\nHow do I find a hotel in central Doha?\nAfter you launch a hotel search on KAYAK, you can refine your research by n